author":{"date":"2026-09-24T15:45:37Z","email":"jlobo@opennebula.io","name":"Jorge Miguel Lobo Escalona"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T15:45:37Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"F #6976: VNC listen is a DNS (#4540)\n\n- Updates VNC console connections to honor the address configured in `GRAPHICS.LISTEN`.\n- Uses loopback addresses for wildcard listeners (`0.0.0.0` and `::`) while supporting explicit IP addresses and DNS names.\n- Passes the resolved graphics address through the Guacamole session and uses it as the remote destination of the SSH tunnel..\n- The Guacamole WebSocket route currently logs the complete connection settings object. Since this object may contain VNC credentials, the debug log should be removed before merging.\n- The new tunnel destination is inserted into a command executed through `bash -c`; it should be validated or safely escaped to prevent command injection through `GRAPHICS.LISTEN`.","tree":{"sha":"3fb5de840035659ee3fbc918b2387af5d1fde6b3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OpenNebula/one/git/trees/3fb5de840035659ee3fbc918b2387af5d1fde6b3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OpenNebula/one/git/commits/6aef9ce448b8c6b2e3acd8581294f0a0c85ae595","verification":{"payload":"tree 3fb5de840035659ee3fbc918b2387af5d1fde6b3\nparent 4914ed32e8fbe8017e745e8104121d6011e95619\nauthor Jorge Miguel Lobo Escalona <jlobo@opennebula.io> 1790264737 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790264737 +0200\n\nF #6976: VNC listen is a DNS (#4540)\n\n- Updates VNC console connections to honor the address configured in `GRAPHICS.LISTEN`.\n- Uses loopback addresses for wildcard listeners (`0.0.0.0` and `::`) while supporting explicit IP addresses and DNS names.\n- Passes the resolved graphics address through the Guacamole session and uses it as the remote destination of the SSH tunnel..\n- The Guacamole WebSocket route currently logs the complete connection settings object. Since this object may contain VNC credentials, the debug log should be removed before merging.\n- The new tunnel destination is inserted into a command executed through `bash -c`; it should be validated or safely escaped to prevent command injection through `GRAPHICS.LISTEN`.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqtUWhCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA79YQADw0MkFqGkCV1FqLO52jJl4t\nKGAuoQME30pt3BdOw2SfEb6i7qwVMEF5aVM04ZZa1T8hxXLcd64kvpKzby189CQM\nCI7sMR2NMyqx96oZT3edMlRekLe4C3odZYLy7ikkZIdCnyOiVwE2ub+AULfGLzWc\nL4cSrmi+mesoc0dX/WBIAy/klp13hs9+w6KaFYJinNBqXDgWFaEviRSpDYduMYpt\nnjWLwKOZdyLZadAkc/kAg2mgvA8nz4idDfeEGlNaxTxG96KzVeosRIScsyGELsaM\nOl1klvBCIr0yxho1YubW2FIZ5z0buvwYWE7QzBt/3ONlt+PSGlDzNJha9CnLKVyv\nZ/9mrHp5X+3WBGm7olKXBjlUnTvgwH52y3IVBosNhuEWg9j/ANPe6x2jRkaN/KC4\nepT9SKml2lYZ7qaOdtfZhx4r+V3Iw20yJtpHL9Wnkx636duy9ukJZxVGXNKii7E+\nJLW/8PDANvrrtBzWAfezegszaY5bhO8En2Q4brvyZI2JW3P119YpwOx8MF4Ia1RK\ndFGvmOogyBisgf6cPAMRURdwx1cLtKQEFpoZbvPlqFUQys2W7vBe8+MiQRjJ0bSe\nwXRXamemjBOpDmvNjW0dedqIfo0mwhy4gjiHUJUcFbsnTqKnx2JjyGdDsxpaNGff\n58/3ig+PRgFz5aLpsDs1\n=MpTY\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-25T07:18:51Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptio