reventing premature disconnections.\n\n(cherry picked from commit 40644b80dbd0321f11ca65dc708361d8370377d9)","tree":{"sha":"13da058db92f651835b90169f73775de2f484547","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OpenNebula/one/git/trees/13da058db92f651835b90169f73775de2f484547"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OpenNebula/one/git/commits/8d85f4b873d2c79b26b8365b064c9c93fc06ef62","verification":{"payload":"tree 13da058db92f651835b90169f73775de2f484547\nparent 0ebdde66e6b465ef43150c13ed6061379e5b1dca\nauthor Jorge Miguel Lobo Escalona <jlobo@opennebula.io> 1789718920 +0200\ncommitter Ruben S. Montero <rsmontero@opennebula.org> 1789718984 +0200\n\nF OpenNebula/One#8095: VNC with LXC (#4524)\n\n- Improves VNC console reliability for LXC virtual machines.\n- Extends the Guacamole tunnel receive timeout to tolerate longer periods without WebSocket messages.\n- Reworks `svncterm` inactivity tracking to use monotonic time and account for both terminal input and output, preventing premature disconnections.\n\n(cherry picked from commit 40644b80dbd0321f11ca65dc708361d8370377d9)\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCgAdFiEEzxcHxw36JXdObq7noM6m+ogKHYcFAmqs8cgACgkQoM6m+ogK\nHYcEvw//fVf9oL6mhfBJ43VS24C3CucudCePKcPsz3qjJYyJsyuQhW/IOfvUgrL3\nf5z86Zxnjh4sWR46P+iASjft6lZ64p9WMYqUF25eg1aVOxtS+90jPl24TByCHdNL\nt/LYhJNI+jXTM6EeUM417h7AYyf19OY6znFTvR4xr4/t6HTnnSPVj4S+ceAdqeYF\n4eIejP8Ia7Hw7svf2nFNh0+JiCJ2EHI7NUnp6n6LzqG/TXiqrCepIU1uOOVYNak2\noPZ9IFGhAdBkIBxAoUZlBQQUJtZbRjKhF+oKQ/Lkp+sz/nfvmku45vcDOGmtoYT1\nyKjGNF3yd7hF4YkmoayjbmB1jJNTQ5E3xUIZh+t+hnssCSYoRLs+ogeE9s0S5acl\neS68h8zKKfL3mZZRddN4OTEIbJpu7/XIK41rCA5dOV/Kz5vUWjX9EA1C9D9l0LsA\n1cXqrvxhCI0DMLNJqIFKnczTZzxf3hQrZQs44VnjVDl8j4cgE4+RCX7jvGG/DVYL\nuZ/1CI3Z4j5oMXoxFycWuuXfQ4dGEb1yDu2sO2I15xd3w+oVSUQ6Qd6UhEsH7ikr\n1J3t2wUAslpUceGpERuCItLil7z4/VvPAB7hUOtFQlrvKTykWIREoRXHonBCusPJ\ndIcOO45iccP8pqzuotWEV/vANfiOgJJZX+hPYncwoOWDvJg1Dj0=\n=w+YJ\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-1