_kwDOABZZE9oAKGMxMGQ4N2RmZGNlOWQ2MGU0NDZjYzBmOTU4ZTI1ZGRlODgwOWQ1ZTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/OpenNebula/one/commit/35995b926723bd0d818b53dec9ee4c043cfbea4f","sha":"35995b926723bd0d818b53dec9ee4c043cfbea4f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OpenNebula/one/commits/35995b926723bd0d818b53dec9ee4c043cfbea4f"}],"sha":"c10d87dfdce9d60e446cc0f958e25dde8809d5e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OpenNebula/one/commits/c10d87dfdce9d60e446cc0f958e25dde8809d5e6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/163847695?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1gramos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1gramos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1gramos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1gramos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/1gramos","id":163847695,"login":"1gramos","node_id":"U_kgDOCcQeDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1gramos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1gramos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1gramos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1gramos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1gramos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/1gramos","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OpenNebula/one/commits/35995b926723bd0d818b53dec9ee4c043cfbea4f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T10:56:57Z","email":"gramos@opennebula.io","name":"Guillermo Ramos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T10:56:57Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"B OpenNebula/one#8011: Fix FS freeze for live Ceph backups (#4466)\n\nParse the VM XML before reading FS_FREEZE, preventing the setting from\nsilently falling back to NONE.\n\nSplit live Ceph backup preparation into two phases:\n\n- Freeze the guest, create RBD snapshots and thaw it on the hypervisor.\n- Export and clean up the snapshots on LAST_BRIDGE.\n\nRun virsh operations as standalone commands so their failures are not\nmasked by chained operations. Preserve the original error and clean up\nthe guest and RBD snapshots when either phase fails.\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillermo Ramos <gramos@opennebula.io>","tree":{"sha":"a1991c23d33441bbf9db4ef13e5937804bb5c223","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OpenNebula/one/git/trees/a1991c23d33441bbf9db4ef13e5937804bb5c223"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OpenNebula/one/git/commits/35995b926723bd0d818b53dec9ee4c043cfbea4f","verification":{"payload":"tree a1991c23d33441bbf9db4ef13e5937804bb5c223\nparent 779b701abb3e963084bc2cf685d3a5eee0ef1336\nauthor Guillermo Ramos <gramos@opennebula.io> 1788346617 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788346617 +0200\n\nB OpenNebula/one#8011: Fix FS freeze for live Ceph backups (#4466)\n\nParse the VM XML before reading FS_FREEZE, preventing the setting from\nsilently falling back to NONE.\n\nSplit live Ceph backup preparation into two phases:\n\n- Freeze the guest, create RBD snapshots and thaw it on the hypervisor.\n- Export and clean up the snapshots on LAST_BRIDGE.\n\nRun virsh operations as standalone commands so their failures are not\nmasked by chained operations. Preserve the original error and clean up\nthe guest and RBD snapshots when either phase fails.\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillermo Ramos <gramos@opennebula.io>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqmAD5CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAgJsQAAZL2QiMcszSedQweH03yj9a\nsQ0Gkqlkd/QM1buvgOEtTEr4W/ZsApn0gO0LMUy+dzv8LDigkS5vZu+DwrD62KTa\ncV33E/Eg1F3JwWrp1IidAdWR/iUZk1TZlmMbav2Mo/WgcumlpEV0P7KgDUj5dqH+\nwRIe4V1SHK2Qw8dlyngYBQpXcCBCl3B4lGGNNYI+C9wtCb3NjaG5/LuwrTOC1IrX\n7D6UUKIumrPk8JTU6DsdQUmPO84MX8VTmlBC0V5q4juxQ3qNWTKMWeqB2IgQ6srK\nzjJQcGYjkAAzWZnYX2kz9zrBbNcR6oOlHT0xbAg3kJAAlqCJQh+5QwusQvozpY2A\nsVkiBB0+6SwFoRQ25RL+Z+cHBV7QycQ+zaq5qJCWoLslwjqyztyAza