_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andreiborza/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andreiborza/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andreiborza","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getsentry/sentry-javascript/commits/1fee6d12201c4423421570d9faceb01908dd2e8b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T12:09:05Z","email":"168741329+andreiborza@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Andrei"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T12:09:05Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"test(node): Cover Jev calls inside createAgent and LangGraph (#25132)\n\n## What\n\nAdds tests that check Jev calls made inside agents show up as\n`gen_ai.evaluate` spans.\n\n- A LangChain `createAgent` with the TypeSafe model router middleware.\n- A LangGraph `StateGraph` node that calls `TypeSafeClassifier`\ndirectly.\n\n## Why\n\nThese Jev calls were invisible inside agents. #25120 fixes that, and\nthese tests keep it from regressing.\n\nCloses: #25032\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"357ef86814646327ea57cfd4959b04a21eed4171","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getsentry/sentry-javascript/git/trees/357ef86814646327ea57cfd4959b04a21eed4171"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getsentry/sentry-javascript/git/commits/1fee6d12201c4423421570d9faceb01908dd2e8b","verification":{"payload":"tree 357ef86814646327ea57cfd4959b04a21eed4171\nparent 540c79858013c1230500b641a81f31eae05d885c\nauthor Andrei <168741329+andreiborza@users.noreply.github.com> 1791461345 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791461345 +0200\n\ntest(node): Cover Jev calls inside createAgent and LangGraph (#25132)\n\n## What\n\nAdds tests that check Jev calls made inside agents show up as\n`gen_ai.evaluate` spans.\n\n- A LangChain `createAgent` with the TypeSafe model router middleware.\n- A LangGraph `StateGraph` node that calls `TypeSafeClassifier`\ndirectly.\n\n## Why\n\nThese Jev calls were invisible inside agents. #25120 fixes that, and\nthese tests keep it from regressing.\n\nCloses: #25032\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqx4fhCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAWo4QAKK6ek+hnDi+Oe1z2f30zO4J\n7bvYHjZ0R3qJjKU36gpydrlo9VQ15FCFYygEzmwqqdMwJBwmzwDb9IAkKP9CErc4\n++iMZDVB0rEo3LFqUigd179AMVgb4CeIUpEeb8BSx10va/0Tt2Z58DyiTbsNGpj9\nUvef02Vj3iVjIJ4wpe+LBOJnoAZZ+9eYstBv0+mVs/2vUfzsW2ydMgJWuH+Lke7N\nZOb9GbBrNAJkSx9R1PHU+jLNI8v+B1rwtOR/Pu+0smSXz8tMd8c31ADVn6apKpqY\nqPZwi6pxktd58V12l/H3YOCJ1Qo3oWu1/HJK4beh357KFs+c2/fkgIyB2BvBDU6d\nXK2U+i9m8CsAVrM+zj5qh/kpru/VprZOldny+Mz5CKoXenSaZNqS/BRxIAEbDq5h\ne3+YI+v783wITQs43kt9yNb1/GWx7XFN9OPeZFBEpyYPgYYvI1OEQ/foT6HtX3+z\nLY4xUMp0QSfq4LQDhvBfVpgMhmk9FzSOyiBd3Kn+pTn1JB05NIjYRgJAk6M3oHfu\nevSV6BHdbWQlWXe6/Cr40rr9JPcF3cf0yCP+vR0V481VEq2t43P2BNpt4lsxIafR\nbvE2U9eyNOf97RqSuh+KGuIiliqG0TcSGsh3VZUI82CEx6LxadRX/g0Ji8zZmyIO\nnQqzpac/Y4/NLgTozpcb\n=ZVM5\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-08T12:09:05Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/getsentry/sentry-javascript/commit/1fee6d12201c4423421570d9faceb01908dd2e8b","node_id":"C_kwDOADLKPNoAKDFmZWU2ZDEyMjAxYzQ0MjM0MjE1NzBkOWZhY2ViMDE5MDhkZDJlOGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/getsentry/sentry-javascript/commit/540c79858013c1230500b641a81f31eae05d885c","sha":"540c79858013c1230500b641a81f31eae05d885c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getsentry/sentry-javascript/commits/540c79858013c1230500b641a81f31eae05d885c"}],"sha":"1fee6d12201c4423421570d9faceb01908dd2e8b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getsentry/sentry-javascript/commits/1fee6d12201c4423421570d9faceb01908dd2e8b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/168741329?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andreiborza/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andreiborza/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andreiborza/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andreiborza/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/andreiborza","id":168741329,"login":"andreiborza","node_id":"U_kgDOCg7J0Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andreiborza/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andreiborza/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andreiborza/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andreiborza/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andreiborza/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andreiborza","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getsentry/sentry-javascript/commits/540c79858013c1230500b641a81f31eae05d885c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T12:09:04Z","email":"168741329+andreiborza@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Andrei"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T12:09:04Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(server-utils): Record LangChain TypeSafeClassifier runs as gen_ai.evaluate spans (#25120)\n\n## What\n\n`TypeSafeClassifier` runs from `@langchain/typesafe` now show up as\n`gen_ai.evaluate` spans with model, provider, token usage, and the\nstate, questions and answers when gen_ai recording is on.\n\n- Standalone `classifier.invoke()` calls are traced automatically.\n- Calls from inside agents (for example the TypeSafe model router and\nauto-mode middleware) are traced too.\n\n## Why\n\nThe classifier calls Jev with `fetch` directly, so the TypeSafe\nintegration did not see it, and LangChain reported it as a generic\n`invoke_agent` span without any evaluation data.\n\nCloses: #24859\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: Charly Gomez <charly.gomez1310@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"035632a297f72d95337930af18853432c78bc4bc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getsentry/sentry-javascript/git/trees/035632a297f72d95337930af18853432c78bc4bc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getsentry/sentry-javascript/git/commits/540c79858013c1230500b641a81f31eae05d885c","verification":{"payload":"tree 035632a297f72d95337930af18853432c78bc4bc\nparent de43b569afe3dd19733675823e59b6eb3086e872\nauthor Andrei <168741329+andreiborza@users.noreply.github.com> 1791461344 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791461344 +0200\n\nfeat(server-utils): Record LangChain TypeSafeClassifier runs as gen_ai.evaluate spans (#25120)\n\n## What\n\n`TypeSafeClassifier` runs from `@langchain/typesafe` now show up as\n`gen_ai.evaluate` spans with model, provider, token usage, and the\nstate, questions and answers when gen_ai recording is on.\n\n- Standalone `classifier.invoke()` calls are traced automatically.\n- Calls from inside agents (for example the TypeSafe model router and\nauto-mode middleware) are traced too.\n\n## Why\n\nThe classifier calls Jev with `fetch` directly, so the TypeSafe\nintegration did not see it, and LangChain reported it as a generic\n`invoke_agent` span without any evaluation data.\n\nCloses: #24859\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: Charly Gomez <charly.gomez1310@gmail.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqx4fgCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAt5AQAK5tCozaYCjsxK0Yxb4P5b8S\nbv1lB/yCc1048Qc2dLMuz8Mtu6uriObpk1P9zkxlM+pTEviVl4cCizxH51lrnuww\ny7WzuPzGmacRxA3E830y/jP8w8yojFCeVixmS3qSoFpZLBWIMcV9NkNZsEqAmF3g\nftS+8uVyIqIQEqmohXOYnfrQB8jlpIEEaHt5OoYbBHbOAvIHb9GqC7TQIUmEbDpW\nckHBxQj/gai9porbnICQ8Wt8oAYBMhZVDB7BBDF4jdTxwQLirWhBb/XV0wzgWvTl\n581BlxwGEXbMlngDu0MoZqqNDF95dMsZu7JhQtm76Lq3KfKbyFJMOg2i9oZDueA3\nsJHJeXPnISrkvP8veudZT5r8ay3PpnkHC1b/kGrPvfLq0nDYZsFk6nYdqS0zKO53\nUaRlmeoKsnWSrR1VuPXgTmYop7erv78gTyNvu4uWjXCqhtBBK3/8k3Jd2SIgiGVB\nL/rmBoVJ9AqNihxsKTxBM6Oy5OeyWgW+X33fs9aIZHrXGzLLIBf74FtlDOcBoQws\nRzx+KkP2UPD/QMEt42i9KtluzQnMCCeflyl8COExhAsqgN5I8gs0Bdf/O9JVhKAo\nLir1oiNBCbJNaFHYb6wKFKhVDYhijdgk1KUnR8KuvH8YqsZ7u2RPfdHRFCwk5grH\nEOy+pGlY/23B7Q8bLUIy\n=A58M\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-08T12:09:05Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/getsentry/sentry-javascript/commit/540c79858013c1230500b641a81f31eae05d885c","node_id":"C_kwDOADLKPNoAKDU0MGM3OTg1ODAxM2MxMjMwNTAwYjY0MWE4MWYzMWVhZTA1ZDg4NWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/getsentry/sentry-javascript/commit/de43b569afe3dd19733675823e59b6eb3086e872","sha":"de43b569afe3dd19733675823e59b6eb3086e872","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getsentry/sentry-javascript/commits/de43b569afe3dd19733675823e59b6eb3086e872"}],"sha":"540c79858013c1230500b641a81f31eae05d885c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getsentry/sentry-javascript/commits/540c79858013c1230500b641a81f31eae05d885c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/29110?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/dependabot","id":49699333,"login":"dependabot[bot]","node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDk2OTkzMzM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getsentry/sentry-javascript/commits/de43b569afe3dd19733675823e59b6eb3086e872/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T11:52:48Z","email":"49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"dependabot[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T11:52:48Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore(deps-dev): Bump next from 15.5.24 to 15.5.27 (#25171)\n\nBumps [next](https://github.com/vercel/next.js) from 15.5.24 to 15.5.27.\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/vercel/next.js/releases\">next''s\nreleases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>v15.5.27</h2>\n<p>This release contains security fixes for the following\nadvisories:</p>\n<p>Medium:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/vercel/next.js/security/advisories/GHSA-f87g-xv8r-7p7x\">Information\ndisclosure in Next.js App Router metadata image routes via dynamicParams\nbypass</a></li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/vercel/next.js/security/advisories/GHSA-4jqv-mc3x-m676\">Cache\npoisoning of SSG and ISR pages in self-hosted Next.js\napplications</a></li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/vercel/next.js/security/advisories/GHSA-mcj8-r9mp-w47p\">Cache\npoisoning in Next.js SSG/ISR rendering leads to cross-user content\nsubstitution and persistent denial of service</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>v15.5.26</h2>\n<p>This release contains additional security hardening for\n<code>next/og</code>. For more information, check out <a\nhref=\"https://nextjs.org/blog/nextjs-security-update-september-22-2026\">https://nextjs.org/blog/nextjs-security-update-september-22-2026</a></p>\n<h2>v15.5.25</h2>\n<p>Follow-up release to <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/vercel/next.js/releases/tag/v15.5.24\">v15.5.24</a>\nre-enabling AVIF Image Optimization when newer versions of\n<code>sharp</code> are installed (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/vercel/next.js/pull/97954\">#97954</a>).</p>\n</blockquote>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/vercel/next.js/commit/def7eff9063f79cf58610c15fe58dd78b967c885\"><code>def7eff</code></a>\nv15.5.27</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/vercel/next.js/commit/52c94abdd2ea5f416f5e8353ea8a2edd3fe311b8\"><code>52c94ab</code></a>\n[lts-maintenance] Scope response cache keys to their source route (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/vercel/next.js/issues/219\">#219</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/vercel/next.js/commit/785f4c2397f25690edf02b5a9f1cd7deaa1abb6d\"><code>785f4c2</code></a>\n[lts-maintenance] Match Next data paths case-sensitively (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/vercel/next.js/issues/197\">#197</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/vercel/next.js/commit/7217d63db316f1650cab9c2a15833155b540766c\"><code>7217d63</code></a>\n[lts-maintenance][webpack] Ensure <code>dynamicParams</code> is\nrespected in `opengraph-...</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/vercel/next.js/commit/d5979baa545099473b9fde8b6e03f06b3167242f\"><code>d5979ba</code></a>\n[lts-maintenance][ci] Remove PR creation from deploy test workflow (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/vercel/next.js/issues/99093\">#99093</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/vercel/next.js/commit/812ae7db8453c0aa65859ea7b2810007e033487c\"><code>812ae7d</code></a>\n[lts-maintenance][test] Adjust deploy assertions for platform drift and\nthe e...</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/vercel/next.js/commit/6936da55033075528f0dfad8f2ec29550b8c9053\"><code>6936da5</code></a>\nv15.5.26</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/vercel/next.js/commit/b49b6ca47ed80a1a3601d63f7ed6c00355ca4bc1\"><code>b49b6ca</code></a>\n[maintenance-lts] Harden next/og SVG serialization</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/vercel/next.js/commit/f391939d5ec8f1c32b339e902100987be0b6f959\"><code>f391939</code></a>\n[15.5.x][test] Disable deploy tests triggering bot challenge (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/vercel/next.js/issues/98132\">#98132</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/vercel/next.js/commit/013ee1d2f25326197453d129430a6da83b86426d\"><