ent.com/u/20254395?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chargome/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chargome/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chargome/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chargome/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chargome","id":20254395,"login":"chargome","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMjU0Mzk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chargome/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chargome/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chargome/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chargome/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chargome/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chargome","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getsentry/sentry-javascript/commits/af84269091981d96d2e6d3b7d8b62312b852de65/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T10:57:15Z","email":"charly.gomez1310@gmail.com","name":"Charly Gomez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T10:57:15Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(sveltekit): Upload source maps with SvelteKit 3 (#25139)\n\nSvelteKit 3 builds all environments in a single Vite build and runs the\nadapter in a post `buildApp` hook. Our upload waited for a separate SSR\nbuild in `closeBundle`, which Kit 3 never does, so nothing was uploaded.\nWe now also upload from a post `buildApp` hook, but only once an\nenvironment has been built. Kit 2 builds only after all `buildApp` hooks\nhave run, so its `closeBundle` path still does the upload.\n\nSource maps were also never deleted after upload, on Kit 2 or Kit 3. The\ndeletion check read `build.sourcemap` after our own plugin had already\nset it.\n\nThe new `sveltekit-3-sourcemaps` e2e app builds against a mock Sentry\nserver. It asserts that the upload happens, that every debug ID has a\nmap, and that no maps are left in `build/`.\n\nFixes #25096\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"25363d9905e7c4d504c8c894535e7cd049f380d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getsentry/sentry-javascript/git/trees/25363d9905e7c4d504c8c894535e7cd049f380d1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getsentry/sentry-javascript/git/commits/af84269091981d96d2e6d3b7d8b62312b852de65","verification":{"payload":"tree 25363d9905e7c4d504c8c894535e7cd049f380d1\nparent 5b98d7572f2f8343959fe55b8e087a120ff8fb97\nauthor Charly Gomez <charly.gomez1310@gmail.com> 1791457035 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791457035 +0200\n\nfix(sveltekit): Upload source maps with SvelteKit 3 (#25139)\n\nSvelteKit 3 builds all environments in a single Vite build and runs the\nadapter in a post `buildApp` hook. Our upload waited for a separate SSR\nbuild in `closeBundle`, which Kit 3 never does, so nothing was uploaded.\nWe now also upload from a post `buildApp` hook, but only once an\nenvironment has been built. Kit 2 builds only after all `buildApp` hooks\nhave run, so its `closeBundle` path still does the upload.\n\nSource maps were also never deleted after upload, on Kit 2 or Kit 3. The\ndeletion check read `build.sourcemap` after our own plugin had already\nset it.\n\nThe new `sveltekit-3-sourcemaps` e2e app builds against a mock Sentry\nserver. It asserts that the upload happens, that every debug ID has a\nmap, and that no maps are left in `build/`.\n\nFixes #25096\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqx3cLCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAzCIQAExCfRY+Ug2hWh8zJmjbnnwY\nRclPWoXBEnCNbA69dvqTGgGfXcAMFmaAXo74VORyolLRdgfK73FEM9Oz17uqeo3v\nHB198or2f5UY8p7JQQn0MCQ/AKg8o4aeNv/7UY0j4n0IJwygZMMBdnIiyh6EfODz\nlo1d1jHUF6pUZmI61yDtvK4QsU6mTDbMbE+2bqo38zHy7B8tzZhWxyKKdntAwGAV\nwHK5Krdtv+B2u0r+QiMJcdxs0N2IstX6V1cO3s8hRrQEmrb7