{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Lms24","id":8420481,"login":"Lms24","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg0MjA0ODE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lms24/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lms24/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lms24/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lms24/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lms24/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lms24","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getsentry/sentry-javascript/commits/edd839a68883eb6be1091118a958e681564cca41/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T10:52:14Z","email":"lukas.stracke@sentry.io","name":"Lukas Stracke"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T10:52:14Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(replay): Place CLS and INP web vitals at the right time (#24990)\n\nThe Replay integration adding web vital breadcrumbs used the metric\nvalue as the timestamp for CLS and INP web vitals. This is incorrect\nbecause that value is a score for CLS and a duration for INP, so both\nevents always landed just after page load. This was a pre-existing bug,\nbut it showed up during work on #23054. With this PR, CLS goes at the\nlast layout shift and INP at the interaction, like we already do with\nspans in tracing. Both also get the time origin from when that happened,\nso they stay correct after a clock drift correction. A CLS of 0 has no\nlayout shift, so it stays at the start of its navigation\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0766913109359ea09c5966c2ea1a4a5cbba0e819","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getsentry/sentry-javascript/git/trees/0766913109359ea09c5966c2ea1a4a5cbba0e819"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getsentry/sentry-javascript/git/commits/edd839a68883eb6be1091118a958e681564cca41","verification":{"payload":"tree 0766913109359ea09c5966c2ea1a4a5cbba0e819\nparent f1cdd11f4bb84f138b104b72e4005936146ecb20\nauthor Lukas Stracke <lukas.stracke@sentry.io> 1791456734 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791456734 +0200\n\nfix(replay): Place CLS and INP web vitals at the right time (#24990)\n\nThe Replay integration adding web vital breadcrumbs used the metric\nvalue as the timestamp for CLS and INP web vitals. This is incorrect\nbecause that value is a score for CLS and a duration for INP, so both\nevents always landed just after page load. This was a pre-existing bug,\nbut it showed up during work on #23054. With this PR, CLS goes at the\nlast layout shift and INP at the interaction, like we already do with\nspans in tracing. Both also get the time origin from when that happened,\nso they stay correct after a clock drift correction. A CLS of 0 has no\nlayout shift, so it stays at the start of its navigation\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqx3XeCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAVmcQAChj70rNSJx6wKuXMZpWBB14\nIIs0uYTlb34aA2su1G7gDY2Bjx18n9Ys9Bxgb+D/GP4d+0BAlmHs0cTtHjo8Avmv\nDX/aBeSv6oQJOWgkoY/xfzsZ6lq6fZG/tYjTwlQVBvtloyvnR+NOkdlBXwWmHMOl\nEBFtbhabswPdfEi7BcbszR4jeSltLQFo7d3bWn9K1qAC3r831pBD88CaUlU/M3aO\nGlHpdmYblEiV/ahYuuLbEMmokUu+b64iPXUzOCdC7+++mFQHZO+ZNoY/wMSgjHpe\nlav81eR+4mWbCS7tSzyxh6C6la+Yi51Jjl5gOLx7PIN0YA2aAg18n2jxSpe7RV4t\ngSPLnMBeGqc7sEySERNmcYtAmjz9vVQ9u1tkEyPqmaTN+JM5bpA0vYQS8qdwFv0k\niHYsan6Boc+G5JoVH50Tv0bn6sc6s8GMo2VJ3ehFf6h3vdf1WI/KkJGMNnQn5AzD\n3sdBHQqPrjP2gaXNqIh9LFAi8u527KnjLGZ5FNQ+1eoj1i6vw4Yr5H+I7XWxsxhH\nYk8s2X9HybzFd57hUl47qcXKJXPbP+HKWFm9SOtjJUC52hbk2eKKz9hsBXFyEjV7\ncKBI0NjqSlaZxGkiapgfr2zotJGvYS8DiogRkxvgRS/LWReffbc/XCcTZGuCi62W\nNXMtPlMS7hjAfWO/o1xX\n=Ny44\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-08T10:52:15Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://