,"events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lms24/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lms24/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lms24/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lms24/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Lms24","id":8420481,"login":"Lms24","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg0MjA0ODE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lms24/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lms24/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lms24/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lms24/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lms24/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lms24","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getsentry/sentry-javascript/commits/559d8bdbd0247c0d60c7b929bbe2018f4f2c135d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T09:08:30Z","email":"lukas.stracke@sentry.io","name":"Lukas Stracke"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T09:08:30Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"test(e2e): Wait for the soft navigation entry before hiding the page (#25127)\n\nThe soft navigation web vitals tests hid the page right after the click.\nChrome only delivers the `soft-navigation` entry once the new route has\npainted, so it can arrive after the page is hidden. web-vitals then\nreports CLS for the pageload, and never finalizes the soft navigation''s\nmetrics, so the test times out. This was flaky on `develop`, e.g. in\n[this\nrun](https://github.com/getsentry/sentry-javascript/actions/runs/37587739193),\nwhere `vue-3 (latest)` and `vue-3 (vue-router 5)` both timed out.\n\nThe tests now wait for the `soft-navigation` entry before calling\n`hidePage`, using a new `waitForSoftNavigation` helper in `test-utils`.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ed4763463f25e40f51a6f01852eb11ffc267e0d3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getsentry/sentry-javascript/git/trees/ed4763463f25e40f51a6f01852eb11ffc267e0d3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getsentry/sentry-javascript/git/commits/559d8bdbd0247c0d60c7b929bbe2018f4f2c135d","verification":{"payload":"tree ed4763463f25e40f51a6f01852eb11ffc267e0d3\nparent d283c16285c9c0c93cde40f7dee9f0a3865845a0\nauthor Lukas Stracke <lukas.stracke@sentry.io> 1791450510 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791450510 +0200\n\ntest(e2e): Wait for the soft navigation entry before hiding the page (#25127)\n\nThe soft navigation web vitals tests hid the page right after the click.\nChrome only delivers the `soft-navigation` entry once the new route has\npainted, so it can arrive after the page is hidden. web-vitals then\nreports CLS for the pageload, and never finalizes the soft navigation''s\nmetrics, so the test times out. This was flaky on `develop`, e.g. in\n[this\nrun](https://github.com/getsentry/sentry-javascript/actions/runs/37587739193),\nwhere `vue-3 (latest)` and `vue-3 (vue-router 5)` both timed out.\n\nThe tests now wait for the `soft-navigation` entry before calling\n`hidePage`, using a new `waitForSoftNavigation` helper in `test-utils`.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqx12OCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA/9UQAJIuyBIFP6M+OkmgYLI/eVmM\nXe+yudONwHCK0Su/vFX8bpQvZYJf94Al5SgL2JeSWU2JOcOHAzsu4K3u0Uic2OAu\nCidhle0xtXwrpJtwEqvVoHAVCRXeu7XSFnoBAjNFLzC4a9TjRqL8RZupobseq9xF\nnj9TY5VeDEHFka1/4qQHJkO2yWDCtsqFIninBCOz7lMHIEEuZI+mGFXJqY7ffhIN\noB9Fh4yD1/Kzp57TYtBN7w75tN+kJtMOL0Kei9V4fhzkyer1HERJr8Q1vGUL+OCT\nHMR4QLiDIRaba/7sKdLmpDhniqgr8V0/MGa0+uJhGjKoADfAlVW2Wd6ftMPozCzH\nfshi9t6SEzjghdd0rkBSUL18qBowN6ZKY7/LiBSICbDWYrEFFwFh0BmHn+AXd6eR\n7rPNgLIjpNL3jc00X+S0NxQthtGw2fNKQNZbOYPsxskGMfDwGpvbJoGjPvpshQVz\nFut0oFnyYEmhK8iPRx1R2rgb3ywoAn92GZfX7PlIKYBAq5johAo9GFl2DN7tW8HH\n