WM0MWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/getsentry/sentry-javascript/commit/dd398d04c3116c246ab7ab18749c55c54fcb0d6c","sha":"dd398d04c3116c246ab7ab18749c55c54fcb0d6c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getsentry/sentry-javascript/commits/dd398d04c3116c246ab7ab18749c55c54fcb0d6c"}],"sha":"603eb60a651653fe47f6ffff6e998dce57f1c41a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getsentry/sentry-javascript/commits/603eb60a651653fe47f6ffff6e998dce57f1c41a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20254395?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chargome/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chargome/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chargome/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chargome/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chargome","id":20254395,"login":"chargome","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMjU0Mzk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chargome/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chargome/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chargome/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chargome/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chargome/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chargome","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getsentry/sentry-javascript/commits/dd398d04c3116c246ab7ab18749c55c54fcb0d6c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T09:08:53Z","email":"charly.gomez1310@gmail.com","name":"Charly Gomez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T09:08:53Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"test(nextjs): Pin nextjs-16-cf-workers latest variant to Next.js 16.3 (#25118)\n\n`@opennextjs/cloudflare` throws on the new `preview-props.json` manifest\nthat Next.js 16.4 loads, so every request in the `(latest)` variant\nreturns a 500\n(https://github.com/opennextjs/opennextjs-cloudflare/issues/1355).\n\nThis pins the variant to 16.3 until the upstream fix\n(https://github.com/opennextjs/opennextjs-cloudflare/pull/1356) is\nreleased, and we should switch it back to `next@latest` then.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4beb24af68a442c7dca115b787289b6b9f167f84","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getsentry/sentry-javascript/git/trees/4beb24af68a442c7dca115b787289b6b9f167f84"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getsentry/sentry-javascript/git/commits/dd398d04c3116c246ab7ab18749c55c54fcb0d6c","verification":{"payload":"tree 4beb24af68a442c7dca115b787289b6b9f167f84\nparent d441a34b781903d8a13d3e251a7c88ed6676b9c2\nauthor Charly Gomez <charly.gomez1310@gmail.com> 1791364133 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791364133 +0000\n\ntest(nextjs): Pin nextjs-16-cf-workers latest variant to Next.js 16.3 (#25118)\n\n`@opennextjs/cloudflare` throws on the new `preview-props.json` manifest\nthat Next.js 16.4 loads, so every request in the `(latest)` variant\nreturns a 500\n(https://github.com/opennextjs/opennextjs-cloudflare/issues/1355).\n\nThis pins the variant to 16.3 until the upstream fix\n(https://github.com/opennextjs/opennextjs-cloudflare/pull/1356) is\nreleased, and we should switch it back to `next@latest` then.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxgwlCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAxFwQAGA00a5H3yEN+wTT3+T2yTXy\nuZvbnjgryNOBc4LH7yPoD7G3CeLc1LD9SQNukIJPUaIK4dFX5GgW0gtG0xyImzr+\nY4WvjBErkMHhO1esURtB6JcevPfjc2+in9G8cfOjaxfhF9prGP4DTx0vipALcO0I\ncRkDL/mMhDDr1TMb2O8FTHh4em6wR2DUCZTy8fgD14NAPJWkw+MnXBm7MSgoSveV\nY2xrvDQ6/wOHOe07fmLWOw4UMXxmOcFYYs692a5kGG20US3wT2iTQcqwRPXSYTpl\nfuVLxQT4Z4anJCOfqNlSy6QaE0NbUxAWfQva+/J77yC7Ji5izQEUJVGB3BTRo1+Y\nY2D9kcRTngAVjezzUxvciD2GXisi1jLz5amW/c2/pETZOATcPwIi6+RxdyG0vniO\nyC4y4pWHC1R1HO/fPHRl3H6+I9aic04vcblbgbB66Fawj7sSbWQgDKtyNGgEQBWD\n