er","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chargome","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getsentry/sentry-javascript/commits/75ae1647c1bdad2ff9a588b901903c5df653c661/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T08:55:28Z","email":"charly.gomez1310@gmail.com","name":"Charly Gomez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T08:55:28Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(nextjs): Don''t capture forbidden() and unauthorized() as errors (#25088)\n\nNext.js 16.4 canary drops the `authInterrupts` flag, so\n`forbidden()`/`unauthorized()` throws\n(`NEXT_HTTP_ERROR_FALLBACK;403`/`;401`) now need to be treated as\ncontrol flow like `notFound()`.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3f3a8820a4580b1531d5c7ae192151f38bca6c8b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getsentry/sentry-javascript/git/trees/3f3a8820a4580b1531d5c7ae192151f38bca6c8b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getsentry/sentry-javascript/git/commits/75ae1647c1bdad2ff9a588b901903c5df653c661","verification":{"payload":"tree 3f3a8820a4580b1531d5c7ae192151f38bca6c8b\nparent c7ed7caea071d97eeeea5a834f3ab7dd6d4e2b92\nauthor Charly Gomez <charly.gomez1310@gmail.com> 1791363328 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791363328 +0200\n\nfix(nextjs): Don''t capture forbidden() and unauthorized() as errors (#25088)\n\nNext.js 16.4 canary drops the `authInterrupts` flag, so\n`forbidden()`/`unauthorized()` throws\n(`NEXT_HTTP_ERROR_FALLBACK;403`/`;401`) now need to be treated as\ncontrol flow like `notFound()`.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxgkACRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAK6UQAHM8nokDmzniEb1NSw/5mWpV\nST3EiLeC5HVAAmesuRKrqwriuccSm90GWWFMqr9Afc4Say5DyXSwlSRtYsPl2D4u\nuZk0sqeejtVXL9XuPFy2RblPioM5FvM92lYLmNyH6I0Nvv4tuuyZg1XvGbpo1My6\nuJ+qJ/Ct198N7JguHOOBt5HV0DTv7+N+PFEEpQoC5b3Jzhzfnk1k0sBQK2twp+4V\nRUHCtO9PxSGsoiQZzAvSMw73