5beeacd094b74e5bc78024e6c6591bfe50d1","sha":"2a085beeacd094b74e5bc78024e6c6591bfe50d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getsentry/sentry-javascript/commits/2a085beeacd094b74e5bc78024e6c6591bfe50d1"}],"sha":"c7ed7caea071d97eeeea5a834f3ab7dd6d4e2b92","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getsentry/sentry-javascript/commits/c7ed7caea071d97eeeea5a834f3ab7dd6d4e2b92"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20254395?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chargome/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chargome/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chargome/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chargome/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chargome","id":20254395,"login":"chargome","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMjU0Mzk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chargome/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chargome/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chargome/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chargome/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chargome/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chargome","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getsentry/sentry-javascript/commits/2a085beeacd094b74e5bc78024e6c6591bfe50d1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T07:09:27Z","email":"charly.gomez1310@gmail.com","name":"Charly Gomez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T07:09:27Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(react-router): Pass the project when creating a release (#25089)\n\nThe release API rejects a release without a project, and the project\ngiven to the `sentry` SDK does not reach `release.create`. Since the\nmove to that SDK (#23398), the Vite plugin logged `[Sentry] Could not\ncreate release` on every build; the upload itself still ran, so builds\nsucceeded without a release. The unit test mocked the SDK, so it did not\ncatch it.\n\nThe plugin now passes the project it already has, as\n`@sentry/bundler-plugins` does. Same bug in the Remix upload scripts,\nfixed in #25079.\n\nRefs #24989\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"33b3c1dbd5c062b7f1abd55542629f4747737471","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getsentry/sentry-javascript/git/trees/33b3c1dbd5c062b7f1abd55542629f4747737471"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getsentry/sentry-javascript/git/commits/2a085beeacd094b74e5bc78024e6c6591bfe50d1","verification":{"payload":"tree 33b3c1dbd5c062b7f1abd55542629f4747737471\nparent 5fc18dc416aeed33fc56227fd3714b7c58f21d97\nauthor Charly Gomez <charly.gomez1310@gmail.com> 1791356967 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791356967 +0200\n\nfix(react-router): Pass the project when creating a release (#25089)\n\nThe release API rejects a release without a project, and the project\ngiven to the `sentry` SDK does not reach `release.create`. Since the\nmove to that SDK (#23398), the Vite plugin logged `[Sentry] Could not\ncreate release` on every build; the upload itself still ran, so builds\nsucceeded without a release. The unit test mocked the SDK, so it did not\ncatch it.\n\nThe plugin now passes the project it already has, as\n`@sentry/bundler-plugins` does. Same bug in the Remix upload scripts,\nfixed in #25079.\n\nRefs #24989\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxfAnCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAQOwQAAei/3oQdplAX2LToL3s67ud\n8nSpSKQjey9JkoY3JF0qCSGThvrfI2EKXOET9E9XnTyCviIoXcHD2Lut3MnbqsoB\n0FhKqg/7muHvsHYTQ0WBzZVyCprxe/WTT0T58FGaUUlbdqZGWYHSwvrALKY7vhxG\nLVeug1BNFxfvi4Oa8mAIFEMw9soCmHz9jdLEZKDwxYMHer7ZYTCtWV7luGo9td7J\nI2n+T3dF2Q0S0b7NwU0+DcLPRJC9yd9KzYGaWVKTrsX+6VlMr1CkIausgXeVAK2y\nmuq/g7LudtkjYOXd0bHNA/PUvqY2T2G7+2YKmIZH2u95J5wUzE9re7708ZDuXYx+\nJQcvqk4ql8