6b152e8a79f87ce6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getsentry/sentry-javascript/git/commits/99d3ed65f363420c9e75d5046d977b81fb03c542","verification":{"payload":"tree 7b6a041bdbb0f0cb363199826b152e8a79f87ce6\nparent d3986589d593e36285021163a9904efb12e0635f\nauthor Nicolas Hrubec <nicolas.hrubec@outlook.com> 1791299924 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791299924 +0200\n\ntest(node): Port Apollo GraphQL integration tests to span streaming (#25030)\n\nPort the Apollo GraphQL integration suites to span streaming. Streaming\nkeeps the root name unchanged and records operation names as attributes.\nKeep focused transaction coverage in `naming-static`.\n\nCloses #24139\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: GPT-6 <codex@openai.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxRFUCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAqgsQADRtgyFCGryw6zYPIv7drk3A\nACuIh7DfTcqRxAYjFqjHhxdHO6+/xr3L6JH4AxaxwYK30705CxAESRwxw2g2xI1o\n1u15ewvtJhxlTuLVVfi3P9/CVnbOpEiuayvaPftwdjwuYlOA2UVZlauHqJX/HuSM\nH+f+MdgKAQGBxorE1msPDnnD9a4cOiH7TQ3Pcc4rIyWs3NzJmip0QEjaukGCz5Yw\n/ZVi7B4GyDpDa1ZJN+Wx4CPyt8hWEAcwxEeIwMlOUQqDMciS5i65GnaK0ioKKbHe\nc2NJD+ZtOtWgfBksXnMKbhzKAKsJczlZic8EXzC3rwZdnPayHi6sYYA+eA0YNMsE\nrAAUeSjld0eiqOgmdIqtJrpEZAqabNoykwP3sEKWoK/V96Njw0avrbVQjYF670mn\nC4vTN4A9mwb3aZ54GNfunmXH0hh4xq9UnUIO+0mV0alooynMJ7xZVmp+iylc2P2e\nP6OldIqTpaG6pNOqRL87/H3FP1urDCNyza5QTsZV3Gw/JT6OZD7HLx3kuHcH2WaD\n2KHDsSp1sno8uEoAWZRRp8563g/JEfhqi4YOzojos9ehnLciCIe/uyod1224kCEC\nsgDofQhq3x0v1lYXeP8g6oa7IVNDxLJUfVnQtyOebI/MHUXMmSnZkLPjjfXgLVGE\nXjrGkr1veAFAsBwZ+kbb\n=LGcH\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-06T15:18:45Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{