owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chargome/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chargome","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getsentry/sentry-javascript/commits/d3986589d593e36285021163a9904efb12e0635f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T15:11:31Z","email":"charly.gomez1310@gmail.com","name":"Charly Gomez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T15:11:31Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(tanstackstart-react): Fix server route parametrization gaps (#25071)\n\nServer route parametrization only read `src/routeTree.gen.ts` and only\nunderstood `$param` segments, so apps with a custom `srcDirectory`,\nindex routes, brace params and splats kept raw URLs as span names.\nThe matcher now follows TanStack''s segment syntax and picks the most\nspecific match, checked against TanStack Router''s own matching.\nIndex routes are named with their trailing slash (e.g. `GET /artists/`),\nmatching TanStack''s route ids and the client-side names.\n\nFixes #25067\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"68f144eae67e4815a5d6dc286de579abff42195f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getsentry/sentry-javascript/git/trees/68f144eae67e4815a5d6dc286de579abff42195f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getsentry/sentry-javascript/git/commits/d3986589d593e36285021163a9904efb12e0635f","verification":{"payload":"tree 68f144eae67e4815a5d6dc286de579abff42195f\nparent a819a8b1e6e27c45fd2f31a6f6478812de13c53b\nauthor Charly Gomez <charly.gomez1310@gmail.com> 1791299491 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791299491 +0200\n\nfix(tanstackstart-react): Fix server route parametrization gaps (#25071)\n\nServer route parametrization only read `src/routeTree.gen.ts` and only\nunderstood `$param` segments, so apps with a custom `srcDirectory`,\nindex routes, brace params and splats kept raw URLs as span names.\nThe matcher now follows TanStack''s segment syntax and picks the most\nspecific match, checked against TanStack Router''s own matching.\nIndex routes are named with their trailing slash (e.g. `GET /artists/`),\nmatching TanStack''s route ids and the client-side names.\n\nFixes #25067\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxQ+jCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA1hgQAHYRzJcT3xYjKSSz3VqK2/lu\n6CxRgVNMtik16p3YLxqAZpJXDsmguh9KVNN8MX2bU0m30PTjfCKfAIAVp0I++lhh\nP4Cjse+dVvS0ZYUraGP3G+RMZ84xoQUOHgk8qBd/KdbDyGZoPt2F2FlVxgdhV4yr\nWXqP/wATL1e8vJBxcSa9OJrwuOsxHUz8PaJyITsCMgu+9tJHFHJTq//iHhVlvCvy\ngd+v1dzjkeN2QfbA0+7eFEQGxqRs9Hwn7JCBXrOba/c9Adkjkos7vg4vian//JFC\nno0IluaEt9zxS4SNx8qbK0x2k+kNGqqOPW6uE3iIk35PKqOoVBj4jJ7u0pOpn/5G\nuFIXxV+yon03Hw5h2flNicmCcs0wY7/SmwFCJCF/c5MBoKRP18becgmaqTUO+kD5\nGoUccY6zh5HkKCnQj4qjHdnWzUujCHjAcFJBuQwfzluYmCYwxr2K5TCawwnjIY7b\nKnQ0DjF4CJlZJ/BuLF94nSVq2J0bT15+AzU85XVijmIowRHEZqh9t1EkYmo0W14s\n1svUA+CMijmUaPqi2yarHK0aWCrvHYb7WMTuTDgvvSaQGT1NDIUzx6qzdIEmCKfT\nBn2oCf7oZiMHRc6po06JAaXa5GwegB1WRiGJiL3VlKK+VmDBzYLve/Q/hhlrj42G\nqKuiBUQOg925R7koZUFR\n=yhZM\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-06T15:11:32Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/getsentry/sentry-javascript/commit/d3986589d593e36285021163a9904efb12e0635f","node_id":"C_kwDOADLKPNoAKGQzOTg2NTg5ZDU5M2UzNjI4NTAyMTE2M2E5OTA0ZWZiMTJlMDYzNWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/getsentry/sentry-javascript/commit/a819a8b1e6e27c45fd2f31a6f6478812de13c53b","sha":"a819a8b1e6e27c45fd2f31a6f6478812de13c53b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getsentry/sentry-javascript/commits/a819a8b1e6e27c45fd2f31a6f6478812de13c53b"}],"sha":"d3986589d593e36285021163a9904efb12e0635f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getsentry/sentry-javascript/commits/d3986589d593e36285021163a9904efb12e0635f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20254395?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chargome/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chargome/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chargome/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chargome/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chargome","id":20254395,"login":"chargome","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMjU0Mzk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chargome/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chargome/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chargome/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chargome/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chargome/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chargome","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getsentry/sentry-javascript/commits/a819a8b1e6e27c45fd2f31a6f6478812de13c53b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T15:10:13Z","email":"charly.gomez1310@gmail.com","name":"Charly Gomez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T15:10:13Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(deps): Bump seroval to 1.6.8 to fix two Dependabot alerts (#25104)\n\nBumps the hoisted `seroval` and `seroval-plugins` lockfile entries from\n1.6.2 to 1.6.8.\n\nThis resolves two Dependabot alerts:\n\n- GHSA-p6vx-979v-rg4c (critical, CVE-2026-104846): `fromJSON()` promise\nthenable\n  assimilation invokes plugin-produced callables.\nhttps://github.com/getsentry/sentry-javascript/security/dependabot/2704\n- GHSA-jp82-f5mq-hwhp (high, CVE-2026-104845): memory exhaustion via\nunchecked\n  TypedArray length in JSON deserialization.\nhttps://github.com/getsentry/sentry-javascript/security/dependabot/2703\n\nEvery range that requests the hoisted copy is a caret range (`^1.4.0`,\n`^1.5.0`,\n`^1.5.4`, `^1.6.2`), so only the lockfile entry needed re-resolving.\nThere is no\n`package.json` change and `yarn dedupe-deps:check` still passes.\n\n`seroval` reaches the tree only through devDependencies of the framework\npackages,\nso it does not ship in any published `@sentry/*` package:\n\n    packages/solidstart (dev) -> @solidjs/start -> seroval\npackages/vue (dev) -> @tanstack/vue-router -> @tanstack/router-core ->\nseroval\npackages/solid (dev) -> @tanstack/solid-router -> @tanstack/router-core\n-> seroval\n    packages/nuxt (dev)       -> nuxt -> @nuxt/vite-builder -> seroval\n\nOne thing for reviewers to note: a second, nested copy at\n`solid-js -> seroval@1.5.4` stays unpatched. `solid-js` pins `seroval`\nto\n`~1.5.4` even on its latest release (1.9.15), and the highest 1.5.x is\n1.5.6,\nwhich is still inside both vulnerable ranges. There is no upstream fix\nfor that\npath yet, so the two alerts may remain open until Solid loosens its pin.\nThat\ncopy is also dev only.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"11bda42624fa3342b94fbff402456b79c1dc8109","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getsentry/sentry-javascript/git/trees/11bda42624fa3342b94fbff402456b79c1dc8109"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getsentry/sentry-javascript/git/commits/a819a8b1e6e27c45fd2f31a6f6478812de13c53b","verification":{"payload":"tree 11bda42624fa3342b94fbff402456b79c1dc8109\nparent 095f48573393c791fd548ab70dd3a513df671bc2\nauthor Charly Gomez <charly.gomez1310@gmail.com> 1791299413 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791299413 +0200\n\nfix(deps): Bump seroval to 1.6.8 to fix two Dependabot alerts (#25104)\n\nBumps the hoisted `seroval` and `seroval-plugins` lockfile entries from\n1.6.2 to 1.6.8.\n\nThis resolves two Dependabot alerts:\n\n- GHSA-p6vx-979v-rg4c (critical, CVE-2026-104846): `fromJSON()` promise\nthenable\n  assimilation invokes plugin-produced callables.\nhttps://github.com/getsentry/sentry-javascript/security/dependabot/2704\n- GHSA-jp82-f5mq-hwhp (high, CVE-2026-104845): memory exhaustion via\nunchecked\n  TypedArray length in JSON deserialization.\nhttps://github.com/getsentry/sentry-javascript/security/dependabot/2703\n\nEvery range that requests the hoisted copy is a caret range (`^1.4.0`,\n`^1.5.0`,\n`^1.5.4`, `^1.6.2`), so only the lockfile entry needed re-resolving.\nThere is no\n`package.json` change and `yarn dedupe-deps:check` still passes.\n\n`seroval` reaches the tree only through devDependencies of the framework\npackages,\nso it does not ship in any published `@sentry/*` package:\n\n    packages/solidstart (dev) -> @solidjs/start -> seroval\npackages/vue (dev) -> @tanstack/vue-router -> @tanstack/router-core ->\nseroval\npackages/solid (dev) -> @tanstack/solid-router -> @tanstack/router-core\n-> seroval\n    packages/nuxt (dev)       -> nuxt -> @nuxt/vite-builder -> seroval\n\nOne thing for reviewers to note: a second, nested copy at\n`solid-js -> seroval@1.5.4` stays unpatched. `solid-js` pins `seroval`\nto\n`~1.5.4` even on its latest release (1.9.15), and the highest 1.5.x is\n1.5.6,\nwhich is still inside both vulnerable ranges. There is no upstream fix\nfor that\npath yet, so the two alerts may remain open until Solid loosens its pin.\nThat\ncopy is also dev only.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxQ9VCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA8+QQAIOpIfT2ZOgnSZFO/QkU0UGq\nf/oCeWlXHY+2u+S6GVneFyTE7NLA3W8ab62o1awd0XisrsQzihEqtvs2bzFFI40O\ntD/7K9vcfqme9JfBqLfbL4TzuFTrgws6i7UUbbeBxY08O8+3HRB43DOXklU6Sedn\nP1Q4OvYGYscqw/uWN7r8PRRk9M1jmGJTO0phCz5FKIXnZsNoI7SrgqdZiXD71UMi\n73GG9djC2ulOHqTRMpi5JHuKCos85wRqCHgKgWjs/QNx4bhlrJXv3GaF/qVIf4ix\nsw2XMw8KEIDW/iH5JU1HPQV9/DdZcPHPN5+NaDxQmDBulLSANEsSgJ/PziMosf61\nPSAGKoKmwqlhFdbXGAT6qZOTMQEcYIoSg7gWE3Hqq0IHeQcr5K0H4BUDV9U+SDI0\nVde5IemxqzsqOLgiYxBh8E91Q7f/rtLYQLCilmI4Y5ZsN0R/2B0JaOFa2hDIN97A\no0OTdTn4q315eXR+n4eWv4ns1MBYkDCN53KoNscwP3cIjqQ3dnj+gE5Lw6mr0W3M\nZpoDlz6wwIeiztBrW4tjRvqtY3mg0jhFc3VbMujG3CjYXvCY+Rb+Ht53Roj/0ePm\nFY0ApD81B2uYQq8RY7WRgMpgJqdU5NKu/JtZdGCr5jrFpkkSZjAkSIrBwGXTqRkW\nf8Zpn/aavU0tLosapeBF\n=qg8m\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-06T15:10:15Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/getsentry/sentry-javascript/commit/a819a8b1e6e27c45fd2f31a6f6478812de13c53b","node_id":"C_kwDOADLKPNoAKGE4MTlhOGIxZTZlMjdjNDVmZDJmMzFhNmY2NDc4ODEyZGUxM2M1M2I","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/getsentry/sentry-javascript/commit/095f48573393c791fd548ab70dd3a513df671bc2","sha":"095f48573393c791fd548ab70dd3a513df671bc2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getsentry/sentry-javascript/commits/095f48573393c791fd548ab70dd3a513df671bc2"}],"sha":"a819a8b1e6e27c45fd2f31a6f6478812de13c53b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getsentry/sentry-javascript/commits/a819a8b1e6e27c45fd2f31a6f6478812de13c53b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/29110?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/dependabot","id":49699333,"login":"dependabot[bot]","node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDk2OTkzMzM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getsentry/sentry-javascript/commits/095f48573393c791fd548ab70dd3a513df671bc2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T15:07:39Z","email":"49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"dependabot[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T15:07:39Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore(deps-dev): bump nx from 22.7.7 to 22.7.10 (#25075)\n\nBumps [nx](https://github.com/nrwl/nx/tree/HEAD/packages/nx) from 22.7.7\nto 22.7.10.\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a href=\"https://github.com/nrwl/nx/releases\">nx''s\nreleases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>22.7.10 (2026-09-09)</h2>\n<h3>🩹 Fixes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>core:</strong> validate the migrations path before\nextracting package migrations (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/nrwl/nx/pull/36887\">#36887</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>❤️ Thank You</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Jason Jean <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/FrozenPandaz\"><code>@​FrozenPandaz</code></a></li>\n<li>Leosvel Pérez Espinosa <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/leosvelperez\"><code>@​leosvelperez</code></a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>22.7.9 (2026-09-01)</h2>\n<h3>🩹 Fixes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>core:</strong> restrict daemon and plugin worker socket\naccess to the owning user (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/nrwl/nx/pull/36370\">#36370</a>, <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/nrwl/nx/issues/36586\">#36586</a>, <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/nrwl/nx/issues/36463\">#36463</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>core:</strong> compare daemon workspace roots\ncase-insensitively on Windows (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/nrwl/nx/pull/36835\">#36835</a>, <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/nrwl/nx/issues/36722\">#36722</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>core:</strong> close daemon log descriptors after spawn to\navoid Node 26 crash (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/nrwl/nx/pull/36280\">#36280</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>core:</strong> port quoteShellArg helper for no-shell spawn\nfixes (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/nrwl/nx/issues/36215\">#36215</a>, <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/nrwl/nx/issues/36626\">#36626</a>, <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/nrwl/nx/issues/35954\">#35954</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>maven:</strong> stop running maven and gradle graph analysis\nthrough a shell (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/nrwl/nx/pull/36626\">#36626</a>, <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/nrwl/nx/issues/36215\">#36215</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>❤️ Thank You</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>AgentEnder <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/AgentEnder\"><code>@​AgentEnder</code></a></li>\n<li>Craigory Coppola <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/AgentEnder\"><code>@​AgentEnder</code></a></li>\n<li>FrozenPandaz <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/FrozenPandaz\"><code>@​FrozenPandaz</code></a></li>\n<li>Jason Jean <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/FrozenPandaz\"><code>@​FrozenPandaz</code></a></li>\n<li>Jelle Bruisten <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/JelleBruisten\"><code>@​JelleBruisten</code></a></li>\n<li>Leosvel Pérez Espinosa <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/leosvelperez\"><code>@​leosvelperez</code></a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>22.7.8 (2026-07-30)</h2>\n<h3>🩹 Fixes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>angular-rspack:</strong> dispose stylesheet bundler so\none-shot builds exit (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/nrwl/nx/pull/35869\">#35869</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>core:</strong> use workspace package manager when fetching\nmigrations via install (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/nrwl/nx/pull/35866\">#35866</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>core:</strong> omit peer dependencies when installing\npackages to a temp dir (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/nrwl/nx/pull/36295\">#36295</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>core:</strong> prevent shell injection in nx import (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/nrwl/nx/pull/36348\">#36348</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>core:</strong> stop passing git revisions through a shell in\naffected commands (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/nrwl/nx/pull/36379\">#36379</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>core:</strong> allow nx build scripts in generated\npnpm-workspace.yaml (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/nrwl/nx/pull/35564\">#35564</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>core:</strong> acknowledge <code>@​swc/core</code> build\nscript in generated pnpm-workspace.yaml (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/nrwl/nx/issues/35608\">#35608</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>core:</strong> keep real dependencies when omitting peers\nfrom npm temp installs (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/nrwl/nx/pull/36518\">#36518</a>, <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/nrwl/nx/issues/36295\">#36295</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>core:</strong> bump pinned axios and brace-expansion past\nvulnerable versions (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/nrwl/nx/pull/36507\">#36507</a>, <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/nrwl/nx/issues/36474\">#36474</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>detox:</strong> resolve jest versions locally instead of\nimporting <code>@​nx/jest</code> internals (<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/nrwl/nx/commit/3ce3f6ab6e\">3ce3f6ab6e</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>docker:</strong> run release pipeline docker commands\nwithout a shell (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/nrwl/nx/pull/36505\">#36505</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>js:</strong> exclude typescript 7 from supported versions on\n22.7.x (<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/nrwl/nx/commit/dc804964e9\">dc804964e9</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>js:</strong> resolve the verdaccio bin through its\npackage.json (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/nrwl/nx/pull/36479\">#36479</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>misc:</strong> use default import for chalk in\n<code>@​nx/workspace</code> output.ts (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/nrwl/nx/pull/35523\">#35523</a>, <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/nrwl/nx/issues/35521\">#35521</a>, <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/nrwl/nx/issues/34111\">#34111</a>, <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/nrwl/nx/issues/21201\">#21201</a>, <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/nrwl/nx/issues/26667\">#26667</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>repo:</strong> use default inputs instead of the ''...'' token\nin nx-dev on 22.7.x (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/nrwl/nx/issues/35530\">#35530</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>repo:</strong> trust wix/brew tap so macOS detox CI can\ninstall applesimutils (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/nrwl/nx/pull/36146\">#36146</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- raw HTML omitted -->\n</blockquote>\n<p>... (truncated)</p>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/nrwl/nx/commit/38cd82a0c05e8212e538bdb87ccb198d6504e58f\"><code>38cd82a</code></a>\nfix(core): validate the migrations path before extracting package\nmigrations ...</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/nrwl/nx/commit/02c5d59e8dbbbe30963c0181c6a22cd8c1190a25\"><code>02c5d59</code></a>\nfix(maven): stop running maven and gradle graph analysis through a shell\n(<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/nrwl/nx/tree/HEAD/packages/nx/issues/36\">#36</a>...</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/nrwl/nx/commit/81698b9e0b131cc043bd444abbbb10e9987e7157\"><code>81698b9</code></a>\nfix(core): port quoteShellArg helper for no-shell spawn fixes</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/nrwl/nx/commit/aa5dc40e85c123466d54c07f5d859161d5772920\"><code>aa5dc40</code></a>\nfix(core): close daemon log descriptors after spawn to avoid Node 26\ncrash (#...</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/nrwl/nx/commit/7f9e52886e7561611274e9011a0c921e716ca309\"><code>7f9e528</code></a>\nfix(core): compare daemon workspace roots case-insensitively on Windows\n(<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/nrwl/nx/tree/HEAD/packages/nx/issues/36835\">#36835</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/nrwl/nx/commit/71c2253b6aac23b008e192c4e2642c42a5e07545\"><code>71c2253</code></a>\nfix(core): restrict daemon and plugin worker socket access to the owning\nuser...</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/nrwl/nx/commit/f7afd77de568bc5f1edbd94e2c6b0707cdf52d68\"><code>f7afd77</code></a>\nfix(core): bump pinned axios and brace-expansion past vulnerable\nversions (<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/nrwl/nx/tree/HEAD/packages/nx/issues/3\">#3</a>...</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/nrwl/nx/commit/983413b1115d0caac0007152fb146d1a6e746591\"><code>983413b</code></a>\nfix(core): keep real dependencies when omitting peers from npm temp\ninstalls ...</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/nrwl/nx/commit/4159295a037fdbd8e7f44a33a19d85ab3792415b\"><code>4159295</code></a>\nfix(core): stop passing git revisions through a shell in affected\ncommands (#...</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/nrwl/nx/commit/cf996496bbad727362d48292b50fafc8c3665847\"><code>cf99649</code></a>\nfix(core): prevent shell injection in nx import (<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/nrwl/nx/tree/HEAD/packages/nx/issues/36348\">#36348</a>)</li>\n<li>Additional commits viewable in <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/nrwl/nx/commits/22.7.10/packages/nx\">compare\nview</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<br />\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: dependabot[bot] <support@github.com>\nCo-authored-by: dependabot[bot] <49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: sentry-junior[bot] <264270552+sentry-junior[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Charly Gomez <charly.gomez@sentry.io>\nCo-authored-by: Andrei <168741329+andreiborza@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"5cae250e3b49b8ff9aa06c8ed834e73d27026653","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getsentry/sentry-javascript/git/trees/5cae250e3b49b8ff9aa06c8ed834e73d27026653"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getsentry/sentry-javascript/git/commits/095f48573393c791fd548ab70dd3a513df671bc2","verification":{"payload":"tree 5cae250e3b49b8ff9aa06c8ed834e73d27026653\nparent 3cafe937afd096d88789fcc7089bc3b0e5c64c73\nauthor dependabot[bot] <49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1791299259 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791299259 +0200\n\nchore(deps-dev): bump nx from 22.7.7 to 22.7.10 (#25075)\n\nBumps [nx](https://github.com/nrwl/nx/tree/HEAD/packages/nx) from 22.7.7\nto 22.7.10.\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a href=\"https://github.com/nrwl/nx/releases\">nx''s\nreleases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>22.7.10 (2026-09-09)</h2>\n<h3>🩹 Fixes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>core:</strong> validate the migrations path before\nextracting package migrations (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/nrwl/nx/pull/36887\">#36887</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>❤️ Thank You</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Jason Jean <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/FrozenPandaz\"><code>@​FrozenPandaz</code></a></li>\n<li>Leosvel Pérez Espinosa <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/leosvelperez\"><code>@​leosvelperez</code></a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>22.7.9 (2026-09-01)</h2>\n<h3>🩹 Fixes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>core:</strong> restrict daemon and plugin worker socket\naccess to the owning user (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/nrwl/nx/pull/36370\">#36370</a>, <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/nrwl/nx/issues/36586\">#36586</a>, <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/nrwl/nx/issues/36463\">#36463</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>core:</strong> compare daemon workspace roots\ncase-insensitively on Windows (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/nrwl/nx/pull/36835\">#36835</a>, <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/nrwl/nx/issues/36722\">#36722</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>core:</strong> close daemon log descriptors after spawn to\navoid Node 26 crash (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/nrwl/nx/pull/36280\">#36280</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>core:</strong> port quoteShellArg helper for no-shell spawn\nfixes (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/nrwl/nx/issues/36215\">#36215</a>, <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/nrwl/nx/issues/36626\">#36626</a>, <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/nrwl/nx/issues/35954\">#35954</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>maven:</strong> stop running maven and gradle graph analysis\nthrough a shell (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/nrwl/nx/pull/36626\">#36626</a>, <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/nrwl/nx/issues/36215\">#36215</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>❤️ Thank You</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>AgentEnder <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/AgentEnder\"><code>@​AgentEnder</code></a></li>\n<li>Craigory Coppola <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/AgentEnder\"><code>@​AgentEnder</code></a></li>\n<li>FrozenPandaz <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/FrozenPandaz\"><code>@​FrozenPandaz</code></a></li>\n<li>Jason Jean <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/FrozenPandaz\"><code>@​FrozenPandaz</code></a></li>\n<li>Jelle Bruisten <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/JelleBruisten\"><code>@​JelleBruisten</code></a></li>\n<li>Leosvel Pérez Espinosa <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/leosvelperez\"><code>@​leosvelperez</code></a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>22.7.8 (2026-07-30)</h2>\n<h3>🩹 Fixes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>angular-rspack:</strong> dispose stylesheet bundler so\none-shot builds exit (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/nrwl/nx/pull/35869\">#35869</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>core:</strong> use workspace package manager when fetching\nmigrations via install (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/nrwl/nx/pull/35866\">#35866</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>core:</strong> omit peer dependencies when installing\npackages to a temp dir (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/nrwl/nx/pull/36295\">#36295</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>core:</strong> prevent shell injection in nx import (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/nrwl/nx/pull/36348\">#36348</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>core:</strong> stop passing git revisions through a shell in\naffected commands (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/nrwl/nx/pull/36379\">#36379</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>core:</strong> allow nx build scripts in generated\npnpm-workspace.yaml (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/nrwl/nx/pull/35564\">#35564</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>core:</strong> acknowledge <code>@​swc/core</code> build\nscript in generated pnpm-workspace.yaml (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/nrwl/nx/issues/35608\">#35608</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>core:</strong> keep real dependencies when omitting peers\nfrom npm temp installs (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/nrwl/nx/pull/36518\">#36518</a>, <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/nrwl/nx/issues/36295\">#36295</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>core:</strong> bump pinned axios and brace-expansion past\nvulnerable versions (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/nrwl/nx/pull/36507\">#36507</a>, <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/nrwl/nx/issues/36474\">#36474</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>detox:</strong> resolve jest versions locally instead of\nimporting <code>@​nx/jest</code> internals (<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/nrwl/nx/commit/3ce3f6ab6e\">3ce3f6ab6e</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>docker:</strong> run release pipeline docker commands\nwithout a shell (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/nrwl/nx/pull/36505\">#36505</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>js:</strong> exclude typescript 7 from supported versions on\n22.7.x (<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/nrwl/nx/commit/dc804964e9\">dc804964e9</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>js:</strong> resolve the verdaccio bin through its\npackage.json (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/nrwl/nx/pull/36479\">#36479</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>misc:</strong> use default import for chalk in\n<code>@​nx/workspace</code> output.ts (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/nrwl/nx/pull/35523\">#35523</a>, <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/nrwl/nx/issues/35521\">#35521</a>, <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/nrwl/nx/issues/34111\">#34111</a>, <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/nrwl/nx/issues/21201\">#21201</a>, <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/nrwl/nx/issues/26667\">#26667</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>repo:</strong> use default inputs instead of the ''...'' token\nin nx-dev on 22.7.x (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/nrwl/nx/issues/35530\">#35530</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>repo:</strong> trust wix/brew tap so macOS detox CI can\ninstall applesimutils (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/nrwl/nx/pull/36146\">#36146</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- raw HTML omitted -->\n</blockquote>\n<p>... (truncated)</p>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/nrwl/nx/commit/38cd82a0c05e8212e538bdb87ccb198d6504e58f\"><code>38cd82a</code></a>\nfix(core): validate the migrations path before extracting package\nmigrations ...<