hub.com/ljharb/shell-quote/issues/31)</code></a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Commits</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>[New] <code>parse</code>: support tab-stripping here-documents\n(<code>&amp;lt;&amp;lt;-</code>) <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ljharb/shell-quote/commit/dbfac376d4065d37539d3abdb5e76847f93797d3\"><code>dbfac37</code></a></li>\n<li>[New] <code>parse</code>: support output process substitution\n(<code>&amp;gt;(</code>) <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ljharb/shell-quote/commit/20533154bb57809c80f55318b8493aef49505f4e\"><code>2053315</code></a></li>\n<li>[New] <code>parse</code>: support the <code>case</code> test-next\nterminator (<code>;;&amp;</code>) <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ljharb/shell-quote/commit/7d688b9bec1917a22cccd4d4c887128a9c66e8a0\"><code>7d688b9</code></a></li>\n<li>[New] <code>parse</code>: support the <code>case</code> fall-through\nterminator (<code>;&amp;</code>) <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ljharb/shell-quote/commit/f27010ed04bcd925795b350afb1c49e36bbd1ba3\"><code>f27010e</code></a></li>\n<li>[New] <code>parse</code>: support redirecting output despite\n<code>noclobber</code> (<code>&amp;gt;|</code>) <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ljharb/shell-quote/commit/b78d19c14da6356cc12c46b3478203247ab8a295\"><code>b78d19c</code></a></li>\n<li>[New] <code>parse</code>: support opening a file for reading and\nwriting (<code>&amp;lt;&amp;gt;</code>) <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ljharb/shell-quote/commit/21cc333eb0ce5bf094f595b7fdc01b3447ffd4b0\"><code>21cc333</code></a></li>\n<li>[New] <code>parse</code>: support redirecting stdout and stderr\n(<code>&amp;&amp;gt;</code>) <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ljharb/shell-quote/commit/6ad6cd215f89adcc29dd601e085fa54083c2f911\"><code>6ad6cd2</code></a></li>\n<li>[New] <code>parse</code>: support appending stdout and stderr\n(<code>&amp;&amp;gt;&amp;gt;</code>) <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ljharb/shell-quote/commit/90cde9cfd8af30fcb65e9fd2cb2f9e181d3f103b\"><code>90cde9c</code></a></li>\n<li>[Dev Deps] update <code>@ljharb/eslint-config</code> <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ljharb/shell-quote/commit/3a7b4ae3960c3ff4413932e276c5b0ecb3a2b456\"><code>3a7b4ae</code></a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ljharb/shell-quote/compare/v1.10.0...v1.11.0\">v1.11.0</a>\n- 2026-09-29</h2>\n<h3>Fixed</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>[Refactor] <code>quote</code>: drop a replace that can never match\nin the single-quote branch <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/ljharb/shell-quote/issues/15\"><code>[#15](https://github.com/ljharb/shell-quote/issues/15)</code></a></li>\n<li>[New] <code>parse</code>: support bash ANSI-C quoting\n(<code>$''...''</code>) <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/ljharb/shell-quote/issues/32\"><code>[#32](https://github.com/ljharb/shell-quote/issues/32)</code></a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Commits</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>[Fix] <code>quote</code>: reject line terminators in tokens after a\n<code>comment</code> <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ljharb/shell-quote/commit/6002b2ed90c6b83095eb272b6b0adaf3a172b0bc\"><code>6002b2e</code></a></li>\n<li>[Fix] <code>parse</code>: preserve text after special shell\nparameters <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ljharb/shell-quote/commit/81b08a532e898a3627f9305fa13d643ffa82a9d3\"><code>81b08a5</code></a></li>\n<li>[Fix] <code>parse</code>: an escaped backslash does not escape the\ncharacter after it <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ljharb/shell-quote/commit/d708019016ce26e1a8a05af4b296e35ef8095c9e\"><code>d708019</code></a></li>\n<li>[Fix] <code>quote</code>: preserve <code>!</code> in arguments that\nalso contain <code>''</code> <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ljharb/shell-quote/commit/ad399279dbbbd086967d2040c1558b4888b074e6\"><code>ad39927</code></a></li>\n<li>[Fix] <code>parse</code>: treat <code>$_name</code> as a variable\nname, not <code>$_</code> followed by text <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ljharb/shell-quote/commit/28f88cd422ae4046aca9556c4b74ca90b0ea7f6b\"><code>28f88cd</code></a></li>\n<li>[Fix] <code>quote</code>: preserve empty glob patterns <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ljharb/shell-quote/commit/35c9b97a744211091b772f145bef0b6a5562b68e\"><code>35c9b97</code></a></li>\n<li>[Fix] <code>quote</code>: escape <code>~</code> in glob patterns to\nprevent shell tilde-expansion <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ljharb/shell-quote/commit/239d49cae6d231436ea4e676850037018c790c49\"><code>239d49c</code></a></li>\n<li>[Dev Deps] update <code>@ljharb/eslint-config</code>,\n<code>auto-changelog</code>, <code>eslint</code>, <code>evalmd</code> <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ljharb/shell-quote/commit/b1e406ed4287a134cc649db47b9a59e21b304472\"><code>b1e406e</code></a></li>\n<li>[meta] npmignore some files <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ljharb/shell-quote/commit/ebfc3080cf5f68db5edfddfba49dc8c4ccacd2d5\"><code>ebfc308</code></a></li>\n<li>[actions] add permissions <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ljharb/shell-quote/commit/3429b0d349211786765e9e68478e029d96ad44e9\"><code>3429b0d</code></a></li>\n<li>[actions] set least-privilege <code>cache-mode</code> <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ljharb/shell-quote/commit/36f23944db50dd3f0df4da9c7cba0bb63df05f64\"><code>36f2394</code></a></li>\n<li>[Dev Deps] update <code>eslint</code> <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ljharb/shell-quote/commit/6de9a41ecfc4fe9f9546df08866c8ead039f8909\"><code>6de9a41</code></a></li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ljharb/shell-quote/commit/6ecb8aa618ba6dc6c3b087fce6d7660320d2adeb\"><code>6ecb8aa</code></a>\nv1.12.0</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ljharb/shell-quote/commit/3a7b4ae3960c3ff4413932e276c5b0ecb3a2b456\"><code>3a7b4ae</code></a>\n[Dev Deps] update <code>@ljharb/eslint-config</code></li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ljharb/shell-quote/commit/7d688b9bec1917a22cccd4d4c887128a9c66e8a0\"><code>7d688b9</code></a>\n[New] <code>parse</code>: support the <code>case</code> test-next\nterminator (<code>;;&amp;</code>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ljharb/shell-quote/commit/f27010ed0