\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/vaibhavmashal\"><code>@​vaibhavmashal</code></a>\nmade their first contribution in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/expressjs/compression/pull/286\">expressjs/compression#286</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Full Changelog</strong>: <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/expressjs/compression/compare/v1.8.1...v1.8.2\">https://github.com/expressjs/compression/compare/v1.8.1...v1.8.2</a></p>\n</blockquote>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Changelog</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/expressjs/compression/blob/master/HISTORY.md\">compression''s\nchangelog</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h1>1.8.2</h1>\n<ul>\n<li>Fix <a\nhref=\"https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-2026-87776\">CVE-2026-87776</a>\n(<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/expressjs/compression/security/advisories/GHSA-vc2v-76pw-4v95\">GHSA-vc2v-76pw-4v95</a>)</li>\n<li>deps: add destroy@1.2.0</li>\n<li>Match <code>Cache-Control: no-transform</code> directive\ncase-insensitively</li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/expressjs/compression/commit/0f9707417bd53d41a319fce8bdb80dfa08b435c8\"><code>0f97074</code></a>\n1.8.2 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/expressjs/compression/issues/287\">#287</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/expressjs/compression/commit/151f63e91e1b64f8fb0b064e19321a4f28db6bff\"><code>151f63e</code></a>\nfix: destroy compression stream on response close</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/expressjs/compression/commit/0a764956691bede2b62c711598ee65ea643d3b1e\"><code>0a76495</code></a>\nfix: match Cache-Control no-transform directive case-insensitively (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/expressjs/compression/issues/286\">#286</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/expressjs/compression/commit/c17b6e58ac914c84d9e3a64130dcc428e0e26887\"><code>c17b6e5</code></a>\ndocs: update outdated Brotli note and fix npm install docs URL (<a\nhref=\"https:/