tar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10677263?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JPeer264/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JPeer264/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JPeer264/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JPeer264/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JPeer264","id":10677263,"login":"JPeer264","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNjc3MjYz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JPeer264/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JPeer264/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JPeer264/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JPeer264/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JPeer264/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JPeer264","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getsentry/sentry-javascript/commits/92d9b8a819da3c7a63a332c0204ed10d6618ac5c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T14:05:08Z","email":"jan.peer@sentry.io","name":"Jan Peer Stöcklmair"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T14:05:08Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"ref(nextjs): Move the server span hooks into `serverSpanHooks.ts` (#24997)\n\nMoves the client hooks and the `ignoreSpans` list of the server `init`\ninto `addNextjsServerSpanHooks` and `NEXTJS_SERVER_IGNORE_SPANS`, next\nto `handleOnSpanStart`. `@sentry/nextjs/cloudflare` registers the same\nhooks on the client of `@sentry/cloudflare`. In their new place next to\n`handleOnSpanStart`, they need no import of the server `init` module, so\nthe Worker does not load `@sentry/node` or the code that this module\nruns on load. No behavior change.\n\nThis PR prepares for the next stacked PRs, as the `index.ts` is, as\nsaid, importing from `@sentry/node`, but we would only be interested in\nthe smaller pieces which are now refactored\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d1997d9bc27e9541e7f2af274d4850ee8812c431","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getsentry/sentry-javascript/git/trees/d1997d9bc27e9541e7f2af274d4850ee8812c431"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getsentry/sentry-javascript/git/commits/92d9b8a819da3c7a63a332c0204ed10d6618ac5c","verification":{"payload":"tree d1997d9bc27e9541e7f2af274d4850ee8812c431\nparent 345064dae7016c2c48a15f6f1bcbdb87b00fd5f1\nauthor Jan Peer Stöcklmair <jan.peer@sentry.io> 1791295508 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791295508 +0200\n\nref(nextjs): Move the server span hooks into `serverSpanHooks.ts` (#24997)\n\nMoves the client hooks and the `ignoreSpans` list of the server `init`\ninto `addNextjsServerSpanHooks` and `NEXTJS_SERVER_IGNORE_SPANS`, next\nto `handleOnSpanStart`. `@sentry/nextjs/cloudflare` registers the same\nhooks on the client of `@sentry/cloudflare`. In their new place next to\n`handleOnSpanStart`, they need no import of the server `init` module, so\nthe Worker does not load `@sentry/node` or the code that this module\nruns on load. No behavior change.\n\nThis PR prepares for the next stacked PRs, as the `index.ts` is, as\nsaid, importing from `@sentry/node`, but we would only be interested in\nthe smaller pieces which are now refactored\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxQAUCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAjIQQAF2Bz591GpqLnR4QJSm3bx9o\nJ58woSxZdrx2LzZDEPZCALG0npsz86MXdOst8M++I/IJNKglLGYMprsWCsQMLYeW\nWWB1ApKEyYvouXuLjyntPq87+g38YZkxIwfYqPY0vVtb1Glf3LwyiWmGTRF0Eofe\nsT/nKE+V/y9OIlTbd9MjImXtnGN1RA6mdWJEbi+MBK/A8000cTGX1x/6TMMb00EE\nn7xmLUT/nKYkWSMkBI5VISDP7R9Jji9rGEGvciGRlbGuuCohdgWXV6CwQ0COhkE7\nBz/cu4bkYQ2a8poBX8CbPuFvIoGkX5IG8GYLhtCU/KJEx3wH7+24DVfXUjxgVl9M\nkfEV+8Y6ql5FbcC4t2Kck/MqZgbpVLzbY9QIMbY9D9j13mxbq38bPw960RM9D1er\ni5mLoezeucYaGOflUrqovpxypLQdt/CFXL