every PR.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"561e6be61f8d3d430d2e956723794a1ddec5f50b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getsentry/sentry-javascript/git/trees/561e6be61f8d3d430d2e956723794a1ddec5f50b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getsentry/sentry-javascript/git/commits/6ba1c6811b0eefd1038a2b63c400978114295f59","verification":{"payload":"tree 561e6be61f8d3d430d2e956723794a1ddec5f50b\nparent d79f44cbe78f84f91b846ae04a8f3c40a5b5bb18\nauthor Andrei <168741329+andreiborza@users.noreply.github.com> 1791286074 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791286074 +0200\n\ntest(e2e): Raise mock Sentry server chunk size to fit whole bundles (#25097)\n\n## What\n\nThe mock Sentry server now asks the CLI to upload each artifact bundle\nas one chunk.\n\n## Why\n\nNuxt 4.6 makes the server bundle of `nuxt-4-sourcemaps` larger than 8\nMiB. The CLI then splits it into chunks that the mock server cannot\nread, so the static variant fails on every PR.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxNs6CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAFaUQADpY1JXKusWgWNbQiuAJiXIF\nXobVI+uGvlUCB3jk7H6IrSM0tRHoZsIzEBqIt3FxU8xFtKCzlNyp7RGkPTVsdchf\nnRO6RtU5cEAp8pqXm2EltZiUo0HHzxWRln5jBRbCJiLQ+NJFnFUXnmMjmmJAGTT6\nqAhhB/G8HfRvSyyWroU7aTglQmVWPLrtQ5ptNuQ8oxJb3Auhv5KEI4x2l1CPptKh\nygrcIk5Q6toK4z43lLCkvzObD2U7DZPZzSwVSHIQr6Vx75k1ZQ2sfwMjL9j2A3Os\n1PlnGR24kmSdTKH2sizPSew9GC6gwql3j8zqV7vKNd/da8P58bUxXvxvAphMpWIK\nyqFFrh5mUefsRgSnejRDeioMDzsYrDHNWkpbsRJF0mO09FTeIgZmNoM7BR38wmzP\nBwo+mfcWTg6oRbR+fZ3rCtb4+fcUKvninlMlferhMe64i53LUZ1XUG/CQVCxpFsp\nDZ5PSixdhknFXI8Qt797Vk34QRCJ7p/aYVyoGynhZUIiKOl7PxKQJpNGgPaEIlNH\n5riLhYrH9dJDL8eBKLnYV1SMReAEJFZBgJL7RxLef8vfhojlzKQ+XKV6gVM11+8M\nCWmlywqPufxvwNXs936SzELQIgJ6wQzoy1AI1nN1r5MDr8U111BUl8N++qHX3Zpb\nEe8oMT6Ab1ho3a/Ro9Bu\n=cCM1\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-06T11:27:54Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/getsentry/sentry-javascript/commit/6ba1c6811b0eefd1038a2b63c400978114295f59","node_id":"C_kwDOADLKPNoAKDZiYTFjNjgxMWIwZWVmZDEwMzhhMmI2M2M0MDA5NzgxMTQyOTVmNTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/getsentry/sentry-javascript/commit/d79f44cbe78f84f91b846ae04a8f3c40a5b5bb18","sha":"d79f44cbe78f84f91b846ae04a8f3c40a5b5bb18","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getsentry/sentry-javascript/commits/d79f44cbe78f84f91b846ae04a8f3c40a5b5bb18"}],"sha":"6ba1c6811b0eefd1038a2b63c400978114295f59","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getsentry/sentry-javascript/commits/6ba1c6811b0eefd1038a2b63c400978114295f59"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32902192?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/s1gr1d/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/s1gr1d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/s1gr1d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/s1gr1d/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/s1gr1d","id":32902192,"login":"s1gr1d","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyOTAyMTky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/s1gr1d/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/s1gr1d/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/s1gr1d/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/s1gr1d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/s1gr1d/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/s1gr1d","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getsentry/sentry-javascript/commits/d79f44cbe78f84f91b846ae04a8f3c40a5b5bb18/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T09:59:01Z","email":"32902192+s1gr1d@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Sigrid"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T09:59:01Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(nuxt): Do not inject debug IDs into the SSR build (#25080)\n\nNuxt server source maps can still resolve to wrong lines (more info in\n#18519).\n\nNitro bundles Nuxt''s SSR build again. The Sentry Vite plugin also ran on\nthe SSR build, so its debug IDs got into Nitro''s output. Many server\nfiles used such an ID instead of Nitro''s own, and both builds uploaded\ndifferent maps under that ID.\n\nThe Vite plugin now runs only on the client build. Nitro''s plugin\nuploads the server maps, which already point to the original sources.\n\nThe e2e test now checks that each shipped file has one debug ID,\nresolving to exactly one map generated for that file.\n\nFixes #18974","tree":{"sha":"ad56854ac676447bd3be4baed88c87b45ae94490","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getsentry/sentry-javascript/git/trees/ad56854ac676447bd3be4baed88c87b45ae94490"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getsentry/sentry-javascript/git/commits/d79f44cbe78f84f91b846ae04a8f3c40a5b5bb18","verification":{"payload":"tree ad56854ac676447bd3be4baed88c87b45ae94490\nparent c8805d82391269612b61ae319022df7387c36f2c\nauthor Sigrid <32902192+s1gr1d@users.noreply.github.com> 1791280741 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791280741 +0200\n\nfix(nuxt): Do not inject debug IDs into the SSR build (#25080)\n\nNuxt server source maps can still resolve to wrong lines (more info in\n#18519).\n\nNitro bundles Nuxt''s SSR build again. The Sentry Vite plugin also ran on\nthe SSR build, so its debug IDs got into Nitro''s output. Many server\nfiles used such an ID instead of Nitro''s own, and both builds uploaded\ndifferent maps under that ID.\n\nThe Vite plugin now runs only on the client build. Nitro''s plugin\nuploads the server maps, which already point to the original sources.\n\nThe e2e test now checks that each shipped file has one debug ID,\nresolving to exactly one map generated for that file.\n\nFixes #18974","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxMZlCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAwpUQAAZiInIeSPRIE/yvQQ+++ZS5\nJVcsTDAIQNEZxyebAx0sebFrv8QHdk5HHGavTmkVhD0tz5oAM+FAlE9Uw+0OEolb\nacNsnO7FMfWIm5LCpKIFM5WjsqWNgoVSJFq3/ZKPYyv//Tt48zCtAUWohSWZZbTw\nu3I4P41IXiwIfqMdWLo433c2h5TTXyuCkn+fQwQREFiS+nf0EnVDYIi/f8RRUDJb\n6mrHqXNiY4WHfffx5jM74lNTs1DcWOLu1zpWwC7gCfRTkJbL37tZqckUPHEZGe1L\nRtkUfnkGot2BOwWoR/Rqc9TqIaQeFwXfkiyWFWTe2fo3Vw4d0u6jvWgVthHsdmzH\n2OvnRuMHFRoLTogUsO9QvvVkpF9TO159fAxAnHyRaZl1LMgYIQ8u2l+D2pL6c12q\nGPVvc9yLXIUdjh6iE2MVJQk9n8SCTOwpdV59ca0RV6UbYwng4eXfB9uRqn/vdym8\nVa2wzVa2NdPO+j5db9rbbsHx6xubyIp6uPo771YFcjBl/hVTreiwmiWUyploNwoH\nynQ0xSNZI2gnTk2EYJ6AE8+dgB94vClnn26wem3iR+uI+N5F06lupluMNP7s2eKE\nyMHV+VmoR5lYh/J9IkQ4qCOELITyUjUoSkAVGfQO1zR1SQ2TfTVhMwQZ4gjVvfgR\n/fFqbajcYhCu1EPWXEk+\n=jak9\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-06T09:59:01Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gis