api.github.com/users/chargome/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chargome/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chargome/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chargome/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chargome","id":20254395,"login":"chargome","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMjU0Mzk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chargome/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chargome/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chargome/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chargome/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chargome/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chargome","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getsentry/sentry-javascript/commits/f2fc75c764a6ff6d9e372dd3a272e6a47000b3c4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T08:38:08Z","email":"charly.gomez1310@gmail.com","name":"Charly Gomez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T08:38:08Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(remix): Report the matched route on Remix 3 HTML responses (#25052)\n\nThe browser has no route table: `remix/component` never matches routes\nclient side and exposes no matched pattern. The server middleware\nalready resolves the pattern for the server span, so it now also reports\nit on HTML responses through a `Server-Timing: sentry-route` entry, the\nsame channel the Remix 2 SDK and Nitro use for trace data.\n\nNothing reads it yet; the browser SDK does in the next PRs of this\nstack.\n\nPart of #24872\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"61d8736fa4d452000c2e8603fc26b1e7cca664df","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getsentry/sentry-javascript/git/trees/61d8736fa4d452000c2e8603fc26b1e7cca664df"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getsentry/sentry-javascript/git/commits/f2fc75c764a6ff6d9e372dd3a272e6a47000b3c4","verification":{"payload":"tree 61d8736fa4d452000c2e8603fc26b1e7cca664df\nparent 95c11468c0188aca1ffcdb1f9b7d44ae1799f3fa\nauthor Charly Gomez <charly.gomez1310@gmail.com> 1791275888 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791275888 +0200\n\nfeat(remix): Report the matched route on Remix 3 HTML responses (#25052)\n\nThe browser has no route table: `remix/component` never matches routes\nclient side and exposes no matched pattern. The server middleware\nalready resolves the pattern for the server span, so it now also reports\nit on HTML responses through a `Server-Timing: sentry-route` entry, the\nsame channel the Remix 2 SDK and Nitro use for trace data.\n\nNothing reads it yet; the browser SDK does in the next PRs of this\nstack.\n\nPart of #24872\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxLNwCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAt1oQACJgbB1X5w3tDSoTNx5QJxoQ\nvZNRv7JhWcSRbLIVTpxvwE1cEtqQCRBuvFsy8BzV6pPCtwZhhWpCsNiNDnpI+yUB\n0SF2yxc4fWnvyMAwo1qoYae0XSy7jaPkRNDgzfnFzI4O2kTqKLaKaLPF1fD/SEMj\nhYjgoPKzZRgRTueRHsNHe0hC+RyTWyiEivM1EFieNiJMH/uxHVKJBJBt3EI814HW\niseb99Kod3rvdaxnM6xe9uyllpIOHzjFIa+XsGRFd8mAkSbM5G9NndWToxCU+ih2\nwCStItfy+f7AF89M+yDcgu4n/P4uz+5GfHDjFIKTMdFQtAY0JRq93yYeR+3+5ywH\nrghdlYGVAtyZ/U1B0LtEA8S253cwcVR6bHTFlQwcriiWFfiIrpNBJ4FG/NVhFY7S\nMa8LERd+wUzqu0ZauOYVJhhQzNxLNBcVAAOdCp55PbaRCIuPUyvz41mNZ6YvJHQE\n15S7+Scmxax+3LmL0W3g2qPQmoa/UjEJbXDQ6C9H9MXYudMNNV/I2cvAexrbc0R8\n67VHa9DkiFU2YF3yCNcoRBBHhZakl7MRkj7ogPrcddainnPiqkQWYRhbfVSIUsuU\nwO11ouLhJjS8lh+kX/rq0STCwP9l6aALyx9oYhRieYniAwJgfrmf6CGF3zxho8fo\nkxinCSVpbIoxZEe4w2F5\n=yXka\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-06T08:38:08Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"htt