api.github.com/users/sentry-junior%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sentry-junior%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sentry-junior%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sentry-junior%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sentry-junior%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sentry-junior%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getsentry/sentry-javascript/commits/95c11468c0188aca1ffcdb1f9b7d44ae1799f3fa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T08:25:19Z","email":"264270552+sentry-junior[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"sentry-junior[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T08:25:19Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore(deps): Bump `@sentry/conventions` to 0.26.0 (#25073)\n\n`@sentry/conventions` 0.26.0 adds the `GEN_AI_EVALUATE` op constant, so\nthe Vercel AI, TypeSafe and Workers AI integrations now import it\ninstead of hardcoding `gen_ai.evaluate` or building it with\n`getGenAiSpanOp(''evaluate'')`. The emitted op is unchanged.\n\nBeyond that, the release only adds new exports (no renames or removals),\nso nothing else needed to change.\n\n<!-- junior-request-attribution:start -->\nvia **Andrei Borza**.\n<!-- junior-request-attribution:end -->\n\n<!-- junior-session-footer:start -->\n<!-- junior-conversation-id:slack%3AC0BKK9QLCUA%3A1791196396.229419 -->\n\n--\n\n[View Junior\nSession](https://junior-prod.sentry.dev/conversations/slack%3AC0BKK9QLCUA%3A1791196396.229419)\n[[Sentry]](https://sentry.sentry.io/explore/conversations/slack%3AC0BKK9QLCUA%3A1791196396.229419/?project=4510944073809921)\n\n<!-- junior-session-footer:end -->\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: sentry-junior[bot] <264270552+sentry-junior[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Andrei Borza <andrei.borza@sentry.io>","tree":{"sha":"b950c2fe4eafbf627e78366f6baa78f29d3ce5f7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getsentry/sentry-javascript/git/trees/b950c2fe4eafbf627e78366f6baa78f29d3ce5f7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getsentry/sentry-javascript/git/commits/95c11468c0188aca1ffcdb1f9b7d44ae1799f3fa","verification":{"payload":"tree b950c2fe4eafbf627e78366f6baa78f29d3ce5f7\nparent 24b945d0bb5b7642f2586696943fb6ce952901d2\nauthor sentry-junior[bot] <264270552+sentry-junior[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1791275119 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791275119 +0200\n\nchore(deps): Bump `@sentry/conventions` to 0.26.0 (#25073)\n\n`@sentry/conventions` 0.26.0 adds the `GEN_AI_EVALUATE` op constant, so\nthe Vercel AI, TypeSafe and Workers AI integrations now import it\ninstead of hardcoding `gen_ai.evaluate` or building it with\n`getGenAiSpanOp(''evaluate'')`. The emitted op is unchanged.\n\nBeyond that, the release only adds new exports (no renames or removals),\nso nothing else needed to change.\n\n<!-- junior-request-attribution:start -->\nvia **Andrei Borza**.\n<!-- junior-request-attribution:end -->\n\n<!-- junior-session-footer:start -->\n<!-- junior-conversation-id:slack%3AC0BKK9QLCUA%3A1791196396.229419 -->\n\n--\n\n[View Junior\nSession](https://junior-prod.sentry.dev/conversations/slack%3AC0BKK9QLCUA%3A1791196396.229419)\n[[Sentry]](https://sentry.sentry.io/explore/conversations/slack%3AC0BKK9QLCUA%3A1791196396.229419/?project=4510944073809921)\n\n<!-- junior-session-footer:end -->\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: sentry-junior[bot] <264270552+sentry-junior[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Andrei Borza <andrei.borza@sentry.io>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxLBvCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAhe0QACw7IBhLW1caclrSYWzVegvp\noBFEUjMDbTqcJ2PJMy3flB7UU07a13p7YpvQy8GtREjdmhwc3a9/fkwEPozIbfUd\nJ9v7+wumQW+CuURWA3ZM/Kk1zC8rvNeYSrfScmkdpaB/2btNUQ9u6iJ08ZcQkC7P\nyAjG92igyscOlnwsqGlBPyZ2HiNkTEPi8p+MALufYY+HwA5K6BCepciy8