:{"account":{"login":"web-flow","providerType":"User"},"email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T17:19:06.418Z","repositoryId":3678731,"sha":"1d8600a369f13a1705c24a0ef94c41ec709b59a4"},{"author":{"account":{"login":"aryanraj45","providerType":"User"},"email":"143009186+aryanraj45@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Raj Aryan"},"authoredDate":"2026-10-05T10:05:14Z","committedDate":"2026-10-05T10:05:14Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"web-flow","providerType":"User"},"email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T17:19:06.418Z","repositoryId":3678731,"sha":"7b3cf6268d5ef56561ddaa4f035408fc189a610d"},{"author":{"account":{"login":"bjohansebas","providerType":"User"},"email":"bjohansebas@gmail.com","name":"Sebastian Beltran"},"authoredDate":"2026-10-05T09:28:56Z","committedDate":"2026-10-05T09:28:56Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"web-flow","providerType":"User"},"email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T17:19:06.418Z","repositoryId":3678731,"sha":"6509b726507f89266557027be52f996d24b9f487"},{"author":{"account":{"login":"alexander-akait","providerType":"User"},"email":"4567934+alexander-akait@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Alexander Akait"},"authoredDate":"2026-10-05T09:23:45Z","committedDate":"2026-10-05T09:23:45Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"web-flow","providerType":"User"},"email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T17:19:06.418Z","repositoryId":3678731,"sha":"f93514ea63d869111931038db85fc74be801975f"}],"observedAt":"2026-10-08T17:19:06.418Z","raw":[{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4567934?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alexander-akait","id":4567934,"login":"alexander-akait","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1Njc5MzQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/commits/30a9de51d7642e2f88fa903dd472495aeee19857/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T15:58:24Z","email":"4567934+alexander-akait@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Alexander Akait"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T15:58:24Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"test: wait 1000 ms between watch steps on macOS (#22551)\n\n* test: wait 1000 ms between watch steps on macOS\n\nmacOS''s watcher sometimes misses a change copied in 200 ms after the\nprevious build, as two WatchCacheUnaffectedTestCases steps did on CI.\n\n* test: wait for every watched change a step made instead of a longer macOS delay\n\nmacOS can report one step''s changes over more than the 50 ms aggregate\ntimeout, so the first build reuses the stale cached module of a file whose\nevent came late. The watch harness now skips a build that has not reported\nevery watched file the step changed and takes the rebuild the late change\nstarts, so macOS keeps the 200 ms step delay.\n\n* test: use the short watch step waits under Deno and Bun too\n\nThe harness now waits for every watched change a step made, which was\nwhat Deno and Bun needed the long waits for.","tree":{"sha":"8f8f5fdcd0856a2d520341c38fe0ebfad431d7b0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/git/trees/8f8f5fdcd0856a2d520341c38fe0ebfad431d7b0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/git/commits/30a9de51d7642e2f88fa903dd472495aeee19857","verification":{"payload":"tree 8f8f5fdcd0856a2d520341c38fe0ebfad431d7b0\nparent 1e0f8af5c70eb6873b3b55ba006219262ef30e92\nauthor Alexander Akait <4567934+alexander-akait@users.noreply.github.com> 1791475104 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791475104 +0300\n\ntest: wait 1000 ms between watch steps on macOS (#22551)\n\n* test: wait 1000 ms between watch steps on macOS\n\nmacOS''s watcher sometimes misses a change copied in 200 ms after the\nprevious build, as two WatchCacheUnaffectedTestCases steps did on CI.\n\n* test: wait for every watched change a step made instead of a longer macOS delay\n\nmacOS can report one step''s changes over more than the 50 ms aggregate\ntimeout, so the first build reuses the stale cached module of a file whose\nevent came late. The watch harness now skips a build that has not reported\nevery watched file the step changed and takes the rebuild the late change\nstarts, so macOS keeps the 200 ms step delay.\n\n* test: use the short watch step waits under Deno and Bun too\n\nThe harness now waits for every watched change a step made, which was\nwhat Deno and Bun needed the long waits for.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqx72gCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA550QADwnxP5iDcAjxY/VDVV/PaPc\nfnLNaCSGDMZaCmak5d4zNMUY+y435gX3wFN57m4vE1fJjIbLHK6cjkLPkGIIBBZE\nvY1Y/4x8mK3MwyeGSfiBTlF9z8RQ9vKzQE3/LKV8MkwKWUrSz/IGyNZ1gKkqW2Ga\njSgWeGumLko9oexoEmEl9rgP3GfDYr5gIzTuhp7kG60Vhyq+x3VEfFSFI2Nd3gBD\noOsx8f9wO3X3HR6mYXcCpoWTnC+tEMckcwjwmxguucnHp0F8CZmAn3qWoOz9FnRf\nlW4LQ+Oarp1GQViV2QxWz2gDuTL4rg6VjxrirbmNeEa0oyuZ4nj1Y3OpjaGuDu1u\nCWJBb24CGfZKMWlWIKJyOI+yZIBDlyMUYxlx1fLQr9iV0ANN0rs7IF8hp419CUxa\n1oOriMpR+DDEFhkQkRTsRBmEL38Ll32eWe9M5mG+Kz1coKYTS+Q2vLtd/OsHJkgn\n0GFEMK8AmGrolcjOQbSA90Qjpac6Ry4LwFRo0elFZN2pQUVYSwwbtNK4WroC8zcv\nlSzvPlnHdnvAZiDZpwFAOIYLoI4kKyQLNNGjlpF4Y+cRgVvN0lGkeQtW5fKBn/tl