"alexander-akait","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1Njc5MzQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/commits/3f390df2c9e49309b901a45c9f474a0cac7237b5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T13:01:28Z","email":"4567934+alexander-akait@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Alexander Akait"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T13:01:28Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"perf(javascript): number the minifier''s tokens instead of building one object each (#22530)\n\nParser-made nodes now hold their start and end tokens as numbers into a\nper-file token table kept on the toplevel, and readers resolve a number\nonly when they need the token: comments, source mappings, error\npositions and the few compressor checks reading a token''s value. The\ntoken objects the parser used to build for every node are no longer\nallocated; minifying typescript.js allocates 1111.6 MB, down from\n1170.5 MB.\n\nA tree read onto another (`wrap`, `enclose`, several files) numbers its\ntokens after that tree''s, a `global_defs` source resolves its tokens\nbefore it joins the file''s tree, and a `new Function` body compresses\nwith its own tree''s tables.","tree":{"sha":"de41a7d3862577b1ebcefd0161056f2425afd898","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/git/trees/de41a7d3862577b1ebcefd0161056f2425afd898"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/git/commits/3f390df2c9e49309b901a45c9f474a0cac7237b5","verification":{"payload":"tree de