"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/commits/d142b8b88bb72ec7a7c4c4f156c5956f9947558b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T12:39:13Z","email":"4567934+alexander-akait@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Alexander Akait"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T12:39:13Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"test: cut fixed waits, verbose stats and duplicate cases from the integration suites (#22550)\n\n* test: shorten fixed waits in watch harness and slow fixtures\n\n* test: wait for lazy-compilation activation instead of a fixed delay\n\n* test: drop fixed sleeps and redundant big assets from slow fixtures\n\n* test: keep only the 600 MB asset in big-assets\n\n* test: skip verbose stats.txt by default and run chain/resolving cases in config suites\n\n* test: merge css minifier corpora and imported html page cases\n\n* test: merge config cases that share a config into one build\n\n* test: merge small test/cases into themed cases per category\n\n* test: keep json cases separate, other json cases import their fixtures\n\n* test: point moved loaders'' type imports at the repo root again\n\n* test: merge css minifier cases sharing a config, each keeping its own checks\n\n* test: format generated test configs\n\n* test: drop parsing cases left behind by their merge and the checkContext duplicate\n\n* test: merge config cases that build with the same options, and option variants of one fixture\n\n* test: give the warn-not-found variant an