b1157e5a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/29110?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/dependabot","id":49699333,"login":"dependabot[bot]","node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDk2OTkzMzM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/commits/49a891da523814f233236ea400f4bc9403038112/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T10:03:10Z","email":"49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"dependabot[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T10:03:10Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(deps): bump the dependencies group with 4 updates (#22518)\n\n* fix(deps): bump the dependencies group with 4 updates\n\nBumps the dependencies group with 4 updates: [test/external/html5lib-tests](https://github.com/html5lib/html5lib-tests), [test/external/wpt](https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt), [test/external/swc](https://github.com/swc-project/swc) and [test/external/oxc](https://github.com/oxc-project/oxc).\n\n\nUpdates `test/external/html5lib-tests` from `224991e` to `c777c40`\n- [Commits](https://github.com/html5lib/html5lib-tests/compare/224991ec10db04f056a89eed8b0bd8695fd2950e...c777c408b61078ea2eb4acefc2535f54dbc8b28a)\n\nUpdates `test/external/wpt` from `f085a1e` to `13748c3`\n- [Release notes](https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/releases)\n- [Commits](https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/compare/f085a1efc1f58fbe263d384b1e335d656fe58e66...13748c36fdf9dd77cd0b34dd6b244256b365ea60)\n\nUpdates `test/external/swc` from `965c2df` to `1391a34`\n- [Release notes](https://github.com/swc-project/swc/releases)\n- [Commits](https://github.com/swc-project/swc/compare/965c2dfe2e6199e918b48ff2db89158e7db7e503...1391a346e1ba8ef0cbaaa7c1b90c391ad6d150c5)\n\nUpdates `test/external/oxc` from `dfbc0d1` to `6a7d48b`\n- [Release notes](https://github.com/oxc-project/oxc/releases)\n- [Commits](https://github.com/oxc-project/oxc/compare/dfbc0d1ea752f021ba4a68e4703b3a9031082a46...6a7d48b4a74822f8b36b4475d6075552beca1e0c)\n\n---\nupdated-dependencies:\n- dependency-name: test/external/html5lib-tests\n  dependency-version: c777c408b61078ea2eb4acefc2535f54dbc8b28a\n  dependency-type: direct:production\n  dependency-group: dependencies\n- dependency-name: test/external/wpt\n  dependency-version: 13748c36fdf9dd77cd0b34dd6b244256b365ea60\n  dependency-type: direct:production\n  dependency-group: dependencies\n- dependency-name: test/external/swc\n  dependency-version: 1391a346e1ba8ef0cbaaa7c1b90c391ad6d150c5\n  dependency-type: direct:production\n  dependency-group: dependencies\n- dependency-name: test/external/oxc\n  dependency-version: 6a7d48b4a74822f8b36b4475d6075552beca1e0c\n  dependency-type: direct:production\n  dependency-group: dependencies\n...\n\nSigned-off-by: dependabot[bot] <support@github.com>\n\n* fix(css): keep an initial keyword that parts another slot''s keywords\n\n`||` matches each slot''s components together, so `flex-flow:wrap row balance`\nand `text-decoration:underline solid overline` are invalid; dropping the\ninitial in the middle revived them.\n\n* test(css): pin every flex property and the shorthand that sets it\n\nFlexbox 2 adds `flex-line-count`, which neither `flex` nor `flex-flow` resets.\nA flex property mdn-data adds next fails until its shorthand is checked.\n\n* test(html): read a `<?…>` range as the tree does in the tokenizer harness\n\nhtml5lib-tests now expects `ProcessingInstruction` tokens, and none where EOF\ncuts one short. `tokenize` reports one comment range and leaves that to the\ntree builder, so the harness asks `parseHtml` as the CDATA case does.\n\n* test(javascript): update the minifier corpus lists for the oxc and swc bump\n\noxc''s peephole tests moved, so each `file:line` key follows its source. New\ncases webpack writes bigger join OXC_SMALLER or SWC_SMALLER under the existing\nreason, and the `import {}` ones REFERENCE_MISPRINTS as EMPTY_IMPORT.\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: dependabot[bot] <support@github.com>\nCo-authored-by: dependabot[bot] <49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: alexander-akait <4567934+alexander-akait@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"e9cbf11be6de51292a028d463eae158450161164","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/git/trees/e9cbf11be6de51292a028d463eae158450161164"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/git/commits/49a891da523814f233236ea400f4bc9403038112","verification":{"payload":"tree e9cbf11be6de51292a028d463eae158450161164\nparent 65ef71f88215f56c03dfb418a51311b1f8794870\nauthor dependabot[bot] <49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1791453790 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791453790 +0300\n\nfix(deps): bump the dependencies group with 4 updates (#22518)\n\n* fix(deps): bump the dependencies group with 4 updates\n\nBumps the dependencies group with 4 updates: [test/external/html5lib-tests](https://github.com/html5lib/html5lib-tests), [test/external/wpt](https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt), [test/external/swc](https://github.com/swc-project/swc) and [test/external/oxc](https://github.com/oxc-project/oxc).\n\n\nUpdates `test/external/html5lib-tests` from `224991e` to `c777c40`\n- [Commits](https://github.com/html5lib/html5lib-tests/compare/224991ec10db04f056a89eed8b0bd8695fd2950e...c777c408b61078ea2eb4acefc2535f54dbc8b28a)\n\nUpdates `test/external/wpt` from `f085a1e` to `13748c3`\n- [Release notes](https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/releases)\n- [Commits](https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/compare/f085a1efc1f58fbe263d384b1e335d656fe58e66...13748c36fdf9dd77cd0b34dd6b244256b365ea60)\n\nUpdates `test/external/swc` from `965c2df` to `1391a34`\n- [Release notes](https://github.com/swc-project/swc/releases)\n- [Commits](https://github.com/swc-project/swc/compare/965c2dfe2e6199e918b48ff2db89158e7db7e503...1391a346e1ba8ef0cbaaa7c1b90c391ad6d150c5)\n\nUpdates `test/external/oxc` from `dfbc0d1` to `6a7d48b`\n- [Release notes](https://github.com/oxc-project/oxc/releases)\n- [Commits](https://github.com/oxc-project/oxc/compare/dfbc0d1ea752f021ba4a68e4703b3a9031082a46...6a7d48b4a74822f8b36b4475d6075552beca1e0c)\n\n---\nupdated-dependencies:\n- dependency-name: test/external/html5lib-tests\n  dependency-version: c777c408b61078ea2eb4acefc2535f54dbc8b28a\n  dependency-type: direct:production\n  dependency-group: dependencies\n- dependency-name: test/external/wpt\n  dependency-version: 13748c36fdf9dd77cd0b34dd6b244256b365ea60\n  dependency-type: direct:production\n  dependency-group: dependencies\n- dependency-name: test/external/swc\n  dependency-version: 1391a346e1ba8ef0cbaaa7c1b90c391ad6d150c5\n  dependency-type: direct:production\n  dependency-group: dependencies\n- dependency-name: test/external/oxc\n  dependency-version: 6a7d48b4a74822f8b36b4475d6075552beca1e0c\n  dependency-type: direct:production\n  dependency-group: dependencies\n...\n\nSigned-off-by: dependabot[bot] <support@github.com>\n\n* fix(css): keep an initial keyword that parts another slot''s keywords\n\n`||` matches each slot''s components together, so `flex-flow:wrap row balance`\nand `text-decoration:underline solid overline` are invalid; dropping the\ninitial in the middle revived them.\n\n* test(css): pin every flex property and the shorthand that sets it\n\nFlexbox 2 adds `flex-line-count`, which neither `flex` nor `flex-flow` resets.\nA flex property mdn-data adds next fails until its shorthand is checked.\n\n* test(html): read a `<?…>` range as the tree does in the tokenizer harness\n\nhtml5lib-tests now expects `ProcessingInstruction` tokens, and none where EOF\ncuts one short. `tokenize` reports one comment range and leaves that to the\ntree builder, so the harness asks `parseHtml` as the CDATA case does.\n\n* test(javascript): update the minifier corpus lists for the oxc and swc bump\n\noxc''s peephole tests moved, so each `file:line` key follows its source. New\ncases webpack writes bigger join OXC_SMALLER or SWC_SMALLER under the existing\nreason, and the `import {}` ones REFERENCE_MISPRINTS as EMPTY_IMPORT.\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: dependabot[bot] <support@github.com>\nCo-authored-by: dependabot[bot] <49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: alexander-akait <4567934+alexander-akait@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqx2peCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAmfMQAJMpvFbf4R/RVcFdrzSsm8K7\n0VMxjvi5lGV5tv5y88lOXjHdXV5g8lyUh3TgD+QBOVY4zclKzanaVsovQ7emQiIi\nx+2SNRpO9fxFvE9XgAz3UmbkGkKq2LbwuAMK5o5VkxI0VuaI+QYFpHD/lYI6uZNk\nfwgaMeA9NctFE/WyFwrkMUyqDhSyQr7vc0Nr8/U4lOIn4YRU6gCipd5IUlIVCuFg\n1fQTnwWf971O+oRQof/39PVsmWc9nH9ZOxHwE5ynoUpLoCZiLBUWYqMmbEolW7Bi\n+MyuHDDMluzLILnVCHwAM1uBjRsW9+BKOaDqMzC8YNOnv2TioqXYQNKwLT+pe2zs\nhmXWkv94z5sMX9oNoAsHNJdn0D4PznfMOnEdpitrXyLFF7jMBkYi0nRCedveuXDm\nHZZPcZAS5vgnCLDmbUmFDj85EZ72OCYjwKVFUXFmCcyF+i4bU+mW6ZxbTaivfPfy\n5pUDDf1BNsaPcnm0CBufQ769iYKRU+nYzpzD1YWqSyFQSuinZ64ErCoqXc+oSPWK\nj/1JeSfaJVK1Mu/iP1JLsiowhFAD1oVwzXzopyVmNpjbRaACtoo31CLFRdN8M5cf\nswktczo9hVcg8bQxziEeNot+xNFHz6WKG82lPSktvYJmLzOVijsgynChHCrnmyDg\nXGOuAX754iw