xander-akait/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alexander-akait","id":4567934,"login":"alexander-akait","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1Njc5MzQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/commits/65ef71f88215f56c03dfb418a51311b1f8794870/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T10:00:41Z","email":"4567934+alexander-akait@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Alexander Akait"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T10:00:41Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"perf(javascript): shorten tail returns in the walk that inlines bodies in place (#22539)\n\nAfter compressing, the improve phase walked the whole tree twice: once\nto shorten each function''s tail `return`, then again to find functions\nwhose body calls another in place. Both act on functions only, and\neach reads only the function''s own subtree, so one walk does both:\ntails shorten on the way down, bodies are found on the way back up.\nMinifying lodash.js runs 1.02% fewer instructions under CodSpeed''s\nsimulation flags.","tree":{"sha":"9b3d66f3848e50c42faece915bc40138173cac8f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/git/trees/9b3d66f3848e50c42faece915bc40138173cac8f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/git/commits/65ef71f88215f56c03dfb418a51311b1f8794870","verification":{"payload":"tree 9b3d66f3848e50c42faece915bc40138173cac8f\nparent 68812dbc0a45810da35ca056a5ff2c1f60d62954\nauthor Alexander Akait <4567934+alexander-akait@users.noreply.github.com> 1791453641 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791453641 +0300\n\nperf(javascript): shorten tail returns in the walk that inlines bodies in place (#22539)\n\nAfter compressing, the improve phase walked the whole tree twice: once\nto shorten each function''s tail `return`, then again to find functions\nwhose body calls another in place. Both act on functions only, and\neach reads only the function''s own subtree, so one walk does both:\ntails shorten on the way down, bodies are found on the way back up.\nMinifying lodash.js runs 1.02% fewer instructions under CodSpeed''s\nsimulation flags.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqx2nJCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAr5wQACIXfpaLYpQUouw+JjQ4hSDf\nXoLmGEENge9TBGW+uB8SymlGTbDX+E8qvfo9nbytv6jv40FfFbF8MNOGMWlMPYkA\nZb99BRrHgFE0aZLpPg7cFfyMbt9Uof4C4Eg2uOIjUqR23BWbExBUxilnoksaf6y9\ntT1cdSNISPSAC/GTHKyLmjvqX+kRXE9gyEenRhWQlf0tPWimQT0cmziAl9JqT7o8\nDK1MWTvwjE/5z9/KJaf4bTkj+YzW9EB+cYPrZ8e7AckF2P7mG/xRBOMdXI5MM94L\nUlE73pk6o24cmKbORh60acyVPYstKBdMLvmySUbiUDOB+hKOuZxs7cHqA0cMxBHw\npws6KqVhseQLkUuKc61tTIfcrFpSkAQtIZjtRgSGm8XxNO3PFt1DrHKNuJG9+i4u\nuY7GeYxmzZewL2eY7jMZ+iQnvi7ZI2PCFDUuE1JyjgwjFuPKdylrMRcTwjPtFcJl\ndIV5v8TV580KgJVSLm0eUfh/Iiw13nh9KCrhkpWq404zJbHy/lD7t85rEUygbN6a\nLzcok3gw5sAy1R5MJEZ5puETCR8QGlfq9Ma8ZjKWkdI6Q9l2JUndeBGvdXR1+42c\nLXFwAFV6P6y2nZfpFJs2YBBqW7wMyzzeRNOXG5Dw5sIS//a1u6jMHNOV2Pca8GRJ\ni/A0Qv7p+ildrZ1/6ESZ\n=cCtI\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-08T10:00:41Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow