ers/alexander-akait/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alexander-akait","id":4567934,"login":"alexander-akait","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1Njc5MzQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/commits/79aa5dffb43ea288e98ed1ed571db9ec7f6855d5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T20:26:06Z","email":"4567934+alexander-akait@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Alexander Akait"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T20:26:06Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"perf(javascript): build tighten_body''s steps once, not per call (#22512)\n\ntightenBody declared its seven steps inside itself, sharing `changed`\nand the scope with them, so every call built them again, 54,503 times\nper minify of typescript.js, with the closures some of them built per\nstatement on top. The steps are now module-level functions handed one\nstate object per nesting depth, and their inner closures take what they\nread as arguments.\n\nAlso carries #22521''s fit of two printer tests and of OXC_SMALLER to\nmain (`vercel/ms` back on, `side_effects_cascade_3` off), which fail\non main and gate the integration jobs.","tree":{"sha":"38710a39df0cbd9518e2bd5bee02d1967c252cb7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/git/trees/38710a39df0cbd9518e2bd5bee02d1967c252cb7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/git/commits/79aa5dffb43ea288e98ed1ed571db9ec7f6855d5","verification":{"payload":"tree 38710a39df0cbd9518e2bd5bee02d1967c252cb7\nparent 0aec6c412ad891c29e83d180fd768de6310c7d89\nauthor Alexander Akait <4567934+alexander-akait@users.noreply.github.com> 1791404766 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791404766 +0300\n\nperf(javascript): build tighten_body''s steps once, not per call (#22512)\n\ntightenBody declared its seven steps inside itself, sharing `changed`\nand the scope with them, so every call built them again, 54,503 times\nper minify of typescript.js, with the closures some of them built per\nstatement on top. The steps are now module-level functions handed one\nstate object per nesting depth, and their inner closures take what they\nread as arguments.\n\nAlso carries #22521''s fit of two printer tests and of OXC_SMALLER to\nmain (`vercel/ms` back on, `side_effects_cascade_3` off), which fail\non main and gate the integration jobs.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxqreCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAARQ4QAHpMa/xbTPf/m0hQogAAN62l\n3o9KMwIoDer+FXZ+myqxVsVs8FJnLp0ju9iv65O62uLbri0Ftrw2E92Sn6DyyWva\nnoi2USETRZtbqVID6Z6AbPRxq4qifV7hFWLa0jPnCTvpQ9mS8lUAtwN3UZZPOLw8\n/hivqRsyRiXS5Dr0qLALc8CIAp3+0dZN6KF+bjVJNu1BvK6tBSAC7AVMZ4HmZAHT\n7MryBmVStmCLvN/aCzg+gu7O+gB3hkZBhwtCQnvhihd/QeaI4LShPbWuVvrCXsih\nvByNKwi/qrKQ1OGUuKO7EE1XcNkP0uCol4hISqn33sxTvYfE45n6H2QcMTUnw9Qo\ngveM1bN0wYuiTHeAVy7rtbpi4nMz+sOpGgpswwMcu3MYACc4/SIo/zmOs57cx9Lx\nA4B6jeoAy+m3HP+Su2IxRacQvT5NtCFghLGeFX8nQplMH4x4n9CzR9bISGik7Wan\nSevL0jEpDUOjW6fUT047VzV3aQXy1CwYEXxAmA2x0SOJsaAk9z5Rxi6uR7EnM5yl\nuc+BxJSyVcthdWYajK6al7Lg7P8JXaUxqcYNoJOYXg/5X/4JX9URM+QBThHmL9vP\nGYwbdMRv3+e2vle4AAJGuKykahrgCE3MO0nWYJvN4Cv4xaM74p2t1rQUNx2o0zmY\nzYVO0L+09v4nZq8wzbin\n=q134\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-07T20:26:07Z"}}