nder Akait <4567934+alexander-akait@users.noreply.github.com> 1791395754 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791395754 +0300\n\ntest: fail on minifier rival exclusions that are never compared (#22503)\n\n* test: fail on rival exclusion entries never compared\n\nAn SWC_SMALLER or OXC_SMALLER entry whose case never reaches a size\ncomparison suppresses nothing, so it now fails the run like any other\nstale table entry; drop the seven that were dead.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01ViD41i2KdwwGxrDk7yrjeD\n\n* test(javascript): retire an swc exclusion `main` no longer needs\n\n`fixture/issues/11684/class-decl` is no bigger than swc''s output since the\nlatest minifier changes on `main`.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01ViD41i2KdwwGxrDk7yrjeD","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxoeqCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA4RwQADCo1x2Pnb40ccdmujc8cfxj\nxSvJ7J4ctZegCZp+7mxgjdp6YN/fWDEXrr3r8Q1FOKbm5uZqHwimQUv7t3ubLSrN\n/MLugt4jC/xznbSRM5jZc2/TNhuOxmDAytWD9SREq+JxEe8IK5WL5V6MSXBaay7T\nFzqasR6wtHOr3E+qLRtwbDlS9x43fuarV98zsGuVdWYTWYx2+KvIxki0x4QyG/9o\nPPGw3L/99D1+auMe9zkvcFnje48IlZyE5hln/D54lvt5jUm/SFLGQnxirJdKfHWF\nqgTV75M2UtIfRj8FAN5Zi2yvAi9iRM5FviSRFh3P7BVNquCIP+WERuu+H/BcXQeD\n+Gvl4pCmk/NbtK4eMR6Kvs7f7sxZb2pNm79EkruYV+UgyelGhSzK2wvWnbCDkXeg\nVhRJIxtUC3XRhA2NmQQ3F2S8T4vuBNHk+XCJWsnqweeVINpNC/qJswlkf5rX08xd\nV6w7samBMtCqC0oXloVaw2zEp96tVS7nT9HwD0WCfuUqR8kGWkfYVumkHh6LzERw\ncJtLWV8pvFpPEjPAC43Rz4Wk95zMZ4/+8Xh2lRZScf/Z+DoBY1bivoI/UzMl4c9v\nyz7umBsEOheKvoWRARHM2eNDbuDrdXGYOYu0y+eomd4foP5Hng/UrggYuFKPwIAy\ne7bCG5vob5HG+EBBjNsr\n=f5UY\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-07T17:55:54Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","g