akait@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Alexander Akait"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T16:43:45Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(javascript): merge consecutive `if`s returning or throwing the same value in the minifier (#22507)\n\n* feat(javascript): merge consecutive `if`s returning or throwing the same value in the minifier\n\n`if (a) return x; if (b) return x;` becomes `if (a || b) return x;`, and\n`throw` alike: the second test runs only where the first did not leave.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01ViD41i2KdwwGxrDk7yrjeD\n\n* test(javascript): fit two minifier tests to #22473 and #22499 together\n\n#22473 counts a conversion as code that may run, so the value\n#22499''s improved case moved past `console` now has effects and\nstays put; it now moves a comparison, which converts nothing. And\n#22499 now shortens #22473''s literal case, whose assertion holds the\noutput to terser''s, so that case runs with the improve phase off.\n\nWith both in, `vercel/ms` is bigger than oxc''s output again (787\nagainst 781 gzip), so it goes back on OXC_SMALLER, where #22499 had\nretired it on its own.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01ViD41i2KdwwGxrDk7yrjeD","tree":{"sha":"34c3fcd9d21f8dda12ddd0c7e57ada48fe3422be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/git/trees/34c3fcd9d21f8dda12ddd0c7e57ada48fe3422be"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/git/commits/0c6e9d89d21b7643ab05c66edfe57de946c4e450","verification":{"payload":"tree 34c3fcd9d21f8dda12ddd0c7e57ada48fe3422be\nparent cb7a4f1f7576dfd42a2902eb96a40c411cc6df38\nauthor Alexander Akait <4567934+alexander-akait@users.noreply.github.com> 1791391425 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791391425 +0300\n\nfeat(javascript): merge consecutive `if`s returning or throwing the same value in the minifier (#22507)\n\n* feat(javascript): merge consecutive `if`s returning or throwing the same value in the minifier\n\n`if (a) return x; if (b) return x;` becomes `if (a || b) return x;`, and\n`throw` alike: the second test runs only where the first did not leave.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01ViD41i2KdwwGxrDk7yrjeD\n\n* test(javascript): fit two minifier tests to #22473 and #22499 together\n\n#22473 counts a conversion as code that may run, so the value\n#22499''s improved case moved past `console` now has effects and\nstays put; it now moves a comparison, which converts nothing. And\n#22499 now shortens #22473''s literal case, whose assertion holds the\noutput to terser''s, so that case runs with the improve phase off.\n\nWith both in, `vercel/ms` is bigger than oxc''s output again (787\nagainst 781 gzip), so it goes back on OXC_SMALLER, where #22499 had\nretired it on its own.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01ViD41i2KdwwGxrDk7yrjeD","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxnbBCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAL9gQAGeEhO6cg0EJ9kb6qr0iy+Z8\nS/MD3XDcIaiL+q2jiRXRPx/ZiDnDf9BMRLYde0EDWPpuIgERssCc6wkIc3I1FQ8h\n24+ySVwWnU6JaoPsb9eK7d54dhq7Cj5rsyc1gnERk5iNHUmtZExoBxWdgTx42iwX\nnqOFQS8YtSHWz6aRbbdRwF/d2g9O7TkmFgzcrvswFwX80gcCKxt7MNpLlgxJlvUT\nFP9mP0l0BtHFG7nepOnva884XQAwBnGfNGLOp5Icn1WeG60/YLCzQzYfQbPZ2E6M\nQUd6A2GRqmGR8BldcNCxXKYCwUn4fWsDmHfeu1V++WZyQfZXe1krnBzwzSLuh/zY\nNbA8c8XGLSbfCCwxlvB0wWQgpv6rFp6qlDQ65Q2uRBlvnO52RsKGWTxEEmpiTRUo\nstsWLaVhANFLTsBI00uZeMVoB18vSpc+sRoAbJiu2yQPak70TjUzUYoPXGjN9j5K\n11MoULEahcYGmDcHJhThunQ0AqPzCKB/aAYRyZ+N6JLGTiPoXi5Fg+poG3wl+mxY\n7Mtwg4nb2sqvBUHuPWq8jcFHxVEBcBTRFRR8DX1bTXv3F+3BElBIzmc2oQyEhgDO\nrcFpAjM2GRYtxtzouQD3nl3UjXQdgUL2zfRxl8oPcIwt+T/0SLSVPGvSnSUqZsR3\nev4FWYw8H9hLU9cW8lxQ\n=IW0a\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-07T16:43:46Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","fol