tree to order the reads and writes. A function at\ndepth n was walked by n functions in every pass. The reduce walk now\nindexes every symbol of the tree once, in terser''s walk order, into one\narray of definition ids with a flag for writes, and records on each\nscope the range its node spans; the check scans that range instead.","tree":{"sha":"e209fe7ef504c93ce5b5dc9e19df2cb3f014c0ed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/git/trees/e209fe7ef504c93ce5b5dc9e19df2cb3f014c0ed"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/git/commits/675f2255fb919ea2173a53a0112c2ff8f0d41d9b","verification":{"payload":"tree e209fe7ef504c93ce5b5dc9e19df2cb3f014c0ed\nparent ad1d016bb3a0eb58945aaacd66245a3b51ec5b36\nauthor Alexander Akait <4567934+alexander-akait@users.noreply.github.com> 1791386265 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791386265 +0300\n\nperf(javascript): index the symbols a hoisted function''s check reads once per pass (#22508)\n\n`reduce_vars` decides for each function whether a hoisted function it\ndeclares may run before a variable it reads is written, by walking the\nfunction''s whole subtree to order the reads and writes. A function at\ndepth n was walked by n functions in every pass. The reduce walk now\nindexes every symbol of the tree once, in terser''s walk order, into one\narray of definition ids with a flag for writes, and records on each\nscope the range its node spans; the check scans that range instead.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxmKZCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAEMYQAAblUxv/XSCJL1anGPgBY9Y9\nteBBRfkHULR2kdo1I1rw97WnlWRb7FeXhlwLX2CUCA+qIOEZwzjBf1wNhU8as3av\nqb7a/407v+YOV+/vauelrK1DpJcIZLzbnHj4VOkrDJi2aP5gbHoURodZIRMXC4UK\nQVpaYEWafefq3sdlStLobrPsVRhonwnUmS1OllbkG0n+8yxoUiFJ3jLtONTjWN+Q\nDqz5Rzi3mH7vg8+9gnHnNQroN7dsLSHWyj61mYS8Goykr/FycRhU07nK5A94mH7E\nflCIZG5DNKXpqVfOa0ohX9AS7VRK6pDthX5h8CSpo2njK4tzqDKOhTU8ovRSDi2Z\nkrbR3EMEQmY2wyKC/G7llO/g7fJQggcFJf/T4bYq1BJJVygSavzbGJRxhnkFnMvB\nbKOo1/hU