n inside, and the top level''s run releases them all.","tree":{"sha":"a5f1eaca6988e8abb5660ab5a96ec494fbd759b0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/git/trees/a5f1eaca6988e8abb5660ab5a96ec494fbd759b0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/git/commits/77c90db2f1007eae2ddfd635eabeca78fbd6f995","verification":{"payload":"tree a5f1eaca6988e8abb5660ab5a96ec494fbd759b0\nparent 1d7acc6f20324136faf0966d50291adb6ee92e11\nauthor Alexander Akait <4567934+alexander-akait@users.noreply.github.com> 1791365874 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791365874 +0300\n\nperf(javascript): replay a function''s drop_unused scan from the scopes around it (#22496)\n\ndrop_unused walks every function nested in the scope it drops from, so a\nfunction at depth n was walked by n scopes per pass, 26% of the compressor''s\nvisits on typescript.js. The first scope around a function now records what\nthe walk reads of it, one event per node, and every scope further out\nreplays that log instead; the drop invalidates a log where it changed the\nfunction inside, and the top level''s run releases them all.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxhLyCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA/7EQAEdsuVVixU0cXSkcnJe6q2Lq\nRU1BG8sxl4VtvD5qdjfY62KkI0JEvuvli6VEKtOmOHCH+c81a/6waf1D4tzcF7Z/\nh9wOxkxwBNKEvKkTPtObfrrg1y88F6aJyySDT1jV7leEA7oGnCAr4u2p46RBlVsh\np5YFoi6KwHqsgn5+Xq9vp9POw+uqQgbH+L+iM2H5xgW32zUzCp/gnc7cTk/lpnEI\nKIDJsDvNwCuOwVN/LtHgOZEW5GBKcMFtzW6QuAtfmSimwOoxvNsBcvHZGGXKj1yJ\n2QN12PQBcdlvWuj8HGohxLmJoeZ5EhiOw4Ld5GdZL3OCedeLL91l1liLXUbO5bQl\n4dzoMQMOuHXiFzqnljDSDflkadEEdlN0TiWbryErnCmuTvxNDFpfHF8pORsL19r5\n8ibmhtn6rciJmeqyr/8ILjVNGQy2p/PhiTHRH6kGeF07vYDVDNyj30OG7/iH+VP0\nNYrNLVh5Vr0QtgNFJAYtjxkQgjaw2sWDP9avCISmluFtLw6YYgTx3OgkryT7IQzW\n6YPnP1zGLgGZP8d//LGPLN/X2qgmdUaQPjCYXjENdByF1/fcCKka4loKYcK6Y3TM\nQRP9id0Q29auO6RNPx8OaIu2J5oxNPl/CiYiK4OODHeLy+o8YMvj1aczGEcgKFIm\nTt+TbYGLa2eGJSaiB66m\n=RENr\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verifi