"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/commits/f6ab46ee7f42c7a7c911dc081add9e1b2b5cc543/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T09:37:12Z","email":"4567934+alexander-akait@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Alexander Akait"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T09:37:12Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"perf(javascript): keep collapse_vars'' state in one object per nesting depth (#22492)\n\nterser''s `collapse` keeps its scan in function-scoped `var`s that its\nclosures share across candidates, and `collapseFrom` built those 25\nclosures, two transformers, a walker per candidate and a transformer\nper fold on every call: 37,201 calls and 86 MB per minify of\ntypescript.js. The state now lives in a `CollapseState` held per\nnesting depth, the helpers are module-level functions handed it, and\nthe scanners, the left-value walker, the remover and the left-value\nmap are built once per state.","tree":{"sha":"68d2ed21a9df428d29d0268f482aa47c683e69ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/git/trees/68d2ed21a9df428d29d0268f482aa47c683e69ff"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/git/commits/f6ab46ee7f42c7a7c911dc081add9e1b2b5cc543","verification":{"payload":"tree 68d2ed21a9df428d29d0268f482aa47c683e69ff\nparent 159dfbfccd0ed8ebbddb6de05026cec825d53b75\nauthor Alexander Akait <4567934+alexander-akait@users.noreply.github.com> 1791365832 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791365832 +0300\n\nperf(javascript): keep collapse_vars'' state in one object per nesting depth (#22492)\n\nterser''s `collapse` keeps its scan in function-scoped `var`s that its\nclosures share across candidates, and `collapseFrom` built those 25\nclosures, two transformers, a walker per candidate and a transformer\nper fold on every call: 37,201 calls and 86 MB per minify of\ntypescript.js. The state now lives in a `CollapseState` held per\nnesting depth, the helpers are module-level functions handed it, and\nthe scanners, the left-value walker, the remover and the left-value\nmap are built once per state.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxhLICRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAZLEQACI+VeSbGQ7cPZ04Q8Sz7pnw\n0bZUQnPEL3Gbd7iFiHdMb3c8L8SnVK5Qnm8oDSPYwcx56LZM1LQUPfyS5Y3Lhajq\nrZeun4mZb0lEmf/zEofumuIE8UDrR1qVmw2ecgTia6+tudR+kdGLMc0OpEmEcZe8\nNEBLhBR7U4gmtye/kat8Qik8w8TDPK2Io6rBjdUga1HNg5Y7XteHdSh+nSKBnI7H\n79XAkcxLL6xr3uoC0O70OtiFI0U59b5sOktIE7tbbM6zIWNhyqUsg76nKvoYGSaM\nuaY2k7aFtEEXAsKAk7XjWU5Pk88BkApMrX5y/E9X2XYz1L6zvT7JT5F+vdIcPZB8\nKKPYwPuXr3fnJsdU1kXu6w9k6/UeKoW70ULM8cKnj+RB2zrPXqf7REWAC0rwbqnf\n/UTc9X/cYDN9XqYnSRMbFPcUkHdsmEOddBjksLw0LQuyBp4V13/phZMqnaLoLlFH\nad9kfShO3mzXlzJJpBVxi+DWmE7ZhWc5aDy6NWCQVfsRvLKUqa66Hlo7bf18HX+d\n/FuRIXGcf6kpiiDZr+b8kXxGEnndUgx204bfHD7sWc/uJKY9FDRKeTp7LzLE6Lq/\nUKR/VEhqo2Eo8T7kiDITV08TNDpJG/duKfWZZTXwpKQfrHMOtkOyhPldPPp7Ue3A\nq/Lodd0vto5uM6oqPKCv\n=jJc5\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-07T09:37:13Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/webpack/webpack/commit/f6ab46ee7f42c7a7c911dc081add9e1b2b5cc543","node_id":"C_kwDOADgiC9oAKGY2YWI0NmVlN2Y0MmM3YTdjOTExZGMwODFhZGQ5ZTFiMmI1Y2M1NDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/webpack/webpack/commit/159dfbfccd0ed8ebbddb6de05026cec825d53b75","sha":"159dfbfccd0ed8ebbddb6de05026cec825d53b75","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/commits/159dfbfccd0ed8ebbddb6de05026cec825d53b75"}],"sha":"f6ab46ee7f42c7a7c911dc081add9e1b2b5cc543","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/commits/f6ab46ee7f42c7a7c911dc081add9e1b2b5cc543"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4567934?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alexander-akait","id":4567934,"login":"alexander-akait","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1Njc5MzQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/commits/159dfbfccd0ed8ebbddb6de05026cec825d53b75/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T04:58:35Z","email":"4567934+alexander-akait@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Alexander Akait"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T04:58:35Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"perf(javascript): build inline''s flattening helpers once, not per call (#22493)\n\ninlineIntoCall built ten closures and an arrow for every call it looked\nat, 79,798 times per minify of typescript.js, to decide whether the\ncalled function flattens into the scope around the call. The helpers\nare now module-level functions handed one state object, which nothing\nthey read optimizes through, so a single one serves every call.","tree":{"sha":"80265f37441e48ed4fa8902ff9f845deff12360d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/git/trees/80265f37441e48ed4fa8902ff9f845deff12360d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/git/commits/159dfbfccd0ed8ebbddb6de05026cec825d53b75","verification":{"payload":"tree 80265f37441e48ed4fa8902ff9f845deff12360d\nparent 6eb6072becaadd61bc388382582120155bf3539e\nauthor Alexander Akait <4567934+alexander-akait@users.noreply.github.com> 1791349115 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791349115 +0300\n\nperf(javascript): build inline''s flattening helpers once, not per call (#22493)\n\ninlineIntoCall built ten closures and an arrow for every call it looked\nat, 79,798 times per minify of typescript.js, to decide whether the\ncalled function flattens into the scope around the call. The helpers\nare now module-level functions handed one state object, which nothing\nthey read optimizes through, so a single one serves every call.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxdF7CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAqAgQAJjagOx25Mr+vOyONp/ojC7O\nxc4WHxb78ZcZpcH/VPt27oRDkj0ZUurEbdGr/3xiRzK435/C0/A7Pdgd4Fh5sPLc\n1++e57lCSKsdojilyOsXLPucq7GlCulCZkicgQSqGi8Q2DcZBF3VaxnYbiZQHc6z\nv7sf0CDxaM0TiDOeHm+jk3h/n7FY226oJLojf9UDC0SKP/pbm3/sptSwnzjT8CuU\nSzuBBzFlsEzRGfuKSuT2BwMLQRZZ3d2i79IJx1Kra6mlGX21zVVpPx/CtesOW3M8\nBEXY6yV7OYHUvukRK5qU3UPjRwN5vbFiWs8f2i39qHHWpaCpiU3zFJ3tqi9A/Jhd\n1U5eX6cHfEv2kNOP0xfRWQgI7CJ2T67HE5Ckguh9hWxuWe1SxHbJ2Am1MJHcXR+W\npVbJAGLJbtYIWZhJyPHS9NxUCs7uO22NsRyb+s5O9HkAo+