iptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/commits/c47682ffc07e96dd8af10d427d12517d273bfbac/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T01:13:49Z","email":"4567934+alexander-akait@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Alexander Akait"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T01:13:49Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(javascript): keep a class key computed where the literal key fails to parse (#22486)\n\n* fix(javascript): keep a class key computed where the literal key fails to parse\n\nA static class key that converts to `prototype` throws when the class is\ndefined, so a class with one is no longer dropped as unused; this includes a\none-element array, an object literal, and a variable holding either.\n`static [\"prototype\"]` and `\"#constructor\"` keys stay computed.\n\nCloses #22474\n\nCo-authored-by: aryanraj45 <rajaryan445567@gmail.com>\n\n* fix(javascript): keep an object''s `__proto__` from turning into a method\n\nA method named `__proto__` became `__proto__: () => …`, which sets the\nprototype, and `unsafe_methods` turned `__proto__: function () {}` into a\nmethod, which defines an own property instead.\n\n* test(javascript): cover a static key evaluated under `unsafe`\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: aryanraj45 <rajaryan445567@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"5aade826970a2df3e1800320b45ff0d093cb5b06","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/git/trees/5aade826970a2df3e1800320b45ff0d093cb5b06"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/git/commits/c47682ffc07e96dd8af10d427d12517d273bfbac","verification":{"payload":"tree 5aade826970a2df3e1800320b45ff0d093cb5b06\nparent ab4d0e696d45d20a91baafa281de04f89f8b5c86\nauthor Alexander Akait <4567934+alexander-akait@users.noreply.github.com> 1791335629 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791335629 +0300\n\nfix(javascript): keep a class key computed where the literal key fails to parse (#22486)\n\n* fix(javascript): keep a class key computed where the literal key fails to parse\n\nA static class key that converts to `prototype` throws when the class is\ndefined, so a class with one is no longer dropped as unused; this includes a\none-element array, an object literal, and a variable holding either.\n`static [\"prototype\"]` and `\"#constructor\"` keys stay computed.\n\nCloses #22474\n\nCo-authored-by: aryanraj45 <rajaryan445567@gmail.com>\n\n* fix(javascript): keep an object''s `__proto__` from turning into a method\n\nA method named `__proto__` became `__proto__: () => …`, which sets the\nprototype, and `unsafe_methods` turned `__proto__: function () {}` into a\nmethod, which defines an own property instead.\n\n* test(javascript): cover a static key evaluated under `unsafe`\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: aryanraj45 <rajaryan445567@gmail.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxZzNCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAqjMQAAIW0O2aVLxd7JlJmIWgP8hI\n2ejf0cFmI08wroDEUptYOw3LoidVVhTSm5pziw7Zn7qmEp3FUKnaTmAYLM2J6Cz4\nZ6+TCYdlwBCM47rU9f1g1IYFTCKm/fvsWH4HzF9q4tncB2+m5R+lInsoxkJ8kQCQ\nqM3d+IqWOtOGoweRLEXH4IvLgylwRj3IqpLDJebuJ1HqN9QFerkMnx9nBNKSl0hO\n4dXRcAJn6nlgWmrkkqT923I7w6Xbh2R8zvkKIUCgWgnFklMOBN6smo42b7yyNfBH\nvWI7LE8/SsBMOgIXAhEuJBxrSPtGTt1gNDGVe8gArx067k6N5nn4x0Zh3DtdV3C1\nvsfj0mU2yjwU7axvKMHrZ6zikfuMKOfnkeMVSmP7dcCbUc0Y4f2KYI5KaGn/A7Vg\nrkE3C5hUaHfj519LEo9CJU6CcD7iHtA6DmtJKKSo2MLP3TQxrumQRKzioLoJND89\n0Emc0nUfzsPem2s7oBBVcrbe/oPzIGk7o+Bdxw5sgt8PCEC/Vp/Geg6YBBTHMPlu\n7Y2WpJHLWO65Fgk78Yf8dLSQq1LkVj8ijc/Bu3ilZX+DBG6XUDx3UxvmH7TS316A\nUTq+f5VPRDGsTUiqG5GP+dPRZJObjeGb8YV/1UySOMNYQU0UUg8eSaEwNyxWbqLl\nS4pHwON2kH6EsHQQFMgR\n=OY7g\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-07T01:13:49Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://a