om/users/aryanraj45/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aryanraj45/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aryanraj45/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aryanraj45/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aryanraj45","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/commits/21d987ef6b2fb86ac18a9ad3112ff767c35abdc4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T18:30:58Z","email":"143009186+aryanraj45@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Raj Aryan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T18:30:58Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(javascript): keep an `instanceof` or `in` nobody reads (#22453)\n\n* fix(javascript): keep an `instanceof` or `in` nobody reads\n\nterser reads both as pure and drops one nobody reads, yet instanceof reads Symbol.hasInstance and prototype, in reaches a proxy''s has, and either throws on a right side that is no object. Each is kept, but for an instanceof of an ES2015 constructor on a literal, as oxc drops it. 30 test262 cases move off the printer''s list; 21 real bundles minify byte for byte the same.\n\n* fix(javascript): keep an `instanceof` of a built-in name the program assigns\n\nA global the program assigns, Object = { [Symbol.hasInstance]() {…} }, stays undeclared, so an instanceof of it on a literal still read as pure and was dropped. The built-in must now go unassigned, as reduce_vars counts. The check wraps BinaryExpression alone through new per-type hooks: 11,767 calls minifying typescript.js rather than 504,096, the 21 real bundles minifying the same.\n\n* test(javascript): list a test262 source the kept instanceof leaves gzip a byte worse\n\nS15.3.5.3_A2_T2.js now keeps obj instanceof FACTORY, beside which the improve phase''s Function() for new Function is 2 bytes fewer and, under the zlib of CI''s Node 24.21, 1 more gzipped. It joins the sources where a dropped new had matched one written again beside it.","tree":{"sha":"9111a086ebab1a9a97017e839952f047658a061f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/git/trees/9111a086ebab1a9a97017e839952f047658a061f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/git/commits/21d987ef6b2fb86ac18a9ad3112ff767c35abdc4","verification":{"payload":"tree 9111a086ebab1a9a97017e839952f047658a061f\nparent eb075418714f4928941c435966d583e3745cf922\nauthor Raj Aryan <143009186+aryanraj45@users.noreply.github.com> 1791311458 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791311458 +0300\n\nfix(javascript): keep an `instanceof` or `in` nobody reads (#22453)\n\n* fix(javascript): keep an `instanceof` or `in` nobody reads\n\nterser reads both as pure and drops one nobody reads, yet instanceof reads Symbol.hasInstance and prototype, in reaches a proxy''s has, and either throws on a right side that is no object. Each is kept, but for an instanceof of an ES2015 constructor on a literal, as oxc drops it. 30 test262 cases move off the printer''s list; 21 real bundles minify byte for byte the same.\n\n* fix(javascript): keep an `instanceof` of a built-in name the program assigns\n\nA global the program assigns, Object = { [Symbol.hasInstance]() {…} }, stays undeclared, so an instanceof of it on a literal still read as pure and was dropped. The built-in must now go unassigned, as reduce_vars counts. The check wraps BinaryExpression alone through new per-type hooks: 11,767 calls minifying typescript.js rather than 504,096, the 21 real bundles minifying the same.\n\n* test(javascript): list a test262 source the kept instanceof leaves gzip a byte worse\n\nS15.3.5.3_A2_T2.js now keeps obj instanceof FACTORY, beside which the improve phase''s Function() for new Function is 2 bytes fewer and, under the zlib of CI''s Node 24.21, 1 more gzipped. It joins the sources where a dropped new had matched one written again beside it.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATU