e a getter, an accessor or `with` may tell\n\nA property target''s object and key must be declared names never\nreassigned, which a getter reading the property cannot repoint; a name\nthe rewrites read once must be declared, not global, and not reached\nthrough `with`.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01ViD41i2KdwwGxrDk7yrjeD\n\n* fix(javascript): keep a computed key held in a name out of logical assignment\n\nThe original converts the key twice, where `o[k] ||= v` converts it once,\nso a key whose `toString` answers differently each time read and wrote\ndifferent properties; only a constant key is rewritten now.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01ViD41i2KdwwGxrDk7yrjeD","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxPgyCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAARs8QAAw8ufi3PBxRDGjZETa0RMKy\nhg78xEMlA/KzNXgiAygx7kSTN64L3HviYvyQWDv1rbSOYi/1kawNIxe3U2jcxHG3\nnJUZROQ/4zUN+CdD3k9RRcMRrFoG3maQFfkS/xQv2+qDdvftTyNAjmwt+VdSMGZ/\ncJyxWjcyq0setuU47wtpbxksu16yG4QPPfB2eeCYVlD58v2h+Ss2wPUSLtQvvAMO\nNysg5IIyQ2U4oi6qbMBtmNiYIhF+QRUkcMYsdoivjpYvH0d7eXdAWtb4ObTz3Gba\nGFC8Ad97QzyOzoZp//esbGPCOt121dtCJikml/fksA31FSdV/JsUlxRQPCtU8uqr\nOtY9lAcH0p7w4yeQ93OoiqXVuxlYqJfIL7UivBorpdpIrzYcP++bciytWStkTeDl\n0nne2QbKacS6c4jh2ouLeVEarkRyHgKt9caFgAI63ozfduQtxj4gnpMUx83g8eW7\nwI6bD4XTuEXiCwsVelZIPUUg1uy3LNkRtCVkPGljMkNgEIRbSAnB87I9+04qXTdV\niQ81e04UFAqpY3uL0h3HrcKvNiJFewdmwQijhzbt9RlMNa1db1X7unvP77mW5HD6\nXO9YiuadEqzTHTNE8Ipq0XmTvMxoXhYS+T9DV/h6BAxubX9I5fCGaUANFBF2fCxX\nj/oLaTi5WOMZcyPGu15z\n=WoP7\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-06T13:31:30Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","