epo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/commits/ff4462000a670bbfa1ca8e4f336b604d0b9dc0a9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T13:31:11Z","email":"4567934+alexander-akait@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Alexander Akait"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T13:31:11Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"perf(javascript): run hoist_props'' transform only where it splits an object (#22454)\n\n* perf(javascript): run hoist_props'' transform only where it splits an object\n\nhoist_props'' check walked every nested function, and let the transform run\nover the whole subtree on any declaration passing its first tests. The check\nnow stops at nested scopes and makes all of terser''s tests, in the order the\ntransform made them, so the transform runs only where it splits an object.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Tgxgyb4N35ndP6cC4KcrXC\n\n* perf(javascript): read hoist_props'' check off kind bits\n\nThe check tested each node with prototype walks for a scope, a declaration\nand a property read; it now reads one kind bit mask.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Tgxgyb4N35ndP6cC4KcrXC","tree":{"sha":"673d5ad76476f13184c5e3005b331444b6ee4367","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/git/trees/673d5ad76476f13184c5e3005b331444b6ee4367"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/git/commits/ff4462000a670bbfa1ca8e4f336b604d0b9dc0a9","verification":{"payload":"tree 673d5ad76476f13184c5e3005b331444b6ee4367\nparent 52082978d6fcf854c21084ee85b25a3ed7ebddb5\nauthor Alexander Akait <4567934+alexander-akait@users.noreply.github.com> 1791293471 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791293471 +0300\n\nperf(javascript): run hoist_props'' transform only where it splits an object (#22454)\n\n* perf(javascript): run hoist_props'' transform only where it splits an object\n\nhoist_props'' check walked every nested function, and let the transform run\nover the whole subtree on any declaration passing its first tests. The check\nnow stops at nested scopes and makes all of terser''s tests, in the order the\ntransform made them, so the transform runs only where it splits an object.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Tgxgyb4N35ndP6cC4KcrXC\n\n* perf(javascript): read hoist_props'' check off kind bits\n\nThe check tested each node with prototype walks for a scope, a declaration\nand a property read; it now reads one kind bit mask.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Tgxgyb4N35ndP6cC4KcrXC","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxPgfCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAPGsQACv1ZBgSnukk7ZGEwhmy3iYJ\nLHowXaynp24KLV4ksoCiIzJmP58NaGNXevR492CCD3UrSneSXtgO4kuB5EmLMc65\nqFprpSZ+DMi0dPAb1DcTH8sHLwW4Dvq4GZQIRhwOX+x4hPaP3bZadQZrhoIPZlbK\nhVn21we6hITikyZHaY6BkY5PncTE3rZhh8+Qvpncs0qDjTifzNdVuymy2hUrgspk\nROc8Pxu9FFHjxpFeYUJv/rMLZpqli6TYpbEs4gnHV1wZTmID/+nOffQQzRc4/TXx\n9+uVxuL35fcNLgKPZJIxDTdIsq2ua/yYKVfwwI6fualIu1kDSDvFJ8w0JtAIGbV1\nTL5y2TrdePFWZDWyZwV3SKGQ8Cnq0u7GW7pMHhCE44JB11Jqs2kHyprI8y1amMP3\n+BQrNL+pOs4Qbm4oALNFQCkcSmVn+aSBQ1kByYRMwzXk4Q0f8OQv+3C0g1B6ymfs\nQUdl6pH0CNBEldlEnjs8g85iKXG5yc5NpGVkkRAF6aQG65IEmaFuzG9ueyAIAoO3\n6y0nnEEH/GrfT3+zYznUEDS5Kn6sqACbBlhSk8w/egM1zmB3LFfoFcsLRG/hclRB\nQyZJtpjKa1/M/DivoU4+YQJg8UcrOIxTiv3X8QbueEgekkbZQZWyEuNL88MMInKR\nwonFy0kbraI/8ff2UGHV\n=NBP9\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-06T13:31:11Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gist