xander-akait/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/commits/52082978d6fcf854c21084ee85b25a3ed7ebddb5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T13:30:51Z","email":"4567934+alexander-akait@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Alexander Akait"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T13:30:51Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(css): omit CSS values a browser already implies (#22457)\n\n- Drop a custom property written again later in the same block, unless the\n  earlier one is `!important` and the later one is not.\n- Drop the trailing values `translate` and `scale` imply when left out.\n- Shorten `<position>` values in each layer of a comma list.\n- Write SVG stroke lengths in px as bare numbers, which SVG reads as px.\n- Fold `grid-row` and `grid-column` into one `grid-area`.","tree":{"sha":"28b3a4fa64e25659966e0b90bd38bc0b07aa1299","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/git/trees/28b3a4fa64e25659966e0b90bd38bc0b07aa1299"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/git/commits/52082978d6fcf854c21084ee85b25a3ed7ebddb5","verification":{"payload":"tree 28b3a4fa64e25659966e0b90bd38bc0b07aa1299\nparent b513c9d32a1a8346886aa82ac9e429a4972fde78\nauthor Alexander Akait <4567934+alexander-akait@users.noreply.github.com> 1791293451 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791293451 +0300\n\nfeat(css): omit CSS values a browser already implies (#22457)\n\n- Drop a custom property written again later in the same block, unless the\n  earlier one is `!important` and the later one is not.\n- Drop the trailing values `translate` and `scale` imply when left out.\n- Shorten `<position>` values in each layer of a comma list.\n- Write SVG stroke lengths in px as bare numbers, which SVG reads as px.\n-