cript): drop unused pattern names and catch bindings in the minifier\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01ViD41i2KdwwGxrDk7yrjeD\n\n* fix(javascript): keep an empty pattern reading a literal that spreads\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01ViD41i2KdwwGxrDk7yrjeD\n\n* fix(javascript): keep an empty pattern reading a nested spread\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01ViD41i2KdwwGxrDk7yrjeD\n\n* fix(javascript): keep an array pattern''s iterator lookup and steps\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01ViD41i2KdwwGxrDk7yrjeD\n\n* fix(javascript): keep a pattern''s computed keys when dropping unused names\n\nA computed key converts its value to a property key, which may run\n`toString` or `Symbol.toPrimitive`, so dropping it changes what runs.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01ViD41i2KdwwGxrDk7yrjeD\n\n* fix(javascript): keep a `catch` binding a `var` of its name redeclares\n\nA `var` in the `catch` block initializes the binding, but its symbol\nresolves to the function''s variable, so the binding looked unused.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01ViD41i2KdwwGxrDk7yrjeD","tree":{"sha":"ac530eeeaae7a4e415b856db21567d68fb73af3e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/git/trees/ac530eeeaae7a4e415b856db21567d68fb73af3e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/git/commits/72e0ac8cfac3e318f93538c55940edf9169eb72a","verification":{"payload":"tree ac530eeeaae7a4e415b856db21567d68fb73af3e\nparent 5d04ae11450446c34aa14e1ddeb0662eefcfc00b\nauthor Alexander Akait <4567934+alexander-akait@users.noreply.github.com> 1791277332 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791277332 +0300\n\nfeat(javascript): drop unused pattern names and catch bindings in the minifier (#22450)\n\n* feat(javascript): drop unused pattern names and catch bindings in the minifier\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01ViD41i2KdwwGxrDk7yrjeD\n\n* fix(javascript): keep an empty pattern reading a literal that spreads\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01ViD41i2KdwwGxrDk7yrjeD\n\n* fix(javascript): keep an empty pattern reading a nested spread\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01ViD41i2KdwwGxrDk7yrjeD\n\n* fix(javascript): keep an array pattern''s iterator lookup and steps\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01ViD41i2KdwwGxrDk7yrjeD\n\n* fix(javascript): keep a pattern''s computed keys when dropping unused names\n\nA computed key converts its value to a property key, which may run\n`toString` or `Symbol.toPrimitive`, so dropping it changes what runs.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01ViD41i2KdwwGxrDk7yrjeD\n\n* fix(javascript): keep a `catch` binding a `var` of its name redeclares\n\nA `var` in the `catch` block initializes the binding, but its symbol\nresolves to the function''s variable, so the binding looked unused.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01ViD41i2KdwwGxrDk7yrjeD","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxLkUCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAwPQQABT/G8ZB4kz4u5RekekpE83i\npObnTeHlOs1v549Rp1RSLvnjb83kqnkMaF3tHSdWR7dvX4eJAwG9GePP9MkPDq/h\nLbaH/WxtcBBI6vcP9GeaOfyXWmshxv3Wu20d02d9FMjIAl3yZdRtgXq+lkJ2uN3j\npw11KyNHS3eR8guTI3FUqZXuZBTrApUP14IKHaXjDz2Px9Lnjg7pVX1Zm6rdl1Rj\nAN7nGGlPaTwfwTzLbQyf6c0Nh4UctOv7aoaNJvl674zgc6t5euwhcJn+/May22xy\n0D0za0IXORSmoNYDHrWFrHfpTC7Puxwg7kLgfYaLGDyyWjm790QEmdUB+axjjqlS\nOt6s/kHSYHrccMj4pf2zzz1oc4x7SNJjmD7mVGrmG38ScRUeuhbLpVfbEA8npAx5\nPwMo43F70iX8hTChhjOTqjmZGXy6tPjpLfuxMqiFqzWfquxAC4jhyPmHqZIiqnDB\nMJJxjJ4hIhb70JzFIXIGGmz7mHQTopGHJnTfN7hpqs0KTLf+7UoROUztpFLN0uH+\nyOM2a+Q6ZhDATCT4V4PwshWxsCq5K8ytZ+K7Xe4MrmsvO9BHGRwRJ7dohTiFzZ+W\nWoutQ7J2a//iijMWJysLuec7bUSMl5CTiiDyB+lk6tt9j5o4CSVwBekRDtOEPvaw\nY5wbLWWFRpR94w93jsPm\n=niX6\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-06T09:02:13Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https:/