om","name":"Alexander Akait"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T20:37:23Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"perf(javascript): skip nested scopes the unused-code pass cannot change (#22445)\n\ndrop_unused runs on every scope and its final transform walked each nested\nfunction again, though there it only rewrites assignments to unused or\nfixed-value names. A nested scope the first two passes walked whole is now\nskipped unless it holds such an assignment or a part they did not walk.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Tgxgyb4N35ndP6cC4KcrXC","tree":{"sha":"c472e75f77e5df609a6dae9361e886083164ff96","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/git/trees/c472e75f77e5df609a6dae9361e886083164ff96"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/git/commits/0af455b8291c2688e5acd1569beee76c3fc1e2e3","verification":{"payload":"tree c472e75f77e5df609a6dae9361e886083164ff96\nparent ee47dc2d669a259916345dc7b844b3507d79224e\nauthor Alexander Akait <4567934+alexander-akait@users.noreply.github.com> 1791232643 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791232643 +0300\n\nperf(javascript): skip nested scopes the unused-code pass cannot change (#22445)\n\ndrop_unused runs on every scope and its final transform walked each nested\nfunction again, though there it only rewrites assignments to unused or\nfixed-value names. A nested scope the first two passes walked whole is now\nskipped unless it holds such an assignment or a part they did not walk.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Tgxgyb4N35ndP6cC4KcrXC","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxAqDCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA8a0QAKp0JoFQjeMbzOLzLsVX8fXG\nXMwh+zzDCmOGqRYaT5K+yPBSdvqfNH72XElZnsT/gQZ+5xoKZSDnJGpb8+iwCdLt\nrXzAWK00ni/rHzToddLwg0P+HXkz7S6HNjx3ffhN9BP+fPdYhfjlNnQmF0KufWQB\nCMWZyqe7ysrXuXBzbC6jGI3OxFnTozvOkFsYicFAH72KZyrJt/wUun1LaZ7rk/70\nwvuWiJKcb9X2/0DI2oRgxzK61YHfqciPRs5Cnha24Jokg82sCnYTzupFDpa7OID9\nXw+1M/