"https://api.github.com/users/bjohansebas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bjohansebas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bjohansebas","id":103585995,"login":"bjohansebas","node_id":"U_kgDOBiyYyw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bjohansebas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bjohansebas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bjohansebas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bjohansebas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bjohansebas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bjohansebas","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/commits/652835567e1f5db4d99c4c62133c8d37e99d738e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T16:40:28Z","email":"bjohansebas@gmail.com","name":"Sebastian Beltran"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T16:40:28Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(javascript): preserve BigInt runtime errors during minification (#22436)\n\n* fix(javascript): preserve BigInt runtime errors during minification\n\n* test(javascript): hold a BigInt error order to the engine''s own read\n\nBun skips a unary `+` feeding `%`, so `+1n % 0n` throws RangeError there\nbefore minification too; compare against the source evaluated unminified.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Dp9zrcrMNKB7SPShAVzh4G\n\n* fix(javascript): evaluate a BigInt operation once when keeping its throw\n\nChecking for the throw before evaluating evaluated each operand twice, so a\nnested remainder chain took exponential time (depth 26: 15s); the evaluator\nnow catches the throw itself (depth 200: 25ms).\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Dp9zrcrMNKB7SPShAVzh4G\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: alexander-akait <sheo13666q@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"5d47c902b2ccf2ba203b7fd4ccde3157008f2455","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/git/trees/5d47c902b2ccf2ba203b7fd4ccde3157008f2455"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/git/commits/652835567e1f5db4d99c4c62133c8d37e99d738e","verification":{"payload":"tree 5d47c902b2ccf2ba203b7fd4ccde3157008f2455\nparent 6d27c4e0a39b9112d85f586760461b4ac6586376\nauthor Sebastian Beltran <bjohansebas@gmail.com> 1791218428 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791218428 +0300\n\nfix(javascript): preserve BigInt runtime errors during minification (#22436)\n\n* fix(javascript): preserve BigInt runtime errors during minification\n\n* test(javascript): hold a BigInt error order to the engine''s own read\n\nBun skips a unary `+` feeding `%`, so `+1n % 0n` throws RangeError there\nbefore minification too; compare against the source evaluated unminified.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Dp9zrcrMNKB7SPShAVzh4G\n\n* fix(javascript): evaluate a BigInt operation once when keeping its throw\n\nChecking for the throw before evaluating evaluated each operand twice, so a\nnested remainder chain took exponential time (depth 26: 15s); the evaluator\nnow catches the throw itself (depth 200: 25ms).\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Dp9zrcrMNKB7SPShAVzh4G\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: alexander-akait <sheo13666q@gmail.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqw9L8CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAqs0QAGr/qCw4KTcnIWck0frXlTxz\nMahePEXszMEKOPco/lYZLkwPlTOtPkYGGShLUwVkFKAJfvqeV3LKXc/SmfZGKBpI\nytp+9A6Wf+yLlfCLcE7Jlse3QmigVBeJ6i5B0Kxf56fmpllAY6JUn0Fk7VJXfgGs\nXkg/qhtsWkfhrXniMy09LVDfTcmQ9wWe4XGhsFt1g1I5oIjz9q9SManCUp+OSu+6\n+1H36XYswi1KS8ixomNqgCNp86hVjsf7yXs5leAsJVXnDNmr8Hv0WH8SNYeLNqvS\nrNE+27oNL754762ZmFQLF0D4E7fKMkiXyFIgKQPAEW/zZdzstEiAUOkej4dZTGrU\nnKWiBC/6jiV0Pp9q8+JBFtYcWIDFssguvPqAEtYWSRLuq9z42y6qMWTVP04kZ4te\nvpSi0a/5jiMQROWr3BdqHAPrTSYnh6Uq54dezZBm7U/hEDipYrWbt/m2l4rncqMT\nLzj/BYH4yuubzU//IZL2A+aVQg6kGn8MGPB+VbTTqLOtfPu