/7b3cf6268d5ef56561ddaa4f035408fc189a610d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T10:05:14Z","email":"143009186+aryanraj45@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Raj Aryan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T10:05:14Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(javascript): parenthesize what the printer wrote as another program (#22437)\n\n* fix(javascript): parenthesize what the printer wrote as another program\n\nA yield, assignment, conditional, sequence or arrow right of `#x in` printed bare, and `async` or `let` heading a for-of, or `let [` heading a statement or loop, printed unparenthesized; each no longer parsed or read otherwise. Moves 6 test262 cases off the printer''s list; printing a 1 MB bundle is within noise.\n\n* fix(javascript): parenthesize a yield, await, private in or chain tag\n\nterser''s list of tags it parenthesizes misses these four, so `(yield o)`t``, `(await o)`t``, `(#x in o)`t`` and `(a?.b)`t`` printed bare and read the template as part of the operand or stopped parsing. Adds a for-await-of `let` case.","tree":{"sha":"24262f3e277ea066555f6a11020444f266bfc54f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/git/trees/24262f3e277ea066555f6a11020444f266bfc54f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/git/commits/7b3cf6268d5ef56561ddaa4f035408fc189a610d","verification":{"payload":"tree 24262f3e277ea066555f6a11020444f266bfc54f\nparent 6509b726507f89266557027be52f996d24b9f487\nauthor Raj Aryan <143009186+aryanraj45@users.noreply.github.com> 1791194714 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791194714 +0300\n\nfix(javascript): parenthesize what the printer wrote as another program (#22437)\n\n* fix(javascript): parenthesize what the printer wrote as another program\n\nA yield, assignment, conditional, sequence or arrow right of `#x in` printed bare, and `async` or `let` heading a for-of, or `let [` heading a statement or loop, printed unparenthesized; each no longer parsed or read otherwise. Moves 6 test262 cases off the printer''s list; printing a 1 MB bundle is within noise.\n\n* fix(javascript): parenthesize a yield, await, private in or chain tag\n\nterser''s list of tags it parenthesizes misses these four, so `(yield o)`t``, `(await o)`t``, `(#x in o)`t`` and `(a?.b)`t`` printed bare and read the template as part of the operand or stopped parsing. Adds a for-await-of `let` case.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqw3ZaCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAADM8QAA6w12a7+kUUyQaOzhxGLwWa\nxPjrZLbgnLGaTGjdmpJ9TmTzIEZ4ljs4RmQrWf9GIeiezoO6z4hhM7xZWnWW7CIU\nIA/mhgX5RBczVNIpAzi+wAT3vDCiFE7qeTzjtfvyOMvYI+hVV0k/05RrNAEh4UHo\nHfNiWpA+Vs7ga4ReF0lsSgIKV4tyIItYiTzyrq+7AsyFpoal7lRWVE57LZOGXENV\nZUQzdDyCCrqShK+cOuOd2hazsOQW3ymXai5TzyOgaVn7XBU8mo+z/d/MaxVJgM1m\nab9L1OkeG5EtEoltuGaknRb2D7cUExcRVtGDP5mudGBR6BEWVPuEk2r7PC4/tmDk\nCv3bhbDuJaZETbuTKWq3dtVSZaCYM9r5VIvDMx7j08KkM2607Km6sWjsMTnIUwxe\nZl3tQ+L5OJl075cwu9CGQVX0Ee63GKBwILotOvK0jUBAE4yqRjBNOmD7AYq8H52L\n6dEMXWw5yTApJU1zqar5hGh4XYhiB6WZieUeVwwdsyvSNRZt15QWEi2fQpA1OdGz\nY5MjBzehyx9Gpwli4A5RSeHFvo5R83w33+ln1fwkQO+uj9TYaYbEvQgNQoHly8pH\nWrhNX5axPAVM2RRdxYCb2EFZ03D0bcrENaK2rASGmgikYC4SHLKqB1e+WpfnsXjc\nxNF9/x8NDUSJ02LcerkV\n=vgSm\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-05T10:05:14Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos"