ck-dev-middleware/commits/e7f53800cc1ef8702954d29f018352479f9a40d8"}],"sha":"991c3868c66e78ac66e1ce5e3c1cd8f449978f3d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack-dev-middleware/commits/991c3868c66e78ac66e1ce5e3c1cd8f449978f3d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4567934?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alexander-akait","id":4567934,"login":"alexander-akait","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1Njc5MzQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack-dev-middleware/commits/e7f53800cc1ef8702954d29f018352479f9a40d8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T09:44:45Z","email":"4567934+alexander-akait@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Alexander Akait"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T09:44:45Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(hot): leave the HMR plugin out of the modes that never use it (#2466)\n\n* fix(hot): leave the HMR plugin out of the modes that never use it\n\nWith hot.client.apply set to reload or nothing no update is applied in place,\nso HotModuleReplacementPlugin only added its runtime to the bundle. A plugin\nalready in the configuration is kept and no longer reported as redundant.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01UjuMAuk9o6UazjHzcAQCTA\n\n* fix(client): reload a page that asked for hmr where the bundle has no runtime\n\nA page''s url can ask for hmr where the project''s own mode left the HMR\nruntime out of the bundle. There was nothing to apply the update with, and the\nhmr mode, which loads the page when an update cannot be applied, only logged,\nso the page stayed on code the build had replaced.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01UjuMAuk9o6UazjHzcAQCTA\n\n* fix(client): reload for a missing runtime only where it was left out on purpose\n\nA runtime missing from a project whose own mode wanted it is a mistake, and the\nexisting behaviour of reporting it once and never reloading is kept. The\nreload applies when the project''s mode is reload or nothing and the page''s url\nasked for hmr, where nothing else would bring the new code to the page.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01UjuMAuk9o6UazjHzcAQCTA\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"dfebad9d27689cf2d4f6b2cffcaaf482166fab52","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack-dev-middleware/git/trees/dfebad9d27689cf2d4f6b2cffcaaf482166fab52"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack-dev-middleware/git/commits/e7f53800cc1ef8702954d29f018352479f9a40d8","verification":{"payload":"tree dfebad9d27689cf2d4f6b2cffcaaf482166fab52\nparent b5d87cfd0cd3eaa42bb0d80057e133723a020f69\nauthor Alexander Akait <4567934+alexander-akait@users.noreply.github.com> 1791279885 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791279885 +0300\n\nfix(hot): leave the HMR plugin out of the modes that never use it (#2466)\n\n* fix(hot): leave the HMR plugin out of the modes that never use it\n\nWith hot.client.apply set to reload or nothing no update is applied in place,\nso HotModuleReplacementPlugin only added its runtime to the bundle. A plugin\nalready in the configuration is kept and no longer reported as redundant.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01UjuMAuk9o6UazjHzcAQCTA\n\n* fix(client): reload a page that asked for hmr where the bundle has no runtime\n\nA page''s url can ask for hmr where the project''s own mode left the HMR\nruntime out of the bundle. There was nothing to apply the update with, and the\nhmr mode, which loads the page when an update cannot be applied, only logged,\nso the page stayed on code the build had replaced.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01UjuMAuk9o6UazjHzcAQCTA\n\n* fix(client): reload for a missing runtime only where it was left out on purpose\n\nA runtime missing from a project whose own mode wanted it is a mistake, and the\nexisting behaviour of reporting it once and never reloading is kept. The\nreload applies when the project''s mode is reload or nothing and the page''s url\nasked for hmr, where nothing else would bring the new code to the page.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01UjuMAuk9o6UazjHzcAQCTA\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxMMNCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA1Z8QAB/HJNlz0/povVUqjq37ZEvm\n7DkN7SnsuRoRYd5oS3MpBTWvF4o9Taxe1QmJrotni1ulFzVo/mtVGvf4fHGgx3Ub\n02JBQPGi145RQuZ0cWYG6BR/UFgHazuy1HHd/t0ukWialKMCKF8FauuJJmDDtPZf\njgwwBiVRLG31TY/P99V9keeKFnO7/YHtLkiqDaov84KrvEctQRGRrOEwdVFCXvFe\ndY9B8dnsqlxI4CmwNszvGbZgXPKPe+l490pMXI4zFcWfd4eUxNWy5qFs5Q6Obkqw\nNj/TsU/M0EdbJeVQ00pMqZcOMEZXdquYJXzCkotV4noE81rS4Qlxpu/h0tLKxYn3\nZY7FnrV15pIfNR1LDKczx3ZvCDm6WQg4eyV7UmisKBAmr8+C3iJRYSxgMIBzJDFV\n6Md6rrT