//avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4567934?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alexander-akait","id":4567934,"login":"alexander-akait","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1Njc5MzQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack-dev-middleware/commits/b5d87cfd0cd3eaa42bb0d80057e133723a020f69/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T09:22:49Z","email":"4567934+alexander-akait@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Alexander Akait"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T09:22:49Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(client): read the options a re-exporting module was given (#2464)\n\n* fix(client): read the options a re-exporting module was given\n\nA package that stands in for webpack-dev-middleware/client by re-exporting\nit, such as webpack-dev-server/client/index.js, is a module of its own. A\nquery written after its name belongs to it, so the client read nothing and\nconnected with its defaults.\n\nThe stand-in leaves the query in __webpack_dev_middleware_client_query__\nbefore requiring the client, which reads it when it has no query of its own.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01UjuMAuk9o6UazjHzcAQCTA\n\n* fix(client): take the query a stand-in left rather than keep it\n\nThe handed-over query stayed on the page after the client read it, so a\nsecond client loaded later without a query of its own was configured by a\nstand-in that was never meant for it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01UjuMAuk9o6UazjHzcAQCTA\n\n* docs: separate the statements in the stand-in example\n\nThe lint rule that checks code in the README wants a blank line before the\nexport.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01UjuMAuk9o6UazjHzcAQCTA\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a41496a77a57c73c3e5f90ba91efb02a60e91c86","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack-dev-middleware/git/trees/a41496a77a57c73c3e5f90ba91efb02a60e91c86"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack-dev-middleware/git/commits/b5d87cfd0cd3eaa42bb0d80057e133723a020f69","verification":{"payload":"tree a41496a77a57c73c3e5f90ba91efb02a60e91c86\nparent 7244e9f014cddc6f3349d4d07c31add8eb6e0ab0\nauthor Alexander Akait <4567934+alexander-akait@users.noreply.github.com> 1791278569 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791278569 +0300\n\nfix(client): read the options a re-exporting module was given (#2464)\n\n* fix(client): read the options a re-exporting module was given\n\nA package that stands in for webpack-dev-middleware/client by re-exporting\nit, such as webpack-dev-server/client/index.js, is a module of its own. A\nquery written after its name belongs to it, so the client read nothing and\nconnected with its defaults.\n\nThe stand-in leaves the query in __webpack_dev_middleware_client_query__\nbefore requiring the client, which reads it when it has no query of its own.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01UjuMAuk9o6UazjHzcAQCTA\n\n* fix(client): take the query a stand-in left rather than keep it\n\nThe handed-over query stayed on the page after the client read it, so a\nsecond client loaded later without a query of its own was configured by a\nstand-in that was never meant for it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01UjuMAuk9o6UazjHzcAQCTA\n\n* docs: separate the statements in the stand-in example\n\nThe lint rule that checks code in the README wants a blank line before the\nexport.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01UjuMAuk9o6UazjHzcAQCTA\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxL3pCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAjWoQABhHFK+kUVWxwsmaWTTd96ml\nYfN7AsItKqYFCOpZW35Wh3Fvj8uLo6ZcnA+eXPPuhwCyOdb1HOuDThKKFlSgBrSz\n1mJpqKrWvlkV/GTMb7VoJykR0DhFOcZt1lQKtbyppJzHOEtZAg6JfAEwGnm1heyS\nxHLsnqT7Jhy4IZnQOOcBSqjSYrBnRIMjgAnIFpHr0U3Tn2XmOgokCSSTxF263/L4\niMw6Lte7RrVbm9hDeMxKTldBmwPLGAgMPXWUNUcIgnmRdT7kv1Yr4jeS6KorTe8S\nCLLIPQTXohsL+qwxo7Vx5PPKV78hJ2+uOyEEMEQ8EVhP5UakrWHJ6PLqAfDOO8L4\n7o8XFtdjFsBjapBfb4ek9QKWI87K/9wsofHAy+4eOqnego9Snd3Jyc7Gn3sLASN+\nB2h7BRFcucRNm+gtp6iJiMHRs2cLH+kVhjxK3WMIhPrS2K7nsbPtv4KIk8Zd1fID\nyxyaWPfWEJ0KPqgRjHH1gXfiWq1EILPmEJOYt8C8jWJk/L/68qn57765RHZseCMa\nxiQDlrMHODhCuiRCs+yjFwSZ4mhUAq0YE4jCjZ6lP5WUQWxjcMRF6+M3Ehmafdz+\npnPf15tLY2jadXTNz+YzAxmCQ3PYBKCHfn7K2YOnbN9N3apfrHyQsE7fRgxwLUon\nWu4AiXvkzeM3jWxSTfGu\n=Y0dh\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-06T09:22:50Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followin