4ZmU5YjdjODM4MWEzODYwZTI0OGE1MjM1OWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/webpack/webpack-dev-middleware/commit/e58a70ba9c36f6acc10617f338b73269f951de35","sha":"e58a70ba9c36f6acc10617f338b73269f951de35","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack-dev-middleware/commits/e58a70ba9c36f6acc10617f338b73269f951de35"}],"sha":"13344e78b26d88fe9b7c8381a3860e248a52359b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack-dev-middleware/commits/13344e78b26d88fe9b7c8381a3860e248a52359b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4567934?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alexander-akait","id":4567934,"login":"alexander-akait","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1Njc5MzQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack-dev-middleware/commits/e58a70ba9c36f6acc10617f338b73269f951de35/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T19:13:22Z","email":"4567934+alexander-akait@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Alexander Akait"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T19:13:22Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"test(hot): reach 100% of the client, off the deprecated statsOptions (#2402)\n\nThe overlay''s payload test drove hot.statsOptions, which is deprecated\nand must not be what a test documents. It now sets stats: \"errors-only\",\nthe option that governs this, which needed a stats passthrough in the e2e\nhelper.\n\nThree more browser cases close what was reachable: restyling a card that\nis already open, an empty problem string through the encoder, and Escape\npressed inside the overlay frame rather than on the host page.\n\nWhat is left cannot be produced from a browser, so it is marked with the\nreason rather than faked: paging and rendering without a problem set, a\nlabel the document-less guard already covers, hot.check() rejecting while\nthe runtime is in abort/fail, an applied update that renews nothing, and\nan error event queued behind close(). client-src is at 100% of statements\nand 92.23% of branches.","tree":{"sha":"df46be38ef50540f71dd69d2adb7c870b15c06bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack-dev-middleware/git/trees/df46be38ef50540f71dd69d2adb7c870b15c06bb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack-dev-middleware/git/commits/e58a70ba9c36f6acc10617f338b73269f951de35","verification":{"payload":"tree df46be38ef50540f71dd69d2adb7c870b15c06bb\nparent 17e689e3290f6d0add35443ca049ea9b906d001b\nauthor Alexander Akait <4567934+alexander-akait@users.noreply.github.com> 1788376402 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788376402 +0300\n\ntest(hot): reach 100% of the client, off the deprecated statsOptions (#2402)\n\nThe overlay''s payload test drove hot.statsOptions, which is deprecated\nand must not be what a test documents. It now sets stats: \"errors-only\",\nthe option that governs this, which needed a stats passthrough in the e2e\nhelper.\n\nThree more browser cases close what was reachable: restyling a card that\nis already open, an empty problem string through the encoder, and Escape\npressed inside the overlay frame rather than on the host page.\n\nWhat is left cannot be produced from a browser, so it is marked with the\nreason rather than faked: paging and rendering without a problem set, a\nlabel the document-less guard already covers, hot.check() rejecting while\nthe runtime is in abort/fail, an applied update that renews nothing, and\nan error event queued behind close(). client-src is at 100% of statements\nand 92.23% of branches.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqmHVSCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAexEQAIJ01p9f1sgeOTsKexBM5GCF\nLMIarzY6kk76GBZ7vGgx7Iwg8+JlZO6BoD3BDtqU505zGDpUjiM6KOe2nLGS30my\nOmIoIRUEdQnwLD6gBBVwfaW1Qf70iCAdlbBmkwDV6RuVMLLvHv9PApRFO7MKaJ4G\nBdB9pA6ZQObzA/tDL8fTpX4mwCskON+gFEEZujuXu58yJSyLeYzDDJKzGBSZVBpB\nO5Bfr4qWNyITAvY7qVv7IETblZaajlBglcRF96c4/ijz3e34v2DSjtGpJkC2ibcH\nMr7qUQQUH7ZHnZPSfsI4NaaqlE9tyjFUSMU3hqHPXKZNVaD7YbUCVYGvBx8zTQBf\nBc0L3nFoPn130JqWgar4dY4mooH/SeRApXZAWeJtnZNj2TM+W6Z5PjpyhhpVl/zA\nJ3z+L97pKJRG0RDgf7A6aGyOD5kjIlbCZukBq3caW9W7YiWZiJ+wMNFhsPUVE+3h\npLXwELU3au7dV+SUIBRC2FxTyRhXAoqzsg8nTwha+4tTWqlkx7H3irZair/Q/HFD\n5+jTt4HoECKkuR/rypTnAG3SWf6la+xG/g/mDOVfKjGMrqifJXYmk2Zp0Wjh9fzU\n9YuojnzdQUf0pg0KaqqAQ21CZZuzQ2FxJNuLnXM/Jcvno+Xzt/u9i2olsPQt/07i\nlodRZPaZh5aKqEj4Ej9w\n=f3l+\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-02T19:13:23Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/star