tps://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack-dev-middleware/commits/7edc8a81feba94b8897506fc72bc4b736abe3f1f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T19:15:14Z","email":"49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"dependabot[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T19:15:14Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore(deps): bump brace-expansion (#2388)\n\nBumps  and [brace-expansion](https://github.com/juliangruber/brace-expansion). These dependencies needed to be updated together.\n\nUpdates `brace-expansion` from 1.1.12 to 1.1.18\n- [Release notes](https://github.com/juliangruber/brace-expansion/releases)\n- [Commits](https://github.com/juliangruber/brace-expansion/compare/v1.1.12...v1.1.18)\n\nUpdates `brace-expansion` from 5.0.6 to 5.0.9\n- [Release notes](https://github.com/juliangruber/brace-expansion/releases)\n- [Commits](https://github.com/juliangruber/brace-expansion/compare/v1.1.12...v1.1.18)\n\nUpdates `brace-expansion` from 2.1.0 to 2.1.4\n- [Release notes](https://github.com/juliangruber/brace-expansion/releases)\n- [Commits](https://github.com/juliangruber/brace-expansion/compare/v1.1.12...v1.1.18)\n\n---\nupdated-dependencies:\n- dependency-name: brace-expansion\n  dependency-version: 1.1.18\n  dependency-type: indirect\n- dependency-name: brace-expansion\n  dependency-version: 5.0.9\n  dependency-type: indirect\n- dependency-name: brace-expansion\n  dependency-version: 2.1.4\n  dependency-type: indirect\n...\n\nSigned-off-by: dependabot[bot] <support@github.com>\nCo-authored-by: dependabot[bot] <49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"f7d13ea8238fc009ab15452906b14e5cab84510d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack-dev-middleware/git/trees/f7d13ea8238fc009ab15452906b14e5cab84510d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack-dev-middleware/git/commits/7ed