i.github.com/repos/benbalter/benbalter.github.com/commits/9d7b008e081d2e2a820505e6c9047488d059c6e7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T22:06:22Z","email":"ben@balter.com","name":"Ben Balter"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T22:06:22Z","email":"ben@balter.com","name":"Ben Balter"},"message":"Fix a Travis CI typo and drop three dead links with no archive\n\nRefs #1915. \"travisci.org\" was a typo for travis-ci.org and never\nworked; Travis CI now lives at travis-ci.com. Two fbo.gov opportunity\npages and a colorado.edu handout are gone with no Wayback snapshot:\nkeep the text, drop the links (and the bare URL in one footnote, which\nwould otherwise be autolinked again).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5d74299de701286fc4406810161f026771676991","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/benbalter.github.com/git/trees/5d74299de701286fc4406810161f026771676991"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/benbalter.github.com/git/commits/9d7b008e081d2e2a820505e6c9047488d059c6e7","verification":{"payload":"tree 5d74299de701286fc4406810161f026771676991\nparent eea6445cfba454ea4683b641eaf1b62f3516d954\nauthor Ben Balter <ben@balter.com> 1791151582 -0400\ncommitter Ben Balter <ben@balter.com> 1791151582 -0400\n\nFix a Travis CI typo and drop three dead links with no archive\n\nRefs #1915. \"travisci.org\" was a typo for travis-ci.org and never\nworked; Travis CI now lives at travis-ci.com. Two fbo.gov opportunity\npages and a colorado.edu handout are gone with no Wayback snapshot:\nkeep the text, drop the links (and the bare URL in one footnote, which\nwould otherwise be autolinked again).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAglXOcMjmJIigvM4sxbnhlTp+cJ7\n0kd3+1606Kav0bdzkAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQMlTx8lAE4TMhefTclh+Soxef/tvjND7v4iTzIcyTKzg