nbalter/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/benbalter","id":282759,"login":"benbalter","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4Mjc1OQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/benbalter.github.com/commits/eea6445cfba454ea4683b641eaf1b62f3516d954/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T22:06:16Z","email":"ben@balter.com","name":"Ben Balter"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T22:06:16Z","email":"ben@balter.com","name":"Ben Balter"},"message":"Point more dead links at Wayback Machine snapshots\n\nRefs #1915. Second pass over links the first triage left as \"probably\nbot-blocked\". A stricter recheck (curl, browser user agent, redirects\nfollowed, TLS and DNS failures distinguished) found eight that are\nreally dead: 404s, a domain sold and now redirecting to an unrelated\nmarketing page (blog.dobt.co), a redirect to a host that no longer\nresolves, and a site whose origin is down. Each now points at the\nlatest 200 snapshot on or before the post''s date. Only link targets\nchanged; every edited line matches the original once the\nweb.archive.org/web/<ts>/ prefix is removed.\n\nContent-Integrity: reviewed\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"860d674cde5d71b32de493f6dd3c9a2cd9a11ad6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/benbalter.github.com/git/trees/860d674cde5d71b32de493f6dd3c9a2cd9a11ad6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/benbalter.github.com/git/commits/eea6445cfba454ea4683b641eaf1b62f3516d954","verification":{"payload":"tree 860d674cde5d71b32de493f6dd3c9a2cd9a11ad6\nparent 93d61ef611f5a3ece67891446464aebbf1d2e75b\nauthor Ben Balter <ben@balter.com> 1791151576 -0400\ncommitter Ben Balter <ben@balter.com> 1791151576 -0400\n\nPoint more dead links at Wayback Machine snapshots\n\nRefs #1915. Second pass over links the first triage left as \"probably\nbot-blocked\". A stricter recheck (curl, browser user agent, redirects\nfollowed, TLS and DNS failures distinguished) found eight that are\nreally dead: 404s, a domain sold and now redirecting to an unrelated\nmarketing page (blog.dobt.co), a redirect to a host that no longer\nresolves, and a site whose origin is down. Each now points at the\nlatest 200 snapshot on or before the post''s date. Only link targets\nchanged; every edited line matches the original once the\nweb.archive.org/web/<ts>/ prefix is removed.\n\nContent-Integrity: reviewed\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAglXOcMjmJIigvM4sxbnhlTp+cJ7\n0kd3+1606Kav0bdzkAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQJ/gEEfL/6zlr8pf1HHOx1irHFdAYjCjg50d1fnclp+JKh0uFFp/hAHBlbAVHC9JEF\nKlTPo3l3lJOVVZjxFDPQY=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-04T22:06:25Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/282759?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/benbalter","id":282759,"login":"benbalter","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4Mjc1OQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/orgs","received_events_url"