s://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/benbalter.github.com/commits/e08441e605c6ecabf5919e17783a74a9fab8335a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T21:31:28Z","email":"ben@balter.com","name":"Ben Balter"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T21:31:28Z","email":"ben@balter.com","name":"Ben Balter"},"message":"Re-enable the scroll-restoration test; the failure was the test''s\n\nBack navigation does restore scroll on this site. The test clicked the\nContact link in the non-sticky header, and Playwright''s click() scrolls\nits target into view first, so the page was at scrollY 0 when the\nhistory entry saved it. Navigating by location.href instead keeps the\nscroll position, and the test passes 10/10.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6a3f6a9d63200f38df6ead83ee4685969d801f37","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/benbalter.github.com/git/trees/6a3f6a9d63200f38df6ead83ee4685969d801f37"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/benbalter.github.com/git/commits/e08441e605c6ecabf5919e17783a74a9fab8335a","verification":{"payload":"tree 6a3f6a9d63200f38df6ead83ee4685969d801f37\nparent 93d61ef611f5a3ece67891446464aebbf1d2e75b\nauthor Ben Balter <ben@balter.com> 1791149488 -0400\ncommitter Ben Balter <ben@balter.com> 1791149488 -0400\n\nRe-enable the scroll-restoration test; the failure was the test''s\n\nBack navigation does restore scroll on this site. The test clicked the\nContact link in the non-sticky header, and Playwright''s click() scrolls\nits target into view first, so the page was at scrollY 0 when the\nhistory entry saved it. Navigating by location.href instead keeps the\nscroll position, and the test passes 10/10.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAglXOcMjmJIigvM4sxbnhlTp+cJ7\n0kd3+1606Kav0bdzkAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQKGoMx9zbWDl