/api.github.com/repos/benbalter/benbalter.github.com/git/trees/67c8038ae8c5a696999060bc8f18dcf57cff960d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/benbalter.github.com/git/commits/80cd84d0f69f502febb4474806e9ddb66d2e4e0c","verification":{"payload":"tree 67c8038ae8c5a696999060bc8f18dcf57cff960d\nparent ead76b7a1ff8394c854b7818a5dc79c3a62f6802\nauthor Ben Balter <ben@balter.com> 1791148646 -0400\ncommitter Ben Balter <ben@balter.com> 1791148646 -0400\n\nRead the E2E Worker port from package.json\n\nKeeps the preview:worker script as the one place the port is set, so\nPlaywright''s baseURL and webServer URL can''t drift from where wrangler\nactually listens. Fails loudly if the script loses its --port.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAglXOcMjmJIigvM4sxbnhlTp+cJ7\n0kd3+1606Kav0bdzkAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQGc6LesxjevZtv0HF+C+bZceJRgQJ3Fdn3LLq/Rmr36GoJXJ7IUPaIGhpyXarqJDis\nrAr5YYCFB7WoGZJw6/XAo=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-04T21:17:30Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/282759?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/benbalter","id":282759,"login":"benbalter","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4Mjc1OQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/user