1:15:13Z","email":"ben@balter.com","name":"Ben Balter"},"message":"Run E2E tests against the real Worker instead of astro preview\n\nastro preview serves dist-astro/ as plain files, so the E2E suite never\ntouched the production request path: worker/index.js (Markdown content\nnegotiation, POST /api/event), public/_headers, the built _redirects,\ntrailing-slash redirects, or the 404 page. A redirect test sat in\ntest.fixme for exactly that reason.\n\nThe new preview:worker script runs `wrangler dev --local` (wrangler is\nalready a devDependency) on 127.0.0.1:8792. Local mode needs no Cloudflare\ncredentials and simulates the ENGAGEMENT Analytics Engine binding. The\nport avoids 4321 and wrangler''s default 8787 so Playwright never reuses\nanother local project''s server. Playwright''s webServer starts it locally,\nCI starts it in the Playwright job, and setting BASE_URL skips webServer.\n\nCoverage added in e2e/worker.spec.ts: Markdown negotiation (content type,\nVary: Accept, _headers surviving the Worker''s header copy, q=0 refusal),\n_headers on pages and hashed assets, public/_redirects and generated\nredirect rules, and /api/event. The trailing-slash test is un-fixme''d.\n\nThe faster server exposed a race in the TL;DR touch tests: tapping during\nthe box''s entrance animation makes Playwright retry with a scroll, which\nsmooth scrolling keeps animating after the tap, and the tooltip closes on\nscroll. waitForTldrSettled waits for that animation first.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c901df26557f5c4f6e41f0db7d9046faee62ce5f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/benbalter.github.com/git/trees/c901df26557f5c4f6e41f0db7d9046faee62ce5f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/benbalter.github.com/git/commits/ead76b7a1ff8394c854b7818a5dc79c3a62f6802","verification":{"payload":"tree c901df26557f5c4f6e41f0db7d9046faee62ce5f\nparent 2b54bedf3c38a38f1f0742275322343bda1b595d\nauthor Ben Balter <ben@balter.com> 1791148513 -0400\ncommitter Ben Balter <ben@balter.com> 1791148513 -0400\n\nRun E2E tests against the real Worker instead of astro preview\n\nastro preview serves dist-astro/ as plain files, so the E2E suite never\ntouched the production request path: worker/index.js (Markdown content\nnegotiation, POST /api/event), public/_headers, the built _redirects,\ntrailing-slash redirects, or the 404 page. A redirect test sat in\ntest.fixme for exactly that reason.\n\nThe new preview:worker script runs `wrangler dev --local` (wrangler is\nalready a devDependency) on 127.0.0.1:8792. Local mode needs no Cloudflare\ncredentials and simulates the ENGAGEMENT Analytics Engine binding. The\nport avoids 4321 and wrangler''s default 8787 so Playwright never reuses\nanother local project''s server. Playwright''s webServer starts it locally,\nCI starts it in the Playwright job, and setting BASE_URL skips webServer.\n\nCoverage added in e2e/worker.spec.ts: Markdown negotiation (content type,\nVary: Accept, _headers surviving the Worker''s header copy, q=0 refusal),\n_headers on pages and hashed assets, public/_redirects and generated\nredirect rules, and /api/event. The trailing-slash test is un-fixme''d.\n\nThe faster server exposed a race in the TL;DR touch tests: tapping during\nthe box''s entrance animation makes Playwright retry with a scroll, which\nsmooth scrolling keeps animating after the tap, and the tooltip closes on\nscroll. waitForTldrSettled waits for that animation first.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAglXOcMjmJIigvM4sxbnhlTp+cJ7\n0kd3+1606Kav0bdzkAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQD6Q0WLjqhMailQIi/aoAkpgxlqShO2WiyFR5z0z9qIBEMjLsGPjgrDErbVjyADMcO\nsQcJhp79517EosGyC2Ag4=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-04T21:17:30Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com