rl":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/benbalter.github.com/commits/e30a937f52273e83ccc109cd384e017090f6e0d6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T21:13:54Z","email":"ben@balter.com","name":"Ben Balter"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T21:13:54Z","email":"ben@balter.com","name":"Ben Balter"},"message":"Test og-image-path and count the Worker in coverage\n\nog-image-path decides whether the advertised og:image matches a file\nthat actually gets built, and had no tests. The Worker''s tests ran but\nits coverage never showed up because coverage only included src/.\nscript/ stays out: it''s mostly untested CLI glue and would bury real\nregressions in the total.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cb814372046e969c3f47cb4524ce2a3fe22eba0d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/benbalter.github.com/git/trees/cb814372046e969c3f47cb4524ce2a3fe22eba0d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/benbalter.github.com/git/commits/e30a937f52273e83ccc109cd384e017090f6e0d6","verification":{"payload":"tree cb814372046e969c3f47cb4524ce2a3fe22eba0d\nparent 161c86c1826cac077b7ed860c68fe53003974461\nauthor Ben Balter <ben@balter.com> 1791148434 -0400\ncommitter Ben Balter <ben@balter.com> 1791148434 -0400\n\nTest og-image-path and count the Worker in coverage\n\nog-image-path decides whether the advertised og:image matches a file\nthat actually gets built, and had no tests. The Worker''s tests ran but\nits coverage never showed up because coverage only included src/.\nscript/ stays out: it''s mostly untested CLI glue and would bury real\nregressions in the total.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAglXOcMjmJIigvM4sxbnhlTp+cJ7\n0kd3+1606Kav0bdzkAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQKEuVQ3bJ9oY3ggaekwVdit0dw6lNUr6wZfsVOpSYnZlag+Jow80Kjze5iieQTiCND\n0FznoeFJf4jLXCRS/HRA8=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-04T21:13:57Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/282759?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/benbalter","id":282759,"login":"benbalter","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4Mjc1OQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/benbalter/benbalter.github.com/commit/e30a937f52273e83ccc109cd384e017090f6e0d6","node_id":"C_kwDOAFLaS9oAKGUzMGE5MzdmNTIyNzNlODNjY2MxMDljZDM4NGUwMTcwOTBmNmUwZDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/benbalter/benbalter.github.com/commit/161c86c1826cac077b7ed860c68fe53003974461","sha":"161c86c1826cac077b7ed860c68fe53003974461","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/benbalter.github.com/commits/161c86c1826cac077b7ed860c68fe53003974461"}],"sha":"e30a937f52273e83ccc109cd384e017090f6e0d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/benbalter.github.com/commits/e30a937f52273e83ccc109cd384e017090f6e0d6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/282759?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/benbalter","id":282759,"login":"benbalter","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4Mjc1OQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/benbalter.github.com/commits/161c86c1826cac077b7ed860c68fe53003974461/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T21:13:54Z","email":"ben@balter.com","name":"Ben Balter"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T21:13:54Z","email":"ben@balter.com","name":"Ben Balter"},"message":"Clear knip''s unused exports and make them fail\n\nknip reported 23 unused exports and exported types as warnings, so CI\npassed while they piled up. Three e2e helpers were dead code; delete\nthem. The rest are used inside their own module, so drop the export.\nThen make exports and types errors, so the list stays empty.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a0ffebcb32c6f8aa6e1f6240310046aca4bbdf52","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/benbalter.github.com/git/trees/a0ffebcb32c6f8aa6e1f6240310046aca4bbdf52"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/benbalter.github.com/git/commits/161c86c1826cac077b7ed860c68fe53003974461","verification":{"payload":"tree a0ffebcb32c6f8aa6e1f6240310046aca4bbdf52\nparent d8ccf6a3755825fcc185d82e0bc4f5b9d3f73c93\nauthor Ben Balter <ben@balter.com> 1791148434 -0400\ncommitter Ben Balter <ben@balter.com> 1791148434 -0400\n\nClear knip''s unused exports and make them fail\n\nknip reported 23 unused exports and exported types as warnings, so CI\npassed while they piled up. Three e2e helpers were dead code; delete\nthem. The rest are used inside their own module, so drop the export.\nThen make exports and types errors, so the list stays empty.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAglXOcMjmJIigvM4sxbnhlTp+cJ7\n0kd3+1606Kav0bdzkAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQHfc4e1a6wx2Go45PBc3djKoV/GaD9gYnGpyhogtz0lbx7IZNFnimzJ+4UxH05ec+S\nySzey2hg1RB3tAYIsIygM=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-04T21:13:57Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/282759?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/benbalter","id":282759,"login":"benbalter","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4Mjc1OQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/benbalter/benbalter.github.com/commit/161c86c1826cac077b7ed860c68fe53003974461","node_id":"C_kwDOAFLaS9oAKDE2MWM4NmMxODI2Y2FjMDc3YjdlZDg2MGM2OGZlNTMwMDM5NzQ0NjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/benbalter/benbalter.github.com/commit/d8ccf6a3755825fcc185d82e0bc4f5b9d3f73c93","sha":"d8ccf6a3755825fcc185d82e0bc4f5b9d3f73c93","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/benbalter.github.com/commits/d8ccf6a3755825fcc185d82e0bc4f5b9d3f73c93"}],"sha":"161c86c1826cac077b7ed860c68fe53003974461","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/benbalter.github.com/commits/161c86c1826cac077b7ed860c68fe53003974461"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/282759?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/benbalter","id":282759,"login":"benbalter","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4Mjc1OQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/benbalter.github.com/commits/d8ccf6a3755825fcc185d82e0bc4f5b9d3f73c93/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T21:13:54Z","email":"ben@balter.com","name":"Ben Balter"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T21:13:54Z","email":"ben@balter.com","name":"Ben Balter"},"message":"Make the 404 page''s suggestion match on the slug\n\nIt compared the full URL (host included) against the first 500 sitemap\nURLs. A different host locally, or a wrong date in the path, outweighed\nthe slug a reader actually typed, so a truncated 2021 link could\nsuggest a 2011 post. The 500 cap never mattered: the sitemap has ~200\nURLs.\n\nclosestPath compares slugs, lets a slug that starts with the requested\none win outright (truncated links are the common miss), and breaks ties\non the full path. The page now also uses the shared post helpers.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"448a9e7b915295c2ae96f2c34cec68cfba408051","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/benbalter.github.com/git/trees/448a9e7b915295c2ae96f2c34cec68cfba408051"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/benbalter.github.com/git/commits/d8ccf6a3755825fcc185d82e0bc4f5b9d3f73c93","verification":{"payload":"tree 448a9e7b915295c2ae96f2c34cec68cfba408051\nparent f223bdc66d9b4c6c5cd74f45bd8af8cf3eff3c25\nauthor Ben Balter <ben@balter.com> 1791148434 -0400\ncommitter Ben Balter <ben@balter.com> 1791148434 -0400\n\nMake the 404 page''s suggestion match on the slug\n\nIt compared the full URL (host included) against the first 500 sitemap\nURLs. A different host locally, or a wrong date in the path, outweighed\nthe slug a reader actually typed, so a truncated 2021 link could\nsuggest a 2011 post. The 500 cap never mattered: the sitemap has ~200\nURLs.\n\nclosestPath compares slugs, lets a slug that starts with the requested\none win outright (truncated links are the common miss), and breaks ties\non the full path. The page now also uses the shared post helpers.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAglXOcMjmJIigvM4sxbnhlTp+cJ7\n0kd3+1606Kav0bdzkAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQLhlftKJ8BsuDJ2U6HQJCM8r4HARvf723P50zJNmIFwNx9XT0krPYQTwVQ/0CBAauB\nSjFeW0OcuLbJcqBtA65w0=\n-----END SSH SI