mmitter Ben Balter <ben@balter.com> 1791147144 -0400\n\nDrop the pointer to the private pi-hole repo from the home network post\n\nThe August 2026 update linked benbalter/pi-hole, which is private, so\nevery reader got a GitHub 404, and it pointed a public site at a private\nrepo. Say the setup has grown (OpenTofu alongside Docker and Ansible)\nwithout naming it; the public repo linked below still works.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAglXOcMjmJIigvM4sxbnhlTp+cJ7\n0kd3+1606Kav0bdzkAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQGEkP5WAZP+e+SF1hh6Kd9Ac1imIDH/3tVzTuiXBM6aqJcINJuxI0KInYI/MrcXBIi\n5OfN4m88nJvOVoeXqFRwM=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-04T20:52:28Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/282759?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/benbalter","id":282759,"login":"benbalter","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4Mjc1OQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/benbalter/benbalter.github.com/commit/0f9b42ee73c167f3e94d22542800de7f57c211e4","node_id":"C_kwDOAFLaS9oAKDBmOWI0MmVlNzNjMTY3ZjNlOTRkMjI1NDI4MDBkZTdmNTdjMjExZTQ