hine has no\ncopies. Point each at the last commit that still had the file, so the\nlinks show exactly what the post described.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAglXOcMjmJIigvM4sxbnhlTp+cJ7\n0kd3+1606Kav0bdzkAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQLMUwogF5KUlQtNjE0pdRPEu3prloDnxL7kytv5Y8JngwjmHn+Wl/ItwV+9MhunU1Q\n4pVqGvua83Q96EqTSFlAA=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-04T16:04:44Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/282759?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/benbalter","id":282759,"login":"benbalter","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4Mjc1OQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/benbalter/benbalter.github.com/commit/85dcd93c6b04d90a054e13ea8f2d4ac1341a444d","node_id":"C_kwDOAFLaS9oAKDg1ZGNkOTNjNmIwNGQ5MGEwNTRlMTNlYThmMmQ0YWMxMzQxYTQ0NGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/benbalter/benbalter.github.com/commit/19d465f133c8f2fca3586c1f1b86bfcb5c2d0c37","sha":"19d465f133c8f2fca3586c1f1b86bfcb5c2d0c37","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/benbalter.github.com/commits/19d465f133c8f2fca3586c1f1b86bfcb5c2d0c37"}],"sha":"85dcd93c6b04d90a054e13ea8f2d4ac1341a444d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/benbalter.github.com/commits/85dcd93c6b04d90a054e13ea8f2d4ac1341a444d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/282759?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/benbalter","id":282759,"login":"benbalter","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4Mjc1OQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/benbalter.github.com/commits/19d465f133c8f2fca3586c1f1b86bfcb5c2d0c37/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T16:04:02Z","email":"ben@balter.com","name":"Ben Balter"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T16:04:02Z","email":"ben@balter.com","name":"Ben Balter"},"message":"Point dead links in old posts at Wayback Machine snapshots\n\nRefs #1915. A fresh lychee scan of the post sources found links that now\n404, return 410, or whose domains no longer resolve. Each was re-checked\nwith a browser user agent so bot-blocking (401/403/429, timeouts) isn''t\nmistaken for a dead page; only confirmed-dead links are touched.\n\nEach one now points at the latest Wayback snapshot that returned 200 on\nor before the post''s date (or, failing that, the earliest within two\nyears after), matching how older posts already cite archived pages.\nReaders get the page the post was written against, not a 404 or\nwhatever the domain hosts now.\n\nOnly link targets outside code fences changed; every edited line is\nidentical to the original once the web.archive.org/web/<ts>/ prefix is\nremoved.\n\nContent-Integrity: reviewed\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5af4ae3bc576d0b64636f802b796e61782d9d7fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/benbalter.github.com/git/trees/5af4ae3bc576d0b64636f802b796e61782d9d7fe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/benbalter.github.com/git/commits/19d465f133c8f2fca3586c1f1b86bfcb5c2d0c37","verification":{"payload":"tree 5af4ae3bc576d0b64636f802b796e61782d9d7fe\nparent edb8efd705531ef2996498b6ed4bd8aeb80d3f1c\nauthor Ben Balter <ben@balter.com> 1791129842 -0400\ncommitter Ben Balter <ben@balter.com> 1791129842 -0400\n\nPoint dead links in old posts at Wayback Machine snapshots\n\nRefs #1915. A fresh lychee scan of the post sources found links that now\n404, return 410, or whose domains no longer resolve. Each was re-checked\nwith a browser user agent so bot-blocking (401/403/429, timeouts) isn''t\nmistaken for a dead page; only confirmed-dead links are touched.\n\nEach one now points at the latest Wayback snapshot that returned 200 on\nor before the post''s date (or, failing that, the earliest within two\nyears after), matching how older posts already cite archived pages.\nReaders get the page the post was written against, not a 404 or\nwhatever the domain hosts now.\n\nOnly link targets outside code fences changed; every edited line is\nidentical to the original once the web.archive.org/web/<ts>/ prefix is\nremoved.\n\nContent-Integrity: reviewed\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAglXOcMjmJIigvM4sxbnhlTp+cJ7\n0kd3+1606Kav0bdzkAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIA