ed out, so no\nmodulepreload links were injected. Static imports and `export * from`\nre-exports are now `''static''` and `''reexport-star''`; dynamic imports and\nimport.meta stay excluded, matching the previous behavior.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: renovate[bot] <29139614+renovate[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Ben Balter <ben@balter.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2587d59444f6f5c1b3e01780b4d23c20d3ba998e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/benbalter.github.com/git/trees/2587d59444f6f5c1b3e01780b4d23c20d3ba998e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/benbalter.github.com/git/commits/2d168822f0fce99f499e4f66189c312d50c5088e","verification":{"payload":"tree 2587d59444f6f5c1b3e01780b4d23c20d3ba998e\nparent 314efdeda7bf1ed764fe4fa4517d01e77b514d70\nauthor renovate[bot] <29139614+renovate[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1791121522 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791121522 +0000\n\nchore(deps): update dependency es-module-lexer to v3 (#2049)\n\n* chore(deps): update dependency es-module-lexer to v3\n\n* Adapt modulepreload injection to es-module-lexer v3\n\nv3 replaced the terse import record fields with named ones: `n` is now\n`specifier`, and the `d === -1` static-import sentinel is now a `type`\nstring. With the old fields every import was filtered out, so no\nmodulepreload links were injected. Static imports and `export * from`\nre-exports are now `''static''` and `''reexport-star''`; dynamic imports and\nimport.meta stay excluded, matching the previous behavior.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: renovate[bot] <29139614+renovate[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Ben Balter <ben@balter.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqwlhyCRC1aQ7uu5Uhl