n@balter.com","name":"Ben Balter"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T13:30:47Z","email":"ben@balter.com","name":"Ben Balter"},"message":"Make agent guidance visible to Claude Code\n\nClaude Code reads CLAUDE.md but not .github/copilot-instructions.md,\n.github/agents/ or .github/instructions/, and the two hand-maintained\ninstruction files had drifted (CLAUDE.md said `npm run lint-md` only\nruns report-only remark; it also runs `markdownlint-cli2 --fix` on\nevery Markdown file). One source that both tools read can''t drift.\n\n- Merge the Copilot instructions into AGENTS.md, keeping the\n  repo-specific facts CLAUDE.md lacked and dropping generic advice.\n- CLAUDE.md imports AGENTS.md.\n- Copilot keeps reading the agents and scoped instructions in .github/.\n  Claude Code gets them through symlinks in .claude/agents/ and\n  .claude/rules/, so there''s still one copy. The scoped instructions\n  gain a `paths:` key (Claude''s name for `applyTo:`). The agents drop\n  `tools: [\"*\"]`, since leaving `tools` out means \"all tools\" in both.\n- Exclude .claude from markdownlint like .github: the symlinks would\n  otherwise pull .github''s asterisk-bulleted files into the check.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"88d0e4640b46777b77ae945d0d327f3c7f76ba83","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/benbalter.github.com/git/trees/88d0e4640b46777b77ae945d0d327f3c7f76ba83"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/benbalter.github.com/git/commits/77bd001f6a63c928e46e0e58f5cda2bbe07edbe7","verification":{"payload":"tree 88d0e4640b46777b77ae945d0d327f3c7f76ba83\nparent 7de44c0a3ae4f17a3c379c96f8e4c5d2445d2205\nauthor Ben Balter <ben@balter.com> 1791055178 -0400\ncommitter Ben Balter <ben@balter.com> 1791120647 -0400\n\nMake agent guidance visible to Claude Code\n\nClaude Code reads CLAUDE.md but not .github/copilot-instructions.md,\n.github/agents/ or .github/instructions/, and the two hand-maintained\ninstruction files had drifted (CLAUDE.md said `npm run lint-md` only\nruns report-only remark; it also runs `markdownlint-cli2 --fix` on\nevery Markdown file). One source that both tools read can''t drift.\n\n- Merge the Copilot instructions into AGENTS.md, keeping the\n  repo-specific facts CLAUDE.md lacked and dropping generic advice.\n- CLAUDE.md imports AGENTS.md.\n- Copilot keeps reading the agents and scoped instructions in .github/.\n  Claude Code gets them through symlinks in .claude/agents/ and\n  .claude/rules/, so there''s still one copy. The scoped instructions\n  gain a `paths:` key (Claude''s name for `applyTo:`). The agents drop\n  `tools: [\"*\"]`, since leaving `tools` out means \"all tools\" in both.\n- Exclude .claude from markdownlint like .github: the symlinks would\n  otherwise pull .github''s asterisk-bulleted files into the check.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAglXOcMjmJIigvM4sxbnhlTp+cJ7\n0kd3+1606Kav0bdzkAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQM+CAK4W3gzAF4Oq7DbayGHktMd3oXuXyJiC5HOlMTldGcRbyyvWLykbjYrKgk8SFB\nZP7gkvf3T2APby5PbTyAk=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-04T13:30:53Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/282759?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/benbalter","id":282759,"login":"benbalter","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4Mjc1OQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/repos","site_