com/commits/33f9a2b3b879d68acab0a05e336645fe9be61a54/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T19:28:09Z","email":"ben@balter.com","name":"Ben Balter"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T19:28:09Z","email":"ben@balter.com","name":"Ben Balter"},"message":"Tell Knip that op is a system binary\n\nCode Tests failed on this branch because Knip reported an \"Unlisted\nbinary: op\" in script/analytics.mjs, which now shells out to the\n1Password CLI via execFileSync(''op'', ...) to resolve op:// references.\nKnip treats any executable it sees invoked as something that should come\nfrom an npm package, and unlisted binaries are an error. op is a system\ntool like vale and yamllint, so it belongs in ignoreBinaries.\n\nThe unused-export lines in the same log (checkNoConsoleErrors etc.) are\npre-existing on main and only warn, per the rules block; they weren''t\nthe cause.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e06850f6c497ac103b302e02e88c98b42a6ec576","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/benbalter.github.com/git/trees/e06850f6c497ac103b302e02e88c98b42a6ec576"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/benbalter.github.com/git/commits/33f9a2b3b879d68acab0a05e336645fe9be61a54","verification":{"payload":"tree e06850f6c497ac103b302e02e88c98b42a6ec576\nparent e1e9ba32a915506d98c1b3cf1cecd97d7c392b6b\nauthor Ben Balter <ben@balter.com> 1791055689 -0400\ncommitter Ben Balter <ben@balter.com> 1791055689 -0400\n\nTell Knip that op is a system binary\n\nCode Tests failed on this branch because Knip reported an \"Unlisted\nbinary: op\" in script/analytics.mjs, which now shells out to the\n1Password CLI via execFileSync(''op'', ...) to resolve op:// references.\nKnip treats any executable it sees invoked as something that should come\nfrom an npm package, and unlisted binaries are an error. op is a system\ntool like vale and yamllint, so it belongs in ignoreBinaries.\n\nThe unused-export lines in the same log (checkNoConsoleErrors etc.) are\npre-existing on main and only warn, per the rules block; they weren''t\nthe cause.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAglXOcMjmJIigvM4sxbnhlTp+cJ7\n0kd3+1606Kav0bdzkAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQOif5MI19ElcP3n3OxURzSiFXZEv4XzSH9DET0MijBmpzhZio/tGT/xeJTwAAtzLgw\nGMf+9x6BoZiiI8pmHEfg8=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-03T19:28:11Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/282759?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/benbalter","id":282759,"login":"benbalter","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4Mjc1OQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/benbalter/benbalter.github.com/commit/33f9a2b3b879d68acab0a05e336645fe9be61a54","node_id":"C_kwDOAFLaS9oAKDMzZjlhMmIzYjg3OWQ2OGFjYWIwYTA1ZTMzNjY0NWZlOWJlNjFhNTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/benbalter/benbalter.github.com/commit/e1e9ba32a915506d98c1b3cf1cecd97d7c392b6b","sha":"e1e9ba32a915506d98c1b3cf1cecd97d7c392b6b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/benbalter.github.com/commits/e1e9ba32a915506d98c1b3cf1cecd97d7c392b6b"}],"sha":"3