from 2026-09-03 until it was dropped in\nbenbalter/renovate-config@2482ee7. Removing the helper doesn''t unpin\nanything: Renovate keeps maintaining whatever it already pinned, so every\naction bump arrived as a SHA-rewrite PR. That churn is noise. Version\ntags still get Renovate updates, and the diffs say what changed.\n\nDocker images keep their version tag and drop the @sha256 digest for the\nsame reason. Generated lock files (gh-aw *.lock.yml,\ndevcontainer-lock.json) are left as their generators write them.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"510dcca10aba638eae8c316eeca8614feb8f91e3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/benbalter.github.com/git/trees/510dcca10aba638eae8c316eeca8614feb8f91e3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/benbalter.github.com/git/commits/0eb8dc96e2175f15e86fe29f68ea46474aa79dcf","verification":{"payload":"tree 510dcca10aba638eae8c316eeca8614feb8f91e3\nparent 50209134f96be759b3693fbec4cc4f59b20bad81\nauthor Ben Balter <ben@balter.com> 1791053846 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791053846 -0400\n\nReference GitHub Actions by version tag, not SHA (#2055)\n\nThese pins came from the shared Renovate preset, which extended\nhelpers:pinGitHubActionDigests from 2026-09-03 until it was dropped in\nbenbalter/renovate-config@2482ee7. Removing the helper doesn''t unpin\nanything: Renovate keeps maintaining whatever it already pinned, so every\naction bump arrived as a SHA-rewrite PR. That churn is noise. Version\ntags still get Renovate updates, and the diffs say what changed.\n\nDocker images keep their version tag and drop the @sha256 digest for the\nsame reason. Generated lock files (gh-aw *.lock.yml,\ndevcontainer-lock.json) are left as their generators write them.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqwVAWCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAmFwQAHk463FPNbRpf3KDeQIAz8FL\nkiNTdS4NzUE7vtxTVAiccmnhi