,"tree":{"sha":"982cf9619338ce066b21273e9e8e9df12bd62d72","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/benbalter.github.com/git/trees/982cf9619338ce066b21273e9e8e9df12bd62d72"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/benbalter.github.com/git/commits/220962b835b82521975bc9e73bb561dfcb0b9b85","verification":{"payload":"tree 982cf9619338ce066b21273e9e8e9df12bd62d72\nparent 50209134f96be759b3693fbec4cc4f59b20bad81\nauthor Ben Balter <ben@balter.com> 1791053493 -0400\ncommitter Ben Balter <ben@balter.com> 1791053493 -0400\n\nResolve the Cloudflare analytics token from 1Password\n\nThe token sat in .env as a literal value. It now lives in 1Password and\n.env holds an op:// reference, so the script resolves that with\n`op read` when it sees one. A literal token, or one already in the\nenvironment, works as before.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAglXOcMjmJIigvM4sxbnhlTp+cJ7\n0kd3+1606Kav0bdzkAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQK/i7TQtpa2hPKI/bDM63dfVxHtC1Ta9sLGNg18yLa0OpRP+uz5dHgMXFmPhq6i1OV\nScSNUwtio8RioIr6zFfgo=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-03T18:51:35Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/282759?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/benbalter","id":282759,"login":"benbalter","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4Mjc1OQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":