-01T01:47:43Z","email":"ben@balter.com","name":"Ben Balter"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T01:47:43Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Source bookmarklets from the benbalter/bookmarklets monorepo (#2053)\n\n- script/update-bookmarklets fetches dist/<id>.js from benbalter/bookmarklets\n  at a pinned commit (no token needed) and records that commit in\n  src/data/bookmarklets.json; --check verifies it in CI\n- Renovate custom manager (git-refs) bumps the recorded commit when the\n  bookmarklets repo''s main moves; CI fails with the fix if the vendored code\n  needs refreshing\n- Add Pages toggle, link all four to their monorepo source, and add a\n  Limitations section to /bookmarklets/\n- /pages-toggle-bookmarklet now redirects to /bookmarklets/#pages-toggle\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"839b5752e569a5f3471fc5ff8e628b4679c76f77","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/benbalter.github.com/git/trees/839b5752e569a5f3471fc5ff8e628b4679c76f77"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/benbalter.github.com/git/commits/50209134f96be759b3693fbec4cc4f59b20bad81","verification":{"payload":"tree 839b5752e569a5f3471fc5ff8e628b4679c76f77\nparent eea83f855a6566b8356b6b702bc31eb4e40f32aa\nauthor Ben Balter <ben@balter.com> 1790819263 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790819263 -0400\n\nSource bookmarklets from the benbalter/bookmarklets monorepo (#2053)\n\n- script/update-bookmarklets fetches dist/<id>.js from benbalter/bookmarklets\n  at a pinned commit (no token needed) and records that commit in\n  src/data/bookmarklets.json; --check verifies it in CI\n- Renovate custom manager (git-refs) bumps the recorded commit when the\n  bookmarklets repo''s main moves; CI fails with the fix if the vendored code\n  needs refreshing\n- Add Pages toggle, link all four to their monorepo source, and add a\n  Limitations section to /bookmarklets/\n- /pages-toggle-bookmarklet now redire