i.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-store/commits/4e95f7f7a254aacced7a444d023a3e903161f182/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T07:42:48Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T07:42:48Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"message":"test: cover recordOwner itself, not only the shouldRecord predicate\n\nThe truth table stated the predicate but not that recordOwner passes it\nthe node''s real isNew(). Stub JCRNodeWrapper with a JDK proxy (the repo\ncarries no Mockito) through a package-private constructor, and assert on\nthe queued identifiers. Mutation-checked: passing true instead of\nnode.isNew() turns recordOwner_reusedNode_isSkipped red.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"8043b165f02de9d22135aa3ccb39eb916b163f44","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-store/git/trees/8043b165f02de9d22135aa3ccb39eb916b163f44"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-store/git/commits/4e95f7f7a254aacced7a444d023a3e903161f182","verification":{"payload":"tree 8043b165f02de9d22135aa3ccb39eb916b163f44\nparent e28ee513a0f41d7e54e9bd3dd996ebacf5fb5b3b\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1790149368 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1790149368 +0200\n\ntest: cover recordOwner itself, not only the shouldRecord predicate\n\nThe truth table stated the predicate but not that recordOwner passes it\nthe node''s real isNew(). Stub JCRNodeWrapper with a JDK proxy (the repo\ncarries no Mockito) through a package-private constructor, and assert on\nthe queued identifiers. Mutation-checked: passing tr