or":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-store/commits/e74ec9786912a10777a81f3645ad123a1b15909e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T15:48:28Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T15:48:28Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"message":"test: fix stale STORE_TEMPLATE_VERSION fallback and name the failure\n\n01-modulesInstalled asserted jahia-store-template 5.0.5-SNAPSHOT while the\ndeployed template is 5.0.6-SNAPSHOT. The .env carries the right value, but\nthe cypress.config.ts fallback is what applies when Cypress runs outside\nthe docker harness, so a manual run failed on that one test.\n\nModule Management answers 200 with {message, cause} for a key it cannot\nresolve, so the existing status check could not distinguish it and the\nfailure surfaced as \"expected undefined to equal ACTIVE\". Assert on the\nnot-found payload and on an empty version so both say what is wrong.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"11ba0c30f4d55177b12116572cacc6b5defdc1ac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-store/git/trees/11ba0c30f4d55177b12116572cacc6b5defdc1ac"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-store/git/commits/e74ec9786912a10777a81f3645ad123a1b15909e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/jahia-store/commit/e74ec9786912a10777a81f3645ad123a1b15909e","node_id":"C_kwDOAHxHXNoAKGU3NGVjOTc4NjkxMmExMDc3N2E4MWYzNjQ1YWQxMjNhMWIxNTkwOWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/jahia-store/commit/ce4f273f9460c0afbdc5ce4fc39a90d304401381","sha":"ce4f273f9460c0afbdc5ce4fc39a90d304401381","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-store/commits/ce4f273f9460c0afbdc5ce4fc39a90d304401381"}],"sha":"e74ec9786912a10777a81f3645ad123a1b15909e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-store/commits/e74ec9786912a10777a81f3645ad123a1b15909e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-store/commits/ce4f273f9460c0afbdc5ce4fc39a90d304401381/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T05:29:59Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T05:29:59Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"message":"fix: never persist the anonymous resolution into the session\n\nThe valve makes a request from the untrusted network anonymous by terminating\nthe authentication pipeline. That is a per-REQUEST decision and must not change\nstored state: the same session belongs to an operator who is expected to still\nbe signed in the moment they are back on the trusted network.\n\nJahia writes a request''s authentication outcome back into the HTTP session\nunless a valve says otherwise, so a guest resolution could be persisted over the\nstored user and turn the per-request decision into a permanent logout. Say\nexplicitly that nothing from this request may be written back.\n\nHonest about scope: this is hardening derived from the API, not a reproduction.\nA three-step walk - authenticated on the trusted network, then marked public,\nthen trusted again - already showed the session surviving without this flag, on\npage renders as well as on an authentication-gated endpoint. So this closes a\npath that the API allows rather than one that has been observed.\n\nsetInvalidateHttpSession is deliberately not called: it exists on the runtime\nclass but not in the compile-time API of the dependency this module builds\nagainst.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"6806fbed7340d104391c8b221304f44adf820eec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-store/git/trees/6806fbed7340d104391c8b221304f44adf820eec"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-store/git/commits/ce4f273f9460c0afbdc5ce4fc39a90d304401381","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/jahia-store/commit/ce4f273f9460c0afbdc5ce4fc39a90d304401381","node_id":"C_kwDOAHxHXNoAKGNlNGYyNzNmOTQ2MGMwYWZiZGM1Y2U0ZmMzOWE5MGQzMDQ0MDEzODE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/jahia-store/commit/10799b74edaf73d07713202e66d81fa524c125ab","sha":"10799b74edaf73d07713202e66d81fa524c125ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-store/commits/10799b74edaf73d07713202e66d81fa524c125ab"}],"sha":"ce4f273f9460c0afbdc5ce4fc39a90d304401381","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-store/commits/ce4f273f9460c0afbdc5ce4fc39a90d304401381"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-store/commits/10799b74edaf73d07713202e66d81fa524c125ab/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T18:04:46Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T18:04:46Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"message":"feat: make requests from an untrusted network anonymous (SUPPORT-687)\n\nThe store can be deployed so that authoring happens only from a trusted network,\nwith the public internet limited to anonymous, read-only use. A reverse proxy in\nfront marks each request with its originating network via X-Jahia-Edge, which\nthe fragment cache key already consumes.\n\nAdd the part only Jahia can implement: a request marked as coming from the\nuntrusted network is made anonymous regardless of the session it carries.\n\nThis cannot be done in the proxy. Stripping the session cookie there is the\nobvious move, but Jahia issues a JSESSIONID to guests too, so such a rule cannot\ntell an authenticated session from an ordinary anonymous one - it would strip\nevery visitor''s session, Jahia would mint a fresh one per request, and\npreviously-cacheable pages would start carrying a Set-Cookie.\n\nImplemented as an authentication valve inserted at position 0 of the pipeline.\nTerminating the pipeline without calling invokeNext means no valve runs - not\nsession, not cookie, not basic, not token - so the request is guest. Nothing is\nmutated: the session object is untouched, so the same session remains\nauthenticated on the trusted network. That is the decisive advantage over\nremoving the session user from a servlet filter, which would log the user out\neverywhere at once.\n\nRegistered as a plain OSGi component taking the authentication Pipeline as a\nservice reference; no Spring context is involved. The new package is added to\n_dsannotations, without which the @Component is silently skipped.\n\nisPublicEdge gains a request-based overload so the valve and the cache key\ngenerator share one definition of what the header means and cannot diverge.\n\nCovered by 27-edgeOrigin.cy.ts, which asserts against an endpoint that requires\nauthentication rather than a who-am-I query: GraphQL currentUser is refused by\nthe security profile whoever asks, so it cannot tell the two cases apart.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"b61a547f9e6394a0b6d71ec935a781de10f913d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-store/git/trees/b61a547f9e6394a0b6d71ec935a781de10f913d4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-store/git/commits/10799b74edaf73d07713202e66d81fa524c125ab","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/jahia-store/commit/10799b74edaf73d07713202e66d81fa524c125ab","node_id":"C_kwDOAHxHXNoAKDEwNzk5Yjc0ZWRhZjczZDA3NzEzMjAyZTY2ZDgxZmE1MjRjMTI1YWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/jahia-store/commit/927de2aac8c112069b006568872f862f653003e1","sha":"927de2aac8c112069b006568872f862f653003e1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-store/commits/927de2aac8c112069b006568872f862f653003e1"}],"sha":"10799b74edaf73d07713202e66d81fa524c125ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-store/commits/10799b74edaf73d07713202e66d81fa524c125ab"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-store/commits/927de2aac8c112069b006568872f862f653003e1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T16:09:44Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T16:09:44Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"message":"chore: bump development version to 5.1.2-SNAPSHOT\n\nThe pom has read 5.1.0-SNAPSHOT since the 5.0.1 release, while two further\nreleases were tagged on top of it: 5_1_0 (2026-07-02) and 5_1_1 (2026-07-09).\nNeither tag carries the maven-release-plugin commit pair - ''prepare release''\nfollowed by ''prepare for next development iteration'' - that moved the version\nthrough 4_3_0, 5_0_0 and 5_0_1, so the pom at both tags still reads\n5.1.0-SNAPSHOT and every build since July has produced a snapshot of a version\nnumber that was already released.\n\nMove development to 5.1.2-SNAPSHOT, the conventional next version after the\n5.1.1 release, so no further snapshot collides with a released artifact.\n\nThree places have to move together or the e2e suite fails: 01-modulesInstalled\nasserts the deployed bundle version against PRIVATEAPPSTORE_VERSION, which is\nread from tests/.env(.example) with a hardcoded fallback in cypress.config.ts.\n\nNote this does not repair the release process itself - the tags were created\nwithout the release plugin, and that is what should be fixed so the next\nrelease bumps the version on its own.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"3905f094a0d84f155361327c9c2217e11ce464b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-store/git/trees/3905f094a0d84f155361327c9c2217e11ce464b4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-store/git/commits/927de2aac8c112069b006568872f862f653003e1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/jahia-store/commit/927de2aac8c112069b006568872f862f653003e1","node_id":"C_kwDOAHxHXNoAKDkyN2RlMmFhYzhjMTEyMDY5YjAwNjU2ODg3MmY4NjJmNjUzMDAzZTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/jahia-store/commit/957f15b7d87109098399a03c6fbe6133db7f4505","sha":"957f15b7d87109098399a03c6fbe6133db7f4505","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-store/commits/957f15b7d87109098399a03c6fbe6133db7f4505"}],"sha":"927de2aac8c112069b006568872f862f653003e1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-store/commits/927de2aac8c112069b006568872f862f653003e1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-store/commits/957f15b7d87109098399a03c6fbe6133db7f4505/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T19:37:51Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T19:37:51Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"message":"test: cover edge-origin cache keying and sign-in visibility (SUPPORT-687)\n\nRegression coverage for the store.jahia.com edge lockdown. Asserts that\njahia-store-template omits the header sign-in trigger when a request carries\nX-Jahia-Edge: public, renders it otherwise, and - the part that matters - that\nEdgeOriginCacheKeyPartGenerator keeps the two variants in separate fragment\ncache entries.\n\nThe arms are interleaved (public, vpn, public) on purpose: asking in one order\nonly would pass even if the cache were cross-serving.\n\nVerified by mutation - removing the @Component registration from\nEdgeOriginCacheKeyPartGenerator fails 3 of the 4 assertions here, including the\ninterleaved one, so they are not vacuous. Worth recording that the FIRST\nassertion fails under that mutation too: without the key component the\nconditional is not merely theoretically unsafe, it is immediately wrong, since\nthe first render is cached and handed to both audiences.\n\nThe HAProxy arm probes for the proxy and skips when it is absent, so CI and\nlocal dev - which run without an edge - stay green.\n\ncy.request rather than cy.visit because the decision is server-side: this reads\nthe SSR output and needs to set a request header, which cy.visit cannot.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"3ae1ac98bea72e677c96927c6a813a7c83903acd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-store/git/trees/3ae1ac98bea72e677c96927c6a813a7c83903acd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-store/git/commits/957f15b7d87109098399a03c6fbe6133db7f4505","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/jahia-store/commit/957f15b7d87109098399a03c6fbe6133db7f4505","node_id":"C_kwDOAHxHXNoAKDk1N2YxNWI3ZDg3MTA5MDk4Mzk5YTAzYzZmYmU2MTMzZGI3ZjQ1MDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/jahia-store/commit/aa1e230bb9fe95e22e1e5ad47f15671c37067dd8","sha":"aa1e230bb9fe95e22e1e5ad47f15671c37067dd8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-store/commits/aa1e230bb9fe95e22e1e5ad47f15671c37067dd8"}],"sha":"957f15b7d87109098399a03c6fbe6133db7f4505","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-store/commits/957f15b7d87109098399a03c6fbe6133db7f4505"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-store/commits/aa1e230bb9fe95e22e1e5ad47f15671c37067dd8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T18:59:20Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T18:59:20Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"message":"fix: implement getClientCachePolicy on EdgeOriginCacheKeyPartGenerator\n\nClientCachePolicyContributor''s default method returns ClientCachePolicy.PRIVATE\nand logs a warning naming the offending class. Jahia combines the policies of\nevery contributor with ClientCachePolicy.strongest(), and cache key part\ngenerators are registered globally, so inheriting that default forced PRIVATE\nclient caching on every fragment on the platform - a broad performance\nregression contributed by a module that only wanted an extra key component.\n\nReturn ClientCachePolicy.DEFAULT instead. Knowing which network a request came\nfrom does not make the response unsafe to cache client-side: the browser cache\nis per-user, and the CDN only ever sees public traffic because VPN traffic\nreaches the origin directly, so a shared cache can never hold a VPN variant and\nhand it to a public visitor.\n\nCaught from the runtime warning in jahia.log during e2e validation, not from\nreview - the default method is silent about its cost at compile time.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"a667c30af98056d3ec16f149e9da35cec91dca81","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-store/git/trees/a667c30af98056d3ec16f149e9da35cec91dca81"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-store/git/commits/aa1e230bb9fe95e22e1e5ad47f15671c37067dd8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/jahia-store/commit/aa1e230bb9fe95e22e1e5ad47f15671c37067dd8","node_id":"C_kwDOAHxHXNoAKGFhMWUyMzBiYjlmZTk1ZTIyZTFlNWFkNDdmMTU2NzFjMzcwNjdkZDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/jahia-store/commit/3acf70cb035f0d92a7d664b3bcfae41545720eff","sha":"3acf70cb035f0d92a7d664b3bcfae41545720eff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-store/commits/3acf70cb035f0d92a7d664b3bcfae41545720eff"}],"sha":"aa1e230bb9fe95e22e1e5ad47f15671c37067dd8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-store/commits/aa1e230bb9fe95e22e1e5ad47f15671c37067dd8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-store/commits/3acf70cb035f0d92a7d664b3bcfae41545720eff/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T18:53:36Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T18:53:36Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"message":"feat: add EdgeOriginCacheKeyPartGenerator (SUPPORT-687)\n\nstore.jahia.com is being locked down at HAProxy so the public internet gets\nanonymous, read-only use while every privileged action stays on Jahia''s VPN.\nThe storefront wants to hide the header sign-in trigger for public visitors,\nsince /cms/login is denied for them and the form would 404 on submit.\n\nA plain server-side conditional cannot do that safely: templates/Page declares\ncache.perUser, whose key for an anonymous visitor is ''guest'' for a public\nvisitor and a VPN operator alike, so the first render would be cached and then\nserved to the other audience in either direction. The cache key would be\nmodelling permission rather than what the output actually varies on.\n\nAdd the originating network as a cache key component so the two audiences get\ntwo entries and the conditional becomes safe to write.\n\nRegistered as a plain OSGi service: the OSGIRegistry bundle\n(org.jahia.bundles.extends.osgi.registry) declares a 0..n dynamic reference on\nCacheKeyPartGenerator and forwards each bound service to\nDefaultCacheKeyGenerator.registerPartGenerator, so no Spring context is needed.\norg.jahia.modules.forge.cache.* is added to _dsannotations accordingly - a\npackage missing from that list has its @Component silently skipped.\n\nThe value comes from a header HAProxy deletes and re-sets on every request, so\na client cannot forge it. An absent header means privileged, which keeps local\ndev, CI and the Cypress harness behaving exactly as before.\n\nNote: part generators are global, so this adds a component to every fragment\ncache key on the platform, not only to this module''s views.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"f492d16d39336db32aa69d35fe9059a7c39a6de6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-store/git/trees/f492d16d39336db32aa69d35fe9059a7c39a6de6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-store/git/commits/3acf70cb035f0d92a7d664b3bcfae41545720eff","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/jahia-store/commit/3acf70cb035f0d92a7d664b3bcfae41545720eff","node_id":"C_kwDOAHxHXNoAKDNhY2Y3MGNiMDM1ZjBkOTJhN2Q2NjRiM2JjZmFlNDE1NDU3MjBlZmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/jahia-store/commit/6e3caf6bba40e49f1d6368ce29a1e1b0c3668004","sha":"6e3caf6bba40e49f1d6368ce29a1e1b0c3668004","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-store/commits/6e3caf6bba40e49f1d6368ce29a1e1b0c3668004"}],"sha":"3acf70cb035f0d92a7d664b3bcfae