or it re-dates the RSS feed, and it runs once per\nworkspace. The rest is in the PR description.\n\nSigned-off-by: Chikku <ccheriyan@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"27dde67ccf22f3d595984e76d2a56ef1eca131eb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-store/git/trees/27dde67ccf22f3d595984e76d2a56ef1eca131eb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-store/git/commits/78863d14a3aaf300ef4ed0806b3d0f16ac86e20d","verification":{"payload":"tree 27dde67ccf22f3d595984e76d2a56ef1eca131eb\nparent b25f396b914b36460740675ff947ed27576574b3\nauthor Chikku <ccheriyan@jahia.com> 1789241434 -0400\ncommitter Chikku <ccheriyan@jahia.com> 1789241434 -0400\n\nstyle: cut the comments that restate the code\n\nKeep the ones that carry a constraint an editor or operator would otherwise\nmiss: uploadDate must never join *_PARAM_KEYS, the backfill must save with\nevent listeners disabled or it re-dates the RSS feed, and it runs once per\nworkspace. The rest is in the PR description.\n\nSigned-off-by: Chikku <ccheriyan@jahia.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgwRPvs9re+yWFMD2YuK/hy7ZaWD\n3WK2kzihe2htSjYLIAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQIA1Ant6aMW3gS7HDnAZravoQoLbLDAauiXdmpAukgQzuUK9sy+cYNzdAz6BiGAhCT\nw5E9RvS3xj/GJBd2s4dQc=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-12T19:30:37Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19653075?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goonerish/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goonerish/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goonerish/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goonerish/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/goonerish","id":19653075,"login":"goonerish","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NjUzMDc1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goonerish/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goonerish/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goonerish/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goonerish/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goonerish/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/goonerish","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/jahia-store/commit/78863d14a3aaf300ef4ed0806b3d0f16ac86e20d","node_id":"C_kwDOAHxHXNoAKDc4ODYzZDE0YTNhYWYzMDBlZjRlZDA4MDZiM2QwZjE2YWM4NmUyMGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/jahia-store/commit/b25f396b914b36460740675ff947ed27576574b3","sha":"b25f396b914b36460740675ff947ed27576574b3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-store/commits/b25f396b914b36460740675ff947ed27576574b3"}],"sha":"78863d14a3aaf300ef4ed0806b3d0f16ac86e20d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-store/commits/78863d14a3aaf300ef4ed0806b3d0f16ac86e20d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19653075?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goonerish/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goonerish/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goonerish/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goonerish/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/goonerish","id":19653075,"login":"goonerish","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NjUzMDc1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goonerish/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goonerish/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goonerish/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goonerish/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goonerish/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/goonerish","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-store/commits/b25f396b914b36460740675ff947ed27576574b3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-11T15:32:35Z","email":"ccheriyan@jahia.com","name":"Chikku"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-11T19:38:02Z","email":"ccheriyan@jahia.com","name":"Chikku"},"message":"feat(forge): stamp an immutable uploadDate on every uploaded version\n\nThe storefront dated a release by jcr:lastModified, so editing a changelog,\ntoggling \"published\" or fixing a description silently re-dated the release.\n\nAdd `uploadDate` (date) to jnt:forgeModuleVersion and jnt:forgePackageVersion,\nwritten once by createEntryFromJar when the version node is created and never\nrewritten. jahia-store-template reads it (falling back to jcr:lastModified for\nversions that predate it) as the version''s and the module''s \"Released\" date.\n\nDeliberately NOT a form parameter: partitionParams is a strict allowlist and\nuploadDate is absent from it, so the value can only come from the server clock -\nan upload cannot forge its own release date. Optional and non-mandatory, so\nJahia''s DefinitionsBundleChecker rates the definition change TRIVIAL and module\ndeployment is not cancelled; existing version nodes simply lack the property.\n\nscripts/backfill-upload-date.groovy seeds it on existing versions from their\ncurrent jcr:lastModified. It saves with JCRObservationManager listeners\ndisabled: LastModifiedListener would otherwise re-stamp jcr:lastModified on\nevery version, which still drives the module-list RSS feed''s pubDate and order.\nRun it once per workspace - versions uploaded from the live storefront are\ncreated directly in LIVE and never published from EDIT.\n\nThe content migration seeds the same value from the historical date it already\npreserves, so migrated releases keep their real dates.\n\nE2E: 16-storefront seeds a 2024 uploadDate on analytics 1.0.0 and asserts the\nrail and the version card show it, that editing the changelog and the\ndescription does not move it, and that a draft-only module shows no date.\n\nSigned-off-by: Chikku <ccheriyan@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"f6a65ea8596f38b0455344cbedfb59c7a88e0977","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-store/git/trees/f6a65ea8596f38b0455344cbedfb59c7a88e0977"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-store/git/commits/b25f396b914b36460740675ff947ed27576574b3","verification":{"payload":"tree f6a65ea8596f38b0455344cbedfb59c7a88e0977\nparent 05900acda675f44c52be3495e4110ada425da083\nauthor Chikku <ccheriyan@jahia.com> 1789140755 -0400\ncommitter Chikku <ccheriyan@jahia.com> 1789155482 -0400\n\nfeat(forge): stamp an immutable uploadDate on every uploaded version\n\nThe storefront dated a release by jcr:lastModified, so editing a changelog,\ntoggling \"published\" or fixing a description silently re-dated the release.\n\nAdd `uploadDate` (date) to jnt:forgeModuleVersion and jnt:forgePackageVersion,\nwritten once by createEntryFromJar when the version node is created and never\nrewritten. jahia-store-template reads it (falling back to jcr:lastModified for\nversions that predate it) as the version''s and the module''s \"Released\" date.\n\nDeliberately NOT a form parameter: partitionParams is a strict allowlist and\nuploadDate is absent from it, so the value can only come from the server clock -\nan upload cannot forge its own release date. Optional and non-mandatory, so\nJahia''s DefinitionsBundleChecker rates the definition change TRIVIAL and module\ndeployment is not cancelled; existing version nodes simply lack the property.\n\nscripts/backfill-upload-date.groovy seeds it on existing versions from their\ncurrent jcr:lastModified. It saves with JCRObservationManager listeners\ndisabled: LastModifiedListener would otherwise re-stamp jcr:lastModified on\nevery version, which still drives the module-list RSS feed''s pubDate and order.\nRun it once per workspace - versions uploaded from the live storefront are\ncreated directly in LIVE and never published from EDIT.\n\nThe content migration seeds the same value from the historical date it already\npreserves, so migrated releases keep their real dates.\n\nE2E: 16-storefront seeds a 2024 uploadDate on analytics 1.0.0 and asserts the\nrail and the version card show it, that editing the changelog and the\ndescription does not move it, and that a draft-only module shows no date.\n\nSigned-off-by: Chikku <ccheriyan@jahia.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgwRPvs9re+yWFMD2YuK/hy7ZaWD\n3WK2kzihe2htSjYLIAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQK+0NTblDMCuSrz9EEGXQjvlhr60lzd/UDC7irD5W9abyGX+DmOsjgOxaqy5A2owQa\nN3U7N8KUWmnTIV5Can5QI=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-12T18:58:25Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19653075?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goonerish/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goonerish/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goonerish/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goonerish/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/goonerish","id":19653075,"login":"goonerish","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NjUzMDc1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goonerish/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goonerish/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goonerish/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goonerish/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goonerish/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/goonerish","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/jahia-store/commit/b25f396b914b36460740675ff947ed27576574b3","node_id":"C_kwDOAHxHXNoAKGIyNWYzOTZiOTE0YjM2NDYwNzQwNjc1ZmY5NDdlZDI3NTc2NTc0YjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/jahia-store/commit/05900acda675f44c52be