fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-store/commits/0af2e26d2873e402cf9bb327b024240d0b0406e9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-09T11:08:29Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-09T11:09:35Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"message":"test: lock moduleList.json field contract to catch removals (#55 guard)\n\nThe feed spec only asserted the fields its download scenario used (name/versions/\ndownloadUrl), so #55 removing path + jcrprimarytype passed CI green while breaking\nJahia core ForgeService consumers (''unable to parse JSON return string'' — the feed\nstayed valid JSON, so nothing producer-side tripped).\n\nAdd a contract test asserting the exact required top-level / per-entry / per-version\nkey sets (incl. path, jcrprimarytype, id). Removing any locked field now fails at\nauthor time. Cross-referenced with the CONTRACT comment in the JSP so the renderer\nand the test stay in sync.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"8ccfa88b578cc9afb0bd697b091d507d3e884d83","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-store/git/trees/8ccfa88b578cc9afb0bd697b091d507d3e884d83"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-store/git/commits/0af2e26d2873e402cf9bb327b024240d0b0406e9","verification":{"payload":"tree 8ccfa88b578cc9afb0bd697b091d507d3e884d83\nparent e8e43d4e2560e693e9fe13a8bc3a0266cbb7b8b4\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1783595309 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1783595375 +0200\n\ntest: lock moduleList.json field contract to catch removals (#55 guard)\n\nThe feed spec only asserted the fields its download scenario used (name/versions/\ndownloadUrl), so #55 removing path + jcrprimarytype passed CI green while breaking\nJahia core ForgeService consumers (''unable to parse JSON return string'' — the feed\nstayed valid JSON, so nothing producer-side tripped).\n\nAdd a contract test asserting the exact required top-level / per-entry / per-version\nkey sets (incl. path, jcrprimarytype, id). Removing any locked field now fails at\nauthor time. Cross-referenced with the CONTRACT comment in the JSP so the renderer\nand the test stay in sync.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQEzBAABCgAdFiEEtcDrrZ6KblczSEt9UhsGUDwSL3kFAmpPgW8ACgkQUhsGUDwS\nL3l6Zwf7BL/SmlSkm7sAHEXqjK9WAFPrCZCSiO+Un8xbGmX6mAwcjUhNYUEcK4du\nEssV+lTcQhnRLkzQTRVSU3/GKl0JdgrR35HbGCoMiZdF7OE+kJyYAREroXjHxGHu\nug2s5Eu0Z0doA2/fh1dTMyzPwPV0kbqgdczwAsnNu1tHC/DDPxtPDajx2cAlqIWs\nbYquKcSlilzgOyByyXLNJ54pEaIvFxg0c+5615YqGnA/bDUqN9oGhATCPOC9TBEN\nIBGqQOuKRY6+BCzEZKCEKF/DswSGZZxNShrLtIINYmAFdTKiWAuauoxHUlQvFCXm\nW0sTeQ1GEqQbxk6KYGxLvnwi8t3O/w==\n=g3V8\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-09T11:09:38Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_even