pos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-store/commits/66247a6c1bb793caeec757ac89703c7ab5f1b922/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-01T17:51:32Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-01T17:51:32Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"message":"ci: fix git dubious-ownership in release workflow\n\nThe release action forks git inside the job container with a HOME that doesn''t\ncarry checkout@v3''s temporary safe.directory entry; a stricter git in the runner\nimage now aborts the Release Module step with ''detected dubious ownership''\n(exit 128) before Maven runs. Register the workspace as a safe directory\nsystem- and global-wide so every git invocation in the container is covered.\n\nUnblocks the 5.0.1 release (on-release.yml unchanged since 5_0_0 shipped, so\nthis is an environmental regression, not a workflow change).\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"9b81cc1a07518f1c732463ce5793f4228972237e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-store/git/trees/9b81cc1a07518f1c732463ce5793f4228972237e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-store/git/commits/66247a6c1bb793caeec757ac89703c7ab5f1b922","verification":{"payload":"tree 9b81cc1a07518f1c732463ce5793f4228972237e\nparent c783dd111e975b3435548c31d5fb65962cab2c08\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1782928292 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1782928292 +0200\n\nci: fix git dubious-ownership in release workflow\n\nThe release action forks git inside the job container with a HOME that doesn''t\ncarry checkout@v3''s temporary safe.directory entry; a stricter git in the runner\nimage now aborts the Release Module step with ''detected dubious ownership''\n(exit 128) before Maven runs. Register the workspace as a safe directory\nsystem- and global-wide so every git invocation in the container is covered.\n\nUnblocks the 5.0.1 release (on-release.yml unchanged since 5_0_0 shipped, so\nthis is an environmental regression, not a workflow change).\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQEzBAABCgAdFiEEtcDrrZ6KblczSEt9UhsGUDwSL3kFAmpFU6QACgkQUhsGUDwS\nL3mtyAf+LVJQ23WWXxo9XPzf65IXMsT30+8EpmqjBh3DmtaYiNuC4mOgCnBLzmOM\n2gTdDlSgvDsQDQJd6D/HcEx6MjXhW86UMBF3wjskt8wAGt/y7AcocHF1HxSdA35P\nswlNE+DN9c8h9jO+rW9DEv9OhUgKK260036JcRyDSRyLojXjdiJztqqxSbLjPlsn\n1X0LDYlpRLuHGz0ECiSkPvoGI6MY4ysUaciQK0pPH0Gsd8trQzDTSGlWZZmsoxuK\noG/hh4HdxS/Krrw9FoHwARe3VBErezHZzFgscDMJ2xEUBNI1njYobUpbMwbN14PA\nXCD9t/6S/Kg8oPSCNTbbyDhemrio4g==\n=dn44\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-01T17:51:34Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"h