re use case);\nthe authz gate is repository-level by design (artifact-level broke spec 14).\nDocument the operator invariant: never co-locate private binaries under the\npublic catalogue''s Nexus root; ACL modules-repository when needed.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"3df7e1b0060ac349335fa9e6f23e58aee9ec1a03","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-store/git/trees/3df7e1b0060ac349335fa9e6f23e58aee9ec1a03"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-store/git/commits/6ffff2f9f6c9445ff71641069bfa0bf409cab12d","verification":{"payload":"tree 3df7e1b0060ac349335fa9e6f23e58aee9ec1a03\nparent 67d0ce036d826a03c5d6dca8ddcb35e05092991d\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1782892294 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1782892294 +0200\n\ndocs: document MavenProxy public-store deployment invariant (#57)\n\nThe proxy serves raw Maven coordinates with the site''s Nexus credentials to\nanonymous callers on a world-readable repository (the public-store use case);\nthe authz gate is repository-level by design (artifact-level broke spec 14).\nDocument the operator invariant: never co-locate private binaries under the\npublic catalogue''s Nexus root; ACL modules-repository when needed.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQEzBAABCgAdFiEEtcDrrZ6KblczSEt9UhsGUDwSL3kFAmpExwYACgkQUhsGUDwS\nL3ks8Qf/Z1ctii1QHZZihjuTVfwUxWuQqRjzopqKPRkk/T9ZVgafzJo3JtF4atP1\ntev2PheG6PsEqb2uzKgXCczQJiSDGWGhSv+UYEx3jvtZJ3lmeZ2sIi0u7OpStKP0\nTutY8+ftATTM49ydMLpr1TUJWhDyHgSXgdWlWl486vUMWzop+xsVeNFfPcobd6Ej\nQb1hLeS+2mtBLgkxqfXTK0ofLEvXGJYp5xdqS/FfWhD0Nrjn788woBoLruaHStsp\nWRsYsaiCD6dVuEv2B9EvKp1zdTJdu/eZRF4jZ/f0c2Vy4InH1c1c6g/y2xs5eQkA\nKVNQYLLBRTUNVfwqZIrohzp7ITzwQg==\n=ikA0\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-01T07:52:01Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","e