ithub.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-store/commits/67d0ce036d826a03c5d6dca8ddcb35e05092991d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-01T07:51:34Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-01T07:51:34Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"message":"fix: drop absolute JCR path + jcr:primaryType from anonymous moduleList.json (#55)\n\nThe anonymous JSON feed emitted each entry''s absolute JCR path and\njcr:primaryType — reconnaissance-grade internal identifiers no consumer needs.\nKeep the opaque UUID id as a stable key; consumers distinguish modules from\npackages via groupId. E2E spec 14 asserts only name/versions/downloadUrl.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"7cf88b861e569bc5b1fffa6d35ae96acd838a847","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-store/git/trees/7cf88b861e569bc5b1fffa6d35ae96acd838a847"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-store/git/commits/67d0ce036d826a03c5d6dca8ddcb35e05092991d","verification":{"payload":"tree 7cf88b861e569bc5b1fffa6d35ae96acd838a847\nparent 91c0802618cae1f5ecf15eec1298d257ea16ac11\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1782892294 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1782892294 +0200\n\nfix: drop absolute JCR path + jcr:primaryType from anonymous moduleList.json (#55)\n\nThe anonymous JSON feed emitted each entry''s absolute JCR path and\njcr:primaryType — reconnaissance-grade internal identifiers no consumer needs.\nKeep 