ng the helper.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"e5a49abcc17299b4554e78a730d34251958b1918","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-store/git/trees/e5a49abcc17299b4554e78a730d34251958b1918"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-store/git/commits/91c0802618cae1f5ecf15eec1298d257ea16ac11","verification":{"payload":"tree e5a49abcc17299b4554e78a730d34251958b1918\nparent 4dc02e354ea2cc22db63b9b307c2d613688e7325\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1782892293 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1782892293 +0200\n\nfix: sanitize siteName/path on MavenProxy rejection-branch log sinks (#58)\n\nMavenProxy.doGet logged raw request-derived siteName/path before the authz\ncheck on an anonymous-reachable path (CWE-117). Reuse the single\nActionSecurityUtils.sanitizeForLog implementation (promoted to public) on the\nfour log statements instead of duplicating the helper.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQEzBAABCgAdFiEEtcDrrZ6KblczSEt9UhsGUDwSL3kFAmpExwUACgkQUhsGUDwS\nL3l/HAgAqmedZIOrBgHyiaCHPSMjv4MP9fzn16BmFmbJD4w2hARbYK7kew8IBOfC\nOkIynVSRd26hBLo87mRqBmjRM1e8OT+1WZuTOTxeBb+VRKqN42WHcyAOXeE/khbF\nLSToAsr2KIhQdhxhdlSETRc2eu4db8hoTX7szdECxIrLhbZeUNcaVKKGvJZY/2Qn\noudXkRUjV8spDWp0eLPVBFV6ym3jwyNYS1YaIx4kBnkA+xCzAsPASgOv255tyPgt\n/mYarJS5EgHzSUpicZze2Vf7hQpAXGp4PM/GjsjSzurAh69DHA+S3CwF2HdENSh2\nh1MNXw2yCUe5fHCyOzLe33sBoNyQrQ==\n=jgwC\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-01T07:52:01Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"http