bourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-store/commits/4dc02e354ea2cc22db63b9b307c2d613688e7325/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-01T07:51:33Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-01T07:51:33Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"message":"fix: sanitize version/title/name on CreateEntryFromJar success-path log sinks (#56)\n\nThe success-path logger.info calls interpolated attacker-controlled archive\nmanifest fields (version, title, moduleName, packageName) raw into SLF4J {},\nallowing CR/LF log forging (CWE-117). Wrap them in the already-shipped\nActionSecurityUtils.sanitizeForLog, matching the error-path sinks.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"60ac7657b96cf815679eada3b68e783d27836293","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-store/git/trees/60ac7657b96cf815679eada3b68e783d27836293"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-store/git/commits/4dc02e354ea2cc22db63b9b307c2d613688e7325","verification":{"payload":"tree 60ac7657b96cf815679eada3b68e783d27836293\nparent 3a44543541ab224733efaed821a6896e2d337fda\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1782892293 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1782892293 +0200\n\nfix: sanitize version/title/name on CreateEntryFromJar success-path log sinks (#56)\n\nThe success-path logger.info calls interpolated attacker-controlled archive\nmanifest fields (version, title, moduleName, packageName) raw into SLF4J {},\nallowing CR/LF log forging (CWE-117). Wrap them in the already-shipped\nActionSecurityUtils.sanitizeForLog, matching the error-path sinks.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQEzBAABCgAdFiEEtcDrrZ6KblczSEt9UhsGUDwSL3kFAmpExwUACgkQUhs