users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-store/commits/a808883764b62a70ae8d5f2840fb8200330e1273/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-26T08:24:07Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-26T08:24:07Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"message":"fix(deps): anchor qs and uuid to patched versions via resolutions\n\nResolves Dependabot security alerts in tests/:\n- qs: ~6.14.1 consumer resolved to vulnerable 6.14.2 (GHSA-q8mj-m7cp-5q26,\n  DoS in qs.stringify). Pin qs >= 6.15.2 so the ~6.14.1 range can''t cap it.\n- uuid: ^8.3.x consumers resolved to vulnerable 8.3.2 (GHSA-w5hq-g745-h8pq,\n  buffer bounds in v3/v5/v6). Pin uuid >= 11.1.1 (only patched line).\n\nThese are TRANSITIVE deps whose patched versions sit OUTSIDE the declared\nranges, so a lockfile pin alone would revert on the next re-resolve. Explicit\nresolutions re-apply on every install -> durable. Verified all uuid consumers\nuse the v4 named export (no removed default-call / deep-import), require-time\nsmoke test passes, and yarn --frozen-lockfile is consistent.\n\njs-yaml 4.x is already on patched 4.2.0; the residual 3.14.2 is pulled only by\nEOL coverage/CLI tooling that needs the removed safeLoad and has no 3.x patch.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"ab89534361a0788301bb5ed0e259cb1a4d3b7fd7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-store/git/trees/ab89534361a0788301bb5ed0e259cb1a4d3b7fd7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-store/git/commits/a808883764b62a70ae8d5f2840fb8200330e1273","verification":{"payload":"tree ab89534361a0788301bb5ed0e259cb1a4d3b7fd7\nparent 919dd0f60e83b3a26568589b8c7d941615c198f0\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1782462247 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1782462247 +0200\n\nfix(deps): anchor qs and uuid to patched versions via resolutions\n\nResolves Dependabot security alerts in tests/:\n- qs: ~6.14.1 consumer resolved to vulnerable 6.14.2 (GHSA-q8mj-m7cp-5q26,\n  DoS in qs.stringify). Pin qs >= 6.15.2 so the ~6.14.1 range can''t cap it.\n- uuid: ^8.3.x consumers resolved to vulnerable 8.3.2 (GHSA-w5hq-g745-h8pq,\n  buffer bounds in v3/v5/v6). Pin uuid >= 11.1.1 (only patched line).\n\nThese are TRANSITIVE deps whose patched versions sit OUTSIDE the declared\nranges, so a lockfile pin alone would revert on the next re-resolve. Explicit\nresolutions re-apply on every install -> durable. Verified all uuid consumers\nuse the v4 named export (no removed default-call / deep-import), require-time\nsmoke test passes, and yarn --frozen-lockfile is consistent.\n\njs-yaml 4.x is already on patched 4.2.0; the residual 3.14.2 is pulled only by\nEOL coverage/CLI tooling that needs the removed safeLoad and has no 3.x patch.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQEzBAABCgAdFiEEtcDrrZ6KblczSEt9UhsGUDwSL3kFAmo+NycACgkQUhsGUDwS\nL3lbsgf/ZSLtNoWP5z0TWu+xBjLJ2g/op0yAc6vT1ty54Bhaj25QcvODxePMI6M6\nv/Zimz5ZjQiW0RYmEyM7HoJWGn4ecDU8he8HEYaY0XfOrbWHlybM24quQVFYcGNz\nYc4U/xs2XjLvLDF5F5EClnwoPwaMZ/n9Q9HeblOiLDF4rPId8/KSu7DOnF65ptpo\naJHVTvwyL1gci85+UkQK2yiTSXS8j90F71ciF/i7tDNrwTsWn9s0IiteJr