https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/jahia-store/commit/5cb32fd0bb2c39998e6ff22417c0ef770f42ce12","node_id":"C_kwDOAHxHXNoAKDVjYjMyZmQwYmIyYzM5OTk4ZTZmZjIyNDE3YzBlZjc3MGY0MmNlMTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/jahia-store/commit/839914700247c914c7ec00a24cc44d628ba0f23b","sha":"839914700247c914c7ec00a24cc44d628ba0f23b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-store/commits/839914700247c914c7ec00a24cc44d628ba0f23b"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/jahia-store/commit/0cef893fcffe423f748a7e1ff5c1b4079a48cfec","sha":"0cef893fcffe423f748a7e1ff5c1b4079a48cfec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-store/commits/0cef893fcffe423f748a7e1ff5c1b4079a48cfec"}],"sha":"5cb32fd0bb2c39998e6ff22417c0ef770f42ce12","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-store/commits/5cb32fd0bb2c39998e6ff22417c0ef770f42ce12"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-store/commits/0cef893fcffe423f748a7e1ff5c1b4079a48cfec/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-22T09:43:07Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-22T10:40:36Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"message":"fix(settings): persist store config via a per-site ManagedServiceFactory so it survives restart\n\nThe per-site store settings were created as a programmatic ConfigurationAdmin factory\nconfiguration and read back by querying ConfigurationAdmin directly. Once a default config file\nshipped for the same factory PID (f909b50), Felix FileInstall / the Jahia module extender took\nownership of that PID at boot and the API-created sibling instances were dropped on restart -\nlosing the store configuration.\n\nModel each site''s settings as an OSGi factory configuration of PID\norg.jahia.modules.forge.forgeSettings, carried by a file\n<karaf.etc>/org.jahia.modules.forge.forgeSettings-<siteKey>.cfg. ForgeSettingsServiceImpl now\nregisters as a ManagedServiceFactory keyed by the siteKey property: Felix FileInstall turns each\n.cfg into a configuration instance and the runtime delivers it to updated(), populating a live\nper-site map that get() serves. save()/delete() write/remove that same file atomically (the admin\nUI writes the file an admin could also hand-edit). One configuration representation, consumed the\nOSGi way; file-backed so it survives restarts and redeploys unconditionally. siteKey is validated\nas a safe single path segment before reaching the file system; base64/plaintext decodePassword\ntolerance kept.\n\nTests cover the factory dispatch (updated/get/deleted, blank-siteKey ignore, re-key) plus the\nsite-key safety, file-name and password helpers. Build green, 98 JUnit. Restart-survival confirmed\nby the maintainer.\n\nNOTE: per-site settings created by the previous API-based code are not auto-migrated - re-save\nonce in the admin UI (or drop the values into the karaf/etc .cfg).\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"7a188835ba156decd6d3956c21139f329da88dbf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-store/git/trees/7a188835ba156decd6d3956c21139f329da88dbf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-store/git/commits/0cef893fcffe423f748a7e1ff5c1b4079a48cfec","verification":{"payload":"tree 7a188835ba156decd6d3956c21139f329da88dbf\nparent 839914700247c914c7ec00a24cc44d628ba0f23b\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1782121387 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1782124836 +0200\n\nfix(settings): persist store config via a per-site ManagedServiceFactory so it survives restart\n\nThe per-site store settings were created as a programmatic ConfigurationAdmin factory\nconfiguration and read back by querying ConfigurationAdmin directly. Once a default config file\nshipped for the same factory PID (f909b50), Felix FileInstall / the Jahia module extender took\nownership of that PID at boot and the API-created sibling instances were dropped on restart -\nlosing the store configuration.\n\nModel each site''s settings as an OSGi factory configuration of PID\norg.jahia.modules.forge.forgeSettings, carried by a file\n<karaf.etc>/org.jahia.modules.forge.forgeSettings-<siteKey>.cfg. ForgeSettingsServiceImpl now\nregisters as a ManagedServiceFactory keyed by the siteKey property: Felix FileInstall turns each\n.cfg into a configuration instance and the runtime delivers it to updated(), populating a live\nper-site map that get() serves. save()/delete() write/remove that same file atomically (the admin\nUI writes the file an admin could also hand-edit). One configuration representation, consumed the\nOSGi way; file-backed so it survives restarts and redeploys unconditionally. siteKey is validated\nas a safe single path segment before reaching the file system; base64/plaintext decodePassword\ntolerance kept.\n\nTests cover the factory dispatch (updated/get/deleted, blank-siteKey ignore, re-key) plus the\nsite-key safety, file-name and password helpers. Build green, 98 JUnit. Restart-survival confirmed\nby the maintainer.\n\nNOTE: per-site settings created by the previous API-based code are not auto-migrated - re-save\nonce in the admin UI (or drop the values into the karaf/etc .cfg).\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQEzBAABCgAdFiEEtcDrrZ6KblczSEt9UhsGUDwSL3kFAmo5ESQACgkQUhsGUDwS\nL3n3mwf+Kyux7BvnCljk3fPwCJpZKLonnYWJ1kA8dJBRoU2YmGSL3riBWjUn1h67\nk4tgXa6dqaSBjNu+lEodXs1LJk8TWITfzpPU24lbY+NqnVJ1ymjC8wZXoeOZ352q\nZQNZsmPOjWXSn0qZ7QZMIDM6CiHRQVOcd1+NNrMHwKHbcjDiKXnA2/y8phCy4TXF\nzQdrFYsguHsrTvr5RMymWu6x/xy2YcmOZgaoRue0PbZhOb0bz9wlg0MMVMUjbcTV\nN9Y+Y444QzJrddbx2/uGsc1OKr7f5Io9vhKkGUakKw6OUa6KN60wBV2Qw9IaOm0R\n7GKxhBACzwwwtRr/zb5kM0KRhIpsLw==\n=jzNV\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-22T10:44:23Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/jahia-store/commit/0cef893fcffe423f