"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/jahia-store/commit/839914700247c914c7ec00a24cc44d628ba0f23b","node_id":"C_kwDOAHxHXNoAKDgzOTkxNDcwMDI0N2M5MTRjN2VjMDBhMjRjYzQ0ZDYyOGJhMGYyM2I","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/jahia-store/commit/48f2d7685d5425c566e50bb289bf5e9a6a085bcc","sha":"48f2d7685d5425c566e50bb289bf5e9a6a085bcc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-store/commits/48f2d7685d5425c566e50bb289bf5e9a6a085bcc"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/jahia-store/commit/faee806d8d17966480a7e6c86df40b76b9917dee","sha":"faee806d8d17966480a7e6c86df40b76b9917dee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-store/commits/faee806d8d17966480a7e6c86df40b76b9917dee"}],"sha":"839914700247c914c7ec00a24cc44d628ba0f23b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-store/commits/839914700247c914c7ec00a24cc44d628ba0f23b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-store/commits/faee806d8d17966480a7e6c86df40b76b9917dee/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-19T19:43:06Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-19T19:43:06Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"message":"refactor: namespace store GraphQL under a single forge field\n\nThe store''s read/write operations each extended the root Query/Mutation with\nflat fields (forgeSettings, forgeCategorySettings, manageRolesSettings,\nsearchForgePrincipals; updateForgeSettings, setRootCategory, addForgeCategory,\nupdateForgeCategoryTitles, deleteForgeCategory, grantSiteRole, revokeSiteRole),\npolluting the global schema with 11 top-level fields.\n\nGroup them under one namespace:\n  query    { forge { settings, categorySettings, manageRolesSettings, searchPrincipals } }\n  mutation { forge { updateSettings, setRootCategory, addCategory,\n                     updateCategoryTitles, deleteCategory, grantRole, revokeRole } }\n\n- New ForgeQuery/ForgeMutation container types hold the @GraphQLField methods;\n  ForgeQueryExtension/ForgeMutationExtension add the single ''forge'' field to\n  Query/Mutation (auto-registered by BundleScanner via @GraphQLTypeExtension).\n- The six former extension classes keep all logic + authorization and become\n  plain static logic-holders the containers delegate to (no behavior change).\n- Admin client (.gql.js + result-read paths) and Cypress fixtures/specs updated\n  to the nested shape. store-template is unaffected (its branding reader uses the\n  ForgeSettingsService OSGi bridge, not GraphQL).\n\nJava build + 93 unit tests green; admin webpack bundle builds.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"90888c2adc11c25e2f5befc44cb856525c8e4f23","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-store/git/trees/90888c2adc11c25e2f5befc44cb856525c8e4f23"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-store/git/commits/faee806d8d17966480a7e6c86df40b76b9917dee","verification":{"payload":"tree 90888c2adc11c25e2f5befc44cb856525c8e4f23\nparent 48f2d7685d5425c566e50bb289bf5e9a6a085bcc\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1781898186 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1781898186 +0200\n\nrefactor: namespace store GraphQL under a single forge field\n\nThe store''s read/write operations each extended the root Query/Mutation with\nflat fields (forgeSettings, forgeCategorySettings, manageRolesSettings,\nsearchForgePrincipals; updateForgeSettings, setRootCategory, addForgeCategory,\nupdateForgeCategoryTitles, deleteForgeCategory, grantSiteRole, revokeSiteRole),\npolluting the global schema with 11 top-level fields.\n\nGroup them under one namespace:\n  query    { forge { settings, categorySettings, manageRolesSettings, searchPrincipals } }\n  mutation { forge { updateSettings, setRootCategory, addCategory,\n                     updateCategoryTitles, deleteCategory, grantRole, revokeRole } }\n\n- New ForgeQuery/ForgeMutation container types hold the @GraphQLField methods;\n  ForgeQueryExtension/ForgeMutationExtension add the single ''forge'' field to\n  Query/Mutation (auto-registered by BundleScanner via @GraphQLTypeExtension).\n- The six former extension classes keep all logic + authorization and become\n  plain static logic-holders the containers delegate to (no behavior change).\n- Admin client (.gql.js + result-read paths) and Cypress fixtures/specs updated\n  to the nested shape. store-template is unaffected (its branding reader uses the\n  ForgeSettingsService OSGi bridge, not GraphQL).\n\nJava build + 93 u