m/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-store/commits/11891ea0cd68e58381b282ddad72e59acb03ab5c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-12T16:13:38Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-12T16:13:38Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"message":"test(feeds): pin the moduleList coordinate guard across both feeds\n\nThe architecture review flagged the mavenproxy download-URL grammar as living in 3\nplaces (json JSP, rss JSP, versions.ts) with the JSPs missing the segment validation\nthe TS side enforces — and ''no spanning test''. PR #39 added the guard to both JSPs;\nthis adds the missing test.\n\nSeeds (via direct GraphQL, bypassing the upload action''s coordinate validation) a\njnt:file-less version under a module whose groupId carries ''/'' and ''..'', publishes,\nthen asserts both feeds suppress the URL: the JSON feed emits an empty downloadUrl\nfor that version (no /modules/mavenproxy/ path, no ''..''), and the RSS feed never\nlinks the traversal coordinate. spec 14 now 8/8.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"dbe8633ac64250035a7a6db61a2e27caeaca8d35","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-store/git/trees/dbe8633ac64250035a7a6db61a2e27caeaca8d35"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-store/git/commits/11891ea0cd68e58381b282ddad72e59acb03ab5c","verification":{"pay