vents_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/modoboa/modoboa/commits/cfa594d2b711a45d3da9c677b3ce1bdb60e4d417/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T11:14:58Z","email":"tonio@ngyn.org","name":"Antoine Nguyen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T11:14:58Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"perf(webmail): speed up the subscriptions dialog with big hierarchies (#4270)\n\nThe dialog rendered every folder at once with v-treeview, at about 2 ms\nper folder (10 s for 4,400 folders), even when collapsed.\n\n- render a flat, virtualized list: only visible rows are mounted\n- add a filter field, matches are listed with their full path\n- return a flat list sorted on path components from the API instead of\n  a tree serialized recursively\n- attach a folder whose parent is not listed to its closest listed\n  ancestor, showing the missing path components in its label","tree":{"sha":"cbd886d06494fc4d25147d18ebfd79a6a15a238b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/modoboa/modoboa/git/trees/cbd886d06494fc4d25147d18ebfd79a6a15a238b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/modoboa/modoboa/git/commits/cfa594d2b711a45d3da9c677b3ce1bdb60e4d417","verification":{"payload":"tree cbd886d06494fc4d25147d18ebfd79a6a15a238b\nparent 2a0bea6b6f0745acad977f2233208b5fbf92da98\nauthor Antoine Nguyen <tonio@ngyn.org> 1791285298 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791285298 +0200\n\nperf(webmail): speed up the subscriptions dialog with big hierarchies (#4270)\n\nThe dialog rendered every folder at once with v-treeview, at about 2 ms\nper folder (10 s for 4,400 folders), even when collapsed.\n\n- render a flat, virtualized list: only visible rows are mounted\n- add a filter field, matches are listed with their full path\n- return a flat list sorted on path components from the API instead of\n  a tree serialized recursively\n- attach a folder whose parent is not listed to its closest listed\n  ancestor, showing the missing path components in its label","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxNgyCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAtS4QAHBkkE8TIT4eRbhGKTo5yELS\n1iBExFY0jk/mni5T2QAu0Yl2EE/Wac6/hHSrJ3ge9Imh+cJK+97M3iRaZuizmzCa\n9YGyaC3mdcNCydM4LugzhfGlHQOKsh1u3561APhGWYu/hRopeQafZOWSZQOsoyzC\ndGBmdbjsmurb/EMognlpqiE/UOo33MPy/3rqaC8sis4jbvYfDTp+HJbO4kRSLukY\npNE2yXSou2j8+HtIvFzidyeVn2K3b3Xw+EvFGTRTxQjiGVu0/wCweg6idPjB1ORM\nz8vIZs1LjL3Z12I4UK+bchz5p5lZgiE1vlpGzcOIP3+ex3ypz4ktQM1mODMUImUS\nlMpInYEeHMbYXgGwdYLUq1tKVW5g2YrtR4ZB7JAahyWqNlOsbSaBrshkHI+lk1ZO\nQ61Sph642T0uPK34jrYkEPmBqQbHLh1bkzuRPeuxHm+IoT/SpvcPQEStNPIO2IdZ\nY8Na4etjSu0R2AjtvkzL6J/gFPGtB1kzd/YaKdKkZvmy+UJX1647Kh6EPd2pt4ox\nvBbNs/pSTrPdAfYGKGCbriDqBhRT5y9EoKD06QTlP9X8LdIVNqtU2zHZkPLtaX+f\n+jIr4jueXFfhfGmgcgpumJG3xO2CB/e7JcZSg1ufOhyRBRUcB7UlIdJtrUmZ4wMf\nZhWul4sXRKL+MYK23Y6g\n=nwpz\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-06T11:14:59Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":