"name":"Antoine Nguyen"},"message":"test: run the test suite in parallel\n\n- the test runner forces the fork start method (Django supports\n  neither forkserver, the default since Python 3.14, nor spawn for\n  this setup), gives each worker its own Redis database and lets\n  workers start child processes (policy daemon tests)\n- test cases sharing an external resource (LDAP directory) declare a\n  parallel_group and run in the same worker\n- use a local memory cache during tests instead of a shared directory\n- rspamd parameters test no longer depends on another test case\n  installing the app\n- CI runs the suite with --parallel auto, and disables mysqldump\n  column statistics so that test databases can be cloned on MariaDB\n- add tblib to test requirements to report worker tracebacks","tree":{"sha":"efcb6cc79a3e78f69dbcd19ee138a52b266f1935","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/modoboa/modoboa/git/trees/efcb6cc79a3e78f69dbcd19ee138a52b266f1935"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/modoboa/modoboa/git/commits/9d609ad645578403286f1593b17933389406cb2f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/531694?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tonioo","id":531694,"login":"tonioo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMTY5NA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo/subscrip