":{"date":"2026-10-02T16:41:07Z","email":"tonio@ngyn.org","name":"Antoine Nguyen"},"message":"ci: speed up the Modoboa App workflow\n\n- cancel superseded runs on pull requests\n- only start the database service under test\n- install dependencies with uv (cached) in a single step, drop the\n  unused postfix and redis-server packages\n- run coverage on Python 3.14, where coverage.py uses the faster\n  sys.monitoring core even with branch coverage","tree":{"sha":"f10d199c567bf58f54b974fc4aa064b226649582","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/modoboa/modoboa/git/trees/f10d199c567bf58f54b974fc4aa064b226649582"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/modoboa/modoboa/git/commits/10c679d03c02ddf535341a54f4df191891c622a6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/531694?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tonioo","id":531694,"login":"tonioo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMTY5NA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/modoboa/modoboa/commit/10c679d03c02ddf535341a54f4df191891c622a6","node_id":"C_kwDOAJB9V9oAKDEwYzY3OWQwM2MwMmRkZjUzNTM0MWE1NGY0ZGYxOTE4OTFjNjIyYTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/modoboa/modoboa/commit/f5e10edefc4957abbd5bd0ec65428c3f8d456021","sha":"f5e10edefc4957abbd5bd0ec65428c3f8d456021","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/modoboa/modoboa/commits/f5e10edefc4957abbd5bd0ec65428c3f8d456021"}],"sha":"10c679d03c02ddf535341a54f4df191891c622a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/modoboa/modoboa/commits/10c679d03c02ddf535341a54f4df191891c622a6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/531694?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tonioo","id":531694,"login":"tonioo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMTY5NA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/modoboa/modoboa/commits/f5e10edefc4957abbd5bd0ec65428c3f8d456021/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T15:46:46Z","email":"tonio@ngyn.org","name":"Antoine Nguyen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T15:46:46Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(webmail): multiples compose fixes (#4254)\n\n* fix(webmail): keep the whole text of HTML messages in their plain text part\n\nhtml2plaintext only kept the first text node of each element: the text\nfollowing an inline element (bold, link...) was dropped from the text\nalternative of every HTML message and from plain text signatures.\n\nThe conversion now keeps the layout: paragraphs, line breaks, lists,\nquotes and link targets.\n\n* fix(webmail): don''t escape the quoted text of plain text replies and forwards\n\nThe quoted message was HTML escaped as if it was displayed: an\napostrophe became &#x27; in the editor and in the message sent.\n\nA message without text part is now quoted from the text of its HTML\npart instead of its markup.\n\n* fix(webmail): give the Sent copy the Message-ID of the message sent\n\nDjango builds a new Message-ID and Date each time the MIME message is\ngenerated: the copy stored into the Sent folder was not the message\nreceived by the recipients, which broke the threads holding it.\n\nBoth headers are now set once, the Message-ID in the domain of the\nsender. A scheduled message records its Message-ID so that the copy\nkept in the Scheduled folder and the message sent share it, and the\nheaders identifying that copy no longer reach the recipients.\n\n* fix(webmail): store a new draft version before removing the previous one\n\nThe previous version was deleted first: the draft was lost when storing\nthe new one failed (quota exceeded, connection lost...).\n\n* fix(webmail): flag the original message of a scheduled reply or forward\n\nThe sending job can''t reach the mailbox of the user: the original\nmessage is flagged as soon as the answer is scheduled.\n\n* fix(webmail): scheduling issues in the compose form\n\n- after a failed scheduling, clicking on Send scheduled the message\n  instead of sending it right away\n- today could not be selected again once another date was picked\n- the selected date was changed when submitting the form","tree":{"sha":"f74984b03139cd3b1ae823098c43b1244e11a431","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/modoboa/modoboa/git/trees/f74984b03139cd3b1ae823098c43b1244e11a431"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/modoboa/modoboa/git/commits/f5e10edefc4957abbd5bd0ec65428c3f8d456021","verification":{"payload":"tree f74984b03139cd3b1ae823098c43b1244e11a431\nparent cc300f2a2e706a21d251173c7fe961a5e2c436c9\nauthor Antoine Nguyen <tonio@ngyn.org> 1790956006 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790956006 +0200\n\nfix(webmail): multiples compose fixes (#4254)\n\n* fix(webmail): keep the whole text of HTML messages in their plain text part\n\nhtml2plaintext only kept the first text node of each element: the text\nfollowing an inline element (bold, link...) was dropped from the text\nalternative of every HTML message and from plain text signatures.\n\nThe conversion now keeps the layout: paragraphs, line breaks, lists,\nquotes and link targets.\n\n* fix(webmail): don''t escape the quoted text of plain text replies and forwards\n\nThe quoted message was HTML escaped as if it was displayed: an\napostrophe became &#x27; in the editor and in the message sent.\n\nA message without text part is now quoted from the text of its HTML\npart instead of its markup.\n\n* fix(webmail): give the Sent copy the Message-ID of the message sent\n\nDjango builds a new Message-ID and Date each time the MIME message is\ngenerated: the copy stored into the Sent folder was not the message\nreceived by the recipients, which broke the threads holding it.\n\nBoth headers are now set once, the Message-ID in the domain of the\nsender. A scheduled message records its Message-ID so that the copy\nkept in the Scheduled folder and the message sent share it, and the\nheaders identifying that copy no longer reach the recipients.\n\n* fix(webmail): store a new draft version before removing the previous one\n\nThe previous version was deleted first: the draft was lost when storing\nthe new one failed (quota exceeded, connection lost...).\n\n* fix(webmail): flag the original message of a scheduled reply or forward\n\nThe sending job can''t reach the mailbox of the user: the original\nmessage is flagged as soon as the answer is scheduled.\n\n* fix(webmail): scheduling issues in the compose form\n\n- after a failed scheduling, clicking on Send scheduled the message\n  instead of sending it right away\n- today could not be selected again once another date was picked\n- the selected date was changed when submitting the form","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqv9HmCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAALucQAKn7XCKhamyudedEJgN4uyEX\nnwxNqOxyK2Y6w0I383B4E+10cSckr9oVaMd5nhVG0FjtiJJpYrz8AUIav7ett/gs\nkKRMzlK7SleJZiYONxEdTYkIL053r+UVHAn9FC6veyTx7Q7TfxyG1CoUixN2PDOt\nDSo7icdH2Ez59hdJSpwcYyco/TcIV5x5SygmFeLc1mA6gUK5UvI6SPvTgjPzwsGt\newdC0t9S1QvuA+RaeKI2BDlyVG1Uquyu5Tb+OMunv57U/lzDwRqf7nNHJ9eYupgd\nFl4ZnaKpjaT9NlXWRljy2fYTcbr+Ji2SM1nF8dPS0aJsZiWlAMGAIr4mRpNspWAf\nAdrSRShDGQliN/eH8En207XJYPG+kO14Nr/i4CxVHWs0XdgSzoTlw9zgVHdqzT8N\n9//Zn6N4YwDeADbpJfX4ohd6oDBVGAzqOPH98isObQpk5Qf9UPzoitBHQQo3sgOu\nskB/QyrLCafjTz/lV64tnVA/my5Je6Zi3THushQiiumX+RwKfEgfitE3UFE95/J1\n8U3eaJr9+lxsRcpKyLrkwnI2/Yh39wxxrX5dvsBumqbhdPhsQlmGRArtTK8s7N5r\nTyuIcyUGGccIcRrlfQOiSpdd9w1La7QdRvYww45Q+9cOERlM3WFzQquSdo9R4gnd\ng9CquJtj+pdOCCAeB47C\n=KMBe\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-02T15:46:47Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/modoboa/modoboa/commit/f5e10edefc4957abbd5bd0ec65428c3f8d456021","node_id":"C_kwDOAJB9V9oAKGY1ZTEwZWRlZmM0OTU3YWJiZDViZDBlYzY1NDI4YzNmOGQ0NTYwMjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/modoboa/modoboa/commit/cc300f2a2e706a21d251173c7fe961a5e2c436c9","sha":"cc300f2a2e706a21d251173c7fe961a5e2c436c9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/modoboa/modoboa/commits/cc300f2a2e706a21d251173c7fe961a5e2c436c9"}],"sha":"f5e10edefc4957abbd5bd0ec65428c3f8d456021","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/modoboa/modoboa/commits/f5e10edefc4957abbd5bd0ec65428c3f8d456021"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/531694?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tonioo","id":531694,"login":"tonioo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMTY5NA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/modoboa/modoboa/commits/cc300f2a2e706a21d251173c7fe961a5e2c436c9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T13:33:03Z","email":"tonio@ngyn.org","name":"Antoine Nguyen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T13:33:03Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(core): Highlight Modoboa Pro in the admin interface (#4253)\n\n* feat(core): let plugins expose a menu badge and a status in their manifest\n\nFrontend plugin manifests can now carry:\n\n- a `badge` on menu entries (short label displayed next to the entry,\n  e.g. \"PRO\");\n- a `status` (`{\"text\", \"color\"}`) returned by the new\n  `ModoExtension.get_frontend_status()` hook, computed on each manifest\n  request and `None` by default.\n\nDocument both fields and the new `admin.information.pro` extension\npoint in the plugin API guide.\n\n* style(core): reformat FIDO registration test with black\n\n* feat(core): add a setting to hide the Modoboa Pro promotion\n\nThe new `hide_pro_promotion` general parameter (Dashboard section) lets\nsuper administrators hide the Modoboa Pro menu entry and presentation\nwhen the plugin is not installed. Unless it is enabled, the\n`pro_promotion` capability is exposed to the frontend.\n\n* feat(frontend): highlight Modoboa Pro in the admin menu and Information page\n\n- Add a \"Modoboa Pro\" entry at the bottom of the admin menu (super\n  admins only), below a new divider. Without the plugin it reads\n  \"Discover\"; with the plugin it shows the license status exposed in\n  its manifest.\n- Display plugin menu badges (e.g. \"PRO\") and actually render the\n  Information entry bell when admin notifications are pending.\n- Split the Information page into \"Installed components\" and\n  \"Modoboa Pro\" tabs, the latter reachable at /admin/modoboa-pro. When\n  the plugin is missing, show a presentation and a greyed row in the\n  components table; otherwise render the components provided through\n  the `admin.information.pro` extension point.\n- Restyle important messages with neutral text and a regular-size\n  title, fix the highlighting of components with an available update\n  and use the theme color for links.","tree":{"sha":"79b1e0ab0916d8cd6c915e5997e0897643608691","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/modoboa/modoboa/git/trees/79b1e0ab0916d8cd6c915e5997e0897643608691"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/modoboa/modoboa/git/commits/cc300f2a2e706a21d251173c7fe961a5e2c436c9","verification":{"payload":"tree 79b1e0ab0916d8cd6c915e5997e0897643608691\nparent 6e074f36f1addedf6e9c3cc0ca628ee8eebdbd37\nauthor Antoine Nguyen <tonio@ngyn.org> 1790947983 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790947983 +0200\n\nfeat(core): Highlight Modoboa Pro in the admin interface (#4253)\n\n* feat(core): let plugins expose a menu badge and a status in their manifest\n\nFrontend plugin manifests can now carry:\n\n- a `badge` on menu entries (short label displayed next to the entry,\n  e.g. \"PRO\");\n- a `status` (`{\"text\", \"color\"}`) returned by the new\n  `ModoExtension.get_frontend_status()` hook, computed on each manifest\n  request and `None` by default.\n\nDocument both fields and the new `admin.information.pro` extension\npoint in the plugin API guide.\n\n* style(core): reformat FIDO registration test with black\n\n* feat(core): add a setting to hide the Modoboa Pro promotion\n\nThe new `hide_pro_promotion` general parameter (Dashboard section) lets\nsuper administrators hide the Modoboa Pro menu entry and presentation\nwhen the plugin is not installed. Unless it is enabled, the\n`pro_promotion` capability is exposed to the frontend.\n\n* feat(frontend): highlight Modoboa Pro in the admin menu and Information page\n\n- Add a \"Modoboa Pro\" entry at the bottom of the admin menu (super\n  admins only), below a new divider. Without the plugin it reads\n  \"Discover\"; with the plugin it shows the license status exposed in\n  its manifest.\n- Display plugin menu badges (e.g. \"PRO\") and actually render the\n  Information entry bell when admin notifications are pending.\n- Split the Information page into \"Installed components\" and\n  \"Modoboa Pro\" tabs, the latter reachable at /admin/modoboa-pro. When\n  the plugin is missing, show a presentation and a greyed row in the\n  components table; otherwise render the components provided through\n  the `admin.information.pro` extension point.\n- Restyle important messages with neutral text and a regular-size\n  title, fix the highlighting of components with an available update\n  and use the theme color for links.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqv7KPCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAEb4QAGepGpZf2Pfo0jPd8LCz0WWI\nigcic1UaBFuKCcdnUU+Ec4iLhr3X2bM6CGbSFarW/KWgeLSm8KArLSwveJPCyEDp\nodO2oN+XT8oazUKCuNsfGoLCOd/pwKrooLGsce9QUdMvS0Q0d1PoobcqSKEeN1c1\nptrCM+b2PbMcZjFJedz9J0lG8SdeS90XlLbaeh1YIlJge9QCbrMXaXJd0GfpLJ0N\ns6V4nIWfBfffLTBL7XGURHlUS3H4GkoLioBcdNqW0w4fwnotUKdXc5VwONmHJviT\nI+vhKgdAKFqVUz8c1YGc1XXcd5PEMCyne/BiSRjX1Y/wDyod1uaIXZHZr1HWeDA9\nEL8Gps5LinFghVC6Z+UJX29HcftRCt8D/QVLPKbhVh77jTE4cFCDLG7UPZdpgNDs\n/7kHmGWkb5MlIpdhjfE8ivtFNSa3CUi8gAsMKVTWahUyWFy1RRLbT/z3PRaYqxNR\nnWGfLjIfnfODHm+0QUTE98NeRHxYVyVpMviYsI/UDRRWMZhPL1DeBSNga6YtlYTG\n+gWen9pr7Tvtu8Ku8rWBWN+5XbvMwAr2A6ZaR9vzl3ok0oEHrEuCq+Y6ztCtZvN8\nB5T/OCvTN5eOOa6MYXXJJtFVbX2FKKmxEK5bMFMXCOfzNRngyl6Ypoigk+T7Y0j+\nPVlpV/HPyCkZIh4Oamf6\n=ska3\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-02T13:33:04Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/modoboa/modoboa/commit/cc300f2a2e706a21d251173c7