rs/tonioo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/modoboa/modoboa/commits/aae32fe8355b53b9ec8dce9aaa96b3c90afd98df/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T20:45:25Z","email":"tonio@ngyn.org","name":"Antoine Nguyen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T20:45:25Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(dkim): allow regenerating an existing or missing DKIM key (#4237) (#4243)\n\nThe \"regenerate\" button ignored the confirmation dialog result, and the\nrequest it would have sent patched a read-only field, so no job was ever\nqueued. The manage_dkim_keys command also skipped any domain with a key\npath set, even when the key file was missing.\n\n- add a --force option to manage_dkim_keys and regenerate keys whose\n  file is missing\n- only notify domains whose key was actually generated\n- add a POST /api/v2/domains/{pk}/dkim/generate/ endpoint\n- never write domains without private key to rspamd maps and skip\n  malformed map lines instead of crashing\n\nClose #4237","tree":{"sha":"f3e9790b651c86e7664561d9e8dc0035d9408a62","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/modoboa/modoboa/git/trees/f3e9790b651c86e7664561d9e8dc0035d9408a62"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/modoboa/modoboa/git/commits/aae32fe8355b53b9ec8dce9aaa96b3c90afd98df","verification":{"payload":"tree f3e9790b651c86e7664561d9e8dc0035d9408a62\nparent 73f147fbe9dea6011a0b6748eef6b51298b768cd\nauthor Antoine Nguyen <tonio@ngyn.org> 1790628325 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790628325 +0200\n\nfix(dkim): allow regenerating an existing or missing DKIM key (#4237) (#4243)\n\nThe \"regenerate\" button ignored the confirmation dialog result, and the\nrequest it would have sent patched a read-only field, so no job was ever\nqueued. The manage_dkim_keys command also skipped any domain with a key\npath set, even when the key file was missing.\n\n- add a --force option to manage_dkim_keys and regenerate keys whose\n  file is missing\n- only notify domains whose key was actually generated\n- add a POST /api/v2/domains/{pk}/dkim/generate/ endpoint\n- never write domains without private key to rspamd maps and skip\n  malformed map lines instead of crashing\n\nClose #4237","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqutHlCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAXVMQAJyA5byEcHrK+wmDjt4Mm9wv\nR58Qvp/PZNm6kLmn0J2SDJkZAhz2uXZG3lMg07RW6gTR0hA1yRY5JT854a3D2nqe\nIAxjcXbDow4C2hXCFJBafb4dRHyelnOqwUEc2TqV/YrGOaKdLsrau8uY/COfr4S3\nqgWtRaHUf3hHMJh9kHiLD9Fe7byfwvPVQxr/fNTrYezKCE7U0sZx4aZsce83FkXw\ncIvDY0TQtRtgfkd9nlf4YLx7+riu4Y45L1far6KAUk8x+5jsnrnsfiG6p5827nMn\nJGDlCyzBD2mQ64oqIVehgCxMmdsYRDCU5Pu7II5d4+IaQG+2v+yvqrAKp5WVmAuo\nYz2ldnuHcvyZlOLb+hcl7AJpAJuovKcTqN/bPmDPG9kxXktTketLRF8iwtbWW0pY\nYShXsyJn7IRA5fk6wpWb+plMoUiaFbyT66npSqMTUbr6hDJoGD7J107pMT5RG1z6\n0ITn3g0Xe9J5RmHMIGyw5lgqvvKAPvoT1UEYiBpE7rP+yd/GIzC3iImdQKC28aQK\n/Zui2hRtG+ctVLVzxDDtBbjqfOLphuifW1HtXqLmiBgIun1RtrcTOHeq9ZC5/fZC\nR2qzIJBSgL0raAwG6QBHw6lFjMx9CKl2iSGegmMiXyEt8KoFItYgmv0XLqTrqmnM\n92IsppjWPgwkHvCHIYZ7\n=QcGA\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-28T20:45:25Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","or