3d760850fa5dc7af61dfd628249c04f926","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/modoboa/modoboa/git/trees/39c1ef3d760850fa5dc7af61dfd628249c04f926"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/modoboa/modoboa/git/commits/77d91752670313fc9052cd93f10bf11bb4a8b13a","verification":{"payload":"tree 39c1ef3d760850fa5dc7af61dfd628249c04f926\nparent c68766498ceef3aff6119a971cdf64fe0386f70b\nauthor Antoine Nguyen <tonio@ngyn.org> 1790265853 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790265853 +0200\n\nfix(calendars): support recurring events and safe calendar change (#4234)\n\n- expand recurring events so every occurrence is displayed, and expose\n  their recurrence_id\n- ask the user whether a modification or a deletion applies to one\n  occurrence (override / EXDATE) or to the whole series\n- when changing the calendar of an event, save it in the new calendar\n  before removing it from the old one, and send the request to the\n  original calendar (the move never worked from the UI)\n- keep the duration of all day events when they are updated (DTEND is\n  exclusive)\n- support events defined with DURATION instead of DTEND\n- patch the CalDAV backend module in event tests instead of relying on\n  import order","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqtUn9CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAJ7oQAHWHTPV6AtPj9+uRlCNM5ruV\nJgUK7AfsdtZ9KtYpHpydyBZyWtjQyLiS0EUwBEW7lizDGYDkJ/lEvDllbzvvlPSq\nhlJeMW+SH4c1I/kqjIL70aQjNE6QFj4DQr1vU/3ob2cvSRo39vdXIwYgRRIGaTuq\nFjqnb7ny7ZJTYefSp+RKNC/QgrEFMzuoA6n8vWSkydx1DEPAE6ZJ24vsZEWUU51f\nbfLo90mhxEOUOr72Gn1uE7ABST1JgMEuYfHskwR7+pPiqOKwKyofCH57b4iSVWKO\nofEMBMylxegbY4KJgCKO2J+oSuwBznUo+EoEYF9puUqpLqYBmfdHHEiEJP6/kspr\nYDHv+jS7tmJxy52bZWDwkXJuCWqxcYpLaxwhRw9JlwC3KFj3bzwzomhd2mqH1OxM\nTpWRsj2ixTAALsLv3I5R0XdvORT+dYJ33x6xkrXRiI9rnW6bj7TJ4wKNUhycYEQ8\nszTC7aNK0OG6AOO7RHcjEE1WJlVoRKVyqrDCoC5atsvTU04cwcoPNZ+ervmBys/N\nEdhXdG+pISyhTxTqthSP3d4K/DxZf7VFVDoC70k3rxrpURMiIk+OZg6FpkHiampS\nBaRAdKhC9oCa+jJGdK+DhQFMeXJMOaWiF9rPJdMd9wvEcxVCQovqTdKOOnYNsSOS\nm2J