n\nThe amavis database encoding now follows the backend, since MariaDB\nexpects \"utf8mb4\" rather than \"UTF-8\".","tree":{"sha":"6933fe8a28b5b390f87d03f29ef9309154f101cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/modoboa/modoboa/git/trees/6933fe8a28b5b390f87d03f29ef9309154f101cb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/modoboa/modoboa/git/commits/b0cdcacc56835ad159e4a52f38a1703a05ed44d5","verification":{"payload":"tree 6933fe8a28b5b390f87d03f29ef9309154f101cb\nparent a03640a3abac641a0da030aa0638e4e4f5d7b7f2\nauthor Antoine Nguyen <tonio@ngyn.org> 1790177632 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790177632 +0200\n\nchore(dev): make amavis optional in the development environment (#4228)\n\nAmavis is now enabled through the AMAVIS_BACKEND environment variable\n(off, sqlite or mariadb) instead of editing the test project settings.\nIt is off by default, and tests always run it against sqlite.\n\nA docker/compose.amavis.yml override starts MariaDB and amavisd and\nswitches the services to the mariadb backend. A Makefile provides\nshortcuts for both variants (make up / make up-amavis).\n\nThe amavis database encoding now follows the backend, since MariaDB\nexpects \"utf8mb4\" rather than \"UTF-8\".","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqs/FgCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAIB4QAJ21phbRlpz/kigjy3lBm5s6\nzxBmlK0P862AwT0eeAOjk/FGMjRLRRxjASJkIijHJrRUdFdvWfxEF/UY/ThRZEJz\nL5UCOFvNhYJoNkQf1+rRVz0yOT+nCe6g504M6zgC6Ck06pPHR2XIGJRfCFg6dUu8\nGgbHvBYmtgGaC0uxU93dKGgMJvMa5EpclatjCZGFj4V5+3uzP91ZQ/srQL7ggkRW\n6qH3/01ZlPjGj6SvYzlX4OisLTVQyz5MIoiQAoHH7tX65XBR1I7NaEn2/x7c7NJM\n+n9wkqgG69tSC+ILAjRJgSfUIo3tTYIqf2zJ3Kx+alfFtdE1nusCimBsy5W6mhM4\nmSWaLLSC9+tYyZvoShJlFJXfPGvD7MlxXn0agkP089PeUvHmGKrlshl4dQMcmoou\nDXXLouKqZlQaojfmckMzF9J5tvJ0GE30yDJgzBKetIYs6/zcIfOwF/YdDzyrcGZU\nDNcsX11q3GQeyHWo5pANEWtjJZQwOi2Cf7lPb/0cAM4AziluyNBVcvK6fn9tvhWJ\nXGDyO269AcDCJphUwmn31pS1w6s6DUrulsty8Zxt9wAG0Hg0qW0NFZb/72L7F9rX\ncPEUL44x6kcre6qpfJ0jpdTI2PAYqA4ys8vv5OF+pQzEBin+ODxzMJxPLLcc5KQQ