_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tonioo","id":531694,"login":"tonioo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMTY5NA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/modoboa/modoboa/commits/a03640a3abac641a0da030aa0638e4e4f5d7b7f2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T15:31:14Z","email":"tonio@ngyn.org","name":"Antoine Nguyen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T15:31:14Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"perf(webmail): cut IMAP round trips and redundant requests (#4224)\n\n* perf(webmail): cut IMAP round trips and redundant requests\n\nBackend:\n- drop CHECK before LOGOUT and GETQUOTAROOT from the listing\n- cache NAMESPACE, and CAPABILITY when the server doesn''t send it\n  with the authentication reply\n- fetch the content parts of a message with a single FETCH, and only\n  the inline images the content references\n- look up known contacts with one query\n- add a mailboxes/status endpoint, and return the mailbox state and\n  unseen counter along the listings\n\nFrontend:\n- poll the mailbox status and only request the listing when it changed;\n  refresh silently, pause while the page is hidden\n- keep the last listing, the preferences and the last opened messages\n  for the session\n- update the listing optimistically after delete, junk, flag and move\n- take unseen counters from the listing instead of separate requests\n\n* test(webmail): cover both authentication commands in the capabilities test","tree":{"sha":"daa8b15a53b9b243c55eb5bee1fd1561168a27c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/modoboa/modoboa/git/trees/daa8b15a53b9b243c55eb5bee1fd1561168a27c3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/modoboa/modoboa/git/commits/a03640a3abac641a0da030aa0638e4e4f5d7b7f2","verification":{"payload":"tree daa8b15a53b9b243c55eb5bee1fd1561168a27c3\nparent 3d97bf6f5837e5dd1b9454385df2da2dc32306ac\nauthor Antoine Nguyen <tonio@ngyn.org> 1790177474 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790177474 +0200\n\nperf(webmail): cut IMAP round trips and redundant requests (#4224)\n\n* perf(webmail): cut IMAP round trips and redundant requests\n\nBackend:\n- drop CHECK before LOGOUT and GETQUOTAROOT from the listing\n- cache NAMESPACE, and CAPABILITY when the server doesn''t send it\n  with the authentication reply\n- fetch the content parts of a message with a single FETCH, and only\n  the inline images the content references\n- look up known contacts with one query\n- add a mailboxes/status endpoint, and return the mailbox state and\n  unseen counter along the listings\n\nFrontend:\n- poll the mailbox status and only request the listing when it changed;\n  refresh silently, pause while the page is hidden\n- keep the last listing, the preferences and the last opened messages\n  for the session\n- update the listing optimistically after delete, junk, flag and move\n- take unseen counters from the listing instead of separate requests\n\n* test(webmail): cover both authentication commands in the capabilities test","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqs/DCCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAKicQAJxlBIXoQn4206Ne+/k6uX+/\nFHJ0lTCRrZePBhI/XO3SBbz83ZyyUpMDhQPUbOLGl7kwv/ZGLhugNdl+Hs83kjCi\n8ZkfI72sHFVC3re5PT0FEZXW8w1uht1bZFQtBPBJeKOdveroIdbQUfs3OIl1UurI\nrqdlNfRegDkxQe1FK83yodeb6yy2RL1a90uY3pj8PWLnAGHcAwIp5u7YsOs125um\nXHCEiR27zEfxMDEk3T8ycKUn30gkrTG7h2qSwNCFBxufhiI++x9ZmT0FdPycAv/v\nsHHYMqpEynOZolmsRaB8j/dOdSlFdBkvukdfVbhIh/k6o74VbisUH6/9vdBFh5fz\nfs/kGoU+HV03OqO8ISSyOnqxv6rdUwqAdbP8ViH4aeBd/dXKcWHJJLghgRdcDH/m\nuLi7cLcmMKdey8nanfPq3Gt4uVc