om/users/tonioo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tonioo","id":531694,"login":"tonioo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMTY5NA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/modoboa/modoboa/commits/3d97bf6f5837e5dd1b9454385df2da2dc32306ac/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T14:49:38Z","email":"tonio@ngyn.org","name":"Antoine Nguyen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T14:49:38Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(frontend): load all domains instead of the first page only (#4227)\n\nThe API ignores page_size=0 and falls back to the default page size\n(50), so domain selectors only offered the first 50 domains. Walk\nthrough every page instead.\n\nAlso fix AliasGeneralForm using the paginated response object as the\ndomain list, and the domains store never setting domainsLoaded to true\nand resetting domains to an object.","tree":{"sha":"8f7a804db13d90875986505740fe2ceb4551cdc9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/modoboa/modoboa/git/trees/8f7a804db13d90875986505740fe2ceb4551cdc9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/modoboa/modoboa/git/commits/3d97bf6f5837e5dd1b9454385df2da2dc32306ac","verification":{"payload":"tree 8f7a804db13d90875986505740fe2ceb4551cdc9\nparent 89c0a8b68e93b05a2a191f5f27d2c2051cbf1fb7\nauthor Antoine Nguyen <tonio@ngyn.org> 1790174978 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790174978 +0200\n\nfix(frontend): load all domains instead of the first page only (#4227)\n\nThe API ignores page_size=0 and falls back to the default page size\n(50), so domain selectors only offered the first 50 domains. Walk\nthrough every page instead.\n\nAlso fix AliasGeneralForm using the paginated response object as the\ndomain list, and the domains store never setting domainsLoaded to true\nand resetting domains to an object.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqs+cCCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAmrcQACyg0oZrcQWX5BmwF92BKt2/\nwOOeH19XjHNLjjXFbvZDwL0dwwlN11ZwZKi5k1rxna6X34hxCz3JXFLRXzC3cZB4\npbz+T914ynW+Z/85EtWYmz/8l7c1pWkRpQkHeTwVVlDSyWKMLOMbhJHeL6qvjDnY\njzjgDgPg7tKDbY1GqbBaA/9DauuWQQf7kPdyDlKvPj8TePewnnwOBt9IPuCLy2xK\nDDlPrw5HEuCyTQX3rzeauVMBc/dxqATZxW7xcKGLdl3ccBSlfEQhbbvNiBV3tIY5\ncZteDmVgKg+StrHDYQ7ettsdOFDBdohWF66ePpzQi4SjEP76Fd6krkvHhIkfHURx\nnQGpMvRO84S2VoWivuAUBlSDd/ccmXqvqHRQQEQfn8WY+brzJ2RSx1DtGkXiz33y\n3imuRTvKod6fikb69UNGUa11ofc8aiyZC1aTl5FN58aspVayndLJC/yyGxBX1rfZ\nzAS07ONHsZElpM5OtjCrOfiTysQ2a6mI4BEgqsOlAZGoKg4qhwpp8GxFHnpJ3u+R\niltqfdC+LXRAN6vrMC+/zZYHUaMdjNQXN7KDNlnwLLpy5VNSB4scsbU2YpXag9hN\nGfJwNL9OWT9w2tom5biHydNosGGCAi6d3kZN2ARxlL5G2c+G6fIQkmhfCH5k3k0Q\nD4pO4KvAtmmBf8K01+KK\n=6dle\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-23T14:49:38Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/modoboa/modoboa/commit/3d97bf6f5837e5dd1b9454385df2da2dc32306ac","node_id":"C_kwDOAJB9V9oAKDNkOTdiZjZmNTgzN2U1ZGQxYjk0NTQzODVkZjJkYTJkYzMyMzA2YWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/modoboa/modoboa/commit/89c0a8b68e93b05a2a191f5f27d2c2051cbf1fb7","sha":"89c0a8b68e93b05a2a191f5f27d2c2051cbf1fb7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/modoboa/modoboa/commits/89c0a8b68e93b05a2a191f5f27d2c2051cbf1fb7"}],"sha":"3d97bf6f5837e5dd1b9454385df2da2dc32306ac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/modoboa/modoboa/commits/3d97bf6f5837e5dd1b9454385df2da2dc32306ac"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/531694?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tonioo","id":531694,"login":"tonioo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMTY5NA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/modoboa/modoboa/commits/89c0a8b68e93b05a2a191f5f27d2c2051cbf1fb7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T14:44:35Z","email":"tonio@ngyn.org","name":"Antoine Nguyen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T14:44:35Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(calendars): regenerate rights file when rules are removed (#4226)\n\ngenerate_rights, run every 2 minutes, skipped the file generation\nunless an AccessRule had been updated after the file''s modification\ntime. Deletions leave no row behind, so a revoked access rule (or one\nremoved by cascade with its calendar, account or domain) stayed in the\nRadicale rights file, and its recipient kept read/write CalDAV access\nuntil another rule was created or modified. New calendars, renamed\nmailboxes and domain administrator changes were not propagated either.\n\nThe rules are now generated in memory and compared with the current\nfile content, which is rewritten only when it differs. Queries are\nordered to keep the output stable. Since generation now runs on every\ncall, rows are fetched with values_list() and iterator() instead of\nbuilding model instances.","tree":{"sha":"f41d90f03f696a49c4f03f5096a12235189509e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/modoboa/modoboa/git/trees/f41d90f03f696a49c4f03f5096a12235189509e5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/modoboa/modoboa/git/commits/89c0a8b68e93b05a2a191f5f27d2c2051cbf1fb7","verification":{"payload":"tree f41d90f03f696a49c4f03f5096a12235189509e5\nparent 332368f66d6aff032b34fd8fd3b4f39bb445bbf9\nauthor Antoine Nguyen <tonio@ngyn.org> 1790174675 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790174675 +0200\n\nfix(calendars): regenerate rights file when rules are removed (#4226)\n\ngenerate_rights, run every 2 minutes, skipped the file generation\nunless an AccessRule had been updated after the file''s modification\ntime. Deletions leave no row behind, so a revoked access rule (or one\nremoved by cascade with its calendar, account or domain) stayed in the\nRadicale rights file, and its recipient kept read/write CalDAV access\nuntil another rule was created or modified. New calendars, renamed\nmailboxes and domain administrator changes were not propagated either.\n\nThe rules are now generated in memory and compared with the current\nfile content, which is rewritten only when it differs. Queries are\nordered to keep the output stable. Since generation now runs on every\ncall, rows are fetched with values_list() and iterator() instead of\nbuilding model instances.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqs+XUCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAumcQACgEqU9Q+AkEE4S/HcV/iZiz\nDRmCQGMEOvxWh1fI08o8ImvGJZtWXTQ3MShun2uu6oiOzylRApPqw3rGU/1h2xMo\nMbgwaRWswc+Qm8ouqu6SNM1D+P7bz9dIcvNCvtI2ltQKlVLcX2bnN0dvYGnGQqkO\nlzI2PIGj+neIQoqQEdhfttcSxpL4yPcxHh8XZ4F51r4GLubQSL6vslgFANhDYhk9\n+9xWqK0Tt9s6PCnqumbqmlpo8ejVtB58n4XRUr5nKSTlti1kJ4fpbluoKPWc7Tl4\ny8GlgdWkNYpu9gSwY8t2qOEAJqJH6n+I94CRVXRu+qztzNpNkDrKmINzq1hMAM26\nJrRe60lKCergd1o+1ruRZE1mwSh6d8WBbJq+HPPFeyR12Gr+nrKglXpQfSklmCXd\nwJULdwNRYenZ66ykvyXcfEL6y/se7oFsuqFdalido7J1QcQR3wxlo85y+JGf/M8x\nC/ydXxKcTS5KFQU1tthzdQLTsUoEPDTapkVBsxSDKozSTiDrpLDjXMqcvKr6ff/B\nNozQ/NVybUdLhcXj24oCvhh43RW4lCG44gDOlrYoKc0qarvjBn/n+oekIS3ebu1i\nGNCd4hCqwc03dIf5yqJWWypHXqhE6jsAkM2fEZFuG3TJhq2Y1o1fCcWMN5CePUm6\nyZddgFQRDrvJHqrSX0ha\n=1Fyp\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-23T14:44:36Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/modoboa/modoboa/commit/89c0a8b68e93b05a2a191f5f27d2c2051cbf1fb7","node_id":"C_kwDOAJB9V9oAKDg5YzBhOGI2OGU5M2IwNWEyYTE5MWY1ZjI3ZDJjMjA1MWNiZjFmYjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/modoboa/modoboa/commit/332368f66d6aff032b34fd8fd3b4f39bb445bbf9","sha":"332368f66d6aff032b34fd8fd3b4f39bb445bbf9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/modoboa/modoboa/commits/332368f66d6aff032b34fd8fd3b4f39bb445bbf9"}],"sha":"89c0a8b68e93b05a2a191f5f27d2c2051cbf1fb7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/modoboa/modoboa/commits/89c0a8b68e93b05a2a191f5f27d2c2051cbf1fb7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/531694?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tonioo","id":531694,"login":"tonioo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMTY5NA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/modoboa/modoboa/commits/332368f66d6aff032b34fd8fd3b4f39bb445bbf9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T14:17:06Z","email":"tonio@ngyn.org","name":"Antoine Nguyen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T14:17:06Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(calendars): nest access rules under their calendar (#4225)\n\n* fix(calendars): nest access rules under their calendar\n\nThe access rules dialog always listed the rules of every calendar owned\nby the user: the frontend never sent the calendar pk, and the backend\nfilter was declared with `filter_fields`, which django-filter ignores\nsince 2.0.\n\nAccess rules are now exposed under\n/api/v2/user-calendars/{calendar_pk}/accessrules/, like events. The\nparent calendar must belong to the current user (404 otherwise), the\ncalendar field is read-only and taken from the URL, and creating a\nsecond rule for the same mailbox on a calendar returns a 400 instead\nof hitting the unique constraint.\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: the /api/v2/accessrules/ endpoint has been removed.\n\n* fix(calendars): allow simple users to share their calendars\n\nAccess rule recipients were validated with check_mailbox_ownership,\nwhich checks that the current user owns the mailbox. A simple user\ncould therefore only grant access to their own mailbox, and every\nrecipient offered by the sharing dialog was rejected. Admins, on the\nother hand, could grant access to mailboxes outside the calendar\nowner''s domain.\n\nRecipients are now validated against the same set of mailboxes the\ndialog offers: active accounts of the calendar owner''s domain, owner\nexcluded.","tree":{"sha":"00140765625cca599ebf54583c674db17f68e1b7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/modoboa/modoboa/git/trees/00140765625cca599ebf54583c674db17f68e1b7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/modoboa/modoboa/git/commits/332368f66d6aff032b34fd8fd3b4f39bb445bbf9","verification":{"payload":"tree 00140765625cca599ebf54583c674db17f68e1b7\nparent 520b906249931c852918e605326744f847f6f6cd\nauthor Antoine Nguyen <tonio@ngyn.org> 1790173026 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790173026 +0200\n\nfix(calendars): nest access rules under their calendar (#4225)\n\n* fix(calendars): nest access rules under their calendar\n\nThe access rules dialog always listed the rules of every calendar owned\nby the user: the frontend never sent the calendar pk, and the backend\nfilter was declared with `filter_fields`, which django-filter ignores\nsince 2.0.\n\nAccess rules are now exposed under\n/api/v2/user-calendars/{calendar_pk}/accessrules/, like events. The\nparent calendar must belong to the current user (404 otherwise), the\ncalendar field is read-only and taken from the URL, and creating a\nsecond rule for the same mailbox on a calendar returns a 400 instead\nof hitting the unique constraint.\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: the /api/v2/accessrules/ endpoint has been removed.\n\n* fix(calendars): allow simple users to share their calendars\n\nAccess rule recipients were validated with check_mailbox_ownership,\nwhich checks that the current user owns the mailbox. A simple user\ncould therefore only grant access to their own mailbox, and every\nrecipient offered by the sharing dialog was rejected. Admins, on the\nother hand, could grant access to mailboxes outside the calendar\nowner''s domain.\n\nRecipients are now validated against the same set of mailboxes the\ndialog offers: active accounts of the calendar owner''s domain, owner\nexcluded.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqs99iCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA9UgQABhpfksCELkdJAJ8mbrqsFh1\njWly6nDztpnRjhZuV65Hd9inBOPtoiGGS62pl6gBz2fACfaK7ru44CiMi15hbapQ\nBIS+BTlaPSvOD7ryjt7KHA70U20B2zj1fUjK9JfX7+HANRRCDJ/lEFIYeAkHhpjQ\nJjN/xJR0ocGgp9kiaVAzcVajIo+GYcLJfzoAaFbCyk5aHEtaXnbBCyXfVh6DTxli\nUEbq5WrRPMdyV9ZcRHIgD1B4iJGhA8pdRm37229LBzUD17Zg2blbcEH/C22ipmbq\nxGBm1fprF9wEYXe7DO0UVnIF8mmk0J0e1gB6uo9qJao56aJdYmQW6wffwVBpZv8A\nhsk5kMaWQ9uJg5Sjr1BOecNKavRPsKaaHs360Zu3MhhsqSHz3RxwpumnNQ9nwFSw\nsKTz4LHTF5XmXdFHAnyDWfUZIPw2/4khppQDOZovBfzXylaeuXs7jYxuFhKGOvV8\nZ5nQbfzbLLqFDkxgTcPVggu6KEkeiVLivkTuCNANel1MqOxOyVk7bQcBvxQCUEa+\nI8tw52If