138b95aab1be31c6990","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/modoboa/modoboa/commits/488ecd73c6dfc1ac86066138b95aab1be31c6990"}],"sha":"6ec8476f4fb1d0cffb8b90461b522ddaf706862f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/modoboa/modoboa/commits/6ec8476f4fb1d0cffb8b90461b522ddaf706862f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/531694?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tonioo","id":531694,"login":"tonioo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMTY5NA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/modoboa/modoboa/commits/488ecd73c6dfc1ac86066138b95aab1be31c6990/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T12:18:23Z","email":"tonio@ngyn.org","name":"Antoine Nguyen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T12:18:23Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(webmail): prevent potential timeout when unfolding a mailbox (#4220)\n\n* fix(webmail): don''t select a mailbox when toggling its children\n\nThe expand button sits inside the mailbox row, so the click bubbled up\nand also selected the parent mailbox, firing the content, threads,\nunseen and quota requests at once.\n\n* fix(webmail): set a timeout on IMAP connections\n\nIMAP sockets were opened without timeout: a server that never answers\n(for example while it waits for the OAuth2 introspection endpoint served\nby the same, saturated, uWSGI instance) blocked the worker forever.\n\nConnections now use a 30s timeout, configurable with the\nWEBMAIL_IMAP_TIMEOUT setting, and socket errors raised by a command are\nreported as ImapError so the request fails cleanly.\n\n* docs: document the introspection uWSGI instance and IMAP timeout\n\nExplain in the 2.10.2 upgrade notes why the OAuth2 introspection\nendpoint should be served by a dedicated uWSGI instance, how to set it\nup (installer upgrade or manual steps), and the new\nWEBMAIL_IMAP_TIMEOUT setting.\n\n* docs: serve OAuth2 introspection with a dedicated uWSGI instance\n\nUpdate the manual web server installation guide so new installations\nroute /api/o/introspect/ to a second uWSGI instance, and explain why.\nAdd the same advice for gunicorn.\n\n* test(webmail): cover IMAP timeout on secured connections and UID commands","tree":{"sha":"5e5266cb8698eb9dc990ffd1c1e2c3c32dc60f26","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/modoboa/modoboa/git/trees/5e5266cb8698eb9dc990ffd1c1e2c3c32dc60f26"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/modoboa/modoboa/git/commits/488ecd73c6dfc1ac86066138b95aab1be31c6990","verification":{"payload":"tree 5e5266cb8698eb9dc990ffd1c1e2c3c32dc60f26\nparent 61ea53d61a8cea4539bc22e3c05da0887a72262d\nauthor Antoine Nguyen <tonio@ngyn.org> 1790165903 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790165903 +0200\n\nfix(webmail): prevent potential timeout when unfolding a mailbox (#4220)\n\n* fix(webmail): don''t select a mailbox when toggling its children\n\nThe expand button sits inside the mailbox row, so the click bubbled up\nand also selected the parent mailbox, firing the content, threads,\nunseen and quota requests at once.\n\n* fix(webmail): set a timeout on IMAP connections\n\nIMAP sockets were opened without timeout: a server that never answers\n(for example while it waits for the OAuth2 introspection endpoint served\nby the same, saturated, uWSGI instance) blocked the worker forever.\n\nConnections now use a 30s timeout, configurable with the\nWEBMAIL_IMAP_TIMEOUT setting, and socket errors raised by a command are\nreported as ImapError so the request fails cleanly.\n\n* docs: document the introspection uWSGI instance and IMAP timeout\n\nExplain in the 2.10.2 upgrade notes why the OAuth2 introspection\nendpoint should be served by a dedicated uWSGI instance, how to set it\nup (installer upgrade or manual steps), and the new\nWEBMAIL_IMAP_TIMEOUT setting.\n\n* docs: serve OAuth2 introspection with a dedicated uWSGI instance\n\nUpdate the manual web server installation guide so new installations\nroute /api/o/introspect/ to a second uWSGI instance, and explain why.\nAdd the same advice for gunicorn.\n\n* test(webmail): cover IMAP timeout on secured connections and UID commands","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqs8OPCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAMvAQAGP3Ufdv1Y9b63b8AprwFQYW\n5ojTVGNPI2PN/gGFdQMJnm1EqOVGTUlW++MPH+ZiMt8Q+vpbUegYRSB5OoDUtfk8\n61F6MUzELPsEveotnLz8MJ3BnH9d9+atECmd5hr70a2irbDloaofN0QgnoIA59sj\nNB5hRuYiDbQZvAi1a3PKfWzkK05klEW0v8uKjFVp09sI4cVw6JuirMQCZ5zp8OoV\nddyz5AY/iE6gTmynGAO9N6bMNBXcL/MHjxS/lFy0n9fE9ov1LmskHaxQHdvupuL+\nCS3DPM8uZvylL/rFQdGf3F72nacfAiOp44W5MA3Ifp1INrgSQdevN+UsrfUAnTWd\n1EAg2OuvK8FSy1H2RCB1q7jYIH2jT5RzE9IXn3olfsS09ZLo2sBBJJKI8aLVb70p\nH9yaXPtQpNeXHBVIjPxmq3KIN3VqKtV1VXm06qhkT+ZyKNzubZ1xwN+qivyAZhYB\n19a5/mqTVlTeq9ZXRoDY4XlzWqPZT3dwr9Rq74viSqyPiif8g1IBJkyASMAWkk8E\nQ6N732mzQVgsd9JqQWQfVpwOUoyU2YhrWf9nD3fugGz7A1YVzDdpgaT3O4RsHHgN\nCoVCkKiJzfbR5sTZVUFQ2YBgWH5AM9U45nbw9Sl3GEdfOiFqhQTE2QsV5GwDfjjB\nL3ZHYtAZJrsgnUBlEZEH\n=T6h/\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-23T12:18:24Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/