https://api.github.com/users/tonioo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tonioo","id":531694,"login":"tonioo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMTY5NA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonioo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/modoboa/modoboa/commits/0b368d1217cd330c214d7f8a22493837d033a00a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T14:51:45Z","email":"tonio@ngyn.org","name":"Antoine Nguyen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T14:51:45Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(policyd): counters and logging (#4211)\n\n* fix(core): send syslog records to /dev/log\n\nSysLogHandler defaults to UDP on localhost:514, which most syslog\ndaemons don''t listen to, so records from the policy daemon and dns\nchecks were silently dropped.\n\n* fix(policyd): make sending limit accounting reliable\n\n- decrement counters at END-OF-MESSAGE stage (by recipient count) so\n  messages rejected during the SMTP transaction are not counted;\n  limits are still checked at RCPT stage. Check and decrement are done\n  atomically with a Lua script.\n- don''t apply a limit twice when an object is saved several times\n- move counters when a domain or a mailbox is renamed, remove them\n  when the object is deleted\n- close sending limit alarms at reset (wrong internal name was used)\n- always close client sockets and Redis clients, keep rescheduling\n  the counters reset if it fails\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: postfix must also query the policy daemon in\nsmtpd_end_of_data_restrictions, otherwise counters are never\ndecremented.\n\n* fix(lib): share Redis connection pool within a process\n\nget_redis_connection() created a new connection pool on every call.\n\n* docs: add upgrade instructions for policy daemon and syslog changes\n\nPostfix must now query the policy daemon in\nsmtpd_end_of_data_restrictions for sending limits to work.","tree":{"sha":"9ea230e59d9fd119254580bdb2a439938927c358","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/modoboa/modoboa/git/trees/9ea230e59d9fd119254580bdb2a439938927c358"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/modoboa/modoboa/git/commits/0b368d1217cd330c214d7f8a22493837d033a00a","verification":{"payload":"tree 9ea230e59d9fd119254580bdb2a439938927c358\nparent 01d8fe50275d744c2fb06d18edeb5b7378833f3e\nauthor Antoine Nguyen <tonio@ngyn.org> 1789743105 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789743105 +0200\n\nfix(policyd): counters and logging (#4211)\n\n* fix(core): send syslog records to /dev/log\n\nSysLogHandler defaults to UDP on localhost:514, which most syslog\ndaemons don''t listen to, so records from the policy daemon and dns\nchecks were silently dropped.\n\n* fix(policyd): make sending limit accounting reliable\n\n- decrement counters at END-OF-MESSAGE stage (by recipient count) so\n  messages rejected during the SMTP transaction are not counted;\n  limits are still checked at RCPT stage. Check and decrement are done\n  atomically with a Lua script.\n- don''t apply a limit twice when an object is saved several times\n- move counters when a domain or a mailbox is renamed, remove them\n  when the object is deleted\n- close sending limit alarms at reset (wrong internal name was used)\n- always close client sockets and Redis clients, keep rescheduling\n  the counters reset if it fails\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: postfix must also query the policy daemon in\nsmtpd_end_of_data_restrictions, otherwise counters are never\ndecremented.\n\n* fix(lib): share Redis connection pool within a process\n\nget_redis_connection() created a new connection pool on every call.\n\n* docs: add upgrade instructions for policy daemon and syslog changes\n\nPostfix must now query the policy daemon in\nsmtpd_end_of_data_restrictions for sending limits to work.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqrVABCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAPSUQAJ1JDvtoW0Vh6Dle08XW1yr9\nyecs8aKLLReF9qPXD4f5HR+TZnuJqx+FBS9qPGSjCI+zmr0ZvLvxyrZmuGV8QzgS\n6lBzWoTSIkTmbGm4RI9bIw9Ty7rCZW3ciN49MWJqq1uxLLQ1Rp5LZIRT/1XvLmSq\nODC1O7rpxax6U0TYIneujmTpWnRgCI7kVQKhrzVKd3E60SjTh1bZpERcTUhGT0TY\nGpYeZyQg0APkQsmjFgwMrLbTUq5wCRbhSmWobHUxLnJk2BzT23yv7dZg4unlZHtJ\n1sOFHEzhJ7f88zfdP0MKtA6dxPQkcXSOFSN+plquTDIxuub8G8eufu07Pbr6cYTn\ntnnclig9NjtPSu4Dk2JXTZBGDxCzcEKOC3P/CjdEcjZVkS6jB116dwmdN7qtlRES\n3k6TrvBH+2NHvLG7kgD2SWL/KPTthTEvTWlErVwEULRnpj6AItygGrFwjRCzwUJn\nD1dM8JPY/zcEcakSJt9og7FA7SdLOFlff5ZlH8N6m44dYS0+hyOqyf0yFz0UxHJa\n9LCEfIxvUXDoa4iIgxZU78GfjcXjsFB+ubM3s1+hNyWIE4Aan5jwc4r8D7Ql+JfR\nsYw9OkqzjO/o7AkISWhMX+g7lymWzjRBkn2+wcsPbTQapHGQGoKd+hnJmHr5qzki\nq7REk3/GA9MYlZNeWAmt\n=WKIB\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-18T14:51:46Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscrip