usercontent.com/u/96288645?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vishalkarmalkarthoughtworks/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vishalkarmalkarthoughtworks/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vishalkarmalkarthoughtworks/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vishalkarmalkarthoughtworks/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vishalkarmalkarthoughtworks","id":96288645,"login":"vishalkarmalkarthoughtworks","node_id":"U_kgDOBb0_hQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vishalkarmalkarthoughtworks/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vishalkarmalkarthoughtworks/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vishalkarmalkarthoughtworks/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vishalkarmalkarthoughtworks/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vishalkarmalkarthoughtworks/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vishalkarmalkarthoughtworks","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bahmni/openmrs-module-bahmniapps/commits/7c38c264fe520146d3c7c313f5f05af9a63b3965/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T05:33:52Z","email":"96288645+vishalkarmalkarthoughtworks@users.noreply.github.com","name":"vishalkarmalkarthoughtworks"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T05:33:52Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"BAH-5025 | Add TruffleHog secret scanning to CI (#1093)\n\n* BAH-5025 | Add TruffleHog secret scanning to CI\n\nAdds .github/workflows/trufflehog.yml. Runs TruffleHog OSS on pull\nrequests, pushes to the default branch, and weekly over full history.\n\nOnly credentials verified live against the provider''s API fail the job\n(--results=verified), so vendored test fixtures and .env placeholders are\nignored. Both actions are pinned to commit SHAs and the workflow requests\nonly contents: read.\n\n* BAH-5025 | Drop the weekly cron from the TruffleHog workflow\n\nGitHub disables a scheduled workflow in a public repo after 60 days with no\nrepository activity, and the disable applies to the whole workflow, not just\nthe cron trigger. Bahmni/bahmni-api-test-automation and\nBahmni/openmrs-module-bedmanagement had already lost Semgrep on every PR this\nway, and GitHub does not re-enable it when the repo becomes active again.\n\nScanning on pull_request and on push to the default branch is unchanged, and\nworkflow_dispatch stays for an on-demand full scan.","tree":{"sha":"1e2162fc682af04fa1c9e96b4e5af156f5a03fde","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bahmni/openmrs-module-bahmniapps/git/trees/1e2162fc682af04fa1c9e96b4e5af156f5a03fde"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bahmni/openmrs-module-bahmniapps/git/commits/7c38c264fe520146d3c7c313f5f05af9a63b3965","verification":{"payload":"tree 1e2162fc682af04fa1c9e96b4e5af156f5a03fde\nparent f9bc64c407f7b1bebd0d8aa2158f0e989ed5e310\nauthor vishalkarmalkarthoughtworks <96288645+vishalkarmalkarthoughtworks@users.noreply.github.com> 1791351232 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791351232 +0530\n\nBAH-5025 | Add TruffleHog secret scanning to CI (#1093)\n\n* BAH-5025 | Add TruffleHog secret scanning to CI\n\nAdds .github/workflows/trufflehog.yml. Runs TruffleHog OSS on pull\nrequests, pushes to the default branch, and weekly over full history.\n\nOnly credentials verified live against the provider''s API fail the job\n(--results=verified), so vendored test fixtures and .env placeholders are\nignored. Both actions are pinned to commit SHAs and the workflow requests\nonly contents: read.\n\n* BAH-5025 | Drop the weekly cron from the TruffleHog workflow\n\nGitHub disables a scheduled workflow in a public repo after 60 days with no\nrepository activity, and the disable applies to the whole workflow, not just\nthe cron trigger. Bahmni/bahmni-api-test-automation and\nBahmni/openmrs-module-bedmanagement had already lost Semgrep on every PR this\nway, and GitHub does not re-enable it when the repo becomes active again.\n\nScanning on pull_request and on push to the default branch is unchanged, and\nworkflow_dispatch stays for an on-demand full scan.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxdnACRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAK58QAJEx5nuH3gBu/D11yoCGIM92\n2Gig0CXG+SuPIeDl6ImfWzrHcVmQY8UARg26lSAagvOrIwAQvh9mxgl3m7WfcDBl\n4Tjqsr5pwjXXSTZhcO0gvDrZ/n7EtSa1vvHCNuPowJhnW33HBvmWOy4e7AQtQbBr\nQo1Ozx14I76vpXygzDdmQRRmaMw3OuA7JYAlTTLhzcY3j27j5wXKcM0MsNRtPm5h\nAUoPfs8KDZpbfxKMZSnpMg6UisPrzF9rwK7uoCUEAsvMWVtMmPQFMJoNXUEs47GM\nBFh/DQsiDJ5ibvP4en2kgvH0mjW209C6uMsDidYne+p1iwBHGhstCcP4ipMOMPve\n3UlFGGMWlJ8K7vlZw0zGiFX8PdDo6G/t8ZUvfPtbUYiuzW+H4v2z3eb/jQVuh2ng\nY/ilMfshaXHIOiZ+QATx7TMjX432iX7USdVkbC/h7i1k29lR/A2ORFmCb/980He0\nPCFyTZm8wP2kPU+B9/pwIbinA2eY6tQhThnoxZnx1nxi57pSB98mjUrc1qGzJEWw\nrMH8W13RMDVw820fhZk1yuF1S2E8m8+/uBkfrkkCXrR0LrjligDN9WyyvxS1WfdI\nNzfcnKl8xdB7ydRI/nz6m5xxPoAa+GDfeSV2KLJKUaGkTTE290BrBNCMIQVDeUfz\nCPkXZkoEbCq/GUX4JFMc\n=gej8\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-07T05:33:53Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users