"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32308441?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvkpd/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvkpd/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvkpd/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvkpd/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vvkpd","id":32308441,"login":"vvkpd","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMzA4NDQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvkpd/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvkpd/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvkpd/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvkpd/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvkpd/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvkpd","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bahmni/openmrs-module-bahmniapps/commits/d24a95701c849b6487fa0ea5776fcc6a03412fd0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T10:40:55Z","email":"32308441+vvkpd@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Vivek Pandey"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T10:40:55Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"BAH-4917 | Fix. Nutrivalues latest obs hidden after surgery order linkage (#1084)\n\n* HIVE-113267: Fix nutrivalues latest obs hidden after order linkage (#185)\n\n* HIVE-113267: Vivek: fix nutrivalues latest obs hidden after order linkage\n\nAfter HIVE-113267 linked orders to height/weight obs on save, the registration\nnutrivalues latest panel stopped showing them because filterObsWithOrders\ndefaulted to true (excluding order-linked obs). Made bahmniObservation\nconfigurable via config.filterObsWithOrders and set it to false for the\nregistration visit latest panel.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* HIVE-113267: Vivek: update bahmniObservation tests for filterObsWithOrders config\n\nUpdated two existing assertions from null to undefined (directive now reads\nfrom config instead of hardcoding null) and added a test verifying that\nfilterObsWithOrders: false is passed through from config to observationsService.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Bump bahmni-form-controls to 1.0.4\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9cac405e6121f9d0249df072626812b6e0949a4c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bahmni/openmrs-module-bahmniapps/git/trees/9cac405e6121f9d0249df072626812b6e0949a4c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bahmni/openmrs-module-bahmniapps/git/commits/d24a95701c849b6487fa0ea5776fcc6a03412fd0","verification":{"payload":"tree 9cac405e6121f9d0249df072626812b6e0949a4c\nparent b170810696f45dfdafb043d8df2c1adad7eb9427\nauthor Vivek Pandey <32308441+vvkpd@users.noreply.github.com> 1789728055 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789728055 +0530\n\nBAH-4917 | Fix. Nutrivalues latest obs hidden after surgery order linkage (#1084)\n\n* HIVE-113267: Fix nutrivalues latest obs hidden after order linkage (#185)\n\n* HIVE-113267: Vivek: fix nutrivalues latest obs hidden after order linkage\n\nAfter HIVE-113267 linked orders to height/weight obs on save, the registration\nnutrivalues latest panel stopped showing them because filterObsWithOrders\ndefaulted to true (excluding order-linked obs). Made bahmniObservation\nconfigurable via config.filterObsWithOrders and set it to false for the\nregistration visit latest panel.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* HIVE-113267: Vivek: update bahmniObservation tests for filterObsWithOrders config\n\nUpdated two existing assertions from null to undefined (directive now reads\nfrom config instead of hardcoding null) and added a test verifying that\nfilterObsWithOrders: false is passed through from config to observationsService.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Bump bahmni-form-controls to 1.0.4\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqrRU3CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAKKEQADN9Dhvy921o4s3IhL1Mf3dN\nzMyMyci4Sp1tPjk9esucSORlW3ThybTWlzTdmNcvpMRul7uUNzqTjlH1c0O9iesi\nyEPVmSZ3NVD+Nnu4O0PM/CPzFjZHRobKZ3aV1h+YsquSrrZH/KZN9A/IHEVSMsCS\nifHHos8bkDcyELM7MIKM1o/D8UFB8b+U6yWuP92XjxjNjntPCm1H0FsGtX4XkCES\n6SscpDLMoKH3Gvkm343gtMWjjw/8eKWZmmoNNCPuWOULgS0eFUTxbcCxPC+tg7QO\n+0hBSvhiycfIeCpcTZTAqcwirtmj9wBynAWn8isYRSJ5m+fz5N6hMx/vMnpcWlEd\nwl/pdMNMZSrys1SCBDlYWVFRC0EI362VTjcTzTVTvAKH8GVNWhW3IPLa/1iyHjNl\nBOq9Md5nInvo/f2p4M/ECsuA9Hg12z0DnKVdW+5Ay9jNOM4a/KuIlYCDO8o3xfTM\nzrafBOcqVWy0jyquQyTVQd/Bub3hRTFbCqlh5rzcVVurgJW/rh1GWkxee6/vfGti\nc6+RjP4wv4zaxgyXvxNXeGrhs+Ra7lbjuypU8C9m8X+YGzVbnnQWTyDUAQ/+RWlt\nHyu57s0V+CkbWnX8F9NLkPqR/hJ9vjZvQsieCMansO4r1zVGp2qQ3R3KjpGi92qm\n9vqO7/rS94SHECnuPQRZ\n=owvY\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-18T10:40:56Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.gi