n and remove reactions from no known allergy\n\n* Vivek: HIVE-99175: Update allergy saved success message\n\n* Vivek: HIVE-99175: Update save success message\n\n* Vivek: HIVE-99175: Make no known allergy row as black coloured and strike-through\n\n* Vivek: HIVE-99175: Remove no known allergy item from search list\n\n* Vivek: HIVE-99175: Add tests for add allergy\n\n* Vivek: HIVE-99175: Filter No Known Allergy item from dropdown\n\n* Vivek: HIVE-99175: css design change when allergies contains no known allergy\n\n* Vivek: HIVE-99175: Remove selected allergen keyword\n\n* Vivek: HIVE-99175: css change once No option is selected\n\n* Vivek: HIVE-99175: Added padding on no known allergy selected\n\n* Vivek: HIVE-99175: Add constant for no known allergy\n\n* Vivek: HIVE-100461: Update allergy success message (#46)\n\n* Vivek: HIVE-99175: Update allergy success message\n\n* Vivek: HIVE-99175: Exclude no known allergy from discharge summary\n\n* Vivek: HIVE-99175: Exclude no known allergy from prescription summary\n\n* Vivek: HIVE-99175: Move no known allergy in constant\n\n* Vivek: HIVE-99175: Move no known allergy in constant for micro-frontends\n\n* Vivek: HIVE-101148: Support localisation for no known allergy (#52)\n\n* Vivek: HIVE-101148: Add no known allergy code constant and remove display text\n\n* Vivek: HIVE-101148: Add no known allergy code constant and remove no known allergy element using code on visit and drug order history print\n\n* Vivek: HIVE-101148: Added translations for KNOWN_ALLERGY_QUESTION, YES and NO\n\n* Vivek: HIVE-101148: Update french transalation\n\n* Vivek: HIVE-101148: Fetch no known allergy code global property and utilise in visit and drug order history\n\n* Vivek: HIVE-101148: Refactor allergy components to fetch and utilize noKnownAllergyCode dynamically via API as global property\n\n* Vivek: HIVE-101148: Rename to noKnownAllergyUuid from noKnownAllergyCode\n\n* Vivek: HIVE-101148: Replace arrow functions with function expressions\n\n* Vivek: HIVE-101148: Fix race condition causing blank allergies on print (#66)\n\n* Vivek: HIVE-101148: Fix race condition causing blank allergies on print\n\n* Vivek: HIVE-101148: Added visitController tests\n\n* Bindu | Fix failing test cases\n\n* Vivek: HIVE-108160: Fix: Allergy display control not rendering in Medication tab (#86)\n\nUse translationKey-based detection for allergy display control instead of type,\n  since CURE config defines allergy section with type allergies but relies on\n  translationKey Allergies for routing to the React micro-frontend component.\n\n* Banti | fix allergy section display issue (#111)\n\n* fix allergy section display issue\n\n* compare no known allergy concept by concept uuid instead of text\n\n* fix test case\n\n* Fix failing tests introduced by cherry-picks\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* BAH-4430: Vivek: Fix allergies display control to render based on type instead of translationKey (#149)\n\n* BAH-4430: Fix SonarQube code smells (#152)\n\n* BAH-4430: Vivek: Fix SonarQube code smells - remove duplicate imports, replace var with const/let\n\n* BAH-4430: Eliminate duplicate allergy fetch logic by reusing allergyService.fetchAndProcessAllergies\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* BAH-4430: Vivek: Fix allergy PR review issues: null safety, FHIR spread, i18n keys, and race condition\n\n- Guard getErrorKey against undefined to prevent TypeError on save failure\n- Pass saveError through onSave to surface API errors in the container\n- Fix isSaveSuccess useEffect firing onSave(null) on mount\n- Null-coalesce allergen spreads to handle missing otherAllergenUuid config\n- Replace JSX element with plain string for RadioButtonGroup name prop\n- Fix stale AKNOWLEDGE_BUTTON / AKNOWLEDGEMENT_REQUIRED_TEXT locale keys\n- Replace non-existent NO_KNOWN_ALLERGY_CODE import with string literal in spec\n- Move SEVERITY_RANK, DEFAULT_SEVERITY_RANK, compareByRankThenDate to module scope\n- Fix setnoKnownAllergyUuid setter casing and guard \"No\" path until UUID loads\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* BAH-4430: Vivek: Align FHIR allergen path to resource.code.coding to match AngularJS layer and FHIR R4 spec\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Pooja Sastry <pooja.sastry@thoughtworks.com>\nCo-authored-by: binduak <tbindu@thoughtworks.com>\nCo-authored-by: bantirathod87 <banti.rathod@thoughtworks.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"422d730b3e195debcecf0f48e772aa62ed72e1b2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bahmni/openmrs-module-bahmniapps/git/trees/422d730b3e195debcecf0f48e772aa62ed72e1b2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bahmni/openmrs-module-bahmniapps/git/commits/5d3788bf0c0064e8f6135577effeeae6c6757bad","verification":{"payload":"tree 422d730b3e195debcecf0f48e772aa62ed72e1b2\nparent c88e61c0adba3018d70a0635c8e875590cc2e89a\nauthor Vivek Pandey <32308441+vvkpd@users.noreply.github.com> 1782664204 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782664204 +0530\n\nBAH-4430: Recording of No Known Allergy in Patient Dashboard (#1049)\n\n* Pooja | Fix for failing test | Update files as per Cure repo openmrs-module-bahmniapps Bahmni-IPD-Master branch\n\n* Hive-97801: Recording of \"No known allergy\" in Patient Dashboard (#43)\n\n* Vivek: HIVE-99175: Add radio button to ask allergy question to patient\n\n* Vivek: HIVE-99175: Save no known allergy record on button click\n\n* Vivek: HIVE-99175: Display allergy when severity is null\n\n* Vivek: HIVE-99175: Default select yes radio button and remove reactions from no known allergy\n\n* Vivek: HIVE-99175: Update allergy saved success message\n\n* Vivek: HIVE-99175: Update save success message\n\n* Vivek: HIVE-99175: Make no 