Controller tests\n\n* Bindu | Fix failing test cases\n\n* Vivek: HIVE-108160: Fix: Allergy display control not rendering in Medication tab (#86)\n\nUse translationKey-based detection for allergy display control instead of type,\n  since CURE config defines allergy section with type allergies but relies on\n  translationKey Allergies for routing to the React micro-frontend component.\n\n* Banti | fix allergy section display issue (#111)\n\n* fix allergy section display issue\n\n* compare no known allergy concept by concept uuid instead of text\n\n* fix test case\n\n* Fix failing tests introduced by cherry-picks\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* BAH-4430: Vivek: Fix allergies display control to render based on type instead of translationKey (#149)\n\n* BAH-4430: Fix SonarQube code smells (#152)\n\n* BAH-4430: Vivek: Fix SonarQube code smells - remove duplicate imports, replace var with const/let\n\n* BAH-4430: Eliminate duplicate allergy fetch logic by reusing allergyService.fetchAndProcessAllergies\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* BAH-4430: Vivek: Fix allergy PR review issues: null safety, FHIR spread, i18n keys, and race condition\n\n- Guard getErrorKey against undefined to prevent TypeError on save failure\n- Pass saveError through onSave to surface API errors in the container\n- Fix isSaveSuccess useEffect firing onSave(null) on mount\n- Null-coalesce allergen spreads to handle missing otherAllergenUuid config\n- Replace JSX element with plain string for RadioButtonGroup name prop\n- Fix stale AKNOWLEDGE_BUTTON / AKNOWLEDGEMENT_REQUIRED_TEXT locale keys\n- Replace non-existent NO_KNOWN_ALLERGY_CODE import with string literal in spec\n- Move SEVERITY_RANK, DEFAULT_SEVERITY_RANK, compareByRankThenDate to module scope\n- Fix setnoKnownAllergyUuid setter casing and guard \"No\" path until UUID