tab in CCX if gradebook is enabled (#39164)\n\nHave the CCX Coach v2 metadata endpoint include the student_grades tab\nonly when the writable gradebook is available for the CCX — both the\ngrades.writable_gradebook waffle flag (evaluated against the CCX key) and\nthe WRITABLE_GRADEBOOK_URL setting (read through site configuration).","tree":{"sha":"ded1ee91279b3e852e63a6390f633c3f15ce7107","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/openedx-platform/git/trees/ded1ee91279b3e852e63a6390f633c3f15ce7107"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/openedx-platform/git/commits/e77f73f32b60aaceec2a03184602274a05f7f012","verification":{"payload":"tree ded1ee91279b3e852e63a6390f633c3f15ce7107\nparent e49247b226d063466f62bbd01fdddfe708c18ded\nauthor brianjbuck-wgu <brian.buck@wgu.edu> 1791395329 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791395329 -0600\n\nfeat: Only return the grades tab in CCX if gradebook is enabled (#39164)\n\nHave the CCX Coach v2 metadata endpoint include the student_grades tab\nonly when the writable gradebook is available for the CCX — both the\ngrades.writable_gradebook waffle flag (evaluated against the CCX key) and\nthe WRITABLE_GRADEBOOK_URL setting (read through site configuration).","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxoYBCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAPBgQAFiKVpIMJ9c6NHxhGzBBOkB7\nHxVlYrOLj4ybXeP/1WPKo6YoJytczs4GlC4dJh/l3NOEWEnlueBBK3CObezKL2UG\n8bEtawkmO8H4PA2aLRwh6JNL0+i8ljWgHykEsr5pglQxkYG8tM6rIOgtFRNEKYpI\noFov1WvW+YhephtF/CEoSDmWfdK1/lQ0q9EqiF/FOht45KswKMIGy3WmIVTV5quF\nVO/NtqztOmd+tKSor++AKtsBLFOgPeWZ4QHBrGNW9DG3PtTYA3waizBbDoHmDFpK\nNw7IBjCHGOpzTbUvxrhjIIs0ZVt8dDn4xT+yCPi0XnBVVquTkLsRhjztNBSkzEA6\n9OOpgxEw6l/ZXLSksgG1vQJi1FbS/KqzsPOeUQ1aovzXFaPBRlXODUt8hbIsm9z4\nEmju+m06QVjSEXdNsjAO0lHwKNmoKFMaZuNtiZGy4FNIGMbogPgbhqp58DDGC0fe\nTwZoqMczJ2ovY0senIn8I1CVpue4hBQxCJFXVEDxlnWYPhYCk14blAeOtuiLY6EN\n+ZAZvX4jzmJg8ZlttfRj+wTegAej8zLWWiT2rlXTg9+5DFOOtypSa/FoxImmiNh0\n2QEBMcC5m3JAAP0ZmznuvyI63phHApORzOZkXnM9WxoWpXhLcy