me (#39192)\n\nCourseEnrollmentsApiListSerializer''s Meta subclasses its parent''s, so it\ninherited ref_name = \"CourseEnrollment\". Both serializers were published\nunder one schema component, and in the full /api-docs schema the subset\nserializer won: the enrollment create and retrieve endpoints were documented\nwith course_id instead of course_details, and clients generated from the\nschema were typed accordingly.","tree":{"sha":"b7d7815e6d81ff1bb8d3add404fc9f572618e1fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/openedx-platform/git/trees/b7d7815e6d81ff1bb8d3add404fc9f572618e1fc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/openedx-platform/git/commits/59a94d1159e51fe09530a28e680a839d8e3b289b","verification":{"payload":"tree b7d7815e6d81ff1bb8d3add404fc9f572618e1fc\nparent 2d85618811ce3f2bea3884590ba8c0ebf51929a5\nauthor Muhammad Faraz Maqsood <faraz.maqsood@arbisoft.com> 1791383065 +0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791383065 +0500\n\nfix: give CourseEnrollmentsApiListSerializer its own schema ref_name (#39192)\n\nCourseEnrollmentsApiListSerializer''s Meta subclasses its parent''s, so it\ninherited ref_name = \"CourseEnrollment\". Both serializers were published\nunder one schema component, and in the full /api-docs schema the subset\nserializer won: the enrollment create and retrieve endpoints were documented\nwith course_id instead of course_details, and clients generated from the\nschema were typed accordingly.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxlYZCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAjGoQAFq72xBhGaQtMFlCw56cPPqM\nO1oK3TBixkYywjNKiLR8NK6+LH8dZnYFAj4AmGMUYtsmdTW9v5dXVfIBk9OQFP6B\nLEgc4HSne8IiVwuswG4oIa1wdRkwOOTio17uRF8FE6a17y9SC6++apKNhJnY2xG5\nOf1BZ07MJfR1C0LRPqJhXqxyrGcluhiK5OheZlfnxsMsxu095Y4qvkvOOhYnTIdk\nZw1dXzPFmihBoiF393qL2uCnFSJd0Ey+a8GzUD+NuCv8TemWYpu8EIcwZ/1CPVRf\nTzDplHWGEDyCWb+OXd6njasm3nsy884oTH7PtaxlVlbBjZGV011ZC4WzWgb7CVY2\nxTXoa1COrLCLja61pAKgtftpeBR4FVhdMedMC1k3qG5aUA6T5+7NCOhxqbf5Ygxf\nRJJXeUYqJYvlhNJ1E