52656433?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asadali145/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asadali145/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asadali145/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asadali145/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/asadali145","id":52656433,"login":"asadali145","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNjU2NDMz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asadali145/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asadali145/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asadali145/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asadali145/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asadali145/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/asadali145","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/openedx-platform/commits/2d85618811ce3f2bea3884590ba8c0ebf51929a5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T13:33:00Z","email":"asad.ali@arbisoft.com","name":"Asad Ali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T13:33:00Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: truncate discussion topic titles to the column length (#39175)\n\nDiscussion topic titles come from course content: a unit''s display name,\nor \"section|subsection|unit\" when a unit is no longer discussable. Either\ncan exceed DiscussionTopicLink.title''s 255-character limit. On strict\nMySQL that raises a DataError, and because the sync runs in a single\ntransaction (and the error is swallowed by send_robust), one oversized\ntitle silently blocks the entire course''s topic sync: new units get no\ntopics and removed units are never disabled.\n\nTruncate the title wherever the sync sets it.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b39a8c7a3d42b480ebb9759ddf4ada4baa097e69","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/openedx-platform/git/trees/b39a8c7a3d42b480ebb9759ddf4ada4baa097e69"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/openedx-platform/git/commits/2d85618811ce3f2bea3884590ba8c0ebf51929a5","verification":{"payload":"tree b39a8c7a3d42b480ebb9759ddf4ada4baa097e69\nparent 532c1af404da1e6aba4c1748cfc34c77a9645a5d\nauthor Asad Ali <asad.ali@arbisoft.com> 1791379980 +0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791379980 +0500\n\nfix: truncate discussion topic titles to the column length (#39175)\n\nDiscussion topic titles come from course content: a unit''s display name,\nor \"section|subsection|unit\" when a unit is no longer discussable. Either\ncan exceed DiscussionTopicLink.title''s 255-character limit. On strict\nMySQL that raises a DataError, and because the sync runs in a single\ntransaction (and the error is swallowed by send_robust), one oversized\ntitle silently blocks the entire course''s topic sync: new units get no\ntopics and removed units are never disabled.\n\nTruncate the title wherever the sync sets it.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxkoMCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA8R4QADboZHLNeBnLXNFhtNBffF5V\nGXF5Ab1zdF6SVFxpwqwP7BA0yyImjC9iy5GerTtLt9mvNla61yKozIC6RIoLQFS2\nfjTH2ppp7u0GpKJNiyts6W+iIAntPelfksD2ZFLqOZUgxt1FNq2wRoqlGwPRV1bN\n2GGF+XXNObPai0/cDvGfjbGI7omWftd/cMisMB4jHqLSK8rcLd82skga9Ml711+b\n0tSuX/3CjzxUqQU0xp+ZdyJwOuQjJmXhBB5JMw/JRnKk3rWhIME6kF272jMvxcUT\ngUKMwHMaUeSUgKP/vqPv9V0yWJJSr2dvUSSx7pjw26qIrM3j29XQcMWBK2y25b+2\neCYkkFpm8yw4Zepb+RlPWnoajcFtwzEHSsgIUViMIuyJ0AAkS+BQNnCPh6YSNKe4\n5JRc8yNJ1HqZmKxVhrCzUmb9C5mWT0xBmeUaPJDFRYXPrAgZWTimUze0ZZrV0704\ntFl2Ke2V3quzS2X67RYPaGnbWdAxk2kCP1xlMlCYdSEY0nDstfuFP4UAR9dR0KS3\nj3kYA1glgehJst4wM7Np8+SW5ORnyqZIq+psEMm9cDZXRgtrv4cqnS4WChbb+qfY\nyCHpSYxaafCkR9adcpiQObv0XdqVc5LHkh9ixUHGAVT8uadeLq5NHMq5mY6cLMU4\nfO7wHB/c2HqHYjbrVhr+\n=wWHQ\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"veri