","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vgulati-apphelix","id":212041181,"login":"vgulati-apphelix","node_id":"U_kgDODKN93Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vgulati-apphelix/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vgulati-apphelix/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vgulati-apphelix/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vgulati-apphelix/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vgulati-apphelix/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vgulati-apphelix","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/openedx-platform/commits/532c1af404da1e6aba4c1748cfc34c77a9645a5d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T13:35:16Z","email":"vgulati-apphelix@2U.com","name":"Vaibhav Gulati"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T13:35:16Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: log user ID instead of PII when SQUELCH_PII_IN_LOGS is enabled (#39156)\n\nSeveral log statements uses usernames, emails, or full\nnames without checking SQUELCH_PII_IN_LOGS, so PII reached the logs\neven though LMS enables the setting. These now log the\nnumeric user ID when the setting is on. When it is off, the log output\nis unchanged.\n\nAdds helpers to log_utils so the check lives in one place. \nLogging user.id directly is always considered safe; the helpers are only\nneeded where the username or email is preferred in deployments that allow\nPII in logs.","tree":{"sha":"8e74793dcec6157e46abb680c10c88b495500f6d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/openedx-platform/git/trees/8e74793dcec6157e46abb680c10c88b495500f6d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/openedx-platform/git/commits/532c1af404da1e6aba4c1748cfc34c77a9645a5d","verification":{"payload":"tree 8e74793dcec6157e46abb680c10c88b495500f6d\nparent caabf1ee7c4b63e3b22a959e3bcdb1aec8e199bf\nauthor Vaibhav Gulati <vgulati-apphelix@2U.com> 1791293716 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791293716 +0000\n\nfix: log user ID instead of PII when SQUELCH_PII_IN_LOGS is enabled (#39156)\n\nSeveral log statements uses usernames, emails, or full\nnames without checking SQUELCH_PII_IN_LOGS, so PII reached the logs\neven though LMS enables the setting. These now log the\nnumeric user ID when the setting is on. When it is off, the log output\nis unchanged.\n\nAdds helpers to log_utils so the check lives in one place. \nLogging user.id directly is always considered safe; the helpers are only\nneeded where the username or email is preferred in deployments that allow\nPII in logs.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxPkUCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA9wcQAB9vpaaTVAjPpxSoBIrrr5wq\nDSrdOqAACHS3lgp8qm6pX6jpN8UB59bspWhKaV7amN99z/sXeDr0eMvylWLhQm7g\n0mewmSW95k3B0h7b0hssTIkpWL7RYiITYkpAonTXI/cDSLmclmVOUNRg+WMUNXm1\nPFuiZuS1O3ixhzl5eWFTyOQAeg4BrV9Fss7+NHdf8YH5h5BPYInio4WxRK/jgHuX\nWl3XzC8qZU5MLYl0ldSnwi4OlBMrwMVxl8BPhu2SSeeqhhlFRDNDh8M23Ayc8bdZ\n7MuVZchZv2AoG8SC1Grf/Hu7HzXbXr78QklQ8akP1gp01ouBeZK0qBJ2FtK0XOmv\napdlbr9r/X6ywaDeOGWnlsMQgWl6AjQpvcBWwnsezEUqpufI0hcqxM2OgIDQrnti\nlBRxnJGYWWd8bQPcFuNLz1sbXOMlXrE3yW3vLYL1Mi18ffO8yjf3x6tqU/xR5ioj\ncpNyJFp0o/8lUMc+kuMYdLD2G21GnMEjd1zgIsuO95o3T8b6AlIIArhKLtLdq+EO\nY7rSl5+fknH74KmV3lOV4s63cJDCx9XDt8zC4QJWaj/KCGS7DnyxbmckOX9GJdel\ntB9hrnXjVCSDb3irW19AGZBAMuZMMwlwINcELD4xHzcMqQGqa8bsS+BE5pr5ErFk\niyuChTZN5CDu8UoXoymc\n=1flT\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-06T13:35:17Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-fl