//api.github.com/repos/openedx/openedx-platform/commits/6056c143d258f66011ecc691dbf2e7861c8f9d87"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/849463?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rpenido/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rpenido/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rpenido/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rpenido/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rpenido","id":849463,"login":"rpenido","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg0OTQ2Mw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rpenido/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rpenido/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rpenido/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rpenido/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rpenido/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rpenido","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/openedx-platform/commits/7944dc908dffff5ff21754859fc0ca554005b313/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T22:45:03Z","email":"romulo.penido@gmail.com","name":"Rômulo Penido"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T22:45:03Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(content_staging): fall back to block type when XBlock plugin is missing (#39152)\n\nThe clipboard holds a *copy* of a block, so its XBlock plugin may no\nlonger be installed (e.g. a custom XBlock was removed from the\nplatform).  StagedContentSerializer.get_block_type_display() called\nxblock_type_display_name(), which raises PluginMissingError in that\ncase, so reading the clipboard raised, and because the clipboard is\nembedded in the course index response (initial_user_clipboard), the\nwhole course index request 500s -- for every course, for any user who\nhappens to have such a clipboard.  The same applies to the\n/api/content-staging/v1/clipboard/ endpoint, and there is no API to\ndiscard the stale clipboard, so authors get stuck.\n\nFall back to the raw block type, mirroring\nopenedx.core.djangoapps.xblock.api.xblock_type_display_name, which\nalready handles a missing plugin this way.","tree":{"sha":"87acdb042bfbcda8b18a4415602ac3a8ac85eb9e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/openedx-platform/git/trees/87acdb042bfbcda8b18a4415602ac3a8ac85eb9e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/openedx-platform/git/commits/7944dc908dffff5ff21754859fc0ca554005b313","verification":{"payload":"tree 87acdb042bfbcda8b18a4415602ac3a8ac85eb9e\nparent 7884e3be0f9669a113bd367cc96284541e22c5f5\nauthor Rômulo Penido <romulo.penido@gmail.com> 1790981103 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790981103 -0700\n\nfix(content_staging): fall back to block type when XBlock plugin is missing (#39152)\n\nThe clipboard holds a *copy* of a block, so its XBlock plugin may no\nlonger be installed (e.g. a custom XBlock was removed from the\nplatform).  StagedContentSerializer.get_block_type_display() called\nxblock_type_display_name(), which raises PluginMissingError in that\ncase, so reading the clipboard raised, and because the clipboard is\nembedded in the course index response (initial_user_clipboard), the\nwhole course index request 500s -- for every course, for any user who\nhappens to have such a clipboard.  The same applies to the\n/api/content-staging/v1/clipboard/ endpoint, and there is no API to\ndiscard the stale clipboard, so authors get stuck.\n\nFall back to the raw block type, mirroring\nopenedx.core.djangoapps.xblock.api.xblock_type_display_name, which\nalready handles a missing plugin this way.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqwDPvCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAARE4QAHA33giwL+12XrgtHZJiLzyN\nEyT7timPGhfKY6CyBITyqSRVsCAwJl991f+5FJzrBjOJ9Hq8abiKjH190eV7j5oL\ns+IzwLD4KgU3bC5kUCOrmCXnaTvfO9tjQDCnUg/re7er2joN4NaHrnwTPTDlb0Rm\nNtcqY4peQ