ter":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/49161187?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/edx-requirements-bot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/edx-requirements-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/edx-requirements-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/edx-requirements-bot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/edx-requirements-bot","id":49161187,"login":"edx-requirements-bot","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5MTYxMTg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/edx-requirements-bot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/edx-requirements-bot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/edx-requirements-bot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/edx-requirements-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/edx-requirements-bot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/edx-requirements-bot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/openedx/openedx-platform/commit/e56f31f2b8bfa9e2f8629ae757218ef56c11e00a","node_id":"C_kwDOAJ6OIdoAKGU1NmYzMWYyYjhiZmE5ZTJmODYyOWFlNzU3MjE4ZWY1NmMxMWUwMGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/openedx/openedx-platform/commit/037eb6a6e472fdbb753da77b09ab0cc4f3122762","sha":"037eb6a6e472fdbb753da77b09ab0cc4f3122762","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/openedx-platform/commits/037eb6a6e472fdbb753da77b09ab0cc4f3122762"}],"sha":"e56f31f2b8bfa9e2f8629ae757218ef56c11e00a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/openedx-platform/commits/e56f31f2b8bfa9e2f8629ae757218ef56c11e00a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4388505?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/holaontiveros/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/holaontiveros/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/holaontiveros/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/holaontiveros/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/holaontiveros","id":4388505,"login":"holaontiveros","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzODg1MDU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/holaontiveros/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/holaontiveros/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/holaontiveros/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/holaontiveros/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/holaontiveros/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/holaontiveros","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/openedx-platform/commits/037eb6a6e472fdbb753da77b09ab0cc4f3122762/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T23:13:28Z","email":"javier.ontiveros@wgu.edu","name":"Javier Ontiveros"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T23:13:28Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"perf: wrap reindex_course loop in modulestore().bulk_operations (#39134)\n\nThe reindex_course management command indexes each course by calling\nCoursewareSearchIndexer.do_course_reindex(store, course_key) in a bare loop.\nWithout a bulk_operations context the split modulestore does not cache the\ncourse structure across the block-tree walk the indexer performs, so the\n(potentially multi-megabyte) structure is re-read from MongoDB on every block\naccess. On large courses this dominates the reindex time.\n\nThe Studio reindex HTTP handler already wraps the same call in\nmodulestore().bulk_operations(course_key)\n(cms/djangoapps/contentstore/views/course.py course_search_index_handler);\nthis change applies the same wrapper to the management command so that\n`reindex_course --all` / `--active` benefit from the single-fetch/cached\nstructure path too.\n\nMeasured on a WGU (Ulmo) deployment: a large course dropped from ~90s to ~5s\nper course (~18x) when wrapped, matching the Studio \"Reindex\" button''s time.\n\nRefs: https://github.com/openedx/edx-platform/issues/36868\n\nAdds a regression test asserting each course reindex runs inside\nstore.bulk_operations(course_key).","tree":{"sha":"4f7b411d98deef5e9433c46d850a542f68b03c8f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/openedx-platform/git/trees/4f7b411d98deef5e9433c46d850a542f68b03c8f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/openedx-platform/git/commits/037eb6a6e472fdbb753da77b09ab0cc4f3122762","verification":{"payload":"tree 4f7b411d98deef5e9433c46d850a542f68b03c8f\nparent 2b65a2179eab47a1c0631b8b725ace4db1c0ecb6\nauthor Javier Ontiveros <javier.ontiveros@wgu.edu> 1790637208 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790637208 -0700\n\nperf: wrap reindex_course loop in modulestore().bulk_operations (#39134)\n\nThe reindex_course management command indexes each course by calling\nCoursewareSearchIndexer.do_course_reindex(store, course_key) in a bare loop.\nWithout a bulk_operations context the split modulestore does not cache the\ncourse structure across the block-tree walk the indexer performs, so the\n(potentially multi-megabyte) structure is re-read from MongoDB on every block\naccess. On large courses this dominates the reindex time.\n\nThe Studio reindex HTTP handler already wraps the same call in\nmodulestore().bulk_operations(course_key)\n(cms/djangoapps/contentstore/views/course.py course_search_index_handler);\nthis change applies the same wrapper to the management command so that\n`reindex_course --all` / `--active` benefit from the single-fetch/cached\nstructure path too.\n\nMeasured on a WGU (Ulmo) deployment: a large course dropped from ~90s to ~5s\nper course (~18x) when wrapped, matching the Studio \"Reindex\" button''s time.\n\nRefs: https://github.com/openedx/edx-platform/issues/36868\n\nAdds a regression test asserting each course reindex runs inside\nstore.bulk_operations(course_key).","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJquvSYCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAfwYQAKc06tc9cwqNmOfyhcpw/Ncb\nMWFLHMwey18elNhX10az0pHyMbP4ZbjwEXH7UnGUZzs1DW3VwY/gigqxqVL8lujq\npz1J2kk4vhJyi6L9Slc7q5DH7yecMMuiOL7CIyYB57I3cJ36KNTMGEty0fuAjXxb\n8vlK/UUj1/LPzuYqzGu67PHRu+VWRv6fyRlVMBO1lyg5hpODBoVXIjWrBjhCRxkP\n2DS4IUOulKd/qFPmxPZOQ5sAefcv+K8o0tKHWuVhnGfoWDyxUzI1vsnnYDS+vsbU\nBLYfgRb8i5eT+ntsHaZ6HMfG+KPNMjzzwuDO6YTIWezBe6UXZXImN8N/6vRqbvrC\nfmqKvgD6RxWtJ9XdPy64cyUN5ANuOFmDLKi6/vlM5PJShYqce00eI6CsNVHEGGz1\nBYj6Biyi6VqAg5cVY/PidGuiXWFzNWTEFxzVsAF62T8wuuoVEFVFqGFFVr7jYgS6\nXh7tqqmHDKwc7NYzk7GQRoZT1VRbXPd965qoJZ57Qd6RN0kOyaRpE0z0uRoqVlLt\n0JsEHQV+T64xI85VPjpxDGiww7mg7KsY4fHBzLC7WTj5kJ6jbrxvbhjYeW60FwQr\nRDmCxx/eKXP45gueHZg5eo4WPPh10ZJLyztjxGc2FHxs4nq/mfOR/9sFnX0pNx6V\nJha0LnCt5KWdnr+EalMs\n=Dk5J\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-28T23:13:29Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/openedx/openedx-platform/commit/037eb6a6e472fdbb753da77b09ab0cc4f3122762","node_id":"C_kwDOAJ6OIdoAKDAzN2ViNmE2ZTQ3MmZkYmI3NTNkYTc3YjA5YWIwY2M0ZjMxMjI3NjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/openedx/openedx-platform/commit/2b65a2179eab47a1c0631b8b725ace4db1c0ecb6","sha":"2b65a2179eab47a1c0631b8b725ace4db1c0ecb6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/openedx-platform/commits/2b65a2179eab47a1c0631b8b725ace4db1c0ecb6"}],"sha":"037eb6a6e472fdbb753da77b09ab0cc4f3122762","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/openedx-platform/commits/037eb6a6e472fdbb753da77b09ab0cc4f3122762"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17108583?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ihor-romaniuk/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ihor-romaniuk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ihor-romaniuk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ihor-romaniuk/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ihor-romaniuk","id":17108583,"login":"ihor-romaniuk","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MTA4NTgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ihor-romaniuk/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ihor-romaniuk/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ihor-romaniuk/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ihor-romaniuk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ihor-romaniuk/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ihor-romaniuk","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/openedx-platform/commits/2b65a2179eab47a1c0631b8b725ace4db1c0ecb6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T23:06:16Z","email":"ihor.romaniuk@raccoongang.com","name":"Ihor Romaniuk"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T23:06:16Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: ensure advanced XBlock editors use full screen when available (#39034)\n\nExpanding the Studio component editor to fullscreen left the settings of every\nadvanced block either cut off or stranded. The action bar is absolutely pinned\nto the bottom of the modal, so with a long settings list it covered the last\nentries, which the list could scroll under but never past. Blocks that wrap\ntheir settings in a form - poll and survey among them - stopped the growing\ncolumn at that wrapper, leaving the editor at its natural height with the\nbuttons alone at the foot of the page.\n\nIn fullscreen the action bar now takes part in the column instead of being\npositioned over it, the settings list may shrink so it scrolls inside the space\nthat is left, and a form wrapper grows with the column. The sized modal keeps\nthe layout it had.","tree":{"sha":"1ee9737f58ba285ae34089254a7afd8875fc8366","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/openedx-platform/git/trees/1ee9737f58ba285ae34089254a7afd8875fc8366"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/openedx-platform/git/commits/2b65a2179eab47a1c0631b8b725ace4db1c0ecb6","verification":{"payload":"tree 1ee9737f58ba285ae34089254a7afd8875fc8366\nparent a98b579a5102a219f22dbbd6aad970895d7e88fd\nauthor Ihor Romaniuk <ihor.romaniuk@raccoongang.com> 1790636776 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790636776 -0700\n\nfix: ensure advanced XBlock editors use full screen when available (#39034)\n\nExpanding the Studio component editor to fullscreen left the settings of every\nadvanced block either cut off or stranded. The action bar is absolutely pinned\nto the bottom of the modal, so with a long settings list it covered the last\nentries, which the list could scroll under but never past. Blocks that wrap\ntheir settings in a form - poll and survey among them - stopped the growing\ncolumn at that wrapper, leaving the editor at its natural height with the\nbuttons alone at the foot of the page.\n\nIn fullscreen the action bar now takes part in the column instead of being\npositioned over it, the settings list may shrink so it scrolls inside the space\nthat is left, and a form wrapper grows with the column. The sized modal keeps\nthe layout it had.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJquvLoCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAYi8QAIo+CE3EJEFHS5FwfxuROmeY\nZLd0kFoHKvTkjh2MQk2YP/amVJQNQpAzRyWuewKoAQIRViQbnNi87UUXH0AJdXsI\nRFvK1oyLaz5/BUitqnsiIlvlhLpmkL6UVXL/PgS+opnlFS8hi+j5I9PDDPjRx2/p\n9TrZpRz7bbSvcGG4FUFv56OkCPnMVblR1H1/hCcsnzQD6BibRTOVuH8scRUoWMMb\neBbrZzpY+sPM1pEP06J/wKMMxEaB0thNNUAZjUBb1oqBUXPIbXOmfE4R/iB/Vev8\nC1fAn0cURtWN4XNlwBW3OcCBc7d4gHZxyEwgsT1w9y1UBotPJKjrSBVFMC+RL5IQ\ntaWR2xiHC8wsxeyAuqr07UWkOtqfoPDb9KaqvatBTxBTOnqkVbUfV0H71ZB3mHl3\nKuGIKGeeP7nuCrrUBsUIqXaByuNTaXn5paruZa4iKVW2c3DulilbM8oUJTYv0WHD\nD5o+10gpctP6y4LlhcBeCpibQFIzo2i61m3HBeraKJMDpSaBh8j5Uqusr8epOq34\n3y9n6jWd5QBo5ldl+XK9PKbUa28HLYnAcZ8TN2vesIWvudtUZkJsbNarjodqKs7d\nNMT32AU21zN/EXzImGdHILuJCkejRb5k7ZJ4f9KaJfPxvQ0Rgd9m/LAEHbT6Lq39\nVe2oi3M1g0CFP0y/BR5/\n=ClVL\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-28T23:06:16Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/openedx/openedx-platform/commit/2b65a2179eab47a1c0631b8b725ace