l":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/feanil","id":781561,"login":"feanil","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4MTU2MQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/openedx/openedx-platform/commit/58a7fdce7d29a50d316bc322604eaa0a7611a49a","node_id":"C_kwDOAJ6OIdoAKDU4YTdmZGNlN2QyOWE1MGQzMTZiYzMyMjYwNGVhYTBhNzYxMWE0OWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/openedx/openedx-platform/commit/9ae7994d66c19c75b9332e3037ade430e6555e31","sha":"9ae7994d66c19c75b9332e3037ade430e6555e31","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/openedx-platform/commits/9ae7994d66c19c75b9332e3037ade430e6555e31"}],"sha":"58a7fdce7d29a50d316bc322604eaa0a7611a49a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/openedx-platform/commits/58a7fdce7d29a50d316bc322604eaa0a7611a49a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/139064778?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abdul-Muqadim-Arbisoft/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abdul-Muqadim-Arbisoft/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abdul-Muqadim-Arbisoft/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abdul-Muqadim-Arbisoft/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Abdul-Muqadim-Arbisoft","id":139064778,"login":"Abdul-Muqadim-Arbisoft","node_id":"U_kgDOCEn1yg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abdul-Muqadim-Arbisoft/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abdul-Muqadim-Arbisoft/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abdul-Muqadim-Arbisoft/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abdul-Muqadim-Arbisoft/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abdul-Muqadim-Arbisoft/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abdul-Muqadim-Arbisoft","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/openedx-platform/commits/9ae7994d66c19c75b9332e3037ade430e6555e31/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T16:40:20Z","email":"139064778+Abdul-Muqadim-Arbisoft@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Abdul-Muqadim-Arbisoft"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T16:40:20Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: apply queryset scoping to the Enrollments v2 admin list (#39037)\n\nWire EnrollmentsAdminListView through ScopedQuerysetMixin from\nedx-drf-extensions so endpoint access, record visibility and user-driven\nfiltering are kept separate. Platform admins may see every enrollment, so\nthe view uses the library''s FullScopePolicy for now; a narrower policy can\nreplace it later without touching the view. The form-based filtering moves\nfrom get_queryset() into filter_queryset(), so it only narrows the scoped\nqueryset. No behavior change.\n\nAdds regression tests for the admin list: 401/403, a regular user filtering\nby someone else''s username gets 403 with no data, admins see all rows, the\ncourse_key/username filters, the 400 on invalid params, and the ADR 0033\nDeprecation header.\n\nBumps edx-drf-extensions 10.8.0 -> 10.9.0, the release that adds\nFullScopePolicy (edx-drf-extensions#578). Follows up\n#38847, whose shared scoping tooling moved to edx-drf-extensions in #569.","tree":{"sha":"b8340e5dc0d4e85802116cde5f8bb5044b2e5d76","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/openedx-platform/git/trees/b8340e5dc0d4e85802116cde5f8bb5044b2e5d76"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/openedx-platform/git/commits/9ae7994d66c19c75b9332e3037ade430e6555e31","verification":{"payload":"tree b8340e5dc0d4e85802116cde5f8bb5044b2e5d76\nparent 77ffca9b2f8d942191018a25a908dfcf320ac1fe\nauthor Abdul-Muqadim-Arbisoft <139064778+Abdul-Muqadim-Arbisoft@users.noreply.github.com> 1789663220 +0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789663220 +0500\n\nfeat: apply queryset scoping to the Enrollments v2 admin list (#39037)\n\nWire EnrollmentsAdminListView through ScopedQuerysetMixin from\nedx-drf-extensions so endpoint access, record visibility and user-driven\nfiltering are kept separate. Platform admins may see every enrollment, so\nthe view uses the library''s FullScopePolicy for now; a narrower policy can\nreplace it later without touching the view. The form-based filtering moves\nfrom get_queryset() into filter_queryset(), so it only narrows the scoped\nqueryset. No behavior change.\n\nAdds regression tests for the admin list: 401/403, a regular user filtering\nby someone else''s username gets 403 with no data, admins see all rows, the\ncourse_key/username filters, the 400 on invalid params, and the ADR 0033\nDeprecation header.\n\nBumps edx-drf-extensions 10.8.0 -> 10.9.0, the release that adds\nFullScopePolicy (edx-drf-extensions#578). Follows up\n#38847, whose shared scoping tooling moved to edx-drf-extensions in #569.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqrBf0CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAJzYQAApkb0Zv+X/ZSh6oK6lrtj7p\n9atd63O7e5w2zPJqkx2GrotS8jmi1hrf6NCwNu8qn2+BxwvhYTc09FEByQZX1Ls8\n9r0Xep2AQuWEBb6xCRCBsYw9drfNfafIjfhOdLech/HHybF0MVuJHn0SZKLz+yvy\nypOeP5rz9gT4ZP6hHkLKSB+uPrkd9DWmAAg9bTXJbtCi33+l0gZFVOjBHMjuBO5y\nt/X2bU3iosOqCWYS+1juTvxzDvpvbba0pOysi31Q3yLTl3guunl3dvpf0vTf2Zst\njuNF0Q65l3w4TjoLVHDJS16/CmlzNoBIujgzTeRmMzVaDlUNYPMt/xf3HEihkqY4\nCgfWwSy5cXme4lkTW8RJpD6QYHZpJfP/xxhaQfAYhuVRTxrEEsaNUwbMawbZFQOh\nYgp27US2fLrswChUA88mv0I