ps://api.github.com/users/feanil/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/openedx-platform/commits/851319a0a76ecb916ff7613322eeeab3650384ac/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T18:51:28Z","email":"feanil@axim.org","name":"Feanil Patel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T18:53:11Z","email":"feanil@axim.org","name":"Feanil Patel"},"message":"docs: drop stale TODO in lti_provider render_courseware\n\nThe docstring referenced ongoing refactoring of the courseware/courseware.html\nMako template and warned the signature might change. That template was deleted\nwhen CoursewareIndex became a pure redirect to the learning MFE (562df7386c),\nand render_courseware already renders via render_xblock. Update the docstring to\ndescribe the current behavior and drop the obsolete TODO.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f0d59725180188e248c7fe4de63677fbd98b3bd3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/openedx-platform/git/trees/f0d59725180188e248c7fe4de63677fbd98b3bd3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/openedx-platform/git/commits/851319a0a76ecb916ff7613322eeeab3650384ac","verification":{"payload":"tree f0d59725180188e248c7fe4de63677fbd98b3bd3\nparent 9a257961c93998e4413037c7c189649227ab6c9a\nauthor Feanil Patel <feanil@axim.org> 1789066288 -0400\ncommitter Feanil Patel <feanil@axim.org> 1789066391 -0400\n\ndocs: drop stale TODO in lti_provider render_courseware\n\nThe docstring referenced ongoing refactoring of the courseware/courseware.html\nMako template and warned the signature might change. That template was deleted\nwhen CoursewareIndex became a pure redirect to the learning MFE (562df7386c),\nand render_courseware already renders via render_xblock. Update the docstring to\ndescribe the current behavior and drop the obsolete TODO.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAglcBDQ9rliT2kx8WFoOW4vSlEaG\noJlB7ebCkwaIN8IboAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQIl3cNQZj+jOHxqSLNGRtKeL3VrFTbcyRKQoqyIVa7Tivi9/oD+Ngv/E4usCCzFo9f\ne3c248N+eZAa362Q9kbAc=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-10T18:53:20Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/781561?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/feanil","id":781561,"login":"feanil","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4MTU2MQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/openedx/openedx-platform/commit/851319a0a76ecb916ff7613322eeeab3650384ac","node_id":"C_kwDOAJ6OIdoAKDg1MTMxOWEwYTc2ZWNiOTE2ZmY3NjEzMzIyZWVlYWIzNjUwMzg0YWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/openedx/openedx-platform/commit/9a257961c93998e4413037c7c189649227ab6c9a","sha":"9a257961c93998e4413037c7c189649227ab6c9a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/openedx-platform/commits/9a257961c93998e4413037c7c189649227ab6c9a"}],"sha":"851319a0a76ecb916ff7613322eeeab3650384ac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/openedx-platform/commits/851319a0a76ecb916ff7613322eeeab3650384ac"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/125318182?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-marquez-wgu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-marquez-wgu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-marquez-wgu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-marquez-wgu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/carlos-marquez-wgu","id":125318182,"login":"carlos-marquez-wgu","node_id":"U_kgDOB3g0Jg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-marquez-wgu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-marquez-wgu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-marquez-wgu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-marquez-wgu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-marquez-wgu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-marquez-wgu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/openedx-platform/commits/9a257961c93998e4413037c7c189649227ab6c9a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T16:13:49Z","email":"125318182+carlos-marquez-wgu@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Carlos Marquez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T16:13:49Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: allow Course Admin/Staff/Editor to sync library updates into a course (#39055)\n\n* fix: allow Course Admin/Staff/Editor to sync library updates into a course\n\nUsers with the courses.manage_library_updates permission (granted by\nCourse Staff, Course Editor, and Course Admin roles) were unable to sync\nlibrary updates into a course unless they also had explicit view\npermissions on the source library.\n\nThis adds a course-level permission check in both sync_from_upstream_block\nand sync_from_upstream_container that skips the library-level permission\ncheck when the user holds manage_library_updates for the downstream\ncourse. A shared helper (user_has_manage_library_updates) centralizes\nthe check with a legacy write-access fallback.","tree":{"sha":"d5bf757c946bbc0dbc2bbe31ca5ea14526c96627","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/openedx-platform/git/trees/d5bf757c946bbc0dbc2bbe31ca5ea14526c96627"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/openedx-platform/git/commits/9a257961c93998e4413037c7c189649227ab6c9a","verification":{"payload":"tree d5bf757c946bbc0dbc2bbe31ca5ea14526c96627\nparent fef9dd5e6ae9ee05b62b0d0c68f09c79e668a583\nauthor Carlos Marquez <125318182+carlos-marquez-wgu@users.noreply.github.com> 1789056829 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789056829 +0200\n\nfix: allow Course Admin/Staff/Editor to sync library updates into a course (#39055)\n\n* fix: allow Course Admin/Staff/Editor to sync library updates into a course\n\nUsers with the courses.manage_library_updates permission (granted by\nCourse Staff, Course Editor, and Course Admin roles) were unable to sync\nlibrary updates into a course unless they also had explicit view\npermissions on the source library.\n\nThis adds a course-level permission check in both sync_from_upstream_block\nand sync_from_upstream_container that skips the library-level permission\ncheck when the user holds manage_library_updates for the downstream\ncourse. A shared helper (user_has_manage_library_updates) centralizes\nthe check with a legacy write-access fallback.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqotc9CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA+loQAJVdW4ShMAKKGs4KE9++hWfc\nriTZZhZDOF33egY6JDjAZvVDM2j5GDdNkb4nbeRysgOLCvyD4mJKPdF5u2qBxQ10\nkUjn4+vMTsMuiFpYGHTJVXynP06VgWcOxrHlxQtoJYx2A2vGFHVUqqntZSa+r7qH\n9OGLz2ZL1SwRtis7T8wu9y+0wm24wccpd1/QqX6zaP4fW5YKLKF3mn80pMPAYdaX\n19JZ3wxLQD8/qqwmnJiYl5AGYxCQvlBkSsiDd1LE8pPjfxLiA+2dwUILAWQyK472\noooUXsYMyaJdiW1BPNzzosIAb0ka/AauHLzZtWu5sSKRBpA5qpP6VLXSAzSefNlA\nX9vKvAnuFBUhz1v43WzzB81OgavtiSC2Z1ISyoU28hVjxgca04mH4tZnLd4SfKlA\nxnpvxOXAoUeIQygMbuXQUmGr2RYZpHq6MSUeusm+pmLfrDNiRm4+yUoraUtk3x1n\nf0taezbwmhoWfP5B1Eq/NSH6XfJG+wWIipB52K/L5pi5xVGsFO0F3CLQ+Nlflxum\nGvxZFVkev42+DQjd0KeLz6qD5DsAJ9nLaJtS7iSuAgQ+rN1tBFjiraIMLxFOfjWB\n4ayPYnrqO8Pfn5KHN/lcAwFmmozraV59mJAoTDrHI3/WYHkB0ferej/CN3RcdpcS\nllBawA5XxvlMr350ItH/\n=/5zg\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-10T16:13:49Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/openedx/openedx-platform/commit/9a257961c93998e4413037c7c189649227ab6c9a","node_id":"C_kwDOAJ6OIdoAKDlhMjU3OTYxYzkzOTk4ZTQ0MTMwMzdjN2MxODk2NDkyMjdhYjZjOWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/openedx/openedx-platform/commit/fef9dd5e6ae9ee05b62b0d0c68f09c79e668a583","sha":"fef9dd5e6ae9ee05b62b0d0c68f09c79e668a583","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/openedx-platform/commits/fef9dd5e6ae9ee05b62b0d0c68f09c79e668a583"}],"sha":"9a257961c93998e4413037c7c189649227ab6c9a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/openedx-platform/commits/9a257961c93998e4413037c7c189649227ab6c9a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/91025555?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/efortish/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/efortish/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/efortish/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/efortish/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/efortish","id":91025555,"login":"efortish","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxMDI1NTU1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/efortish/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/efortish/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/efortish/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/efortish/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/efortish/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/efortish","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/openedx-platform/commits/fef9dd5e6ae9ee05b62b0d0c68f09c79e668a583/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T14:23:41Z","email":"91025555+efortish@users.noreply.github.com","name":"KEVYN SUAREZ"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T14:23:41Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: course editor gets 403 copying a unit to the clipboard  (#39075)\n\n* fix: Course Editor gets 403 copying a unit to the clipboard\n\nClipboardEndpoint.post() gated read access on has_studio_read_access(),\na legacy-only check with no knowledge of AuthZ-native roles like\ncourse_editor and course_auditor. Switched to user_has_course_permission()\nwith COURSES_VIEW_COURSE, falling back to the same legacy check when AuthZ\ncourse authoring isn''t enabled for the course. Same pattern already used for\nthe same class of bug in openedx-authz#384.\n\n* test: wrap the 403 assertion in allow_transaction_exception\n\nMatches the existing test_no_course_permission''s pattern for this same\nendpoint: a PermissionDenied raised mid-request under\ntransaction.non_atomic_requests leaves ModuleStoreTestCase''s cleanup\nunable to run its own queries afterward, unless the assertion is wrapped\nin allow_transaction_exception().","tree":{"sha":"6e6d70ee1a11df5f4792d1bdf11b924e8b1fdc6b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/openedx-platform/git/trees/6e6d70ee1a11df5f4792d1bdf11b924e8b1fdc6b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/openedx-platform/git/commits/fef9dd5e6ae9ee05b62b0d0c68f09c79e668a583","verification":{"payload":"tree 6e6d70ee1a11df5f4792d1bdf11b924e8b1fdc6b\nparent b6efe1ab36983ee167d3f5eaac80867c13d2a259\nauthor KEVYN SUAREZ <91025555+efortish@users.noreply.github.com> 1789050221 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789050221 +0200\n\nfix: course editor gets 403 copying a unit to the clipboard  (#39075)\n\n* fix: Course Editor gets 403 copying a unit to the clipboard\n\nClipboardEndpoint.post() gated read access on has_studio_read_access(),\na legacy-only check with no knowledge of AuthZ-native roles like\ncourse_editor and course_auditor. Switched to user_has_course_permission()\nwith COURSES_VIEW_COURSE, falling back to the same legacy check when AuthZ\ncourse authoring isn''t enabled for the course. Same pattern already used for\nthe same class of bug in openedx-authz#384.\n\n* test: wrap the 403 assertion in allow_transaction_exception\n\nMatches the existing test_no_course_permission''s pattern for this same\nendpoint: a PermissionDenied raised mid-request under\ntransaction.non_atomic_requests leaves ModuleStoreTestCase''s cleanup\nunable to run its own queries afterward, unless the assertion is wrapped\nin allow_transaction_exception().","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqor1tCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAcE4QAG9czyFHSWKvnFNRkoK81J1j