field. Any user with a platform-wide role crashed\nget_orgs_for_user()/has_org_for_user() with an AttributeError.\n\nSpecial-case platform-wide assignments: since they cover every org,\nreturn all registered org short names instead of deriving them from\nindividual assignments.\n\nFixes https://github.com/openedx/openedx-authz/issues/380","tree":{"sha":"9fb93d380728566e03053c52f2594fb2c31b6887","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/openedx-platform/git/trees/9fb93d380728566e03053c52f2594fb2c31b6887"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/openedx-platform/git/commits/8f802e8ffdfc2e69de12b201d0e65ed2cbaee798","verification":{"payload":"tree 9fb93d380728566e03053c52f2594fb2c31b6887\nparent 34e4d6dc3d43bd8989961854d82f7700c8d6ef92\nauthor KEVYN SUAREZ <91025555+efortish@users.noreply.github.com> 1788862777 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788862777 +0200\n\nfix: platform-wide glob role assignments crash get_orgs_for_user/has_org_for_user (#38980)\n\nRoleBase._authz_get_orgs_for_user() read assignment.scope.org for every\nAuthZ assignment, but PlatformGlobData (course-v1:*, lib:*) has no .org\nattribute at all, unlike CourseOverviewData/OrgGlobData where it''s a\nreal (possibly None) field. Any user with a platform-wide role crashed\nget_orgs_for_user()/has_org_for_user() with an AttributeError.\n\nSpecial-case platform-wide assignments: since they cover every org,\nreturn all registered org short names instead of deriving them from\nindividual assignments.\n\nFixes https://github.com/openedx/openedx-authz/issues/380","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqn+E5CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAIIgQAGR/kNhvHWEER3NP5pgiHGeT\nEdT3VJg/2yAEgqS5QOrvLquR8ReJ1kBFds2Izr+dweWAXpycG5ve+L8B+aVYgkDa\nsCkAH9DG71FONCjpQlqFcyAw8t0Z7gx8Vy8FKnsBb3vsghf1QjzphSgBIlr7ZDmI\nTdwkWbFNY03rbHsjQZ83p37B+Zy3RcVrScKdmsGF2z392hshadR6dVCxIuXHvPZ6\nkBwUY3dtsq67ydOJqwBN6M9rQiYjlGL+NOSsK/lFp83N6VZTSjk8orjiLqBPLcnP\nyaSuTb+E95Nn9H8eOpXzYSgT2CQylZH3L92cedPbpgI