ers/Gi-ron/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gi-ron/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gi-ron/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Gi-ron","id":57727342,"login":"Gi-ron","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3NzI3MzQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gi-ron/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gi-ron/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gi-ron/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gi-ron/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gi-ron/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gi-ron","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/openedx-platform/commits/890ee180d6c04d91cb1a3f91a3c00eb8fef533d4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T19:02:29Z","email":"57727342+Gi-ron@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Steven Giron"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T19:02:29Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: prevent silent errors during SSO (account settings) (#38673)\n\n* feat: update tpa config\n\n* fix: silent TPA error messages in MFE account\n\n* feat: pass provider name as dynamic error_code param in account redirect\n\n* feat: surface TPA errors to Account MFE via endpoint instead of query param\n\n* fix: preserve unrelated Django messages in TPA error endpoint\n\nReading django.contrib.messages marks the whole session storage as\nconsumed, not just the message we want. Without re-queuing the rest,\nany unrelated message queued in the same session (from some other,\nunrelated flow) was being silently dropped instead of shown wherever\nit was actually meant to appear. Now only the first social-auth\nmessage is consumed; everything else is re-queued.\n\nAlso add a drf_yasg schema to the endpoint, matching the convention\nalready used elsewhere in this app, and expand test coverage: message\npreservation, multiple queued social-auth messages, unrecognized\nexceptions, and the full set of TPA exception types for both the\nredirect-dispatch and message-queuing paths.\n\n* fix: address pylint failures in new tests\n\n- use-implicit-booleaness-not-comparison: \"list(...) == []\" -> \"not list(...)\"\n- comparison-with-callable: match.func == view_function needs an explicit\n  disable, same pattern already used elsewhere in this codebase (e.g.\n  common/djangoapps/util/date_utils.py).\n\n* fix: limit test account path only to lms","tree":{"sha":"5c62694f90c77fad3648c5bd5d2c032a705898e4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/openedx-platform/git/trees/5c62694f90c77fad3648c5bd5d2c032a705898e4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/openedx-platform/git/commits/890ee180d6c04d91cb1a3f91a3c00eb8fef533d4","verification":{"payload":"tree 5c62694f90c77fad3648c5bd5d2c032a705898e4\nparent e2e8edf73f87d9c9aac4067327d06913f7de97b5\nauthor Steven Giron <57727342+Gi-ron@users.noreply.github.com> 1788375749 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788375749 -0500\n\nfix: prevent silent errors during SSO (account settings) (#38673)\n\n* feat: update tpa config\n\n* fix: silent TPA error messages in MFE account\n\n* feat: pass provider name as dynamic error_code param in account redirect\n\n* feat: surface TPA errors to Account MFE via endpoint instead of query param\n\n* fix: preserve unrelated Django messages in TPA error endpoint\n\nReading django.contrib.messages marks the whole session storage as\nconsumed, not just the message we want. Without re-queuing the rest,\nany unrelated message queued in the same session (from some other,\nunrelated flow) was being silently dropped instead of shown wherever\nit was actually meant to appear. Now only the first social-auth\nmessage is consumed; everything else is re-queued.\n\nAlso add a drf_yasg schema to the endpoint, matching the convention\nalready used elsewhere in this app, and expand test coverage: message\npreservation, multiple queued social-auth messages, unrecognized\nexceptions, and the full set of TPA exception types for both the\nredirect-dispatch and message-queuing paths.\n\n* fix: address pylint failures in new tests\n\n- use-implicit-booleaness-not-comparison: \"list(...) == []\" -> \"not list(...)\"\n- comparison-with-callable: match.func == view_function needs an explicit\n  disable, same pattern already used elsewhere in this codebase (e.g.\n  common/djangoapps/util/date_utils.py).\n\n* fix: limit test account path only to lms","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqmHLFCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAQxUQAF6B7TAzw6d2ViYhAdo67tf6\nRnFErtlQvdAz2JfSSu4SJXbDyqiiJOsMKwjuHRUbuLw0LsfEHNlmxFUoi6d36tup\nqCokAb6NmHH+ftSLs3knKw6Ps6VGMVsdz1S/ybTU3jcWRNyiucIcXuZBnVmfLvuL\nvQH4ccUFJpRLl75y9rat8xoIdexyWmOoLW+9KkCz20yEhoBBxTtIAPReArI5Lnz9\nSqJOckgSEW8iPB6Iiq67fJCcdVrk1xQHt1hTk2GUzs9RckZD5R2IP9M5jU8lMMpZ\njodDGvutVvBFRqBsNiRKfIWNOGg3iMbmSxP20x3fS0aen2+TrqiEopNMbsNgPx8/\nDwAtgkA/iW6xhlBo171I1qaxVe0Wo6koMPtQBVh2qrcgzSD1y++xdb3eiWjzk4qk\njB1q3M95QaaiBPyRAZd1fi0qknLIXx2soXjnu2vWtMmluaaPsId3zaEX3HauLRMt\nSRynbTaQn2KCaHi/oRudw7VGpdfjJ9c2n6Rim2dDsevYYvgce68MkC+ipJa4nPMU\nQ8Kzf6bwBOxutVX10cygNh4Ox6RNvyBbc/J3EmZ7ofnD8gj5U+XOh1Bn5TsgzfZX\nUH6+R7edVvpKUiTWrCYF8lygtWZjZpes0HGI54Is0AnpgDYUhDUuAS/D+knTxcC6\n6JLRmaSfxoAZloKB2MIX\n=WYS2\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-02T19:02:30Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/user