 can reach logged-in pages that DevTools MCP, headless browsers, and curl can''t. Drafted messages read better broken into short paragraphs with the ask on its own line than as a wall of text.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAglXOcMjmJIigvM4sxbnhlTp+cJ7\n0kd3+1606Kav0bdzkAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQP4fmphHyVZNJplRr9Jjt3JAYy0Wys/GpoNztQid74NUBGqhU1q+TUqvoksPhgZcVZ\nDhgoQfk9vNIhlRwLyWTgE=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-04T13:11:18Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/282759?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/benbalter","id":282759,"login":"benbalter","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4Mjc1OQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/benbalter/dotfiles/commit/65f22d8f5cd957647228f4ec750cbd7e12e98997","node_id":"C_kwDOALmu69oAKDY1ZjIyZDhmNWNkOTU3NjQ3MjI4ZjRlYzc1MGNiZDdlMTJlOTg5OTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/benbalter/dotfiles/commit/f23b80091c21f00c97bd1edb742438f695a54d54","sha":"f23b80091c21f00c97bd1edb742438f695a54d54","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/commits/f2