.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/git/trees/b196f1e198226e071bed1509ff6d0fad4f710ce7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/git/commits/f23b80091c21f00c97bd1edb742438f695a54d54","verification":{"payload":"tree b196f1e198226e071bed1509ff6d0fad4f710ce7\nparent 1132ebc3abac30ef0bf8b0b0787b6691d287b617\nauthor Ben Balter <ben@balter.com> 1791057706 -0400\ncommitter Ben Balter <ben@balter.com> 1791057706 -0400\n\nEncourage subtle Gen Z slang in casual drafts to Gen Z recipients\n\nA light touch of self-aware slang helps casual texts to younger folks\nland as friendly rather than formal. Scoped to casual messages and\ncapped at one or two bits, kept out of the actual ask, because more\nreads as parody from a millennial and slang anywhere professional\nwould undercut the message.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAglXOcMjmJIigvM4sxbnhlTp+cJ7\n0kd3+1606Kav0bdzkAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQOxmWwuhFvaYjLZmbNDa608fcXk/kb+LwneWxGzT0g0H5qCB1jMx8xyqTKFt3jFDcF\nM2njdMJ+8/Fci+rRNDdQ4=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-03T20:01:57Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/282759?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/benbalter","id":282759,"login":"benbalter","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4Mjc1OQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/user