r":{"date":"2026-10-03T19:42:48Z","email":"ben@balter.com","name":"Ben Balter"},"message":"Add \"mag\" (merge all green) shorthand to global CLAUDE.md\n\nI keep asking Claude to merge a batch of PRs only where CI passes. Spell\nout that it reports the rest instead of overriding branch rules, since\nseveral repos require reviews or checks an admin merge would skip.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b357d78d8e7da0a7f4daada2d891cef1cf74e7d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/git/trees/b357d78d8e7da0a7f4daada2d891cef1cf74e7d2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/git/commits/1132ebc3abac30ef0bf8b0b0787b6691d287b617","verification":{"payload":"tree b357d78d8e7da0a7f4daada2d891cef1cf74e7d2\nparent 0a3799a0886bf36777dea6587f75f3dbfd8e847c\nauthor Ben Balter <ben@balter.com> 1791056568 -0400\ncommitter Ben Balter <ben@balter.com> 1791056568 -0400\n\nAdd \"mag\" (merge all green) shorthand to global CLAUDE.md\n\nI keep asking Claude to merge a batch of PRs only where CI passes. Spell\nout that it reports the rest instead of overriding branch rules, since\nseveral repos require reviews or checks an admin merge would skip.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAglXOcMjmJIigvM4sxbnhlTp+cJ7\n0kd3+1606Kav0bdzkAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQFaiOcI3Z32tSDOmPVSs2o+fn4gv8Na+E2ZfkAgSITAF9+GM4JZJCxZuhxVs+3b7wi\nCdJRSyJgjxAE+dWvlV+Qc=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-03T20:01:57Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/282759?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ben