-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAglXOcMjmJIigvM4sxbnhlTp+cJ7\n0kd3+1606Kav0bdzkAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQFWLgwvW8NosZSiNkCktfQ4uJKXPDAKrFf2FEHwC231i1ypjzOqP2/DYROkHcRosgD\nyACyerBHgrVshr1wcb1Qk=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-03T18:48:44Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/282759?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/benbalter","id":282759,"login":"benbalter","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4Mjc1OQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/benbalter/dotfiles/commit/74bdeb3772e3f00f99e4042466879bfd24d692ec","node_id":"C_kwDOALmu69oAKDc0YmRlYjM3NzJlM2YwMGY5OWU0MDQyNDY2ODc5YmZkMjRkNjkyZWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/benbalter/dotfiles/commit/10bd3bb3d25fc94ebf7e4efb122357af35b9ca1c","sha":"10bd3bb3d25fc94ebf7e4efb122357af35b9ca1c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/commits/10bd3bb3d25fc94ebf7e4efb122357af35b9ca1c"}],"sha":"74bdeb3772e3f00f99e4042466879bfd24d692ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/commits/74bdeb3772e3f00f99e4042466879bfd24d692ec"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/282759?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/benbalter","id":282759,"login":"benbalter","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4Mjc1OQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/commits/10bd3bb3d25fc94ebf7e4efb122357af35b9ca1c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T18:26:11Z","email":"ben@balter.com","name":"Ben Balter"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T18:26:11Z","email":"ben@balter.com","name":"Ben Balter"},"message":"Ask for inclusive language in global CLAUDE.md\n\nClaude''s replies and writing used terms like \"sanity check\". Spell out\nthe inclusive alternatives so it uses them by default, with an exception\nfor external names it can''t change (API fields, a master branch) so it\ndoesn''t go renaming those unasked. Also reword the review rule from\n\"review it blind\" to \"independently\".\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3f5f140f4848ceb577610a45ac5e51d3c04d2fc9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/git/trees/3f5f140f4848ceb577610a45ac5e51d3c04d2fc9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/git/commits/10bd3bb3d25fc94ebf7e4efb122357af35b9ca1c","verification":{"payload":"tree 3f5f140f4848ceb577610a45ac5e51d3c04d2fc9\nparent f57a5242363974998c7d9964c6dee1bfd09b59f8\nauthor Ben Balter <ben@balter.com> 1791051971 -0400\ncommitter Ben Balter <ben@balter.com> 1791051971 -0400\n\nAsk for inclusive language in global CLAUDE.md\n\nClaude''s replies and writing used terms like \"sanity check\". Spell out\nthe inclusive alternatives so it uses them by default, with an exception\nfor external names it can''t change (API fields, a master branch) so it\ndoesn''t go renaming those unasked. Also reword the review rule from\n\"review it blind\" to \"independently\".\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAglXOcMjmJIigvM4sxbnhlTp+cJ7\n0kd3+1606Kav0bdzkAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQFM6A4lb1D7I42Mag05F/WV3RHdE//ILzi8Te6g0jd6PsA+TiaPCXP6a+/Qd9aT6As\nMtd0Wxe+Z8d6O/CnP8wQo=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-03T18:26:39Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/282759?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/benbalter","id":282759,"login":"benbalter","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4Mjc1OQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter","user_view_