bal CLAUDE.md, which\ndefers to a repo''s existing style; leaving these wrapped would have kept\nthis repo wrapping. Reflowed with prettier --prose-wrap never.\n\nMIGRATION.md also had a rendering bug: list items indented continuation\nlines six spaces, so the ```sh fences weren''t code blocks under\nCommonMark and rendered as inline text run into the checklist item.\nRe-indented them to the list''s two-space content column.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2ce88fe25839bcb85c8465c046fde52e7a0843de","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/git/trees/2ce88fe25839bcb85c8465c046fde52e7a0843de"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/git/commits/f57a5242363974998c7d9964c6dee1bfd09b59f8","verification":{"payload":"tree 2ce88fe25839bcb85c8465c046fde52e7a0843de\nparent faba2b25da6177fc73700880c4038897369884ad\nauthor Ben Balter <ben@balter.com> 1791050487 -0400\ncommitter Ben Balter <ben@balter.com> 1791050487 -0400\n\nUnwrap the repo''s remaining Markdown\n\nFollows the no-hard-wrap rule just added to the global CLAUDE.md, which\ndefers to a repo''s existing style; leaving these wrapped would have kept\nthis repo wrapping. Reflowed with prettier --prose-wrap never.\n\nMIGRATION.md also had a rendering bug: list items indented continuation\nlines six spaces, so the ```sh fences weren''t code blocks under\nCommonMark and rendered as inline text run into the checklist item.\nRe-indented them to the list''s two-space content column.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAglXOcMjmJIigvM4sxbnhlTp+cJ7\n0kd3+1606Kav0bdzkAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQCOErPfGdsYw6AAGxLNPE+AyYnFYsx4UamXy2NxuCoXs/iQiuUqzcdrCpOZFlzyqkQ\nCINtb9chVVnZs7Uc+PMgc=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-03T18:01:56Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://