ps://api.github.com/users/benbalter/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/commits/3acbbe0be16bbdb77cf25fbfcde2b6ce3fedcb73/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T22:43:06Z","email":"ben@balter.com","name":"Ben Balter"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T22:43:06Z","email":"ben@balter.com","name":"Ben Balter"},"message":"Scope global CLAUDE.md''s macOS-only guidance\n\nThe file is also linked in Codespaces, where the repo isn''t at ~/.files\nand Workbrew, 1Password and op-ssh-sign don''t exist. Group those under a\nmacOS heading, state the Workbrew ownership rule (never chown\n/opt/homebrew to the login user), and say .env holds op:// references.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"562d4e7ff9e8f1fd69324077e91a1201788cafb5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/git/trees/562d4e7ff9e8f1fd69324077e91a1201788cafb5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/git/commits/3acbbe0be16bbdb77cf25fbfcde2b6ce3fedcb73","verification":{"payload":"tree 562d4e7ff9e8f1fd69324077e91a1201788cafb5\nparent 8936938db7811586a60cdb4434113e5e258b5afc\nauthor Ben Balter <ben@balter.com> 1790721786 -0400\ncommitter Ben Balter <ben@balter.com> 1790721786 -0400\n\nScope global CLAUDE.md''s macOS-only guidance\n\nThe file is also linked in Codespaces, where the repo isn''t at ~/.files\nand Workbrew, 1Password and op-ssh-sign don''t exist. Group those under a\nmacOS heading, state the Workbrew ownership rule (never chown\n/opt/homebrew to the login user), and say .env holds op:// references.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAglXOcMjmJIigvM4sxbnhlTp+cJ7\n0kd3+1606Kav0bdzkAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQLHIUM6eZhhqNCF6FM/0K