ceived_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/commits/ab4572d8042f972d56e0faf667b6d14bc841f4db/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T13:50:06Z","email":"ben@balter.com","name":"Ben Balter"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T13:50:06Z","email":"ben@balter.com","name":"Ben Balter"},"message":"Make doctor''s TouchID test hermetic; key init caches on binary path\n\n- doctor reads sudo_local from SUDO_LOCAL when set, so the macOS\n  security test no longer depends on the host having TouchID sudo\n- _cached_init regenerates when the resolved binary (with its Cellar\n  version) or the command changes. Bottles keep their build mtime, so\n  an -nt check could miss an upgrade\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f0a96a5f54437f6ec96d8553297161d1fbdbb69c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/git/trees/f0a96a5f54437f6ec96d8553297161d1fbdbb69c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/git/commits/ab4572d8042f972d56e0faf667b6d14bc841f4db","verification":{"payload":"tree f0a96a5f54437f6ec96d8553297161d1fbdbb69c\nparent 077c18aaf55aaf116bb79b3e75f36289202a4648\nauthor Ben Balter <ben@balter.com> 1790517006 -0400\ncommitter Ben Balter <ben@balter.com> 1790517006 -0400\n\nMake doctor''s TouchID test hermetic; key init caches on binary path\n\n- doctor reads sudo_local from SUDO_LOCAL when set, so the macOS\n  security test no longer depends on the host having TouchID sudo\n- _cached_init regenerates when the resolved binary (with its Cellar\n  version) or the command changes. Bottles keep their build mtime, so\n  an -nt check could miss an upgrade\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAglXOcMjmJIigvM4sxbnhlTp+cJ7\n0kd3+1606Kav0bdzkAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQE6rEqG16rjUuSYRxLkzEqiKc+avQLAqw1WSpkzdt4tK3/BAPGIOZx7TeIxoVALeGO\nphceH8jnWuJHOL35/ylQM=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-27T13:50:40Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/282759?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/benbalter","id":282759,"login":"benbalter","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4Mjc1OQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/benbalter/dotfiles/commit/ab4572d8042f972d56e0faf667b6d14bc841f4db","node_id":"C_kwDOALmu69oAKGFiNDU3MmQ4MDQyZjk3MmQ1NmUwZmFmNjY3YjZkMTRiYzg0MWY0ZGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/benbalter/dotfiles/commit/077c18aaf55aaf116bb79b3e75f36289202a4648","sha":"077c18aaf55aaf116bb79b3e75f36289202a4648","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/commits/077c18aaf55aaf116bb79b3e75f36289202a4648"}],"sha":"ab4572d8042f972d56e0faf667b6d14bc841f4db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/commits/ab4572d8042f972d56e0faf667b6d14bc841f4db"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/282759?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/benbalter","id":282759,"login":"benbalter","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4Mjc1OQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/commits/077c18aaf55aaf116bb79b3e75f36289202a4648/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T13:44:05Z","email":"ben@balter.com","name":"Ben Balter"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T13:44:05Z","email":"ben@balter.com","name":"Ben Balter"},"message":"Polish shell startup, config and docs\n\n- Cache mise, starship, fzf and atuin init scripts, regenerated when the\n  binary is newer (about 25ms per shell)\n- Load fzf only on a terminal: its option restore printed \"can''t change\n  option: zle\" twice under `zsh -ic`, which CI''s new check would catch\n- Rebind common-aliases'' editor suffix aliases to ${=EDITOR}, so\n  notes.txt opens in \"code --wait\" instead of failing\n- .editorconfig uses tabs for script/* and lib/*, matching shfmt\n- config.yml: drop the dotfile_links alias; screenshot location is an\n  absolute path instead of a literal ~\n- Document the settings.json merge''s add-only behavior and fix a stale\n  Linux comment in the playbook\n- README lists every headless skip; CLAUDE.md lists every playbook tag\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"77290d3a17f8a8af1746ac1d59bcc59e9ab08690","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/git/trees/77290d3a17f8a8af1746ac1d59bcc59e9ab08690"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/git/commits/077c18aaf55aaf116bb79b3e75f36289202a4648","verification":{"payload":"tree 77290d3a17f8a8af1746ac1d59bcc59e9ab08690\nparent 91b5e801f649b6f056bac8387d7e483baf25e9e1\nauthor Ben Balter <ben@balter.com> 1790516645 -0400\ncommitter Ben Balter <ben@balter.com> 1790516645 -0400\n\nPolish shell startup, config and docs\n\n- Cache mise, starship, fzf and atuin init scripts, regenerated when the\n  binary is newer (about 25ms per shell)\n- Load fzf only on a terminal: its option restore printed \"can''t change\n  option: zle\" twice under `zsh -ic`, which CI''s new check would catch\n- Rebind common-aliases'' editor suffix aliases to ${=EDITOR}, so\n  notes.txt opens in \"code --wait\" instead of failing\n- .editorconfig uses tabs for script/* and lib/*, matching shfmt\n- config.yml: drop the dotfile_links alias; screenshot location is an\n  absolute path instead of a literal ~\n- Document the settings.json merge''s add-only behavior and fix a stale\n  Linux comment in the playbook\n- README lists every headless skip; CLAUDE.md lists every playbook tag\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAglXOcMjmJIigvM4sxbnhlTp+cJ7\n0kd3+1606Kav0bdzkAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQK/nGlEcB2s3jo302TAzxAnGKzqJHYeLm0CkAR9DEQpZ6VnR3YQT4cUtQ7XUdlNy/F\n1hHn9E+5pss5pV8NmbCQQ=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-27T13:50:40Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/282759?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/use