d_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/commits/91b5e801f649b6f056bac8387d7e483baf25e9e1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T13:40:47Z","email":"ben@balter.com","name":"Ben Balter"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T13:40:47Z","email":"ben@balter.com","name":"Ben Balter"},"message":"Settle audit-casks'' pending removal proposals\n\nKeep docker-desktop, openlogi and steam; drop the other 16 casks. `clean`\nuninstalls them, and script/update-brewfile is no longer blocked.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"949ebd25e65ff1fd29dfb3aa2f1f7f49ad0b7d98","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/git/trees/949ebd25e65ff1fd29dfb3aa2f1f7f49ad0b7d98"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/git/commits/91b5e801f649b6f056bac8387d7e483baf25e9e1","verification":{"payload":"tree 949ebd25e65ff1fd29dfb3aa2f1f7f49ad0b7d98\nparent 50a8563afb837ca9fe6ef17189f80acf8209fe5f\nauthor Ben Balter <ben@balter.com> 1790516447 -0400\ncommitter Ben Balter <ben@balter.com> 1790516447 -0400\n\nSettle audit-casks'' pending removal proposals\n\nKeep docker-desktop, openlogi and steam; drop the other 16 casks. `clean`\nuninstalls them, and script/update-brewfile is no longer blocked.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAglXOcMjmJIigvM4sxbnhlTp+cJ7\n0kd3+1606Kav0bdzkAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQPKROfWKeUfnyZVGRTNBPVJ1PiTwufm1JbU/L6VlHSPZ0oMvNBkp