 right after a\n  bootout.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"70ec975756b29470ac673ae6efe1467fbf520a1e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/git/trees/70ec975756b29470ac673ae6efe1467fbf520a1e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/git/commits/ce62489f2becafb6345a3dcf442a8a44bff8e026","verification":{"payload":"tree 70ec975756b29470ac673ae6efe1467fbf520a1e\nparent 7051142230e629038622baac1fc3c8b2877c9ff8\nauthor Ben Balter <ben@balter.com> 1790443590 -0400\ncommitter Ben Balter <ben@balter.com> 1790443590 -0400\n\nFollow-ups from review: vendor/ lint, pinned shellcheck, agent retries\n\n- remark ignores vendor/, where setup-ruby''s bundler-cache puts gems in CI.\n- CI installs shellcheck 0.11.0 (checksum-verified) instead of apt''s older\n  one, matching the local version like shfmt and actionlint.\n- Retry launch agent bootstrap, which can fail with error 5 right after a\n  bootout.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAglXOcMjmJIigvM4sxbnhlTp+cJ7\n0kd3+1606Kav0bdzkAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQH8tnzpacL0EO0EfFNswUSzMlCm/eMZQrRtEdj6/KlBp/HRN9EtURCrROEcnNur0+z\n5qeyf3au/JPFAvo/evYw0=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-26T17:29:31Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/282759?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/benbalter","id":282759,"login":"benbalter","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4Mjc1OQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/orgs","received_events_url":"ht