7051142230e629038622baac1fc3c8b2877c9ff8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-26T17:13:22Z","email":"ben@balter.com","name":"Ben Balter"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-26T17:13:22Z","email":"ben@balter.com","name":"Ben Balter"},"message":"Docs: match the code; delete stale files\n\n- Delete config_ci.yml (empty; CI behavior lives in `when: not is_ci`),\n  default_gems (stale copy of .default-gems, unreferenced) and\n  .github/copilot-setup-steps.yml (wrong path and shape, so never ran).\n- copilot-instructions.md was macOS-only and out of date; point it at\n  CLAUDE.md instead.\n- README: full doctor scope, install-tools, the `clean` alias, lint''s\n  run-everything behavior, the six CI jobs and weekly run.\n- MIGRATION: the playbook (or Workbrew) installs Homebrew; check the new\n  machine with script/doctor.\n- CLAUDE.md: where lint runs, the Brewfile path the scripts use, the\n  renamed aliases, and script/lint''s helper.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"db29d72743c80e8ec296bba92a51abcad9ad3a91","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/git/trees/db29d72743c80e8ec296bba92a51abcad9ad3a91"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/git/commits/7051142230e629038622baac1fc3c8b2877c9ff8","verification":{"payload":"tree db29d72743c80e8ec296bba92a51abcad9ad3a91\nparent 8d18b549a9086b632159d9a8df93491ac1fdc253\nauthor Ben Balter <ben@balter.com> 1790442802 -0400\ncommitter Ben Balter <ben@balter.com> 1790442802 -0400\n\nDocs: match the code; delete stale files\n\n- Delete config_ci.yml (empty; CI behavior lives in `when: not is_ci`),\n  default_gems (stale copy of .default-gems, unreferenced) and\n  .github/copilot-setup-steps.yml (wrong path and shape, so never ran).\n- copilot-instructions.md was macOS-only and out of date; point it at\n  CLAUDE.md instead.\n- README: full doctor scope, install-tools, the `clean` alias, lint''s\n  run-everything behavior, the six CI jobs and weekly run.\n- MIGRATION: the playbook (or Workbrew) installs Homebrew; check the new\n  machine with script/doctor.\n- CLAUDE.md: where lint runs, the Brewfile path the scripts use, the\n  renamed aliases, and script/lint''s helper.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAglXOcMjmJIigvM4sxbnhlTp+cJ7\n0kd3+1606Kav0bdzkAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQHtVcGP5kRPqQyc4pJz+jtxKHZ3I9Lb7Qz4MtE0dnNOI4EUr5hPKEB/qEX7UOgi+kN\nVDWv2AObyPyMqesXP2aQA=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-26T17:29:31Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/282759?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/benbalter","id":282759,"login":"benbalter","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4Mjc1OQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/benbalter/dotfiles/commit/7051142230e629038622baac1fc3c8b2877c9ff8","node_id":"C_kwDOALmu69oAKDcwNTExNDIyMzBlNjI5MDM4NjIyYmFhYzFmYzNjOGIyODc3YzlmZjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/benbalter/dotfiles/commit/8d18b549a9086b632159d9a8df93491ac1fdc253","sha":"8d18b549a9086b632159d9a8df93491ac1fdc253","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/commits/8d18b549a9086b632159d9a8df93491ac1fdc253"}],"sha":"7051142230e629038622baac1fc3c8b2877c9ff8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/commits/7051142230e629038622baac1fc3c8b2877c9ff8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/282759?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/benbalter","id":282759,"login":"benbalter","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4Mjc1OQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/commits/8d18b549a9086b632159d9a8df93491ac1fdc253/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-26T17:12:17Z","email":"ben@balter.com","name":"Ben Balter"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-26T17:12:17Z","email":"ben@balter.com","name":"Ben Balter"},"message":"Shell: stop aliases shadowing real commands, dedupe PATH\n\n- Rename reset -> greset and the git branch-cleanup clean -> gclean;\n  `clean` now runs script/clean, as audit-casks and update-brewfile tell\n  you to. ip -> myip (it hid iproute2''s `ip` on Linux).\n- Drop grep->rg and diff->difft: incompatible flags, same reasoning as the\n  existing find->fd note. Drop dead gg, ghcs/ghce; afk uses pmset now that\n  CGSession is gone. One lc definition.\n- .zshrc: derive DOTFILES_ROOT from the symlink; dedupe path/fpath (-U,\n  plus a final re-assignment, since -U skips writes to the PATH scalar);\n  put ~/.local/bin on PATH before checking for mise; only point fzf at\n  fd/bat/eza when installed; drop unused git-extras, battery and\n  zsh-interactive-cd plugins; load history-substring-search after\n  syntax-highlighting as its README requires; guard the LM Studio path.\n- lib/globals: prepend the probed Homebrew prefix instead of a hard-coded\n  /opt/homebrew (gives non-login Linux shells Linuxbrew); drop the default\n  HOMEBREW_CASK_OPTS and a dead SHELL fallback.\n\nStartup: ~0.215s -> ~0.170s (zsh -i -c exit, mean of 8).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c6c4264c20deb6417ee0b2005afe6de92c8b172e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/git/trees/c6c4264c20deb6417ee0b2005afe6de92c8b172e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/git/commits/8d18b549a9086b632159d9a8df93491ac1fdc253","verification":{"payload":"tree c6c4264c20deb6417ee0b2005afe6de92c8b172e\nparent 0b528d29f7bfb5db465e4f4143c299434304efa4\nauthor Ben Balter <ben@balter.com> 1790442737 -0400\ncommitter Ben Balter <ben@balter.com> 1790442737 -0400\n\nShell: stop aliases shadowing real commands, dedupe PATH\n\n- Rename reset -> greset and the git branch-cleanup clean -> gclean;\n  `clean` now runs script/clean, as audit-casks and update-brewfile tell\n  you to. ip -> myip (it hid iproute2''s `ip` on Linux).\n- Drop grep->rg and diff->difft: incompatible flags, same reasoning as the\n  existing find->fd note. Drop dead gg, ghcs/ghce; afk uses pmset now that\n  CGSession is gone. One lc definition.\n- .zshrc: derive DOTFILES_ROOT from the symlink; dedupe path/fpath (-U,\n  plus a final re-assignment, since -U skips writes to the PATH scalar);\n  put ~/.local/bin on PATH before checking for mise; only point fzf at\n  fd/bat/eza when installed; drop unused git-extras, battery and\n  zsh-interactive-cd plugins; load history-substring-search after\n  syntax-highlighting as its README requires; guard the LM Studio path.\n- lib/globals: prepend the probed Homebrew prefix instead of a hard-coded\n  /opt/homebrew (gives non-login Linux shells Linuxbrew); drop the default\n  HOMEBREW_CASK_OPTS and a dead SHELL fallback.\n\nStartup: ~0.215s -> ~0.170s (zsh -i -c exit, mean of 8).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAglXOcMjmJIigvM4sxbnhlTp+cJ7\n0kd3+1606Kav0bdzkAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQMur+fl7sfhdp/O6r/70SJ4gn5ffgnnevZW65Eqm8prxHAu6LwEDtyIMHyze+waR1Z\n3qH6VaT/zuOqtT6pja5Ak=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-26T17:29:31Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/282759?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/benbalter","id":282759,"login":"benbalter","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4Mjc1OQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/benbalter/dotfiles/commit/8d18b549a9086b632159d9a8df93491ac1fdc253","node_id":"C_kwDOALmu69oAKDhkMThiNTQ5YTkwODZiNjMyMTU5ZDlhOGRmOTM0OTFhYzFmZGMyNTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/benbalter/dotfiles/commit/0b528d29f7bfb5db465e4f4143c299434304efa4","sha":"0b528d29f7bfb5db465e4f4143c299434304efa4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/commits/0b528d29f7bfb5db465e4f4143c299434304efa4"}],"sha":"8d18b549a9086b632159d9a8df93491ac1fdc253","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/commits/8d18b549a9086b632159d9a8df93491ac1fdc253"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/282759?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/benbalter","id":282759,"login":"benbalter","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4Mjc1OQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/commits/0b528d29f7bfb5db465e4f4143c299434304efa4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-26T17:09:51Z","email":"ben@balter.com","name":"Ben Balter"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-26T17:09:51Z","email":"ben@balter.com","name":"Ben Balter"},"message":"Prune Brewfile duplicates, bare dependencies and an unused role\n\n- cargo just/lychee duplicated the brew formulae; both were installed.\n- typescript (brew 7.x) shadowed mise''s pinned 6, which keeps tsserver.\n- python@3.13, node-build, ruby-build: nothing depends on them; mise owns\n  runtimes. ansible/ansible-lint: the playbook and lint use the venv.\n- jemalloc, openldap: nothing depends on or references them.\n- 17 libraries left by `brew bundle dump` that are only dependencies.\n- The darrylmorley/whatcable tap: homebrew/cask has whatcable itself.\n- VS Code: remote-wsl (Windows-only), vstuc (Unity Hub was removed).\n- requirements.yml: elliotweiser.osx-command-line-tools was never used,\n  which leaves no roles, so drop the `role install` steps.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f5b91c3f4828a3a398b33c77997b4dcae6fae289","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/git/trees/f5b91c3f4828a3a398b33c77997b4dcae6fae289"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/git/commits/0b528d29f7bfb5db465e4f4143c299434304efa4","verification":{"payload":"tree f5b91c3f4828a3a398b33c77997b4dcae6fae289\nparent 96360be322fe6e30094274f9a67bacc56f7a9f51\nauthor Ben Balter <ben@balter.com> 1790442591 -0400\ncommitter Ben Balter <ben@balter.com> 1790442591 -0400\n\nPrune Brewfile duplicates, bare dependencies and an unused role\n\n- cargo just/lychee duplicated the brew formulae; both were installed.\n- typescript (brew 7.x) shadowed mise''s pinned 6, which keeps tsserver.\n- python@3.13, node-build, ruby-build: nothing depends on them; mise owns\n  runtimes. ansible/ansible-lint: the playbook and lint use the venv.\n- jemalloc, openldap: nothing depends on or references them.\n- 17 libraries left by `brew bundle dump` that are only dependencies.\n- The darrylmorley/whatcable tap: homebrew/cask has whatcable itself.\n- VS Code: remote-wsl (Windows-only), vstuc (Unity Hub was removed).\n- requirements.yml: elliotweiser.osx-command-line-tools was never used,\n  which leaves no roles, so drop the `role install` steps.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAglXOcMjmJIigvM4sxbnhlTp+cJ7\n0kd3+1606Kav0bdzkAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1