ttps://api.github.com/users/benbalter/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/benbalter","id":282759,"login":"benbalter","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4Mjc1OQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/commits/96360be322fe6e30094274f9a67bacc56f7a9f51/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-26T17:07:37Z","email":"ben@balter.com","name":"Ben Balter"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-26T17:07:37Z","email":"ben@balter.com","name":"Ben Balter"},"message":"Make lint, tests and CI catch what the audit found\n\n- script/lint runs every linter and lists all failures instead of stopping\n  at the first; also checks the BATS files and devcontainer script, runs\n  rubocop via bundle exec, and passes --frail to remark.\n- .remarkrc: the rule options under remark-lint did nothing (remark-lint 10\n  takes none). Install and configure each rule as its own plugin, wire in\n  no-empty-sections and no-url-trailing-slash, drop two unused packages.\n  Bullet style set to `-`, which every Markdown file here already uses.\n- New tests: system defaults use absolute domains, scripts use set -eu and\n  pipefail, lib/ never sets -e/-u, Claude plugin marketplaces are known,\n  launch agent plists are valid. install.bats checks each link''s target;\n  drop the weaker text-grep tests in config.bats.\n- CI: drop the redundant bootstrap job, move lint to Ubuntu with pinned\n  shfmt/actionlint and setup-{python,node,ruby} caches, cache pip wheels not\n  the venv, add timeouts and persist-credentials: false, pin fedora:44, add\n  a weekly schedule, read the Linux brew skip list from config.yml, and stop\n  chmod''ing scripts before testing their exec bit.\n- Reload a launch agent when its plist changes.\n- install-tools and post-create.sh use set -eu and pipefail; post-create\n  installs yq for the tests.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"722a7b8c334b715a6a710674e28409fd7f38b4a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/git/trees/722a7b8c334b715a6a710674e28409fd7f38b4a3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/git/commits/96360be322fe6e30094274f9a67bacc56f7a9f51","verification":{"payload":"tree 722a7b8c334b715a6a710674e28409fd7f38b4a3\nparent e5abc2d06e91305461a6ba9253a7ce99864bdc55\nauthor Ben Balter <ben@balter.com> 1790442457 -0400\ncommitter Ben Balter <ben@balter.com> 1790442457 -0400\n\nMake lint, tests and CI catch what the audit found\n\n- script/lint runs every linter and lists all failures instead of stopping\n  at the first; also checks the BATS files and devcontainer script, runs\n  rubocop via bundle exec, and passes --frail to remark.\n- .remarkrc: the rule options under remark-lint did nothing (remark-lint 10\n  takes none). Install and configure each rule as its own plugin, wire in\n  no-empty-sections and no-url-trailing-slash, drop two unused packages.\n  Bullet style set to `-`, which every Markdown file here already uses.\n- New tests: system defaults use absolute domains, scripts use set -eu and\n  pipefail, lib/ never sets -e/-u, Claude plugin marketplaces are known,\n  launch agent plists are valid. install.bats checks each link''s target;\n  drop the weaker text-grep tests in config.bats.\n- CI: drop the redundant bootstrap job, move lint to Ubuntu with pinned\n  shfmt/actionlint and setup-{python,node,ruby} caches, cache pip wheels not\n  the venv, add timeouts and persist-credentials: false, pin fedora:44, add\n  a weekly schedule, read the Linux brew skip list from config.yml, and stop\n  chmod''ing scripts before testing their exec bit.\n- Reload a launch agent when its plist changes.\n- install-tools and post-create.sh use set -eu and pipefail; post-create\n  installs yq for the tests.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAglXOcMjmJIigvM4sxbnhlTp+cJ7\n0kd3+1606Kav0bdzkAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQOFw0HCDAk6Dc9aL+DiXaOBubTn3f/3Kqe+Ewo8jLlB+3qIBZRz51kXKcP7c4EItp/\nidSNiBBnHb+wfeaFrfrAo=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-26T17:29:31Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/282759?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/benbalter","id":282759,"login":"benbalter","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4Mjc1OQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/benbalter/dotfiles/commit/96360be322fe6e30094274f9a67bacc56f7a9f51","node_id":"C_kwDOALmu69oAKDk2MzYwYmUzMjJmZTZlMzAwOTQyNzRmOWE2N2JhY2M1NmY3YTlmNTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/benbalter/dotfiles/commit/e5abc2d06e91305461a6ba9253a7ce99864bdc55","sha":"e5abc2d06e91305461a6ba9253a7ce99864bdc55","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/commits/e5abc2d06e91305461a6ba9253a7ce99864bdc55"}],"sha":"96360be322fe6e30094274f9a67bacc56f7a9f51","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/commits/96360be322fe6e30094274f9a67bacc56f7a9f51"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/282759?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/benbalter","id":282759,"login":"benbalter","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4Mjc1OQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/commits/e5abc2d06e91305461a6ba9253a7ce99864bdc55/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-26T17:03:16Z","email":"ben@balter.com","name":"Ben Balter"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-26T17:03:16Z","email":"ben@balter.com","name":"Ben Balter"},"message":"Fix data-loss and headless bugs found in audit\n\n- Dotfile backup no longer skips when a .bak exists (the force-link then\n  deleted the file); a second backup gets a .bak.<epoch> suffix. install.sh\n  gets the same backup for its special-cased links via a link() helper.\n- audit-casks: exit from INT/TERM traps so Ctrl-C can''t truncate the Brewfile.\n- update: skip mas and headless cask/mas bundle installs, which can hang on\n  sign-in or sudo; re-exec by absolute path after a pull.\n- update/doctor/clean: use the repo Brewfile (~/.Brewfile is macOS-only) and\n  the Linux brew skip list.\n- script/ansible passes its arguments through; scripts cd to the repo root.\n- bootstrap: split role/collection installs like update.\n- Playbook: don''t re-defer FileVault every run, keep its recovery key out of\n  /tmp, skip security setters in CI, restart LanguageTool on config change,\n  fix mise changed_when (stderr), label the system defaults loop.\n- doctor: stale-update is only a failure on macOS; flag .bak.* files.\n- Remove disable-comic-sans: Font Book isn''t scriptable, so it never did\n  anything. VS Code font overrides remain.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e7ea00efcf3d2582ce2d02a6541fa78b4d46917b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/git/trees/e7ea00efcf3d2582ce2d02a6541fa78b4d46917b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/git/commits/e5abc2d06e91305461a6ba9253a7ce99864bdc55","verification":{"payload":"tree e7ea00efcf3d2582ce2d02a6541fa78b4d46917b\nparent 6e2ea213e890ffd0b654f6228dc5b3f1669499e7\nauthor Ben Balter <ben@balter.com> 1790442196 -0400\ncommitter Ben Balter <ben@balter.com> 1790442196 -0400\n\nFix data-loss and headless bugs found in audit\n\n- Dotfile backup no longer skips when a .bak exists (the force-link then\n  deleted the file); a second backup gets a .bak.<epoch> suffix. install.sh\n  gets the same backup for its special-cased links via a link() helper.\n- audit-casks: exit from INT/TERM traps so Ctrl-C can''t truncate the Brewfile.\n- update: skip mas and headless cask/mas bundle installs, which can hang on\n  sign-in or sudo; re-exec by absolute path after a pull.\n- update/doctor/clean: use the repo Brewfile (~/.Brewfile is macOS-only) and\n  the Linux brew skip list.\n- script/ansible passes its arguments through; scripts cd to the repo root.\n- bootstrap: split role/collection installs like update.\n- Playbook: don''t re-defer FileVault every run, keep its recovery key out of\n  /tmp, skip security setters in CI, restart LanguageTool on config change,\n  fix mise changed_when (stderr), label the system defaults loop.\n- doctor: stale-update is only a failure on macOS; flag .bak.* files.\n- Remove disable-comic-sans: Font Book isn''t scriptable, so it never did\n  anything. VS Code font overrides remain.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAglXOcMjmJIigvM4sxbnhlTp+cJ7\n0kd3+1606Kav0bdzkAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQCh0veNKB23DulKhExKJxPGkgEElUFVjRlZ+VePaw0bUW1jhsHMU6Ojn9cupUdech6\nf8uUaH5W6G8aAMMz7+3Q8=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-26T17:29:31Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/282759?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/benbalter","id":282759,"login":"benbalter","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4Mjc1OQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/benbalter/dotfiles/commit/e5abc2d06e91305461a6ba9253a7ce99864bdc55","node_id":"C_kwDOALmu69oAKGU1YWJjMmQwNmU5MTMwNTQ2MWE2YmE5MjUzYTdjZTk5ODY0YmRjNTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/benbalter/dotfiles/commit/6e2ea213e890ffd0b654f6228dc5b3f1669499e7","sha":"6e2ea213e890ffd0b654f6228dc5b3f1669499e7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/commits/6e2ea213e890ffd0b654f6228dc5b3f1669499e7"}],"sha":"e5abc2d06e91305461a6ba9253a7ce99864bdc55","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/commits/e5abc2d06e91305461a6ba9253a7ce99864bdc55"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/282759?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/benbalter","id":282759,"login":"benbalter","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4Mjc1OQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/commits/6e2ea213e890ffd0b654f6228dc5b3f1669499e7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-26T16:27:12Z","email":"ben@balter.com","name":"Ben Balter"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-26T16:27:12Z","email":"ben@balter.com","name":"Ben Balter"},"message":"Harden playbook: private dirs, launch agents, Fedora and macOS security\n\n- Keep ~/.ssh and ~/.gnupg at 0700 in every task that creates them\n  (private_directories), and in install.sh\n- Bootstrap repo launch agents that aren''t loaded\n- Write screensaver idleTime to the ByHost domain and read it back\n- Check Gatekeeper before enabling it, then verify\n- Disable Remote Login and Screen Sharing in launchd, require admin for\n  System Settings, and check sudo still includes sudo_local\n- Fedora: enable firewalld and dnf5-automatic security updates\n- Pin Finder visibility and current typing defaults\n- Guard Comic Sans task to macOS, tag writing skills with claude\n- Drop dead homebrew_* vars and the unused config_ci.yml override\n- Make read-only checks work under --check\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"82dff459caddb5cf04e7435d31e3c7f6e4a8f9d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/git/trees/82dff459caddb5cf04e7435d31e3c7f6e4a8f9d7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/git/commits/6e2ea213e890ffd0b654f6228dc5b3f1669499e7","verification":{"payload":"tree 82dff459caddb5cf04e7435d31e3c7f6e4a8f9d7\nparent e08d617997fe7a27b43b6addf06a78fed9076507\nauthor Ben Balter <ben@balter.com> 1790440032 -0400\ncommitter Ben Balter <ben@balter.com> 1790440032 -0400\n\nHarden playbook: private dirs, launch agents, Fedora and macOS security\n\n- Keep ~/.ssh and ~/.gnupg at 0700 in every task that creates them\n  (private_directories), and in install.sh\n- Bootstrap repo launch agents that aren''t loaded\n- Write screensaver idleTime to the ByHost domain and read it back\n- Check Gatekeeper before enabling it, then verify\n- Disable Remote Login and Screen Sharing in launchd, require admin for\n  System Settings, and check sudo still includes sudo_local\n- Fedora: enable firewalld and dnf5-automatic security updates\n- Pin Finder visibility and current typing defaults\n- Guard Comic Sans task to macOS, tag writing skills with claude\n- Drop dead homebrew_* vars and the unused config_ci.yml override\n- Make read-only checks work under --check\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAglXOcMjmJIigvM4sxbnhlTp+cJ7\n0kd3+1606Kav0bdzkAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQBGz9xMz8876950Z2T8Rpx/c5XcsPHjBcgA6M6EPL3pnqGIyH+6fATyeZipwez5C+L\nYfJ0BVwiw+KOiZMC9KygM=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-26T16:27:16Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/282759?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/benbalter","id":282759,"login":"benbalter","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4Mjc1OQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/benbalter/dotfiles/commit/6e2ea213e890ffd0b654f6228dc5b3f1669499e7","node_id":"C_kwDOALmu69oAKDZlMmVhMjEzZTg5MGZmZDBiNjU0ZjYyMjhkYzViM2YxNjY5NDk5ZTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/benbalter/dotfiles/commit/e08d617997fe7a27b43b6addf06a78fed9076507","sha":"e08d617997fe7a27b43b6addf06a78fed9076507","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/commits/e08d617997fe7a27b43b6addf06a78fed9076507"}],"sha":"6e2ea213e890ffd0b654f6228dc5b3f1669499e7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/commits/6e2ea213e890ffd0b654f6228dc5b3f1669499e7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/282759?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/benbalter","id":282759,"login":"benbalter","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4Mjc1OQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/commits/e08d617997fe7a27b43b6addf06a78fed9076507/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T23:43:10Z","email":"ben@balter.com","name":"Ben Balter"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T23:43:10Z","email":"ben@balter.com","name":"Ben Balter"},"message":"Track mole config; protect model cache, skip repair tasks\n\nLink ~/.config/mole/{purge_paths,whitelist,whitelist_optimize} from the\nrepo. Just the files, since mole writes generated reports beside them.\n\n- purge_paths: drop ~/Library/CloudStorage, which mole auto-discovered;\n  scanning it can hydrate cloud-only files.\n- whitelist: keep `mo purge` off the 43GB Hugging Face model cache in\n  fast-detect-gpt, which it flags as a build artifact.\n- whitelist_optimize: skip cache_refresh and launch_services_rebuild,\n  repair tasks that `up` would otherwise run every time.\n\nAlso set the .DS_Store network/USB defaults in config.yml so a fresh\nmachine doesn''t depend on `mo optimize` having run.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"98ea32b953af1bfdc1c950c7300a396f688e44c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/git/trees/98ea32b953af1bfdc1c950c7300a396f688e44c3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/git/commits/e08d617997fe7a27b43b6addf06a78fed9076507","verification":{"payload":"tree 98ea32b953af1bfdc1c950c7300a396f688e44c3\nparent feb437aa6496bd59f5ab22d4c185ad3456029911\nauthor Ben Balter <ben@balter.com> 1790293390 -0400\ncommitter Ben Balter <ben@balter.com> 1790293390 -0400\n\nTrack mole config; protect model cache, skip repair tasks\n\nLink ~/.config/mole/{purge_paths,whitelist,whitelist_optimize} from the\nrepo. Just the files, since mole writes generated reports beside them.\n\n- purge_paths: drop ~/Library/CloudStorage, which mole auto-discovered;\n  scanning it can hydrate cloud-only files.\n- whitelist: keep `mo purge` off the 43GB Hugging Face model cache in\n  fast-detect-gpt, which it flags as a build artifact.\n- whitelist_optimize: skip cache_refresh and launch_services_rebuild,\n  repair tasks that `up` would otherwise run every time.\n\nAlso set the .DS_Store network/USB defaults in config.yml so a fresh\nmachine doesn''t depend on `mo optimize` having run.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAglXOcMjmJIigvM4sxbnhlTp+cJ7\n0kd3+1606Kav0bdzkAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQBMPMpZPNEl+7v4WIaVHD61EekOjVreYxpa4ydj0lagRMpPR2dT6SEoFutEkMOi7YN\n0yUE4JMpLiwlV9EU5k8Qw=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-24T23:43:14Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/282759?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter