.com/users/benbalter/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/commits/c0bda1c9c93774e0d21257f45f92981ea1e80bb6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T22:46:20Z","email":"ben@balter.com","name":"Ben Balter"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T22:46:20Z","email":"ben@balter.com","name":"Ben Balter"},"message":"README: fix new-machine setup steps and stale descriptions\n\nAdds the prerequisites a fresh machine needs (CLT, App Store sign-in,\ngit on Fedora), post-setup steps (logout, 1Password, gh auth), the\nmissing scripts, and corrects dnf, language, tool, install.sh, up and\nCI details. script/setup now cds to the repo, since install.sh and the\nsetup alias exec it from anywhere and it calls siblings by relative\npath.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f71dfe5fe444196d53ccc9009488c60ca526cb31","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/git/trees/f71dfe5fe444196d53ccc9009488c60ca526cb31"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/git/commits/c0bda1c9c93774e0d21257f45f92981ea1e80bb6","verification":{"payload":"tree f71dfe5fe444196d53ccc9009488c60ca526cb31\nparent a90f1ca4a57079bd94a7ac7385c57adb46a7f1db\nauthor Ben Balter <ben@balter.com> 1790289980 -0400\ncommitter Ben Balter <ben@balter.com> 1790289980 -0400\n\nREADME: fix new-machine setup steps and stale descriptions\n\nAdds the prerequisites a fresh machine needs (CLT, App Store sign-in,\ngit on Fedora), post-setup steps (logout, 1Password, gh auth), the\nmissing scripts, and corrects dnf, language, tool, install.sh, up and\nCI details. script/setup now cds to the repo, since install.sh and the\nsetup alias exec it from anywhere and it calls siblings by relative\npath.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH 