ack the macOS security settings the playbook applies.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"15033138af2257b29b7019d0684e3e8a0c6835a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/git/trees/15033138af2257b29b7019d0684e3e8a0c6835a9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/git/commits/d4b159770973bd1ec657a30115e7def5b8ad6747","verification":{"payload":"tree 15033138af2257b29b7019d0684e3e8a0c6835a9\nparent dc0d30ab53fdd53a9ae33f58c627b96c12cd3a00\nauthor Ben Balter <ben@balter.com> 1790289979 -0400\ncommitter Ben Balter <ben@balter.com> 1790289979 -0400\n\ndoctor: check all launch agents, last update, packages, security\n\nReports failed steps from the last update run and a hung or stale\nupdate lock, every repo launch agent''s load state, exit code and\nlogging, Brewfile and mise entries that never installed, and reads\nback the macOS security settings the playbook applies.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAglXOcMjmJIigvM4sxbnhlTp+cJ7\n0kd3+1606Kav0bdzkAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQHsrPF5x5z2uo0wPXiLKULIMJl6xOF7+hmbd9bav+av2s6GLNOfjrMZw1CyR/PkPJm\nBOYRxyrdX+2G5T55dhYAk=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-24T22:46:22Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/282759?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/benbalter","id":282759,"login":"benbalter","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4Mjc1OQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/benbalter/dotfiles/commit/d4b159770973bd1ec657a30115e7def5b8ad6747","node_id":"C_kwDOALmu69oAKGQ0YjE1OTc3MDk3M2JkMWVjNjU3YTMwMTE1ZTdkZWY1YjhhZDY3NDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/benbalter/dotfiles/commit/dc0d30ab53fdd53a9ae33f58c627b96c12cd3a00","sha":"dc0d30ab53fdd53a9ae33f58c627b96c12cd3a00","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/commits/dc0d30ab53fdd53a9ae33f58c627b96c12cd3a00"}],"sha":"d4b159770973bd1ec657a30115e7def5b8ad6747","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/commits/d4b159770973bd1ec657a30115e7def5b8ad6747"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/282759?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/benbalter","id":282759,"login":"benbalter","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4Mjc1OQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/commits/dc0d30ab53fdd53a9ae33f58c627b96c12cd3a00/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T22:46:17Z","email":"ben@balter.com","name":"Ben Balter"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T22:46:17Z","email":"ben@balter.com","name":"Ben Balter"},"message":"Make up report failed steps, lock out overlapping runs\n\nEvery step ended in || true, so the nightly job always exited 0 and\ndoctor''s exit-code check could never fire. A step helper now records\nfailures, the run exits 1 with a summary, and each run writes\n~/.local/state/dotfiles/update-status for doctor. Also: a lock so a\nwake-time launchd run can''t collide with a manual up, log trimming and\ntimestamps, a pull-and-re-exec from a terminal, and oh-my-zsh, tldr and\nsoftwareupdate --list steps.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9f1f09baa9d288b5726a6a669c328a5aeb7056fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/git/trees/9f1f09baa9d288b5726a6a669c328a5aeb7056fb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/git/commits/dc0d30ab53fdd53a9ae33f58c627b96c12cd3a00","verification":{"payload":"tree 9f1f09baa9d288b5726a6a669c328a5aeb7056fb\nparent 251504caa2d57ba73488a20a5cb2f06044f48040\nauthor Ben Balter <ben@balter.com> 1790289977 -0400\ncommitter Ben Balter <ben@balter.com> 1790289977 -0400\n\nMake up report failed steps, lock out overlapping runs\n\nEvery step ended in || true, so the nightly job always exited 0 and\ndoctor''s exit-code check could never fire. A step helper now records\nfailures, the run exits 1 with a summary, and each run writes\n~/.local/state/dotfiles/update-status for doctor. Also: a lock so a\nwake-time launchd run can''t collide with a manual up, log trimming and\ntimestamps, a pull-and-re-exec from a terminal, and oh-my-zsh, tldr and\nsoftwareupdate --list steps.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0l