ter/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/benbalter","id":282759,"login":"benbalter","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4Mjc1OQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/commits/251504caa2d57ba73488a20a5cb2f06044f48040/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T18:21:17Z","email":"ben@balter.com","name":"Ben Balter"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T18:21:17Z","email":"ben@balter.com","name":"Ben Balter"},"message":"Install Linux CLI tools with mise instead of by hand\n\nscript/install-tools downloaded delta and zoxide .debs, parsed the GitHub\nrelease JSON with awk to find each asset''s SHA256 digest, verified it,\nand git-cloned fzf. mise does the same digest check, installs all three\nfrom its registry, and keeps them upgradable via `mise upgrade`.\n\nTools go in ~/.config/mise/conf.d rather than via `mise use -g`, which\nwould write into the repo''s config (install.sh symlinks it), and their\nshims are linked into /usr/local/bin so oh-my-zsh''s zoxide plugin finds\nzoxide before `mise activate` runs. The Fedora dnf path is unchanged.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"32d4c93ea42b6d36baadeea231c40c832026ab81","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/git/trees/32d4c93ea42b6d36baadeea231c40c832026ab81"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/git/commits/251504caa2d57ba73488a20a5cb2f06044f48040","verification":{"payload":"tree 32d4c93ea42b6d36baadeea231c40c832026ab81\nparent 88a2a3b390d2c96c1c9d1e1a275750fbd7655591\nauthor Ben Balter <ben@balter.com> 1790187677 -0400\ncommitter Ben Balter <ben@balter.com> 1790187677 -0400\n\nInstall Linux CLI tools with mise instead of by hand\n\nscript/install-tools downloaded delta and zoxide .debs, parsed the GitHub\nrelease JSON with awk to find each asset''s SHA256 digest, verified it,\nand git-cloned fzf. mise does the same digest check, installs all three\nfrom its registry, and keeps them upgradable via `mise upgrade`.\n\nTools go in ~/.config/mise/conf.d rather than via `mise use -g`, which\nwould write into the repo''s config (install.sh symlinks it), and their\nshims are linked into /usr/local/bin so oh-my-zsh''s zoxide plugin finds\nzoxide before `mise activate` runs. The Fedora dnf path is unchanged.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAglXOcMjmJIigvM4sxbnhlTp+cJ7\n0kd3+1606Kav0bdzkAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQHyK6fqvjGdr4Drb/jH3GH9Ms/JR31gxzqt9lf2qLaoRUbgiK5s5PPk5YsfCXixNV8\ne2nXrDZWPtcPEjMSxKJwE=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-23T18:23:42Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/282759?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/benbalter","id":282759,"login":"benbalter","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4Mjc1OQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/benbalter/dotfiles/commit/251504caa2d57ba73488a20a5cb2f06044f48040","node_id":"C_kwDOALmu69oAKDI1MTUwNGNhYTJkNTdiYTczNDg4YTIwYTVjYjJmMDYwNDRmNDgwNDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/benbalter/dotfiles/commit/88a2a3b390d2c96c1c9d1e1a275750fbd7655591","sha":"88a2a3b390d2c96c1c9d1e1a275750fbd7655591","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/commits/88a2a3b390d2c96c1c9d1e1a275750fbd7655591"}],"sha":"251504caa2d57ba73488a20a5cb2f06044f48040","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/commits/251504caa2d57ba73488a20a5cb2f06044f48040"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/282759?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/benbalter","id":282759,"login":"benbalter","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4Mjc1OQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/commits/88a2a3b390d2c96c1c9d1e1a275750fbd7655591/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T18:18:47Z","email":"ben@balter.com","name":"Ben Balter"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T18:18:47Z","email":"ben@balter.com","name":"Ben Balter"},"message":"Remove unused homebrew-fix role and fix-permissions script\n\nNothing references either. The homebrew-fix role went dead when the\nplaybook started skipping geerlingguy.mac.homebrew under Workbrew, and it\ncarried an unconditional `brew upgrade`. fix-permissions ran\n`chmod -R u+rwx,g+rx,o+rx` over the whole repo, marking every file\nexecutable and world-readable, SSH and GPG configs included.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1bb83ebaab9f338c7b0a02d3816f7e650b566195","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/git/trees/1bb83ebaab9f338c7b0a02d3816f7e650b566195"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/git/commits/88a2a3b390d2c96c1c9d1e1a275750fbd7655591","verification":{"payload":"tree 1bb83ebaab9f338c7b0a02d3816f7e650b566195\nparent cdaf24f3c8933297c8b50fd508af8f006ecdd6f6\nauthor Ben Balter <ben@balter.com> 1790187527 -0400\ncommitter Ben Balter <ben@balter.com> 1790187527 -0400\n\nRemove unused homebrew-fix role and fix-permissions script\n\nNothing references either. The homebrew-fix role went dead when the\nplaybook started skipping geerlingguy.mac.homebrew under Workbrew, and it\ncarried an unconditional `brew upgrade`. fix-permissions ran\n`chmod -R u+rwx,g+rx,o+rx` over the whole repo, marking every file\nexecutable and world-readable, SSH and GPG configs included.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAglXOcMjmJIigvM4sxbnhlTp+cJ7\n0kd3+1606Kav0bdzkAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQIKbmHN2mHYvyhebyFbMIxcIH243zT3m9pW+LYVc4e9bfOL0Wh5o5ThN5TP2Rjh86y\n7PBkjyw