9ce33da15d0b7208\nauthor Ben Balter <ben@balter.com> 1790186002 -0400\ncommitter Ben Balter <ben@balter.com> 1790186002 -0400\n\nAdd script/doctor health check\n\nRead-only check that every configured dotfile is symlinked into the repo,\nflags .bak files left behind by setup, confirms brew resolves to the\nWorkbrew wrapper, and reports the nightly update job''s last exit code.\nExits non-zero when something needs attention.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAglXOcMjmJIigvM4sxbnhlTp+cJ7\n0kd3+1606Kav0bdzkAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQDyv78G+NSRzYEu5wpbLU5twyg6O6WRASetRFNBlg1s3WMsUYpU4x42hLrmEz3ccFx\n4cV9VcCBsV5BJBAjm6cgI=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-23T17:58:46Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/282759?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/benbalter","id":282759,"login":"benbalter","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4Mjc1OQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/benbalter/dotfiles/commit/d6531d63b70fcacf8fc23b8e32e2364066d81190","node_id":"C_kwDOALmu69oAKGQ2NTMxZDYzYjcwZmNhY2Y4ZmMyM2I4ZTMyZTIzNjQwNjZkODExOTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/benbalter/dotfiles/commit/a27f67b3016de30dd31d36a99ce33da15d0b7208","sha":"a27f67b3016de30dd31d36a99ce33da15d0b7208","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/commits/a27f67b3016de30dd31d36a99ce33da15d0b7208"}],"sha":"d6531d63b70fcacf8fc23b8e32e2364066d81190","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/commits/d6531d63b70fcacf8fc23b8e32e2364066d81190"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/282759?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/benbalter","id":282759,"login":"benbalter","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4Mjc1OQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/commits/a27f67b3016de30dd31d36a99ce33da15d0b7208/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T17:53:22Z","email":"ben@balter.com","name":"Ben Balter"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T17:53:22Z","email":"ben@balter.com","name":"Ben Balter"},"message":"Test that install.sh links exactly config.yml''s common dotfiles\n\nThe existing checks grep install.sh for each config.yml entry, which only\ncatches drift in one direction. Run install.sh into a temp HOME and diff\nthe links it creates against dotfiles_files_common + dotfile_links_common\nboth ways, so extra links (like the gpg-agent.conf leak) fail too.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1df087a2783d7a669d13ad7741a97daad031b4d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/git/trees/1df087a2783d7a669d13ad7741a97daad031b4d5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/git/commits/a27f67b3016de30dd31d36a99ce33da15d0b7208","verification":{"payload":"tree 1df087a2783d7a669d13ad7741a97daad031b4d5\nparent 73dcc2f9a51952cc207feae23a085ac0e4323201\nauthor Ben Balter <ben@balter.com> 1790186002 -0400\ncommitter Ben Balter <ben@balter.com> 1790186002 -0400\n\nTest that install.sh links exactly config.yml''s common dotfiles\n\nThe existing checks grep install.sh for each config.yml entry, which only\ncatches drift in one direction. Run install.sh into a temp HOME and diff\nthe links it creates against dotfiles_files_common + dotfile_links_common\nboth ways, so extra links (like the gpg-agent.conf leak) fail too.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAglXOcMjmJIigvM4sxbnhlTp+cJ7\n0kd3+1606Kav0bdzkAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQLt2m9oS++5Bsw0BhbDMyd95FOYQB2scmd3HN+QtGUwTclCVzaacVfcnM9Y6z3FZfq\n1N9aYjPlmugt1w8iaQAgc=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-23T17:58:46Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/282759?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/benbalter","id":282759,"login":"benbalter","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4Mjc1OQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/benbalter/dotfiles/commit/a27f67b3016de30dd31d36a99ce33da15d0b7208","node_id":"C_kwDOALmu69oAKGEyN2Y2N2IzMDE2ZGUzMGRkMzFkMzZhOTljZTMzZGExNWQwYjcyMDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/benbalter/dotfiles/commit/73dcc2f9a51952cc207feae23a085ac0e4323201","sha":"73dcc2f9a51952cc207feae23a085ac0e4323201","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/commits/73dcc2f9a51952cc207feae23a085ac0e4323201"}],"sha":"a27f67b3016de30dd31d36a99ce33da15d0b7208","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/commits/a27f67b3016de30dd31d36a99ce33da15d0b7208"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/282759?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/benbalter","id":282759,"login":"benbalter","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4Mjc1OQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/commits/73dcc2f9a51952cc207feae23a085ac0e4323201/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T17:51:50Z","email":"ben@balter.com","name":"Ben Balter"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T17:51:50Z","email":"ben@balter.com","name":"Ben Balter"},"message":"Drop Dependabot for Renovate; stop nightly lockfile churn\n\nRenovate (config:recommended via benbalter/renovate-config) already\ncovers bundler, npm, pip and GitHub Actions, so Dependabot was opening\nduplicate PRs for the same bumps. Remove it and its auto-merge workflow;\nRenovate''s instant preset auto-merges on the required lint/test checks.\n\nscript/update ran `npm update`, which rewrote the tracked\npackage-lock.json every night. Use `npm ci` to install what the lockfile\npins and leave bumps to Renovate.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3cd64291f1ea3c0577413b94ff949c45ad296ea8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/git/trees/3cd64291f1ea3c0577413b94ff949c45ad296ea8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/git/commits/73dcc2f9a51952cc207feae23a085ac0e4323201","verification":{"payload":"tree 3cd64291f1ea3c0577413b94ff949c45ad296ea8\nparent 11e30afb773baaec479e0f4542b811c448822cda\nauthor Ben Balter <ben@balter.com> 1790185910 -0400\ncommitter Ben Balter <ben@balter.com> 1790185910 -0400\n\nDrop Dependabot for Renovate; stop nightly lockfile churn\n\nRenovate (config:recommended via benbalter/renovate-config) already\ncovers bundler, npm, pip and GitHub Actions, so Dependabot was opening\nduplicate PRs for the same bumps. Remove it and its auto-merge workflow;\nRenovate''s instant preset auto-merges on the required lint/test checks.\n\nscript/update ran `npm update`, which rewrote the tracked\npackage-lock.json every night. Use `npm ci` to install what the lockfile\npins and leave bumps to Renovate.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAglXOcMjmJIigvM4sxbnhlTp+cJ7\n0kd3+1606Kav0bdzkAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQNcBGRAxx4XLc7aFYPyocWWuIAHeR+XuYlUoXXyeBAD95uh38+UemdrVapTzvaFV+m\n2zcpicUprBJEqlVdG8LwA=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-23T17:58:46Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/282759?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/benbalter","id":282759,"login":"benbalter","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4Mjc1OQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/benbalter/dotfiles/commit/73dcc2f9a51952cc207feae23a085ac0e4323201","node_id":"C_kwDOALmu69oAKDczZGNjMmY5YTUxOTUyY2MyMDdmZWFlMjNhMDg1YWMwZTQzMjMyMDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/benbalter/dotfiles/commit/11e30afb773baaec479e0f4542b811c448822cda","sha":"11e30afb773baaec479e0f4542b811c448822cda","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/commits/11e30afb773baaec479e0f4542b811c448822cda"}],"sha":"73dcc2f9a51952cc207feae23a085ac0e4323201","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/commits/73dcc2f9a51952cc207feae23a085ac0e4323201"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/282759?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/benbalter","id":282759,"login":"benbalter","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4Mjc1OQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/commits/11e30afb773baaec479e0f4542b811c448822cda/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T17:50:54Z","email":"ben@balter.com","name":"Ben Balter"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T17:50:54Z","email":"ben@balter.com","name":"Ben Balter"},"message":"Harden nightly update and stop leaking Mac-only config\n\n- script/update: guard mas, npm, bundle, pip and ansible-galaxy with\n  `|| true` so one failure no longer aborts every later step under set -e.\n- Log the nightly launchd job to ~/Library/Logs/dotfiles-update.log;\n  its output was being discarded, so failures left no trace.\n- install.sh: stop linking .gnupg/gpg-agent.conf on Linux. It hardcodes\n  pinentry-mac, so gpg failed as soon as it needed a passphrase. New\n  test asserts install.sh links no dotfiles_files_macos entry.\n- Untrack .claude/settings.local.json. It predates the .gitignore rule\n  and exposed the local permission allowlist in this public repo.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"49380bef74c25e6028ddb40ad3a1cbb59d934440","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/git/trees/49380bef74c25e6028ddb40ad3a1cbb59d934440"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/git/commits/11e30afb773baaec479e0f4542b811c448822cda","verification":{"payload":"tree 49380bef74c25e6028ddb40ad3a1cbb59d934440\nparent a45a76e4b73865463bc9b5ad191df720e4644788\nauthor Ben Balter <ben@balter.com> 1790185854 -0400\ncommitter Ben Balter <ben@balter.com> 1790185854 -0400\n\nHarden nightly update and stop leaking Mac-only config\n\n- script/update: guard mas, npm, bundle, pip and ansible-galaxy with\n  `|| true` so one failure no longer aborts every later step under set -e.\n- Log the nightly launchd job to ~/Library/Logs/dotfiles-update.log;\n  its output was being discarded, so failures left no trace.\n- install.sh: stop linking .gnupg/gpg-agent.conf on Linux. It hardcodes\n  pinentry-mac, so gpg failed as soon as it needed a passphrase. New\n  test asserts install.sh links no dotfiles_files_macos entry.\n- Untrack .claude/settings.local.json. It predates the .gitignore rule\n  and exposed the local permission allowlist in this public repo.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAglXOcMjmJIigvM4sxbnhlTp+cJ7\n0kd3+1606Kav0bdzkAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQPqRHArL6MInF2NwputAYfI3U0kBquGFufYQEcRThT7xdWVxeOOapQs7tQA/s0+o3w\nhM/93BhhoMsl+zb2/nvws=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-23T17:58:46Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/282759?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/benbalter"