enbalter/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/commits/a0e2c2afbd5786acdfccd5c900f94d7dbbb9d654/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T17:43:34Z","email":"ben@balter.com","name":"Ben Balter"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T17:43:34Z","email":"ben@balter.com","name":"Ben Balter"},"message":"Manage Claude Code config from the dotfiles\n\n- claude/CLAUDE.md is symlinked to ~/.claude/CLAUDE.md through a new\n  cross-platform dotfile_links_common list (src/dest pairs), which the\n  formerly Linux-only link block now also handles. It lives in claude/\n  rather than .claude/ so it doesn''t double as this repo''s project config.\n- claude/settings.json holds the shareable user settings (plugins,\n  marketplaces, UI prefs). Claude Code replaces settings.json on write, so\n  the playbook merges these keys in rather than symlinking; autoMode names\n  private hosts and stays local, which a test enforces.\n- The playbook also adds the plugin marketplaces, installs the enabled\n  plugins, and registers the chrome-devtools MCP server.\n- mise installs typescript-language-server (for the typescript-lsp\n  plugin) with typescript 6 (7.x dropped tsserver), and chrome-devtools-mcp\n  instead of running `npx chrome-devtools-mcp@latest` every session.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7a4650016db655ae52a3626d7bc0f0438f21358a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/git/trees/7a4650016db655ae52a3626d7bc0f0438f21358a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/git/commits/a0e2c2afbd5786acdfccd5c900f94d7dbbb9d654","verification":{"payload":"tree 7a4650016db655ae52a3626d7bc0f0438f21358a\nparent 1dcfa702b250aa122baab9c1c4b234944e249dd8\nauthor Ben Balter <ben@balter.com> 1790185414 -0400\ncommitter Ben Balter <ben@balter.com> 1790185414 -0400\n\nManage Claude Code config from the dotfiles\n\n- claude/CLAUDE.md is symlinked to ~/.claude/CLAUDE.md through a new\n  cross-platform dotfile_links_common list (src/dest pairs), which the\n  formerly Linux-only link block now also handles. It lives in claude/\n  rather than .claude/ so it doesn''t double as this repo''s project config.\n- claude/settings.json holds the shareable user settings (plugins,\n  marketplaces, UI prefs). Claude Code replaces settings.json on write, so\n  the playbook merges these keys in rather than symlinking; autoMode names\n  private hosts and stays local, which a test enforces.\n- The playbook also adds the plugin marketplaces, installs the enabled\n  plugins, and registers the chrome-devtools MCP server.\n- mise installs typescript-language-server (for the typescript-lsp\n  plugin) with typescript 6 (7.x dropped tsserver), and chrome-devtools-mcp\n  instead of running `npx chrome-devtools-mcp@latest` every session.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAglXOcMjmJIigvM4sxbnhlTp+cJ7\n0kd3+1606Kav0bdzkAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQP9HTnmVfgx+Z3vYZlWeETm46l5T7lNl3U9q7MTad6rm9U0hCjWhPgfAA1x/1u5iCR\nVy4hZaL3xg9McJ4xg1+gY=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-23T17:45:01Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/282759?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/benbalter","id":282759,"login":"benbal