"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/commits/fe79a43eaa9a0fefc9f0a57673d048074e8c594a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T17:05:30Z","email":"ben@balter.com","name":"Ben Balter"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T17:05:41Z","email":"ben@balter.com","name":"Ben Balter"},"message":"Set up Zed alongside VS Code\n\n- Re-enable the zed cask and manage ~/.config/zed/settings.json as a\n  dotfile: Hack Nerd Font, self-updater off (cask-managed), ruby-lsp\n  over solargraph, Ansible vault YAML tags, and auto-installed\n  extensions for this stack\n- Add .zed/tasks.json for script/lint, test, ansible and update\n- Use `zed --wait` as the git editor on macOS\n- Add `zd` (Zed''s analogue of oh-my-zsh''s `vsc`)\n- gccd: cd and pull when the repo is already cloned; return rather\n  than exit on failure so it can''t close the shell\n- VS Code: macOptionIsMeta in the terminal, add Error Lens\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3b6ef3f57b0a6baf232e636f935db9561c2a4fb7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/git/trees/3b6ef3f57b0a6baf232e636f935db9561c2a4fb7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/benbalter/dotfiles/git/commits/fe79a43eaa9a0fefc9f0a57673d048074e8c594a","verification":{"payload":"tree 3b6ef3f57b0a6baf232e636f935db9561c2a4fb7\nparent 4ce621234cee5bc0518abdc633bbb9a3ea4abf2a\nauthor Ben Balter <ben@balter.com> 1790183130 -0400\ncommitter Ben Balter <ben@balter.com> 1790183141 -0400\n\nSet up Zed alongside VS Code\n\n- Re-enable the zed cask and manage ~/.config/zed/settings.json as a\n  dotfile: Hack Nerd Font, self-updater off (cask-managed), ruby-lsp\n  over solargraph, Ansible vault YAML tags, and auto-installed\n  extensions for this stack\n- Add .zed/tasks.json for script/lint, test, ansible and update\n- Use `zed --wait` as the git editor on macOS\n- Add `zd` (Zed''s analogue of oh-my-zsh''s `vsc`)\n- gccd: cd and pull when the repo is already cloned; return rather\n  than exit on failure so it can''t close the shell\n- VS Code: macOptionIsMeta in the terminal, add Error Lens\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAglXOcMjmJIigvM4sxbnhlTp+cJ7\n0kd3+1606Kav0bdzkAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQOXq5+2VYxexdANW5bOlix7shMnsZPXwD9yo1P7tLGCwZzAAqtIR/L8yeWQMYh2PVx\nazZ0okSDLLxW2aceYopQs=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-23T17:05:43Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/282759?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/benbalter","id":282759,"login":"benbalter","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4Mjc1OQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbalter","user_view_type":"public"},"html_