b.com/users/mshima/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mshima/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mshima","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jhipster/generator-jhipster/commits/9f8be994edbabc40c015a50b85cbbecd0f9056cf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T23:22:51Z","email":"marceloshima@gmail.com","name":"Marcelo Shima"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T23:22:51Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"refactor(ci): build the matrix of a workflow by with a function (#35310)\n\nThe rules choosing the samples of each workflow from the detected\nchanges lived in the github-build-matrix generator, so they could only\nrun through the generator, against the last commit.\n\n`buildMatrix({ workflow })` in\n`.blueprint/github-build-matrix/support/build-matrix.ts` holds the rules;\nthe generator only prints the result. The changes are the git changes of\n`revisions`, `@~1` (the last commit, what the ci compares) by default:\n`upstream/main...HEAD` gives the changes of a branch, `HEAD` the\nuncommitted ones. `changes` can also be given: `detectChanges(files)`\nfor a list of files, without git, or `allChanges()` for the events\nwithout a base commit.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7733075e0f7b408a1f15503f2dfba8f247fa27ac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jhipster/generator-jhipster/git/trees/7733075e0f7b408a1f15503f2dfba8f247fa27ac"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jhipster/generator-jhipster/git/commits/9f8be994edbabc40c015a50b85cbbecd0f9056cf","verification":{"payload":"tree 7733075e0f7b408a1f15503f2dfba8f247fa27ac\nparent fb6cddf3936983cf248a7651beb5ace3fefea173\nauthor Marcelo Shima <marceloshima@gmail.com> 1791242571 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791242571 +0000\n\nrefactor(ci): build the matrix of a workflow by with a function (#35310)\n\nThe rules choosing the samples of each workflow from the detected\nchanges lived in the github-build-matrix generator, so they could only\nrun through the generator, against the last commit.\n\n`buildMatrix({ workflow })` in\n`.blueprint/github-build-matrix/support/build-matrix.ts` holds the rules;\nthe generator only prints the result. The changes are the git changes of\n`revisions`, `@~1` (the last commit, what the ci compares) by default:\n`upstream/main...HEAD` gives the changes of a branch, `HEAD` the\nuncommitted ones. `changes` can also be given: `detectChanges(files)`\nfor a list of files, without git, or `allChanges()` for the events\nwithout a base commit.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxDFLCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAjh8QAGH0T5JwVviSaIp7u8BXj2km\nxSjcL30jrGSjwDIaU8rFOuXMVVLY+LlSfSGDtxw7FjzhHSuviNjpLFHiozj7Tm4P\nDcZoygL9Fip7B6Pyl+4DnElOrSQWa7GUpYUMDsdj///T2lGys7SHgM7zAUX7TKqf\nGwtp1aeFN1n5WSC3wdtTt/01q+oOPLRrJc6ujfXwSU9bv2wiu5b6M4StoDSTyr03\n93Fb9x3Fl+ECSljcAf3b5e8l5HnbEhBhLHdRsiF3hqPtT0fV8vBSd3nYe8LDKEQ3\nhq1W25yh4ze2XOZLvkVAyP7m+Bt5vft/axLRdPrl+Nv5UguxsSzQX2hKTdncXW2T\nQsuXtbgTGm/dvglw4W7NElLlOqldeTcYVZVdA2TsAFxm3y6Zu8RsD95vdzfcS2h/\nyKaGr9t5kyW0iKn6NZW8TGvjzeFvYyP8WtJz9A8lE2VvSnXACwdFqCNqGGB1CAOd\nPUofLzS1MpC5iGHaF4Jc5fEzyf7gDGOgKqUMu4ZGE0ipNVtLiLIwEGrMwPIw7CDA\nfTH3hJcWeaS4v3s5s3Hw37puYj9rIMlp9gsyPtWr44yyOBJkTmWz4TBQma59N76P\nUHHxXREM89lODaREdQ6xI6rIvo/X8jqnz9Qozy3DT9IzP1Odk+povqZuz5NvdPJr\nYpIhQ98J7BSx7FYG5MNP\n=eihU\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-05T23:22:51Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":""